window.AKK_HER_KINDERGARTEN_IS_FULL_OF_VILLAINOUS_STUDENTS_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_HER_KINDERGARTEN_IS_FULL_OF_VILLAINOUS_STUDENTS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101: Nursery School Starts Calculus","paragraphs":["The System made a ringing sound in Shen Wei's mind.","\"Detected a local genius, none other than Zhao Jie, a new student at Starry Sky Kindergarten. Issuing a task next.\"","\"Cultivate Zhao Jie into He Lingfeng 2.0.\"","Shen Wei was stunned.","She didn't expect to find a genius in the kindergarten, one that even the System found surprising.","And it had added a task out of the blue.","The System pulled up Zhao Jie's information.","This kid Zhao Jie is 6 years old. He's considered a sweet little angel in the kindergarten, and all the teachers adore him.","But who would have thought that Zhao Jie was hiding such talents.","Shen Wei compared Zhao Jie's scores with He Lingfeng's.","She found that his intelligence and learning ability were no less than He Lingfeng's.","Shen Wei was thrilled.","To encounter a genius like He Lingfeng was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","She didn't expect her kindergarten to be a breeding ground for talents, with not only outstanding teachers but also such brilliant students.","Zhao Jie was admitted in the second batch, and among the over 100 new students, he didn't stand out, yet his abilities were so strong.","Looking at Zhao Jie's talents, they were also in mathematics and computer science.","This was great, Shen Wei was genuinely delighted.","Because geniuses are often lonely.","If there were a few more like this, they could learn from and encourage each other on the path of learning.","Shen Wei went straight to Teacher Yue.","Teacher Yue was the head teacher of Class 6, and upon seeing Shen Wei, she immediately asked, \"What's the matter?\"","Shen Wei said, \"I want to learn more about Zhao Jie.\"","Teacher Yue knew every student in her class like the back of her hand. She said, \"Zhao Jie is exceptionally smart, and the kid has a very high EQ!\"","The key is that this child looks chubby and comes from a well-off family.","His parents are both in business, and the kid is quite a charmer.","After enrolling, he even brought a drink to toast her, the teacher.","Truly rare.","Without anyone teaching him, this kid's EQ is innate.","Shen Wei said, \"I want to focus on cultivating him, like He Lingfeng.\"","Although outsiders may not know He Lingfeng, these teachers were all aware that the child was a genius.","Teacher Yue, who had seen her fair share, was still a bit flustered upon hearing Shen Wei's arrangement: \"Real... really? That's great!\"","Shen Wei said, \"I want to call the kid's parents over. I have something to discuss with them specifically.\"","Soon, the kid's parents hurried to the school.","They thought their child had caused trouble at the kindergarten.","But when they arrived, they found Principal Shen Wei and Teacher Yue both smiling and waiting for them.","Shen Wei got straight to the point, \"I want to transfer Zhao Jie to the elite training program.\"","She then explained that the so-called elite education meant exposing the child to elementary, middle, and high school knowledge from a young age. The content would be increased gradually, and eventually, the child would be taught by Professor Liu and Professor Gao.","She hoped the parents would support this.","The parents were overjoyed. Before coming to the kindergarten, they had actually looked into it.","They never expected such a great opportunity would fall on them, and immediately said, \"Sure, we fully support it, as long as it's good for the child!\"","Previously, the parents thought their child was intelligent, but they didn't dare say it out loud, fearing it was just a parent's bias.","Now that Starry Sky Kindergarten also said the child was smart, it was probably true.","After all, Starry Sky has seen a lot.","The kid's mother said, \"No matter how much it costs, we'll support it.\"","In the previous incident with He Lingfeng, Su Jun had revealed online that the training fee was two hundred yuan per hour.","Since the kindergarten valued their child so much, they couldn't let the kindergarten pay for it.","\"To be honest, we're wealthy!\" As long as there was training, money wasn't a problem.","The kid's father took the initiative to suggest, \"Or we could just leave the kid here completely. My wife is always on business trips, and I have banquets to attend, so we can't properly take care of and discipline the child!\"","Shen Wei didn't expect the parents to trust her so much.","So she said, \"Okay, you can take the child home on Saturdays and Sundays.\"","The parents immediately said, \"Let's deposit ten thousand for tuition first. If it's not enough, have Teacher Yue notify us.\"","The couple had both graduated from top universities and had high salaries.","They met the qualifications for elite kindergartens, but they still chose Starry Sky.","Shen Wei said, \"Alright, since you support this, let me ask for the child's opinion as well.\"","The parents brought the little kid out.","Upon hearing that he could live on campus, the child's eyes lit up.","He had always wanted to stay here.","He was envious of He Lingfeng and Mu Zhixing.","Other children could only have two meals here.","But Mu Zhixing could have all three meals.","Afterwards, the parents arranged for the child to enroll, went home to get his luggage, and came to the dorm Shen Wei had arranged for them.","It was a single room.","They were told that if they needed anything, they should contact Doctor Lu.","The child's dorm was a high-end, hotel-style accommodation.","Initially, they thought the ten thousand yuan they were paying wasn't a small amount, just to express their trust and determination as parents.","But after seeing the accommodation, the kid's parents looked at each other and said, \"Maybe we should deposit a hundred thousand instead.\"","The kid's mother agreed, but Shen Wei declined.","Then she called Su Jun to tutor Zhao Jie.","Su Jun was originally He Lingfeng's enlightenment teacher.","When Shen Wei made the request, he readily agreed, and it wouldn't interfere with his part-time class, which ended at five in the afternoon. He could come right over after that and get paid two hundred yuan per hour for tutoring, earning two incomes from one job. Awesome!","Although teaching He Lingfeng previously always felt like being rushed by the child.","It was extremely fulfilling.","Later, he taught some ordinary children and realized he still preferred teaching geniuses.","Since he had the experience of teaching He Lingfeng, he was exceptionally well-prepared this time.","He came over and greeted Zhao Jie, who responded sweetly, \"Hello, teacher.\"","The little kid even pressed his chubby face against Su Jun and said, \"Everyone likes to pinch my face, do you want to feel it too? It feels great.\"","Su Jun laughed, who could resist that.","So he affectionately squeezed the child's big face.","Then he started teaching.","Zhao Jie's learning pace wasn't as outrageously fast as He Lingfeng's, but it was much quicker than ordinary children.","After the lesson ended, Su Jun went to find He Lingfeng.","The little kid was walking ahead. Su Jun snuck up from behind, hugging and pinching his face.","He Lingfeng didn't expect him to be such a person, accusing him with his eyes.","Clearly, the child didn't like getting his face pinched, except by Shen Wei.","But the child's adorable look was just too irresistible.","Even if the child didn't want it, He Lingfeng still pinched his face several times.","When Shen Wei came over, He Lingfeng finally escaped from Teacher Su Jun's \"claws.\"","Su Jun hurriedly let his disciple go.","He Lingfeng disappeared in a flash.","Su Jun didn't even get the spicy snacks he bought for the kids out.","Su Jun couldn't help but say, \"This child used to be soft and adorable, but how did he become a little iceberg now?\"","Shen Wei smiled, \"Being soft and adorable was just his disguise, actually He Lingfeng has an icy demeanor in his bones.\"","But he was somewhat better only to Shen Wei.","Su Jun also praised Zhao Jie highly. Shen Wei was very pleased.","When Professor Liu heard that Shen Wei had found another little genius, he immediately became excited, saying, \"I'm going to start a course on calculus and advanced mathematics now. Get ready, and I'll have the kid come and attend the class.\"","Shen Wei said, \"But the kid can't understand it yet.\"","Professor Liu said, \"Let him be exposed to it first. He'll be able to understand it later.\"","Shen Wei couldn't dissuade Professor Liu, so she started this course.","These days, everyone was focused on watching the flash mob. Fewer people were watching the kindergarten's daily life.","Shen Wei deliberately separated into two accounts, one for the flash mob store, and one for the kindergarten.","There were still some old fans who would come to watch the kids.","As a result, they discovered a shocking thing.","\"When did the kindergarten start teaching calculus and advanced mathematics?\"","What had happened at this kindergarten in the few days they hadn't visited?"]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102: Chef Liu Became Vain","paragraphs":["And so many college and high school students were pulled by their parents to watch online classes, with the ID being a kindergarten.","Down below were seen students like Zhao Jie, He Lingfeng, and some other little friends.","Professor Liu was lecturing on top. Outside the live stream, the students really understood.","As the professor explained lucidly and clearly.","Very accessible for high school or college students.","There were many people attending the course online.","But only a few delivered it in a way that was easy to understand, requiring the lecturer to have an exceptionally high level of proficiency.","This was a course specially tailored by Professor Liu for third-tier students, who would have thought it would be used here.","Many who attended the online classes felt the effect was quite good, and so it spread by word of mouth.","The kindergarten's official WeChat account gained many student fans, and this number kept increasing.","The academic atmosphere at the kindergarten was so strong.","Shen Wei was also very pleased.","Liu Chef approached Shen Wei about another matter: \"We can't finish all the vegetables in our little garden.\"","Previously, they had only opened up a small vegetable patch.","Liu Chef had never seen such a thing before.","From planting to harvesting, they just kept growing after being picked.","Tomatoes, cucumbers, just brushing off the dust and eating them fresh, soft and sweet in the mouth.","Much tastier than those bought from outside.","Liu Chef said, \"Can we give these to the students' parents?\"","He had his own little thoughts too.","The little garden produced such delicious vegetables, he couldn't help but want to hear praise from others.","Shen Wei said, \"Will it be enough?\"","They had quite a number of students now.","Liu Chef said, \"It's enough, I've been picking them for two days!\"","With two pounds given to each person, there was still plenty left.","Shen Wei said, \"Okay then, go ahead and arrange it.\"","Not just for the students' parents, but also for the teachers and teaching assistants as well.","After Liu Chef told Shen Wei about this, he happily went to announce it to everyone.","But as soon as he turned around, he saw his senior Chef Chen, holding a big ladle with a dark look on his face.","It gave Liu Chef quite a fright.","Chef Chen bitterly said, \"I've been eyeing that little vegetable garden for a while now, waiting for them to ripen so I could pick them. And you've gone and given away such good vegetables.\"","Liu Chef said, \"Well, shared joy is a greater joy!\"","With Chef Chen now wielding the ladle and receiving high praises, that was enough for him.","Liu Chef, having now retreated to the sidelines, still had a feeling of restless energy with no outlet.","His cooking prowess had also been overshadowed by Chef Chen, but this vegetable patch was what he tended to.","By giving them away, he could hear many praises.","This little thought, Chef Chen knew well, \"This once is allowed, but not again next time.\"","Liu Chef nodded and said, \"Got it!\"","He then cheerfully went out.","Chef Chen let out a cold snort, perhaps having stayed at the kindergarten for too long, he had become childish too.","Otherwise, it was hard to explain why he was so easily ruffled.","Ever since learning that the vegetable patch he had been watching over for a long time would be given away by his junior chef, Chef Chen's face was shrouded in black aura.","In the back kitchen, no one dared utter a word, for fear of provoking Chef Chen's anger.","So on that day when classes ended, every child carried a two-pound bag of vegetables, two varieties each.","Either cucumbers and tomatoes,","Or tomatoes and baby greens.","The tomatoes they had were exceptional, completely edible as fruits, with a well-balanced sweet and sour taste.","If sprinkled with white sugar, wow, a mouthful of sweet fragrance, perfect as a cold dish or even for drinking.","When Meng Meng came home carrying the vegetables, Elder Sister Xu asked, \"Where did these vegetables come from?\"","Meng Meng said, \"From the kindergarten, let's make something with them today!\"","Elder Sister Xu smiled and said, \"Sure, we'll go with what Meng Meng says!\" She stir-fried some tomato and egg, and sautéed the baby greens with garlic.","As the tomato and egg sizzled in the oil, the aroma of tomatoes quickly released.","The rich tomato fragrance was invigorating to smell.","Much more fragrant than the ones she used to buy from the market.","The eggs looked even more golden-yellow against the backdrop of the tomatoes.","Soon after they were plated, the other dish was cooked.","These vegetables should not be overcooked, and as soon as they were tossed in the wok, the whole family couldn't sit still anymore.","Her husband couldn't help but say, \"I wanted to go into the kitchen when you were cooking, it smelled so good!\"","\"Quick, give it a taste, these are from Meng Meng's kindergarten!\"","Meng Meng's father exclaimed in surprise, \"Wow, your kindergarten is so good they even give out vegetables!\"","As he spoke, he picked up a tomato and put it in his mouth, the sweet and sour taste was truly astonishing, making him crave rice.","After that one bite, everyone switched to using spoons, scooping the dishes onto their rice.","In no time, the tomato and egg was gone.","Everyone then moved their chopsticks to the sautéed greens.","The greens looked a bit plain.","The family didn't really enjoy eating them.","But this time, the greens tasted completely different, crisp and fresh with a sweet aftertaste when taken into the mouth.","For these two dishes, they would usually have some leftovers in the past.","But this time, they finished everything and still weren't full.","When Meng Meng's father went to get more rice, he found the rice pot empty. He said with embarrassment, \"You didn't cook much today!\"","Elder Sister Xu gave him a look, \"I cook this much every day!\"","Who knew these vegetables would be so enjoyable that it made the rice insufficient.","Elder Sister Xu said, \"Since you're still hungry, let me make you some noodles!\"","Meng Meng's father asked, \"Is there any more of those vegetables?\"","Elder Sister Xu said, \"There are a few leaves left, I was planning to make vegetable porridge for the child.\"","He felt a bit embarrassed, \"If it's for the child, then nevermind!\"","He couldn't very well take food from a child.","Elder Sister Xu said, \"Meng Meng eats better than you every day, if you're hungry, I'll use those vegetables to make you some noodles.\"","She realized that today's praise wasn't because of her cooking skills, but because the vegetables were good.","\"Okay then.\" Her husband grinned widely.","Soon a plate of plain noodles arrived, with the baby greens on top looking especially appetizing.","The greens that used to be just a garnish were completely finished today.","After they were full, he said, \"Wife, these vegetables are so delicious, ask them where they bought them, we should get some too next time!\"","Elder Sister Xu's pretty face turned red as she replied, \"Sure, I'll ask for you!\"","She then opened the WeChat group, which was flooded with people asking where they could buy these vegetables.","They were really too delicious.","Some weren't even willing to cook the cucumbers they got.","The whole family washed and snapped them open to eat raw.","The teachers said they were grown in the school's vegetable garden, organic vegetables without pesticides. But they're all gone now.","Next time, we'll talk about it if there's anything!","Everyone heard it's no wonder it tastes so good.","The parents of these students were praising the kindergarten to the skies, saying the kindergarten really does whatever it says, being so great at cultivating a small vegetable garden.","At this moment, Liu Chef, who had just returned home from work, was delightedly looking at his phone, unable to keep up with all the praises."]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103: King Zhou Experience Card","paragraphs":["Ever since the Starry Sky Kindergarten opened its pop-up store, it has become a sensation on social media.","Previously, the kindergarten's fans were mostly mothers, but now it has successfully gained popularity among young people.","Even the vegetables that the kindergarten gifted to parents went viral online.","Other kindergartens were gritting their teeth, thinking, \"How can a mere two pounds of vegetables make parents so nostalgic?\"","They wondered what spell Starry Sky Kindergarten had cast on the parents.","As a result, all kindergartens in the city started gifting vegetables as well.","They made it mandatory for parents to praise the kindergartens on social media.","After posting, the parents had to screenshot and send it to the teachers.","Many parents complained bitterly about it, as they were already overwhelmed with their own matters and now had to deal with these trivial kindergarten affairs!","The other kindergartens felt aggrieved too.","Why could the parents of Starry Sky Kindergarten praise it to the heavens for just gifting vegetables, while their kindergartens struggled to get parents to post on social media?","They were even mocked by the principal of the Noble Kindergarten in the kindergarten group chat, although he didn't name names directly.","The kindergartens that ran the vegetable-gifting program all felt humiliated but didn't dare to retaliate against the Noble Kindergarten, fearing internal injuries from suppressed anger.","...","The pop-up store of Starry Sky Kindergarten was already a hit in the days leading up to it.","Now, with the addition of professional theater instructors, it has become a sensation.","Unfortunately, by the time people wanted to participate, all the tickets were sold out.","Under every video posted by Starry Sky Kindergarten, there were people begging for tickets.","Even the personal accounts of Doctor Lu and Teacher Tang were flooded with pleas for tickets.","It was nearly impossible to get a ticket.","Even the elites who donated large sums to experience it were unable to get tickets.","Although they had no connection to the kindergarten, they could at least boast about participating in the activities with the elites in the future.","\"I used to play games with the elites,\" they could brag, sounding very impressive.","Unfortunately, Starry Sky Kindergarten's capacity was limited, and they didn't open up additional tickets.","Initially, Yu Fei was reluctant to visit Starry Sky Kindergarten with her best friend.","This was a ticket her best friend had managed to secure, which everyone wanted, but she still gave it to Yu Fei.","Logically, Yu Fei should have been touched, but in reality, she wasn't interested in the kindergarten at all.","Yu Fei's style was that of a fashionable trendsetter.","Normally, forget kindergartens, she even avoided children, finding them annoying.","Seeing crying children on high-speed trains in videos, she felt a sense of exasperation and wanted to shout, \"Get out!\"","She initially didn't want to go at all.","But her best friend got angry, saying it was such a rare ticket, and she had registered Yu Fei's information, so the ticket would be wasted if she didn't attend.","So Yu Fei reluctantly went along.","To be honest, Yu Fei's mood had been quite low lately.","Her boyfriend of 5 years, with whom she was discussing marriage, had cheated on her.","Now, she could only numb herself with work.","Business trips had become a routine for her. She didn't want any downtime or to \"play games\" at the kindergarten, like passing handkerchiefs or blindfolded foot massages – such childish activities.","On the day of the event, when the two friends arrived at the designated location, Yu Fei noticed her best friend had applied full makeup.","Her unsatisfied best friend said to her, \"Why didn't you put on makeup?\" They had agreed on it previously.","Yu Fei replied dismissively, \"Who am I putting on makeup for?\" She couldn't be bothered to make the effort.","With her natural bare face, Yu Fei still looked quite attractive, her fierce aura softened to resemble a girl-next-door.","Her best friend said, \"I just want you to cheer up a bit. Stop thinking about that scumbag. Let that scumbag and that sl*t be locked together forever.\"","Like a cheating scumbag, no matter who he's with, he won't be content.","Yu Fei said, \"It's in the past. I don't think about it anymore.\"","Seeing that Yu Fei didn't seem to be forcing herself, her best friend introduced, \"This place is really fun. Not only is there acting, but there are also various singing, dancing, painting, and calligraphy classes, and you can even have a big meal.\"","Yu Fei noticed her best friend's high spirits and could only muster up a half-hearted, \"That's great!\"","She really didn't have any enthusiasm and felt like her energy had been drained.","Her heartbreak couldn't be resolved by a kindergarten.","What she needed was a group of male models sweetly calling her \"sister\" – that might lift her mood a little.","When the two arrived at the entrance, they noticed a row of luxury cars parked outside.","Yu Fei was surprised. Were all the people coming to the kindergarten this wealthy?","Outside, many people were live-streaming and dressed in costumes – hanfu, battle robes, horse-face skirts, and more.","After verifying their tickets, they entered together.","Upon entering, they were greeted by a row of tall, muscular, and incredibly handsome young men over 1.8 meters tall.","Yu Fei was stunned, and her best friend exclaimed in delight, \"Oh my god, they're so handsome!\"","These handsome young men were security guards that Shen Wei had asked to ensure everyone's safety.","Although dressed in uniform patrol outfits, they exuded a sense of awe, as if wearing anti-explosion suits, their pheromones exploding.","Not only were those present flustered, but even online, there was a moment of breathlessness.","\"In 30 seconds, I need to get the specific information of these 20 handsome men.\"","\"What other surprises does Starry Sky Kindergarten have in store that I can't even imagine?\"","\"They're not just male models, but the kindergarten offers better value.\"","\"Don't mention value, it makes me want to cry – I don't have a ticket.\"","\"I hereby declare that I am Shen Wei's die-hard fan. She really... I'm crying. Previously, she turned the kindergarten into a place where commoners could enjoy aristocratic services at affordable prices, and now she's opened a pop-up store with professional instructors, professional chefs, and now a boy band of male models.\"","\"They're so handsome!\" While everyone online was drooling, those present had already started asking for WeChat contacts.","Those online could only rant, while the brave ones were already enjoying the experience.","\"Why them and not us? Just because we couldn't buy the $400 tickets?\"","People online were furious.","\"Previously, someone was willing to pay $10,000 for a ticket, and I thought they were crazy – how could anyone spend money like that? But now, I realize $10,000 is nothing. The pop-up store is about to end, and they've upgraded it again.\"","\"Oh my god, I'm dizzy. I want to faint into the chiseled chests of these handsome men.\"","\"Sister, please restrain yourself a bit. It's still daytime.\"","\"I'm a man, but I also want to lie on the pecs of a handsome guy.\"","\"Sorry, I'm a perceptive one, the scent alone got me going.\"","\"It's not Starry Sky Kindergarten, if you keep acting like this, it'll be hard for me to roast you in the future.\"","After a whole day of frolicking, Yu Fei was completely convinced, even a little carried away.","She was a bit of a slow starter.","At first, she had a cold expression on her face.","When acting, she happened to get the role of a tortured female lead.","Her outburst of crying stunned even her co-star.","Teacher Meng Zhi said she acted well.","In reality, she was just letting out all the frustration she had bottled up during this period.","It was an exhilarating release.","Outsiders found it perplexing, but after it ended, many people added her on WeChat.","Then she ate delicious food again,","And then there was painting, calligraphy, singing and dancing. After it ended, she was escorted out by a group of handsome security guards.","Her whole being felt light and airy, was this the happiness of a 400 yuan experience?","This was simply the Indulgence Experience Card."]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104: The Giraffe Kindergarten Turns Yellow","paragraphs":["Giraffe Kindergarten went downhill.","Giraffe Kindergarten was Teacher Tang's former employer, where he had worked for over 10 years.","Previously, they had a decent reputation, although not a high-end kindergarten, their fees were around 3,500. Their student enrollment was stable.","However, things went wrong after they had conflicts with Starry Sky Kindergarten multiple times, ultimately leading to their own downfall.","With parents withdrawing and even getting into physical altercations with parents, they ended up angering the parents' group.","The best batch of teachers from Giraffe Kindergarten left for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The remaining staff also quit.","With no teachers and no students, the principal had to disband the kindergarten.","They were left to rent out the kindergarten premises.","When Giraffe Kindergarten went bankrupt and settled accounts, they found that they hadn't earned a single penny that year, but had actually lost several hundred thousand.","It was like being trapped in an information cocoon.","While running the kindergarten, they thought everyone was in the same business.","But when they put the property up for rent, they realized that no one was interested.","For half a month, only one person inquired about it, wanting to open a restaurant.","They said they would have to demolish everything and install new ventilation ducts.","The principal initially refused and even mocked the person.","After that person left, there wasn't a single other inquiry.","In the end, they had no choice but to reluctantly go back to the person who wanted to open a restaurant.","They thought they could secure the deal first and then negotiate.","Otherwise, with the rental pressure, the rent for a year would be a considerable amount.","Little did they know that their previous poor attitude had angered the person, who refused to rent the place no matter what.","Not only were they scolded, but the agent also politely told them, \"Sister, you need to work on your attitude!\"","Back when they ran the kindergarten, everyone respected them. Now, no one pampered them.","Giraffe Kindergarten had no choice but to slash the price.","They sold the entire kindergarten at a considerably low price.","Seeing the fate of Giraffe Kindergarten, their peers in the industry couldn't help but sigh.","This time, they made up their mind to focus on their own business.","They wouldn't be like Giraffe Kindergarten, obsessively targeting Starry Sky Kindergarten like madmen.","Looking back at the recent conflicts with Starry Sky Kindergarten, they had no good outcome.","Including the previous Dan brand, which was considered a leader in the children's clothing industry, they were fined several billion and have now completely disappeared.","The comments made by these people in the kindergarten group were seen by Teacher Zhang from Noble Kindergarten.","She came and told the principal, \"These people have such a small mindset, running kindergartens without any ambition! Even a small influencer kindergarten makes them hesitant.\"","In the past, the principal of Noble Kindergarten would have certainly agreed and mocked them with a few words.","But now, she remained silent.","Even Teacher Zhang felt a bit awkward and asked, \"What's wrong?\"","The principal said, \"The shareholders are very dissatisfied!\"","This year, the proportion of noble children enrolling had decreased slightly, with several potential enrollments not materializing.","There were too many middle-class families, but they were of no use. One noble child was equivalent to 1,000 middle-class children.","Moreover, their expenses this year were exceptionally high, spending 20 million on advertising and promotion.","They also spent nearly 10 million to build a stable on campus.","But their student enrollment remained the same.","These tens of millions seemed to have been wasted, and the shareholders berated her yesterday.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten was a well-known figure in the industry.","But this was the first time she had been scolded like that by the shareholders.","She was utterly stunned.","The shareholders even said that if there was no improvement by the end of the year, they might consider replacing her as the kindergarten's principal.","The principal was terrified.","She couldn't afford to lose this position.","Her entire social status stemmed from this role. Without this identity, she couldn't imagine what she would face.","However, she couldn't share this with her subordinates.","But Teacher Zhang, her old colleague, asked, \"Is it an enrollment problem?\"","The principal didn't want to say it initially, but since the words were already on her lips, she admitted, \"Yes.\"","This issue had been weighing on her mind for several days.","Combined with the collapse of Giraffe Kindergarten,","Other kindergartens didn't dare challenge Starry Sky anymore.","Starry Sky had become their formidable rival. Their previous promotional tactics were no longer effective, and they didn't know what new strategies they could use against them.","Teacher Zhang said, \"Why don't we follow Starry Sky Kindergarten's approach?\"","The principal scoffed, \"What, are we going to hand out vegetables too? Didn't you see what I said in the group?\"","The families who send their children to their Noble Kindergarten all have nannies. Who would care about a bunch of vegetables?","Teacher Zhang said, \"That's not what I meant. The reason Starry Sky Kindergarten has such a good reputation is that they're spending money to gain popularity, right? They only charge 1,600 per person, but they provide services beyond that value. Whatever they do in the future, they'll have countless fans. The pop-up store is an example.\"","The principal's expression darkened, feeling that this tactic was too underhanded.","In general, even if they wanted to spend money, they wouldn't dare do it for such a long period.","The popularity of the pop-up store further boosted Starry Sky Kindergarten's reputation.","Several noble children who had agreed to enroll started observing the situation instead.","\"This is what they call the countryside surrounding the city,\" Teacher Zhang remarked about enrollment.","The principal's heart stirred, and she said, \"What did you say earlier?\" She had been interrupted before.","Teacher Zhang said, \"We've always offered high-end services. Why don't we open a mass-market class?\"","This was a long-standing discussion at Noble Kindergarten.","Previously, some colleagues suggested having elite classes, mass-market classes, and noble classes.","But everyone refused because they didn't lack students.","Even with such stringent financial requirements, parents would strive to meet them.","Over time, the employees at Noble Kindergarten became spoiled.","From top to bottom, they took pride in serving the wealthy.","As for children from the general public, they felt teaching them was a waste of time.","When Starry Sky Kindergarten live-streamed their interviews, many of their colleagues watched and mocked them.","At their kindergarten, many children were multilingual and had won international awards from an early age.","Unlike Starry Sky's students, who could only recite and perform skits, clearly destined to be small-town test-takers in the future.","But Shen Wei's strategy was truly effective. Starry Sky Kindergarten is now renowned.","Meanwhile, Noble Kindergarten is losing students.","You can use a broad student base to regain some lost reputation and impression points.","The principal said, \"Let me think about it again.\"","Teacher Zhang said, \"Okay, think about it first!\" Before leaving, he turned his head back impulsively. He found the principal frowning.","It is evident that Starry Sky Kindergarten has put a lot of pressure on them."]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105: Expanding the Vegetable Garden","paragraphs":["After Shen's Father recovered his health, he insisted on returning to the Starry Sky Kindergarten, and no one could stop him.","He had been hospitalized for over a month, constantly keeping an eye on the kindergarten and sending red envelopes to the employee group chat.","Seeing the bustling pop-up store, he had energy but nowhere to expend it.","Fortunately, his recovery was going well, and the doctor advised him to rest at home, but Shen Wei was concerned that he would overexert himself and wanted him to stay home.","He had previously been quite obedient to Shen Wei's words.","But after a month, he came to the kindergarten with his belongings, missing it too much.","Shen's Mother told Shen Wei, \"If you don't let your father come, he'll come anyway!\"","Faced with Shen's Mother's complaint, Shen's Father didn't refute it, only saying, \"I'm feeling much better now.\" He still spoke with a hint of concern for Shen Wei's reaction, fearing she wouldn't agree.","Shen Wei said, \"Okay. But don't overdo it.\"","Shen's Father nodded and finally broke into a smile.","Before coming, Shen's Father was afraid his daughter wouldn't agree.","He had truly become addicted to the Starry Sky Kindergarten and enjoyed the comfortable environment.","Everyone was busy with the same purpose, which was very invigorating.","Over the years, Shen's Father had made a considerable amount of money, either through land acquisitions and demolitions when he was younger or by buying stocks.","But he had never been involved in the industry and was often mocked by the so-called upper-class wealthy people.","Now, he could finally hold his head high.","Shen Wei gave Doctor Lu a few reminders.","Doctor Lu patted his chest and promised, \"I'll definitely keep an eye on Old Shen and make sure he doesn't overwork himself.\"","Shen Wei went to speak with Liu Chef, saying, \"By the end of the year, we'll give Doctor Lu a 20,000 yuan raise and make him a manager as well.\"","During this period, Doctor Lu had been busy without a break.","Liu Chef fully supported this decision, having long felt that Doctor Lu was a promising manager.","Doctor Lu was young and picked up new things exceptionally fast.","With him around, Liu Chef could take it a bit easier.","Now that Liu Chef's vegetable garden had become popular, many students' parents were willing to pay high prices to buy the produce.","They also enthusiastically posted positive reviews online.","Being praised so lavishly, Liu Chef had truly become addicted.","What Liu Chef didn't know was that the seeds for this little vegetable garden were provided by Shen Wei.","They were seeds selected by the System, with high yields, pest and disease resistance, and exceptional flavor.","Compared to the vegetables from large greenhouses, their vegetables were a level above.","Anyone who tasted them had nothing but praise.","Liu Chef wanted to continue developing this vegetable garden.","But Chef Chen had been keeping an eye on him.","The last time, he had distributed the produce without consulting anyone, and Chef Chen had been furious. Now, he still had a sour expression whenever he saw Liu Chef.","Currently, Liu Chef's only regret was the small size of the vegetable garden.","If they could secure a larger plot of land,","not only could they distribute the produce to the students' parents, but they could also use it in their own kitchen. Wouldn't that be the best of both worlds?","The more he thought about it, the more he felt the idea was feasible.","Coincidentally, Shen Wei brought up Doctor Lu's matter with him, and after discussing that, he mentioned his own idea: \"It would be great if we could secure another plot of land.\"","Shen Wei was slightly tempted as well.","With their current number of people, their daily food purchases were a substantial expense.","And she had accumulated quite a few seeds from completing tasks.","As Shen Wei was contemplating this, the System released a new task.","\"Please have Shen Wei open a five-acre vegetable garden next to the Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"Upon completion, you will be rewarded with 2 million yuan, 10,000 points, and a 10kg seed lootbox.\"","Shen Wei immediately accepted the task.","After accepting it, she realized she had acted too hastily.","She had just seen the vegetable garden task and without carefully reading the details, she discovered the requirement was to open it next to the kindergarten.","Ever since the Starry Sky Kindergarten became popular, the property prices in the surrounding area had skyrocketed.","Originally, this location was average, but now the price per square meter for the surrounding buildings had risen to 10,000 yuan!","There was a large car wash business next door that was up for sale. From the initial asking price of 1 million yuan at the beginning of the year, it had now risen to 2 million!","This kind of place was considered unappealing by the wealthy but unaffordable for the poor.","For the sake of a vegetable garden, spending 2 million yuan was even too much for a wealthy person like Shen Wei.","It was as if the System had calculated everything in advance, and even with the reward, it would barely be enough.","Now, the rewards it offered were not as generous as before.","The System seemed to sense Shen Wei's inner grumbling.","The System's cold, mechanical voice said, \"The previous rewards were for new users.\"","For this small task, what attracted her most were the 10kg seed lootbox and the point rewards.","As for negotiating prices and handling related business matters, Gu Qingyan was undoubtedly the most suitable candidate.","He had done an excellent job with the previous Starry Sky pop-up store.","Not surprising for someone from a renowned business family.","Even without prior experience, he picked things up quickly.","In the last event with the Starry Sky pop-up store, he had secured a solid foothold in the kindergarten, which made him quite pleased.","Already good-looking, his arrogance had increased, and he often tilted his chin up, making people want to pinch him.","This time, Shen Wei sought him out again.","Upon hearing about the task, he immediately became energized.","Learning that Shen Wei was willing to spend 2 million yuan on a vegetable garden, he didn't object at all.","He and Shen Wei were of the same age.","Nowadays, thanks to the kindergarten, Shen Wei had successfully achieved upward social mobility and gained a good reputation among the wealthy class.","Previously, she had never been involved in kindergartens, but now she was exerting such significant pressure on prestigious kindergartens, a classic example of a counterattack taken to the extreme.","Gu Qingyan had a somewhat biased view of Shen Wei.","Even if Shen Wei spent 2 million yuan on a vegetable garden,","Gu Qingyan thought it was impressive.","He immediately went to negotiate and bargain with the car wash owner.","Initially, the owner wanted to sell for 1 million yuan but backed out.","Now, they were asking for 2 million yuan, leaving room for negotiation.","Ultimately, through Gu Qingyan's bargaining skills, they settled on 1.5 million yuan.","However, demolishing the entire area not only required filing paperwork but also involved demolition costs.","With various fees added up, the total cost was 500,000 yuan.","In the end, it still amounted to 2 million yuan.","The authorities quickly approved their plan.","Soon after, construction work began next door.","If someone else had attempted this, it would have been extremely difficult.","Because it was right next to a kindergarten,","the loud noises and pervasive dust would have had a significant impact on the children's health.","Shen Wei specifically used 500 points from the System's point mall to redeem a massive dust barrier.","The kindergarten was securely enclosed within it!","The children were transported to and from school by shuttle buses, avoiding any contact with dust, and even the noise was minimal.","It didn't affect the children running and playing in the Starry Sky Kindergarten at all!","Shen Wei thought spending 2 million on a vegetable garden would make others in the kindergarten think it was absurd.","These days, she felt a little self-conscious walking around the kindergarten.","Unexpectedly, others, like Gu Qingyan, had an inexplicable reverence for Shen Wei.","Especially Liu Chef, he had reddened eyes several times when looking at Shen Wei.","Liu Chef never expected Shen Wei to take his words so much to heart.","Just because he casually mentioned something, Shen Wei actually paid such a high price for it.","Having such a great leader who values her employees' words, at that moment, he instantly understood the ancient feeling of willing to die for one's mentor.","Liu Chef's gaze towards Shen Wei became complicated.","Regardless of what others think, he was determined to follow Shen Wei to the end.","Upon hearing this, Chef Chen was also stunned.","The vegetables from the garden were of much better quality than those bought from the market.","For an excellent chef, having good ingredients made cooking more enjoyable.","Now that this had happened, seeing Liu Chef's eagerness to sacrifice himself for Shen Wei, he understood.","No wonder Liu Chef refused to leave no matter how many people tried to poach him.","Shen Wei was someone worth following.","Chef Chen was also touched.","Shen Wei didn't expect that by simply completing a task for the System, she unexpectedly won everyone's heart."]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106: Lotus Flower Wall","paragraphs":["What Shen Wei is most focused on now is Zhao Jie's learning progress. This child is certified by the System as a local genius.","He is currently taking supplementary lessons from Su Jun as well.","Apparently, Professor Liu has also been paying close attention to him.","He specifically sought out Su Jun to ask how the child has been learning recently.","Su Jun is quite conscientious and responsible.","It was under his guidance that He Lingfeng made remarkable progress at the beginning.","Su Jun said, \"Zhao Jie does not learn as quickly as He Lingfeng, but once he has learned something, he grasps it firmly. His learning is exceptionally solid.\"","No one else can match He Lingfeng's ability to complete an entire grade's worth of knowledge points in just one hour.","If this were told to his classmates, they would not believe it.","Although Zhao Jie's learning progress is slower than He Lingfeng's, it is still faster than other children.","Su Jun also remarked with a hint of awe, \"Before meeting He Lingfeng and Zhao Jie, I was considered highly praised from a young age, but now I realize that there are always greater people and even greater heights.\"","Shen Wei smiled and said, \"I can rest assured leaving him in your care. If any teaching materials or anything else need to be purchased, go ahead and buy them first, then submit the receipts to the accountant for reimbursement.\"","Su Jun replied, \"Understood.\"","He still hopes to create another miracle like He Lingfeng.","Su Jun truly marvels that encountering someone like He Lingfeng in a lifetime is already considered an eye-opening experience.","Yet, he has now encountered two such individuals.","He is immensely excited.","After chatting with Su Jun for a while and making the necessary arrangements, Shen Wei started to leave but noticed a timid little child peeking at her from the corner.","As soon as Shen Wei approached, the little one immediately hid, leaving only a corner of their clothes visible.","It was Mu Zhixing.","Shen Wei approached and said, \"Why are you here?\"","At that moment, Mu Zhixing was holding a painting she had just completed - a wall of hibiscus flowers.","Upon seeing Shen Wei, she shyly handed the painting to her.","Shen Wei was pleasantly surprised. True to her talent as a painting prodigy, she had captured the floral shapes remarkably well after only learning for a short time. The colors she used were also vibrant and striking.","Shen Wei pinched the little one's cheeks affectionately. The child was shy.","In her previous home, Mu Zhixing held a low status.","Not only was she beaten and scolded by her mother, but she was also humiliated by her younger sister.","After coming here, every teacher has treated her kindly, an immense kindness the little one had never experienced before.","Being introverted by nature, she could not easily change right away.","She expressed all her thoughts through painting.","Since Qi Zhong started mentoring her, her painting skills have soared.","The calligraphy teacher has also been cultivating her at the same time.","Calligraphy and painting are inseparable.","Proficiency in calligraphy promotes better line work in painting.","Therefore, her foundation is solid, and each painting she creates is more beautiful than the last.","This hibiscus wall painting is vibrant in color, exquisite in brushwork, and it's hard to imagine that it was created by a child.","Mu Zhixing has always been mature for her age, aware that she has nothing exceptional to offer, so she spent a long time on this painting.","Moreover, she was born with an innate sense of perspective.","Just by observing the shape of the flowers, she could paint an entire wall of them.","It's as if the heavens aren't just giving her a meal, but force-feeding her.","Shen Wei loves this painting.","When Mu Zhixing becomes famous, each of her paintings will be worth over millions. They will have more collectible value than antiques.","What surprised Shen Wei the most is that this painting is an original creation by Mu Zhixing.","Seeing that Shen Wei liked it, the little one smiled and ran off.","Shen Wei took the painting back to her office. After walking a few steps, she saw the painting teacher, Qi Zhong.","\"So this painting was for you!\" he said in a sour tone. \"She spent a very long time on this painting.\"","Even with his professional eye, he was very fond of it.","More importantly, the painting radiated vitality.","Previously, the child liked to paint oceans and planets, all in beautiful shades of blue.","But the education expert Weng Lan said this child showed tendencies of autism.","Loneliness made her feel safe.","However, starting with this painting, the little one seemed to have truly emerged from the gloom and into the sunshine.","Both the artistic value of this painting and the story behind its creation are remarkable.","Qi Zhong collects all of Mu Zhixing's paintings.","He wanted this one too.","He didn't expect her to give it to Shen Wei.","As an artist himself, Qi Zhong knows that such an immersive and uninhibited creative experience is a rare opportunity for anyone.","He couldn't help but feel a twinge of jealousy.","Previously, when teaching Mu Zhixing, he only saw that the child had a talent for painting.","As someone so focused on his craft, he was completely unaware of the child's original family situation.","It was only by chance that he heard about it from the calligraphy teacher.","Qi Zhong was almost infuriated.","He could hardly bear to imagine what the child would have faced if Shen Wei hadn't rescued her from that cruel birth mother and stepfather with disturbing tendencies.","To Shen Wei, Qi Zhong is grateful.","Years ago, it was because of a student's issue that Qi Zhong suffered a major career setback.","It's hard to say whether he regretted it later or not.","But if it were Mu Zhixing's case, he would have done the same thing.","His personality simply cannot tolerate any slight injustice.","Coupled with his protectiveness, seeing his own students being mistreated would be even more painful than being mistreated himself.","Furthermore, Qi Zhong had previously suffered a major setback in life due to a student-related incident, so he deeply resonates with and approves of Shen Wei's actions to stand up for her students, as they are kindred spirits.","The only difference is that Qi Zhong's actions were too extreme back then, ruining his prospects.","Apparently, even after such a major incident, Mu Zhixing's birth mother still hasn't divorced this stepfather.","Fortunately, the law is fair and just, and this man has been arrested.","He lost his job, and now he has no choice but to face issues like moving homes.","Because no one wants to be in the same neighborhood as someone like him.","Qi Zhong has developed a closer relationship with Mu Zhixing.","This child may have developed a deep psychological scar from the trauma inflicted by her stepfather.","She has an innate aversion to men and is much more comfortable with women.","She especially adores Shen Wei.","Sometimes, a single word of praise from Shen Wei can make the little girl jump around gleefully all day.","His care for his disciple has touched Qi Zhong's heart, and he has come to respect Shen Wei even more as a teacher.","Qi Zhong said to Shen Wei, \"Could you let me scan this painting first?\"","He collects Mu Zhixing's paintings and plans to publish a collection for her in the future.","Shen Wei agreed. He carefully took the painting to scan it.","Afterwards, he repeatedly reminded Shen Wei to preserve it properly.","He repeated himself so many times that it almost became rude, but he couldn't help it."]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107: Master Chef Liu's Battle with his Apprentice","paragraphs":["When Shen Wei was talking to Qi Zhong, Su Jun suddenly rushed in and said that there was trouble.","Su Jun's face had turned pale, and then he took out his phone to show Shen Wei. Their pop-up store had been doing very well, with only four or five days left before it closed.","Many people had left comments below, hoping that it wouldn't end.","They said they hadn't had enough and many people hadn't managed to get tickets.","Some who had experienced it even wanted to revisit.","Just when the hype was at its peak, Shen Qingqing opened an amusement arcade.","It was clearly targeted at the pop-up store of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Not only did it have large-scale immersive murder mystery games, but also dance classes, music classes, and a self-service restaurant. At a glance, it was imitating what they had been doing.","Crucially, their competitor's ticket price was 300 yuan per person, a full 100 yuan cheaper than their own.","And it was located diagonally across from them.","This infuriated Su Jun. It wasn't that they weren't allowed to do it, but their intentions were just too obvious.","Now their pop-up store was ending.","A large number of returning customers wanted to come back again.","With the high imitation amusement arcade opening, all their initial efforts had essentially brought customers to their competitor.","Everyone knew about the conflict between Shen Qingqing and Shen Wei.","There had been two incidents before, and no one had expected even a relative to be so mean. People generally disliked Shen Qingqing.","After Shen Qingqing partnered up with Lu Zheng, she came and issued threats.","Although they were heavily criticized online, it still ruined the reputation of the kindergarten.","And now she was pulling this stunt again. She was really pushing them to the limit!","Su Jun asked, \"What should we do now?\"","Qi Zhong had just come to chat, but he didn't expect to run into such a situation. \"You two discuss it, I'll leave.\"","The two of them didn't think much of it, but then Qi Zhong went and told Liu Chef about the matter.","Liu Chef was furious when he heard about it.","He ranted about it in the group chat, and in an instant, everyone knew.","Shen Wei's parents had just returned from their vacation.","They were specifically in charge of the small vegetable garden. It was the lightest task, and they could also see the fruits and vegetables being harvested.","But when they saw this incident in the group chat, Shen's Father's smile immediately disappeared.","Since the last time Shen Qingqing had caused trouble online, the two families had been at odds.","This time, he immediately called Shen Qingqing's parents and angrily criticized Shen Qingqing's dishonorable actions.","He said that even in business, there were limits to how much one could exploit others.","Ever since Shen Qingqing had partnered with Lu Zheng, the Shen family had become arrogant.","Now, when Shen's Father called, they immediately said, \"What, only you're allowed to make money, and others aren't?\"","Shen's Father said, \"Are we talking about the same thing?\"","The other party snorted and said, \"Just do it, and let's see who has the real ability!\"","They even said a few harsh words, which made Shen's Father so angry that he hung up the phone.","When the people in the group learned about this incident, the employees were all very worried.","The news couldn't be hidden, so Shen Wei announced that a meeting would be held.","The meeting mainly covered two points.","First, the pop-up store would be closed for five days.","After 5 days, the pop-up store would start selling tickets again.","During this time, everyone had been busy without rest. They had indeed reached their limit.","The employees also needed to rest properly.","Second, the pop-up store would remain open.","From then on, it would operate four days a week, with tickets for each week going on sale every Monday.","Originally, the pop-up store was meant to be a temporary amusement, and later it would become the second branch of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","But they hadn't expected the pop-up store to become so popular right from the start.","The craze kept growing fiercer, and even she couldn't easily say it would close.","Fortunately, she had enough money during this period. She could open a second branch anytime.","This news lifted the spirits of all the employees.","The success of the pop-up store wasn't just due to the amusement projects. It was because everyone's love for Starry Sky Kindergarten had been extended to these games.","After the meeting, no one paid any attention to Shen Qingqing.","As long as Shen Wei didn't mess things up, no one cared about Shen Qingqing.","...","Shen Wei was somewhat speechless. It seemed that Shen Qingqing, her sister, had taken on the role of an overbearing female lead, obsessed with whatever Lu Zheng loved.","Why was she always fixated on her?","If the kindergarten was popular, she had to do a kindergarten.","If the pop-up store was popular, she had to open an amusement arcade.","Shen Wei was puzzled. Did these two even have time for a romance, with how closely Shen Qingqing was watching her every move?","Shen Wei had previously thought that they might be imitated, because the market was huge and there was an undersupply.","Everyone could see it.","An entertainment experience costing 400 yuan per person was not a small amount.","There were bound to be many people wanting to enter the industry. But she didn't expect it to happen so quickly.","This pop-up store had become extremely popular.","Even the cultural and tourism authorities had taken notice. Apparently, people from other cities wanted to experience it.","Because of this, they had even called Shen Wei, hoping she wouldn't close the pop-up store.","After the meeting, the employees' hearts were settled.","When they first heard about it, they were furious.","Now, everyone felt much more relaxed.","They marveled at how composed Shen Wei was.","Liu Chef had initially breathed a sigh of relief, but he quickly became enraged over another matter.","His former disciple Liu Ming, who had been expelled from the sect, was now working as the head chef of the self-service restaurant at Shen Qingqing's amusement arcade.","Shen Qingqing's relationship with Shen Wei was complicated.","And the disciple clearly knew that he was at Starry Sky, yet he had provided a gimmick for someone else.","Liu Chef was furious.","He wasn't even this angry when his disciple had betrayed him before.","Shen Wei had been generous to Liu Chef, making him the deputy principal in charge of everything.","And previously, just because of something he said, 2 million yuan had been invested in the small vegetable garden.","He didn't want Shen Wei to face backlash again because of him.","So he took the disciple's number out of his blacklist and purposely called him. The other person answered quickly.","\"Liu Ming, what are you thinking, trying to go against me?\" Liu Chef was truly heartbroken.","He had raised this disciple like a son before.","After this incident, he had been criticized by many peers in the culinary world for lack of discipline.","And now the disciple was stabbing him in the back again and again. Was he just a pincushion that could be stabbed freely?","As expected, Liu Ming said, \"I have no choice, I need to make a living too.\"","In the end, he said meaningfully, \"When I wanted to go to Starry Sky Kindergarten before, you didn't agree. Just give your disciple a way to survive.\"","Liu Chef said, \"Although our master-disciple relationship has ended, if you still remember that I was once your teacher, then you should resign from there, and I'll let bygones be bygones.\"","Liu Ming laughed, \"You sound so magnanimous.\"","Liu Chef said, \"Don't you understand what they mean by using you? They want to challenge me to a cook-off.\"","His apprentice, Liu Ming, replied, \"I know.\"","Liu Chef was left speechless.","Liu Ming continued, \"I used to truly respect you as my master, but no matter how I cook, my dishes never taste as good as yours. Are you secretly holding back techniques? How could you be so malicious, Master?\"","Liu Chef, being a kind-hearted soul, was taken aback. This was the first time anyone had called him malicious.","He chuckled in disbelief, \"Your talent is limited. How dare you blame me for that?\"","Seeing that his words weren't getting through, Liu Chef said, \"Since you insist on a cook-off, I won't hold back!\"","The idea of Liu Ming challenging him to a cook-off was laughable. Did he even realize his own capabilities?","As for Liu Ming's accusations, they were utterly baseless.","In the culinary world, natural talent is also crucial.","Some aspects, like heat control, temperature, and timing, are quite mystical. Even with the same dish and identical steps, some people's cooking tastes better than others.","It's absurd to blame the teacher when one lacks talent.","He didn't want this cook-off, but he certainly didn't want to lose.","Over the years, he hadn't been idling in the culinary world. He had catered for many distinguished guests.","Through this time, he had amassed quite a few favors.","Now that his apprentice and Shen Qingqing had pushed him this far...","Even a cornered rabbit will bite.","How much more so a human?","So, he decided to directly reveal the list of master chefs he had been working with recently.","At Starry Sky Kindergarten, where people had spent a few hundred yuan, they had been enjoying meals prepared by state banquet chefs.","In the past, everyone praised the food as delicious, unaware of the caliber of chefs behind the scenes.","This time, with Liu Chef's public revelation, those dazzling reputations would instantly blind many with their brilliance."]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108: Lost in Mahjong","paragraphs":["People who have been to the Starry Sky Flash Store think the food there is incredibly delicious.","After eating there, everyone is haunted by the memory.","The peculiar thing is, no matter where else they go to eat, they feel it's not as good as the Starry Sky.","That is, until Liu Chef revealed the names of the master chefs who had been helping at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","In an instant, all the old foodies were stunned.","\"What's this about Master Chen going there to work at the buffet? Why didn't anyone tell me?\"","\"Not just Master Chen, even Masters Li and Zhang are reclusive old legends. To get them to make a dish for you, you'd have to book from the start to the end of the year.\"","\"They went to the Starry Sky Kindergarten to help out in the kitchen?\"","\"You don't know how many people Liu Chef has helped before. Whoever he calls will come to support him.\"","\"Oh my, if I had known, I would have gone too. When did this happen?\"","\"These people are so unreliable, secretly getting together to make delicious food.\"","\"What is this kindergarten?\" Some of the older folks who don't go online much still didn't understand what was going on, so the others quickly explained.","For just 400 yuan, they could eat food made by these masters.","And they could eat as much as they wanted, leaving all the foodies amazed.","Each one regretted why Liu Chef didn't say so sooner. If he had, they would have definitely gone too.","The younger ones reminisced, \"No wonder, I have a new bragging point now.\"","\"I ate food made by chefs who cook for state banquets.\"","\"Now I really wish I could rub it in my colleague's face. My colleague got two tickets and said he'd bring me. I just gave him 400 yuan, had a great time, and the food was good. Now seeing the list of chefs, I'm totally stunned.\"","\"What, your colleague even brought you? He only got one ticket before, and my brother wanted to go but I didn't let him. Now that these chefs' backgrounds are exposed, I feel like my brother's silent treatment towards me will be extended.\"","\"I need to go again. Last time I was like Zhu Bajie eating the reincarnation pills, just gulping everything down. If I had known, I would have savored each bite carefully.\"","\"Thankfully I had 4 bowls of rice and a bunch of dishes there, really getting my money's worth from the ticket price.\"","\"Why didn't anyone post reviews after eating there?\"","\"What good would a review do? It's not like getting a good review means you can eat there.\"","Shen Qingqing wanted to draw everyone's attention to her place.","But Liu Chef only had to reveal this one move, and everyone's eyes shifted back there again.","Instantly, the arcade was overshadowed.","For master chefs like them, money can't sway them. What they need is connections.","Ever since Shen Qingqing hired Liu Ming as the head chef, she has blocked all the paths in the culinary world.","Now people are clamoring even more loudly, hoping the Starry Sky Kindergarten will keep its flash store open, as they don't want to go anywhere else.","Shen Qingqing was almost furious enough to die.","She had invested no small amount of money recently, all to fiercely compete for attention.","Knowing full well her disciple's grudge against Liu Chef, she still did this just for publicity.","But she didn't expect her ploy to be seen through.","With this move, Liu Chef instantly put them on the defensive.","So Shen Qingqing had her operations team increase the budget and get the promotion in place. On opening day, quite a few people came.","A 300 yuan day pass that included one meal was reasonable.","Especially for those who couldn't get tickets to the Starry Sky Kindergarten, going here to satisfy their urges was acceptable.","Some were cautious and waited for reviews first.","After the day ended, the positive reviews poured in, with comments including at least 5 pictures.","The decor, facilities, activities - everything was thoroughly described, each comment over a thousand words like mini essays.","You rarely see good reviews this detailed anywhere.","But people kept going online feeling something was off, very strange.","They couldn't help but ask those who had been to the Starry Sky Kindergarten - did they praise it this much back then?","Netizens joked: \"When did we have time to praise it? We were too busy eating, drinking, and having fun there. Taking out our phones to take photos would have killed the vibe.\"","\"Could this be Shen Qingqing's internet brigade?\"","Soon this comment was reported and hidden from view.","Thanks to the good reviews, even more people came the next day.","The third day also saw no lack of people.","But with more people came reviews that were less than flattering.","Many knew about the Starry Sky Kindergarten's flash store.","They livestream everything they do and eat there for all to see.","At this place, though the decor was beautiful, there was an overwhelmingly strong smell of new renovations. If you stayed over 4 hours, you'd start to feel dizzy.","To compete with Shen Wei for business, Shen Qingqing had just renovated this place and hired a professional team to apply some deodorizing coating.","Then she opened right away, not wanting to wait even a day.","She was determined to start harvesting fans as soon as Shen Wei's business closed.","Not only did people complain about the smell of renovations, but many more criticized the disorganized processes.","Many activities were so boring, people just left halfway through.","It was chaotic like a marketplace.","Even the large-scale role-playing murder mystery event had a very average game master.","It was hard to get immersed, with them just reading from a script.","Some couples who came together even got into fights because of in-game couples pairing up with different people.","But what left everyone speechless was the buffet.","This place advertised that Liu Ming was Liu Chef's disciple, so expectations were high.","But the taste was just average restaurant quality.","People had come with empty stomachs, hoping to really indulge, but after a few bites they were put off by the greasiness.","They really couldn't stomach much.","With such a chaotic start and chaotic end, people not only didn't get any happiness for their 300 yuan, but were left fuming!","As soon as they got home, they posted lengthy negative reviews of several thousand words. But as soon as they posted them and went back to check for typos, they found their posts had been reported.","Seeing a screen full of positive reviews, what wasn't clear now?","These days people are all about being contrarian rebels.","The more you try to stop them from posting, the more determined they become.","So they posted negative reviews on other platforms instead.","When the incident happened, subordinates hurriedly told Shen Qingqing, \"Quick, hire a PR firm to counter the negativity!\"","But Shen Qingqing, remembering Shen Wei's reaction back then, immediately started a livestream instead.","Her subordinates thought this was Shen Qingqing wanting to clarify some things and apologize.","However, she didn't expect that in response to those negative reviews, she would warn the reviewers that they were professional critics, and has already sent them legal notices.","The other staff at the video game arcade turned green with envy. Wow, were the netizens scared off?","Isn't this just fanning the flames?","Sure enough, a torrent of outrage from netizens came pouring down.","The staff at the video game arcade were dumbfounded."]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109: Clowns always come to dance","paragraphs":["Shen Qingqing was at her wits' end.","With no other choice, she had to seek help from Lu Zheng.","Ever since he got together with Shen Qingqing, Lu Zheng had felt like he was intoxicated by love.","Although his millions-worth video game arcade was also very important to him, seeing his woman crying her heart out made him ache with sympathy. He hurried to console Shen Qingqing.","At this moment, the CEO's assistant came and told Lu Zheng, \"Mr. Lu, Ms. Lin Rui is back.\"","Those words made Shen Qingqing's face turn pale.","Lu Zheng quickly frowned, because this Lin Rui was his fiancée.","In these wealthy families, arranged marriages were a necessity. So they would select a spouse at an early age.","But in recent years, things were different from before. Even for arranged marriages, the opinions of the two people involved had to be considered.","Lu Zheng and Lin Rui were childhood friends.","When they got engaged initially, they were both willing.","Later, Lu Zheng went abroad to study and returned a year earlier to take over the family business. Lin Rui was still studying abroad, and that's when they parted ways.","Little did they expect that Lu Zheng would encounter true love in the meantime.","He had long forgotten about his faraway fiancée.","Perhaps the fiancée had caught wind of something and rushed over.","Shen Qingqing had known about Lu Zheng and Lin Rui's situation all along.","But she didn't expect her to return so soon. \"You should go find your fiancée,\" she said.","The domineering Lu Zheng blocked her waist. \"What are you trying to say?\"","Shen Qingqing's eyes turned red.","The CEO's assistant couldn't say anything else, as the person in question had already arrived downstairs. Even he, the chief assistant, was feeling tense.","The lovestruck couple in front of him was oblivious to everything else.","Indeed, a high salary wasn't easy to earn.","Actually, he had some reservations about Shen Qingqing. Although it was a business marriage, Lin Rui was still Lu Zheng's girlfriend in name.","Yet Shen Qingqing was shamelessly clinging to him. Wasn't she a third party?","Ever since Shen Qingqing became close to Lu Zheng, her arrogance had skyrocketed.","Little did she know, all this was being live-streamed by the system for Shen Wei to see.","Shen Wei sighed, Shen Qingqing's love life was quite dramatic.","When Lin Rui entered and saw the two embracing, her face turned pale as she said to Lu Zheng, \"What is the meaning of this?\"","Lin Rui had a stunning and elegant appearance, with curled hair and a windbreaker, exuding the aura of a fashionable beauty.","Combined with her overseas education, she was far more poised and beautiful than Shen Qingqing in every way.","Watching the live stream, Shen Wei found it hard to understand why this domineering CEO seemed blinded, letting go of such a beautiful fiancée and instead favoring the devious Shen Qingqing.","Ever since Shen Wei learned that her original life was a book, and witnessing the lack of affection between Shen Qingqing and Lu Zheng, she couldn't help but feel sympathetic toward Lin Rui.","After all, Lin Rui and Lu Zheng were childhood sweethearts.","Now that they were nearing marriageable age, this incident was a blow no one could bear.","Not only was it emotionally damaging, but it would also invite public ridicule.","True to his domineering nature, Lu Zheng immediately shielded Shen Qingqing behind him. \"I'm sorry, but as you can see, this is the person I truly love. I will dissolve our marriage engagement. Please do not barge into my office again, it's impolite.\"","Lin Rui was angered to the point of laughter. \"You really want to throw away our years of affection for this person?\"","Seeing Lin Rui, Shen Qingqing felt like an ugly duckling confronted by a swan, filled with self-doubt and guilt.","But Lu Zheng insisted, \"I have never had any romantic feelings for you. I've always seen you as a sister.\"","In an instant, Lin Rui was devastated.","Now he was trying to sound noble, but in high school, they had shared a passionate kiss under the moonlight.","What kind of \"brother\" would do that to a \"sister\"?","If he had simply admitted to not loving her, Lin Rui might have respected his courage.","But now, not only did he not love her, he wanted to erase their past. She could only see him as a shameless scoundrel.","Oblivious to Lin Rui's thoughts, Lu Zheng continued to lecture her self-righteously, \"Please do not harbor any inappropriate thoughts about me.\"","In that moment, Lin Rui was utterly humiliated.","For them to engage in such a shameless act, only to be mocked by high society.","Did they really think she was some kind of prize to be won?","True, the Lu family had an impressive pedigree. But the Lin family was no pushover either.","Lin Rui said, \"Fine. From today onwards, we are severing all ties! I will inform everyone that our engagement is off.\"","Lu Zheng hadn't expected Lin Rui's reaction to be so intense, and for a moment, he felt uneasy.","He didn't like arranged marriages.","But he hadn't intended to completely burn bridges either.","After Lin Rui left, Shen Qingqing suggested, \"Shouldn't we go and explain things to her?\"","Lu Zheng replied curtly, \"No need.\" His expression remained cold, as if someone owed him millions.","Lu Zheng was handsome, and with his family background, he had been showered with love letters since childhood.","Lin Rui's departure didn't make him reflective. Instead, he felt a sense of humiliation.","He was truly furious.","...","After successfully witnessing this dramatic scene, Shen Wei received a message from the system: \"The enemy of your enemy is your friend. Issuing a new system quest - recruit Lin Rui into your team, and successfully complete it to earn a 15% reward for reversing the storyline.\"","Shen Wei sighed, realizing the system always had an ulterior motive. No wonder it had revealed this information to her - it was to issue a new quest. But this aligned with her own intentions.","After accepting the quest, she immediately contacted Lin Rui.","Before coming, Lin Rui had already learned about the relationships between Shen Qingqing, Shen Wei, and others.","Now, receiving Shen Wei's call, she was a little surprised, not expecting Shen Wei to act so quickly.","Although they moved in the same wealthy circles, Shen Wei was previously considered a nouveau riche, not highly regarded by the wealthy elite.","But Lin Rui had a decent impression of Shen Wei from their previous encounters at social events.","In this moment, with Shen Wei's invitation, Lin Rui accepted after some thought.","They met at a bustling café in the city.","When meeting Shen Wei, Lin Rui intentionally wore sky-high heels and red lipstick.","The necklace she wore cost over a hundred thousand yuan.","With a hint of wariness in her eyes, she regarded Shen Wei, \"Why did you call me here?\"","Lin Rui knew about the conflict between Shen Qingqing and Shen Wei, and while she hoped Shen Wei would win, she didn't want to become a target herself.","\"I'm very sorry about what happened between you and Mr. Lu. I didn't expect my own cousin to stoop so low. But don't be too heartbroken, there will be better opportunities in the future.\"","A look of gloom crossed Lin Rui's eyes.","In the business world, where comparisons were rife, she had been cast aside.","Lu Zheng would rather have a woman of poor character than her, and she could only imagine the mockery she would face.","Seeing that Shen Wei didn't continue, Lin Rui took the initiative, \"If you're trying to get me to go after Shen Qingqing, I'm not interested.\"","Shen Wei said, \"Have you heard of the kindergarten I run?\"","Lin Rui nodded.","She had heard about it even when she was abroad.","It was truly remarkable. Shen Wei had gained tremendous reputation and attention through it, far exceeding the subsidies she received.","As long as people trusted her, she could succeed in whatever she did.","The pop-up store was an example.","Lin Rui studied economics and was very interested in the kindergarten.","Shen Wei said, \"If you join our team, even if you don't do anything, it would still make them feel deeply hurt and resentful.\"","The feud between Shen Wei and Shen Qingqing was destined from the beginning.","Previously, Shen Wei had spread rumors online under a pseudonym, and now she had allied with Lu Zheng to undermine Shen Qingqing's business.","Although Shen Wei was laid-back, she still had her bottom line.","This time, Shen Wei was determined to teach them a lesson.","Lin Rui was moved by Shen Wei's words.","\"Let me think about it!\"","She couldn't respond immediately. Shen Wei invited her to visit the kindergarten."]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110: Untitled 02","paragraphs":["They were already part of the same social circle, with no deep grudges or enmities.","Lin Rui happily accepted the invitation.","As a result, she had just entered the kindergarten.","Lin Rui immediately received a call from Lu Zheng: \"Why did you go to Starry Sky Kindergarten?\"","They had someone specifically monitoring the kindergarten, and as soon as they saw Lin Rui go to Starry Sky Kindergarten, their vigilance shot up to the highest level.","Lin Rui and Lu Zheng didn't have much of a relationship anymore. She thought that after their falling out, they would only see each other at business circles and friends' gatherings. Now he had called with an accusatory tone.","Lin Rui was instantly displeased: \"What I want to do is my business.\"","\"You know very well that Starry Sky Kindergarten doesn't get along with us, yet you still go there.\"","\"You are you, and I am me. Please don't confuse the two, okay?\"","Sure enough, the other party was so angry they were left speechless.","Lin Rui suddenly felt a surge of satisfaction at that moment.","She wasn't a meek lamb. She had held onto old feelings before, but her forbearance hadn't earned her anything.","Why should he, after doing something that wronged her, still be able to speak so righteously?","Just her visiting Starry Sky Kindergarten was enough to make him unable to bear it.","What if she started working here?","In an instant, she turned dark.","\"Please don't call me anymore. It seems Boss Lu and I aren't that close after all.\"","\"You...\" Lu Zheng was at a loss for words. \"Even if we're not lovers anymore, we're still like brother and sister.\"","Lin Rui said, \"Honestly, I'm not as shameless as you. A decent ex should be like they're dead. Don't 'rise from the grave' again in the future. I'm afraid I won't be able to resist slapping you.\"","With that, she hung up the phone.","On the other end, Lu Zheng listened to the busy tone and violently threw his phone.","After hanging up, she let out a long sigh.","Turning to Shen Wei, she said, \"Your overt scheme was quite successful.\"","Originally, she wasn't sure whether to come to the kindergarten or not.","But receiving Lu Zheng's call instantly solidified her resolve.","She wanted to give him a hard time.","And she wanted to make the kindergarten bigger and stronger.","The Lu family was rich, right? Well, coincidentally, her Lin family was rich too.","He had trampled her dignity underfoot. Now it was time to see if he had the resources to match.","Shen Wei said, \"Welcome aboard.\"","Shen Wei directly made her part of the kindergarten's management, as a manager.","Her family had business experience. She had spent so many years abroad and had also studied business management.","Lin Rui surveyed the place and discovered a strange phenomenon.","The employees were working harder than the boss; the boss was just slacking off while the employees were working themselves to death.","If she could thoroughly research this phenomenon, it would be enough for her to publish a paper in an authoritative column.","Just as she was strolling around, she suddenly saw a little girl who quickly hid upon seeing them.","Like a startled little rabbit, she only reluctantly turned around after Shen Wei waved her over.","The little girl looked at Shen Wei, then glanced at Lin Rui, and lowered her head.","Shen Wei said, \"This is our painting prodigy.\" Introducing Mu Zhixing, she had a sense of parental pride.","Lin Rui originally didn't like children, but seeing this little one so socially anxious, she suddenly felt like teasing her a bit. She said, \"Little one, do you have any drawings? Can you show big sister?\"","\"Yes,\" Mu Zhixing's voice was like a mosquito's buzz.","Lin Rui opened her eyes wide and said, \"This child is so well-behaved!\" She reached out to hug her.","Mu Zhixing had rarely encountered kindness since she was little. She liked being hugged.","The teachers and others she met at the kindergarten were all kind and gentle.","Lin Rui, with her sharp, mature woman vibe, was someone Mu Zhixing hadn't encountered before.","But she was afraid that refusing would make the lady angry. So, trembling, she reached out her little hands to be hugged.","Being held in Lin Rui's arms, the child was unusually stiff.","It made Lin Rui laugh: \"What's wrong? I'm not going to eat you.\"","When Qi Zhong came out, he saw his beloved disciple curled up motionless in someone's arms. He immediately said, \"Mu Zhixing, why are you still dazed? Go back to your painting.\"","His one sentence directly rescued the child. The little one let out a sigh of relief. \"Okay.\"","Then she wriggled out of Lin Rui's embrace and ran away.","Lin Rui hadn't had enough of hugging the child yet. She said, \"You all...\"","Qi Zhong glanced at Lin Rui and said, \"If you like hugging children so much, have one of your own.\" Look how scared his disciple was.","Lin Rui was instantly enraged. \"Hey, how can you talk like that?\"","\"I just talk like this.\"","\"Fine, remember this!\" Lin Rui walked away haughtily.","Qi Zhong didn't care at all.","He thought she was just a parent with power and influence. But the next day, Qi Zhong was completely stunned.","Lin Rui had joined the staff, coming in directly as a manager. She was in charge of everyone except the principal and vice-principal, including him.","Qi Zhong snorted.","Lin Rui raised an eyebrow: \"Didn't expect that, did you?\"","Qi Zhong didn't make a sound. After all, he was the painting teacher, not under her jurisdiction.","Qi Zhong looked at her and snorted, \"Childish!\"","Then he turned to leave.","But Lin Rui said, \"I heard you're a painter. What works have you done? I'd like to see.\"","Her coming to the kindergarten was to give Lu Zheng and Shen Qingqing a hard time, not really to change the structure of the kindergarten.","Although nominally a manager, it was a sinecure.","She particularly liked Mu Zhixing, finding the little socially anxious one super adorable.","Incidentally, she enjoyed bantering with the painting teacher.","Especially Qi Zhong's shocked expression today, it really amused her.","Lin Rui was dying of laughter.","She still wanted to elicit a few more reactions from Qi Zhong.","But Qi Zhong, except for his initial surprise, kept a straight face afterward. He had no intention of showing her.","As a genius, he had his pride. How could he let someone tease him on a whim?","Shen Qingqing saw Lin Rui allying with Shen Wei and truly felt a sense of panic.","Plus, due to her erroneous public relations tactics, she had generated a lot of resentment, and her current public image was very poor.","At present, she hadn't made any blunders, just frantically discounting. They weren't even charging 300 anymore, offering experience tickets for 200.","Shen Wei was just about to breathe a sigh of relief.","But then the System sounded an alarm.","Shen Wei hurriedly checked in the System space and found that this time, the trouble was coming from the Noble Kindergarten.","The Noble Kindergarten had really opened up classes for the general public.","This time, with one move, they took in 2,000 people.","The Noble Kindergarten had been operating in this city for decades, giving everyone a high-end impression.","They had never opened classes for the general public before. Anyone wanting to enter the Noble Kindergarten had to pass a wealth verification.","Parents had to undergo various interviews and tests, and the children you could see were either wealthy or from prestigious families.","Ordinary people couldn't even reach the threshold of getting into that kindergarten.","Now, this time they've opened admissions for a public class, and the price they've offered is incredibly affordable: 1,500 yuan.","Clearly, this is in response to the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","When this price was announced, the entire kindergarten community went into an uproar.","Previously, no one dared to provoke the Noble Kindergarten because they weren't even in the same league.","They positioned themselves as a high-end kindergarten.","Now, the Noble Kindergarten has slashed their price to 1,500 yuan.","Moreover, they're admitting 2,000 children, which is an even bigger blow to the community than what Starry Sky Kindergarten did.","Those kindergartens that used to grovel before them in the group chat couldn't help but lose their composure, even resorting to outright cursing.","They complained that the Noble Kindergarten was leaving no room for other kindergartens to survive.","The Noble Kindergarten was most interested in Starry Sky Kindergarten's reaction.","But Starry Sky Kindergarten had no reaction, which left the Noble Kindergarten somewhat disappointed."]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111: Team Building","paragraphs":["The recruitment for the aristocratic kindergarten didn't provoke any retaliation from Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Currently, Starry Sky Kindergarten is busy with team building activities.","Over at the pop-up store, they take two days off every week.","But every time they open for registration, the number of people signing up is extraordinarily high.","It's as if Shen Qingqing's arcade is being ground into the dust.","Shen Qingqing's overwhelming advertising in the past has ended up benefiting the pop-up store.","After all, a cheap imitation can never truly compete with the real thing.","When the pop-up store opens for ticket sales each week, there are over a hundred thousand people online simultaneously.","Many new employees haven't even met the old-timers from the kindergarten yet.","So Shen Wei thought about organizing a team-building event, treating everyone to food and drinks for a two-day break.","Shen Wei mentioned this idea to Liu Chef.","Liu Chef was delighted: \"Great! We don't even need to eat out. My senior and I can cook for everyone.\"","Liu Chef's intentions were good.","But his words made Shen Wei reflect a bit.","Ever since Starry Sky Kindergarten took off, both the kindergarten and the pop-up store have had a high demand for good food.","As a result, Liu Chef and Chef Chen haven't had much time to rest.","Shen Wei thought about it and said, \"Let's change it to rest and red envelopes.\"","Apart from the bosses who like team building,","Others prefer an extra day of rest.","If they could get the team-building expenses as cash, that would be even better.","Shen Wei is quite young and doesn't have the airs of a seasoned leader. She wants to give her employees something truly beneficial.","In the end, she decided to change it to two days of paid leave and a red envelope with 1,000 yuan for each person.","Everyone could buy whatever they want to eat and really relax.","Liu Chef shared this news in the group chat. Within three seconds, everyone came out to sincerely thank Shen Wei!","Two extra days of personal time, you can do a lot with that.","Plus, it's a benefit from the boss, on top of the 1,000 yuan bonus.","It really lifted the spirits of the working folks.","However, since the pop-up store released tickets this week, their break is moved to next week. The kindergarten gets this week off.","When Su Jun heard about this, he directly sang praises for eight hundred words.","Although this kindergarten isn't old-school, being young has its advantages.","Young people understand other young people better.","Once the kindergarten side was notified, the students' parents also expressed support and understanding.","Even though many old employees were on paid leave,","There were still some old employees living in the campus, like the gatekeeper Li Yi, Doctor Lu, and the two little ones, He Lingfeng and Mu Zhixing.","Teacher Qi Zhong also comes here rain or shine.","Not only does he have his beloved student at the kindergarten, but he also particularly enjoys the art studio here.","Especially on rest days, coming here to clear his mind is a form of leisure. The calligraphy teacher, Wang Pei, is the same.","Normally, the local genius Zhao Jie would be here too. But this holiday, his family took him home.","With six or seven people in total, Shen Wei directly bought over 20 pounds of meat.","\"Everyone else is on holiday, so let's organize a barbecue here today!\" Shen Wei said.","Doctor Lu's eyes lit up: \"Great!\"","Barbecue is simple, just cut the meat and you're good to go. The dips are ready-made.","With charcoal and a grill at hand, everyone quickly formed a circle.","Doctor Lu has long considered this place home.","He even brought yogurt drinks for everyone.","Washing vegetables, cutting meat, they were busy with joy.","Soon the grill was set up, and the charcoal lit. These young people weren't fazed by such tasks.","Shen Wei was grilling on the side.","People next to her quickly turned the meat.","The meat she bought was good, high-end beef with a rich, milky aroma.","Wrapped in seasoning, rolled in lettuce, and taken in one bite.","The crispness of the lettuce combined with the tenderness of the grilled meat, each bite bursting with juice.","Shen Wei directly rolled up a grilled meat piece and handed it to Mu Zhixing.","Mu Zhixing took a bite, and his little eyes immediately lit up, saying it was delicious.","Shen Wei rolled another small lettuce wrap with grilled meat for He Lingfeng.","The two little ones were like baby birds waiting to be fed.","Once Shen Wei prepared something, the two would wait beside her with open mouths.","It was utterly adorable.","Both children were soft and tender. Shen Wei really wanted to hug and kiss the little ones.","After the two little ones were full, they ran off to play.","There are many fun things at the kindergarten, with indoor and outdoor big slides.","Plus various ball pits and such.","The two children are exceptionally gifted, but they also need to decompress occasionally.","Moreover, under Shen Wei's protection, both little ones retain the innocence of childhood.","After the two kids were full, everyone started to chat and gossip.","Soon, Liu Chef and Chef Chen came over hand in hand.","Shen Wei said, \"It's a holiday today, why did you come?\"","Liu Chef said, \"I just came for a stroll. My senior is being stubborn, he clearly wanted to come and take a look, but he's putting up a front!\"","Chef Chen said, \"You're everywhere.\"","But he didn't deny what Liu Chef said.","From afar, the two saw smoke coming from the kindergarten and thought something was up, so they hurried over.","Only when they entered did they realize Shen Wei was having a barbecue with a few people.","They immediately relaxed.","Their faces broadened with more smiles. Barbecue is slow-paced, suitable for leisurely eating.","Plus, with two big eaters like Doctor Lu and gatekeeper Li Yi around,","No matter how much meat you grill, it's not enough for those two.","Liu Chef said, \"Let me help you grill! If you'd told me earlier you wanted barbecue, I could have marinated the meat in advance. It would have been even more tender and juicy!\"","As the group ate and drank, Shen Wei said, \"Today is a rest day. If anyone wants to drink alcohol, you can have a little.\"","Doctor Lu said, \"I don't drink, but you all can!\"","Although he doesn't drink, he quite enjoys watching others drink and brag.","He cheerfully urged, \"Liu Chef, you should have some!\"","\"Chef Chen, I heard your alcohol tolerance is quite good, haven't seen it yet!\"","To gatekeeper Li Yi: \"You ex-military guys, no need to say more, just keep filling our glasses!\"","He was more enthusiastic than anyone. Everyone said, \"This guy is the worst!\"","But since they could drink, everyone was quite tempted.","As they were eating and drinking,","Teacher Tang and Weng Lan also came.","Like Liu Chef, although it was their day off, they were used to coming over.","Since they had nothing to do and saw everyone eating and drinking, they were tempted too.","It was a lucky coincidence, so everyone came over to eat.","They all started cutting meat and washing vegetables, busily working.","Gu Qingyan also came. She didn't even have time to change out of her high-end outfit and just sat there eating with everyone.","After eating and drinking their fill, several people had already gathered to drink.","Originally, it was just a gathering of seasoned employees from the kindergarten, eating and drinking together. Everyone started speaking their minds freely.","\"I really don't regret coming to our kindergarten,\" Doctor Lu said.","\"I've never found a job as comfortable as this one,\" Liu Chef spoke from the heart.","Chef Chen let out a grunt beside them.","Not to mention the others, even he, a person known for his peculiar temper, was willing to come and work here.","It just goes to show how great Shen Wei's charm is."]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112: The Gift of Steel Straight Men","paragraphs":["Everyone was eating and drinking merrily.","They started praising the kindergarten, complimenting Shen Wei to the point of embarrassment.","Shen Wei got up and left that area. She worried that as the boss, if she stayed there too long, her employees would have to keep up their \"business-like\" demeanor.","She went to stroll around the side,","The vegetable garden nearby was taking shape, and in another week of construction, they could start laying the soil.","They bought all their soil from the mountain.","It could be fertilized to nourish the land.","Shen Wei stood lost in thought in a quiet corner of the kindergarten.","Before, the system would just assign her tasks.","But in the process, she truly fell in love with this kindergarten. Every staff member here was personally invited by her. Now, having such a large scale, she felt a great sense of achievement.","Suddenly, she heard a clear voice from behind: \"Why aren't you eating?\"","Shen Wei turned around and saw it was Gu Qingyan.","Shen Wei said, \"I'm full.\"","The others were still eating. Ever since Chef Chen and Liu Chef arrived, the barbecue had become delicious. After slicing and mixing, the flavors were even more savory.","Even those who weren't hungry could eat a lot.","The group of adults, ravenous like children, made Shen Wei want to laugh.","Gu Qingyan said, \"I'm full too!\"","His words were pure deception. Men generally have bigger appetites, especially with the taste improved by the two chefs. The aroma was tantalizing.","Seeing him there, Shen Wei walked with him, having an idle chat: \"How do you feel being here?\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"I really love the kindergarten.\"","After a pause, he added, \"Oh, right, I have a gift I want to give you!\" As he spoke, his face started to redden.","Shen Wei: \"Ah?\"","Gu Qingyan said shyly, \"Wait a moment, I'll be right back.\"","They didn't notice at all that their entire conversation was witnessed by Doctor Lu.","Doctor Lu used to have a cool, scholarly vibe.","But after spending so much time with children at the kindergarten, his inner passion for gossip and surfing had been ignited.","Now, hearing such juicy news, he covered his mouth, eyes brimming with excitement.","He immediately returned to the barbecue group and said, \"Hey, hey, big news. Gu Qingyan might confess to Shen Wei.\"","\"Really?\" Liu Chef said.","\"Could it be fake!\"","Everyone present had the expression of eager gossip-seekers.","They all understood why someone of Gu Qingyan's status came to their kindergarten.","Moreover, his eagerness to please Shen Wei's parents was too obvious.","Every time Gu Qingyan faced Shen Wei, he was both shy and excited.","Everyone was betting on when he would finally confess.","Hearing such big news during their break, everyone's gossip blood started boiling.","Then, following Doctor Lu, they quietly went to a first-floor classroom.","They could see the couple's meeting spot through one window.","Plus, the wall here was thin.","Both windows were open.","They could clearly see what each one was saying.","Sure enough, when they returned, Gu Qingyan gave her a small box.","Everyone was guessing what was inside.","Gu Qingyan was nervous the whole time, completely unaware that just a wall away, many of his kindergarten colleagues were secretly ambushed.","Pairs of eyes were fixed intently, and those near the windows were straining their ears.","Liu Chef teased them for being too gossipy but also joined in.","Soon, they heard Gu Qingyan tell Shen Wei: \"These are our childhood photos. It's not the first time I've met you; I knew you when we were little.\"","The photo showed two children. The boy looked refined, the girl adorable, huddled together like two well-behaved dolls.","He had searched a long time to find this photo. His confidence surged.","The others behind the wall were speechless. Of all things to give, he chose a photo. What kind of straight-guy aesthetics was this?","Teacher Tang, also eavesdropping, made a shushing gesture, and the faint murmurs quieted down.","As a young master from a wealthy family, Gu Qingyan had prepared other gifts too.","He chose a diamond brand.","The brand's slogan was about loving only one person for a lifetime.","He wanted to buy a ring, but that was too direct.","Fearing Shen Wei's rejection would put him on the back foot,","He bought a diamond bracelet instead.","Seven diamonds sparkled brilliantly.","Each was a top-tier three carats, like candies, with yellow and pink diamonds.","Each could be a centerpiece on its own.","He meticulously selected these, strung into a bracelet. The diamonds were dazzling, like strung-up stars.","He most hoped that Shen Wei would notice the brand of this diamond bracelet.","Shen Wei, not quite understanding these things, said, \"This bracelet is beautiful, it must be expensive. I can't accept it.\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"But I saw it and thought it would suit you perfectly.\"","\"In the past, when I saw beautiful things, I'd buy them for others too. Please don't overthink it.\"","Just a wall away, the others wanted to punch the wall for Gu Qingyan. My goodness, did he even listen to what he was saying?","Such a perfect opportunity, and he's telling her not to overthink.","Luckily, Shen Wei truly had a personality that didn't overthink things.","Otherwise, even if the matchmaker god tied their red strings, he'd cut them with his own hands.","Unable to refuse such kindness, Shen Wei accepted, and it indeed looked stunning on her wrist.","Shen Wei also loved shiny things and said, \"Thank you, I love it!\"","He scratched his head and said, \"I'm glad you like it. I'll buy you more next time!\"","Shen Wei changed the topic, saying she was getting a bit hungry after so long, and it'd be good to go back for some barbecue.","They started walking back.","The group rushed back through the small path to do the barbecue.","Li Yi, a former investigator, calculated that given Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan's longer route, they had about 5 minutes.","Everyone was exasperated, still absorbed in the juicy gossip they'd just consumed.","\"Seriously, Gu Qingyan seems quite smart, but this is unbelievable!\"","\"Maybe he's never chased a girl before.\"","\"If he manages to get a wife, it'd be a miracle!\"","\"Actually, I think he's a bit unworthy of Shen Wei!\" Liu Chef said on the side.","Although Gu Qingyan's family background and status were excellent,","Liu Chef's filter for Shen Wei made him feel no man in the world was good enough for her.","Soon, the couple returned.","The group started chattering, back in \"business mode.\"","But their gazes were noticeably odd when looking at him.","Shen Wei quickly called the system to see why everyone was acting so strange.","It was only then that she realized everyone had been eavesdropping in unison. Shen Wei's face turned crimson in an instant.","The others were still immersed in their awkward performance. Only Gu Qingyan noticed her reaction.","His heart suddenly leapt with joy."]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113: Teacher Tang Gets Certified","paragraphs":["For this team-building event, Shen Wei gave the kindergarten staff two days off. On the first day, everyone had a barbecue.","On the second day, just as Shen Wei woke up, she found her WeChat had exploded.","For a moment, she thought Shen Qingqing or the Noble Kindergarten had pulled some stunt again.","But when she opened it, she discovered that Teacher Tang and Doorman Li Yi had officially announced their marriage registration.","The group chat was all about confirming this news, mainly because it had been kept so secret before.","Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan had vaguely guessed earlier, but the others hadn't heard a whisper.","Everyone was discussing when these two got together.","How they just got married.","Teacher Tang said, \"After spending some time together, I felt he was quite a reliable person.\"","Li Yi was busy sending red packets in the group chat. He was too happy for words!","On Shen Wei's phone, there were messages from Liu Chef, education experts, and Doctor Lu.","Teacher Tang's news was even more explosive than Gu Qingyan pursuing Shen Wei.","The key was, even though Gu Qingyan's pursuit of Shen Wei was a bit slow, at least you could see it coming.","But with Teacher Tang, there really wasn't the slightest hint.","However, everyone was extremely happy.","This was the biggest joy for the kindergarten this year.","Shen Wei dialed Doctor Lu's number.","Doctor Lu answered instantly: \"Heavens! You finally replied. I've been grilling them for ages!\"","Doctor Lu was particularly shaken by this news. He's naturally a gossip lover, and Li Yi lives right next door to him. Not noticing anything for so long felt like a belief crumbling.","Doctor Lu rambled on, all dissatisfaction towards the couple.","Such big news, and they kept it from him. It's too much!","While they were chatting, Liu Chef also sent a WeChat message to Shen Wei.","Shen Wei said she'd briefly talk to Doctor Lu and then pick up Liu Chef's call.","Liu Chef said, \"This is fantastic news! I think there's no need for an outside banquet. My senior and I will handle the wedding feast!\"","They also discussed some details, like wanting to send them some wedding gifts.","Liu Chef didn't know what to give, as older people usually prefer more practical things. He decided on a gold necklace and a men's pixiu bracelet, as congratulatory gifts.","Shen Wei paid in full for a car worth over 300,000 yuan at the 4S store.","Teacher Tang can drive.","She always had a car worth tens of thousands for commuting, but it was a bit old. This new model has many brand-new features.","When Shen Wei arrived at the kindergarten, the old colleagues had come to interrogate them.","The newlyweds had bought a lot of wedding candy, distributing it to everyone.","Teacher Tang smiled with eyes full of tenderness.","The usually cold and icy doorman now also had a hint of a smile. Faced with everyone's questioning, he glanced at Teacher Tang.","They were completely in a lovey-dovey state.","Everyone could see that both were very satisfied with this relationship.","Teacher Tang explained, \"It's not that I hid it from you. I just didn't know if we could make it to the end.\"","As an excellent teacher at Starry Sky Kindergarten, who could have imagined that in this relationship, she was the one who took the initiative.","Li Yi is nearly 10 years older than her and has a disability.","You could say Teacher Tang choosing him is marrying down. Because of this, Li Yi initially refused.","But with Teacher Tang being so proactive, there's a natural attraction between men and women.","Who could resist such temptation?","So they really got together.","After being together, Teacher Tang increasingly felt that Li Yi was clear-headed and upright, much better than her ex-boyfriend.","Those so-called gaps didn't matter anymore.","She knew what kind of life she wanted.","Everyone gradually presented their wedding gifts.","Some gave things, some gave red packets.","Working here, they're all quite well-off. When it comes to gift-giving, they're not stingy at all.","Moreover, Teacher Tang has a gentle personality, and many people like her.","Shen Wei directly handed over a set of car keys to Teacher Tang, saying, \"I'll accompany you to transfer the ownership later. This is a new car, consider it your wedding gift.\"","Teacher Tang is the pillar of the kindergarten.","You could say that since Teacher Tang came, she set the tone for the entire Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Teacher Tang is truly a teacher who loves children, with an excellent reputation among parents.","And for the first time they were able to attract students, Teacher Tang also established great merits.","Shen Wei is very grateful to Teacher Tang.","Everyone thought Shen Wei was generous, but Teacher Tang's eyes reddened.","\"I won't accept it. It's too expensive!\"","They already knew Shen Wei was very kind before.","Whether it's towards her subordinate staff or salary benefits, it far exceeds other places by a large margin.","Getting married was their own choice. They couldn't let Shen Wei subsidize so much.","They resolutely refused. Shen Wei said, \"Just accept it since I'm giving it to you.\" She persuaded her repeatedly.","Finally, Teacher Tang accepted the car.","Teacher Tang had completely cut ties with her parents, much like Li Yi in this aspect.","Previously, because of her ex-boyfriend, she had a falling out with her family.","She didn't understand why her parents sided with her scumbag ex-boyfriend.","After the falling out, her parents repeatedly mocked her to outsiders for not getting married, saying her brain was broken.","For her wedding, Teacher Tang invited all the staff from Starry Sky Kindergarten.","She truly considered Starry Sky Kindergarten her home.","The two didn't have a wedding ceremony and didn't plan to hold one.","They just wanted to drink and chat with everyone here.","It made her feel incredibly comfortable.","When Teacher Tang raised her wine glass, she said emotionally, \"My greatest fortune is joining this place.\"","Everyone applauded excitedly.","Doctor Lu said, \"You better not bully her! If you bully her, I'll definitely deal with you!\"","After saying that, he glanced at Li Yi's build and said, \"Even if I can't beat you, I have to make my stance clear.\"","Don't underestimate the doorman because of his disability. Before retiring, he was an elite soldier.","Dealing with a few people like Doctor Lu would be too easy for him.","Li Yi said, \"Don't worry, I'll definitely treat her well.\"","He never thought he'd get married in this life. It's a blessing from heaven."]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114: Unbeatable Cost Performance","paragraphs":["The Flash Store had no idea about the major incident happening at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","At that moment, the viewers in the Flash Live Room were surprised to find a new street dance teacher.","Street dance classes alternated with classical dance classes.","Since the classical dance teacher had quite a lot of classes at the kindergarten, she was too busy to handle everything.","Having a street dance teacher could help alleviate the pressure to some extent.","Moreover, people generally had a higher perception of street dance compared to classical dance.","Especially the younger generation.","With all the energetic songs and dances on the internet, many people enjoyed them.","Qi Yuan was dressed in a trendy style, with an iron chain around his waist.","His cap was pulled down low, and he wore a black face mask. When he danced, he exuded an explosive level of charisma.","He danced so coolly. It was more than just dancing; there was an element of performance as well.","\"I used to learn street dance before, and he's truly a master.\"","\"He's dancing right on the tip of my heart!\"","\"This Flash Store seduces me 80 times a day. Last time it was the security team that made me drool, and now there's a new street dance teacher. Why can't I get tickets?\"","\"Oh my, his face is so small! I used to have that black mask, but it could only cover half of my face.\"","\"From today onwards, he's my new internet husband.\"","Not only did Qi Yuan dance well, but his hands were also particularly slender and fair.","Whenever his movements drew attention to his hands, it would trigger a wave of screams in the live room.","Even though it was just an ordinary movement, it felt a little tantalizing when viewed through his hands. What was going on?","When teaching the students, he rarely spoke. He would start with warm-up exercises as soon as the music began.","Everyone followed the rhythm of the music.","When it was time to teach the dance moves, he would say a few words. However, the viewers noticed that his voice was as clear as a stream, very pleasant to the ear.","Each time, it made these female rascals in the live room scream.","\"Oh my, I just need to close my eyes and listen to his voice!\"","\"Please don't speak anymore, just say it to me alone, and that's fine.\"","\"So handsome! They used to say that street dancers were all scumbags, but if he's this handsome, I'll accept being a scumbag too.\"","The new street dance teacher caused a small stir at Starry Sky.","This wave was just too cool. Someone even recorded and shared the video online.","They felt that something this good should be shared among sisters.","It was initially thought to be just another video that would cause screaming and drooling.","Unexpectedly, it attracted some random and ridiculous comments.","\"This kind of person who doesn't show their face must be fat and ugly.\"","\"If not, then they must be short and poor.\"","\"Before, the dancer who wore a mask and sunglasses turned out to be really ugly in real life, and there was even an incident where the truth was exposed.\"","\"If they were handsome, they would have revealed their face long ago!\"","\"He has a few moves, like hip thrusts, that are really disgusting. They clearly have strong suggestive undertones.\"","\"Just thinking that the dancer could be a fat and ugly person, secretly flirting, and seeing people online getting excited about him, it makes me feel sick!\"","Many people thought the dance was good, but as soon as they saw the insults, they lost interest.","People online tend to follow the crowd.","The blogger felt the insults were a bit too harsh and deleted the post.","Little did they expect that this post would then be reposted by a public account.","The public account used a voice changer to read out all the malicious comments.","Soon, there were even more people mocking and ridiculing.","Shen Wei detected the online public opinion through the system's monitoring and even called Qi Yuan: \"It's not your fault. Starry Sky Kindergarten has always been in the public eye, and even small incidents can be magnified and lead to online abuse!\"","They were already used to this, but she was worried that the new teacher might not be able to handle it.","Qi Yuan said, \"Thank you, I suppose I'm just not meant to be popular.\"","He used to be an idol in a boy group before.","Even back then, he was not very popular in the group.","Now that he had terminated his contract and become a street dance teacher, not revealing his face, he was still being insulted and trending on the short video hot search lists.","At that moment, he felt a sense of disorientation.","After hanging up the call with Shen Wei, he sat there for a long time without saying a word.","It wasn't until much later that he finally let out a sigh.","Although he was now a street dance teacher, he had once dreamed of those glamorous stages in the past.","Perhaps there was still a sense of gap in his heart.","That's why he kept his cap pulled down low during classes.","He didn't want people to know that he actually didn't have many fans. But his inexplicable sense of pride made him very reserved.","However, after realizing that he had caused trouble for Starry Sky by being criticized, he felt a little regretful.","After some thought, he finally decided to take off his mask.","During the second street dance class, the live room's loyal fans were worried about him, while some were trolls who had come to insult him after hearing the public account's video.","However, upon entering, they discovered a handsome young man sitting there.","This young man began teaching everyone to dance.","Although he looked delicate and pretty, his dancing was incredibly wild.","Even the sweat flowing down his neck looked sensual when he danced.","The female rascals in the live room went crazy again: \"No wonder he wore a mask before, he was trying to hide his stunning good looks!\"","\"Seeing him, I finally understand what it means to be both pure and sensual. He's simply dancing on the tip of my heart!\"","\"Is your heart tip a durian? Why are there people standing on every tip? You praised the classical dance teacher the same way last time. I remember your ID.\"","\"So what kind of divine place is this Flash Store at Starry Sky Kindergarten?\"","\"Damn it, I recognize him with a single glance. He's my long-lost husband.\"","\"No matter what you say, you can't get tickets.\"","The viewers were so excited that they started insulting those who made negative comments in the chat.","\"Stop saying those mood-killing things.\"","Everyone was in a state of excitement.","Online, there was also someone staring at the video in a daze. She was a fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten, always refreshing but never following.","But today, she had to follow because the street dance teacher was her former idol.","She immediately tried to get tickets.","As a devoted fan, her speed paid off, and she managed to snag one.","When she arrived, her former idol was teaching her to dance, an experience even a top-level VIP couldn't have.","At the appointed time, there were activities like acting, singing, painting, and finally, a street dance class.","She danced with great joy, as if in a dream. After it ended, she summoned her courage and approached Qi Yuan, saying, \"I'm Potato Little Pumpkin. Do you still remember me?\"","Qi Yuan's pupils shook slightly, then he said, \"I remember.\"","He had only about thirty fans in total, and he remembered every single ID.","However, he later didn't post any content and didn't become popular. He didn't have any shows, and the group gradually grew cold.","Those who used to like him seemed to have gradually abandoned him one by one.","Qi Yuan didn't expect to run into a fan when he came out.","The thing he feared most had happened, he thought he would feel very awkward.","But he found that he didn't feel awkward at all, his heart was only filled with calmness.","Potato Pumpkin said, \"Keep working hard.\"","Qi Yuan's smile became much more sincere, \"Yeah.\"","After returning, Potato Pumpkin wrote about this encounter and posted it in the group.","The originally quiet fan group suddenly exploded: \"What? My former idol is teaching street dance at a web celebrity shop!\"","\"400 bucks for food and drinks, and an idol personally promoting. Teaching dance, what a heavenly place, I've decided to form a group and go there immediately.\"","This 400 yuan price was unbeatable in terms of value.","It was just very difficult to get tickets.","They tried to grab tickets several times but couldn't get a single one.","They couldn't help but ask Potato Pumpkin, \"How did you manage to get tickets back then?\"","Potato Pumpkin was also confused, thinking she was just very lucky.","She originally thought it was just a treasure web celebrity shop, but later found out her idol was there too.","She had a strong feeling that her former little sugar bean idol would have a turn of luck."]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115: Idol by My Side","paragraphs":["The fact that the street dance instructor was an idol was an open secret among fans, but no one spoke about it publicly.","However, they all started vying for tickets.","As long as they got a ticket, and exchanged a secret code with him, their former idol Qi Yuan would visibly become happier.","Perhaps this was the meaning behind their idol-chasing pursuits.","Qi Yuan was once their light, but now he was by their side, truly striving to make a living and actively working.","This was probably the advantage of being a fan of a small, lesser-known idol.","Having watched him dance online, seeing him perform those powerful dance moves live was truly captivating!","Even his beads of sweat had an indescribable allure.","He was far superior to those just going through the motions on stage in the entertainment industry.","The Starry Sky Flash Store was a popular internet cafe, and it already had many fans! Talented individuals will always shine, no matter when.","Although the street dance classes were added later, his classes were always the most crowded!","Some of the girls who came were bold enough to openly flirt with him, successfully making the small idol Qi Yuan's face turn red.","The street dance instructor was handsome, an excellent dancer, and endearingly shy—who could resist that?","Suddenly, there were more and more screams of excitement.","In the livestream chat, whenever they saw the street dance instructor being teased like that, the viewers couldn't help but smirk.","\"That sister is so brave! Coming up and confessing like that. I wouldn't dare.\"","\"Our little Qi Yuan teacher may have come late, but I see his popularity is catching up to the security team.\"","\"Wow, wow! His legs are so beautiful.\"","\"Why couldn't it have been me?\"","\"So handsome! And he has great camera presence. On several occasions, during breaks in his dancing, he would glance at the camera, and that focused gaze really electrified me.\"","\"Should I say it or not, where does Shen Wei find all these great talents? With our street dance instructor's looks and skills, he would surely outshine the entertainment industry.\"","There were fans of Qi Yuan's former boy group in the livestream chat. At the sight of these comments, they didn't dare speak up.","How could they tell these sisters in the livestream chat?","He used to be in a boy group. Unfortunately, it's like he never existed.","But if he was given the chance to have an open mic, he might have become famous! Over thirty fans said in their group chat.","Many had given up midway. But they were called back by the group's sisters, suddenly reminded of the time when they were tallying data for Qi Yuan's fanbase.","Back then, they thought he would eventually become famous. But they never imagined how dark it would become.","Now that he had left the industry, his fans were the ones growing in numbers!","His personal account gained over 10,000 new followers in just a few days. And the numbers kept rising.","These boy group fans felt very conflicted. Some of the more emotional sisters even sent voice messages with a sobbing tone: \"If only he had become popular earlier.\"","The group chat fell silent!","The fan club's vice president said: \"I see Qi Yuan is happy, and I hope he stays happy! I will always support him. Even without a big stage. But the fact that so many people can see his excellence and his brilliance proves that we didn't misjudge him from the start.\"","\"Yes. I will also continue to support him.\"","\"I propose that since he is now a regular person, we should protect his secret. No one should mention his previous boy group!\"","\"That trashy company is inhumane. I really want to shove his popularity in their face, let them know that it's not that our brother was incapable, but that he was wronged.\"","\"Bringing this up makes me cry with anger! No one could withstand so many years of darkness. How did he endure it?\"","There weren't many people in the group, but they were all in tears.","It's not that they didn't resent the situation!","If only the agency had put in more effort, he wouldn't have had to wait until he was older before being noticed and loved by people.","But the long-time group leader spoke up: \"Don't cry anymore, let's just continue supporting him!\" She then changed her profile picture to their fan club's logo from back in the day.","Soon, many others followed suit.","\"That's right. We will always support him.\"","\"We haven't forgotten him.\"","\"Even though many people like him now, we were the early supporters.\"","\"Last time I said my ID, he looked at me with surprise and gratitude. He remembers me.\"","\"A fun fact: he remembers all of our IDs.\"","That one sentence brought tears to their eyes.","But things were better now.","Their beloved treasure was being seen by more and more people.","He could dance freely and happily!","His fans could feel his joy when he danced.","Qi Yuan's fans were all very grateful to the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","It was thanks to this kindergarten that Qi Yuan could be loved by so many people.","Those who had visited the Starry Sky Flash Store said: \"That place is really great. Not only do they have Qi Yuan, but they also have all sorts of interesting classes and delicious food. You can spend a whole day there for just 400 yuan.\"","\"The only downside is that it's difficult to get tickets.\"","\"You're betting against an idol fan's speed? I don't believe it!\"","\"Me neither!\"","\"Next time you sisters can get tickets, get two and sell me one at triple the price.\"","\"Me too.\"","\"...\"","Qi Yuan had no idea that his fans had cried countless times in their group chat over his mistreatment.","He only felt a sense that he might actually become famous!","Every time he danced, there were so many people signing up for classes. Some even said they came just for him.","And when walking on the street, people would greet him.","It was a subtle feeling, but he quite liked it.","So whenever he finished a class, he would linger in the dance studio, either practicing or analyzing dance moves! He had done facial expression training before, so he knew what movements were most alluring.","During each class, the screams coming from their dance studio were the loudest.","Because every one of his movements was carefully choreographed.","He no longer yearned for stardom! But he wanted those who came for him to feel it was worthwhile.","At this moment, he felt that all those years of training had not been in vain.","...","The Starry Sky Kindergarten had a new blind singing teacher.","When he first appeared in the livestream, many people were shocked.","He previously had an account called \"Blind Zhang Song\" with several hundred thousand followers.","Many people online had encountered his videos before!","They never expected him to come to the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He sang together with these \"students\" who came.","His voice was clear and ethereal, and even among a crowd of people, you could sense that his voice was extraordinarily special! Like a mountain nightingale.","It made their entire song so much more beautiful.","And every time he saw him singing, the worries, fatigue, and even inexplicable anxiety deep inside would dissipate.","If a disabled person like him could love life so much, what reason did one have to be defeated by life?","In Zhang Song's class, one unconsciously entered the quiet world of music, feeling every change brought about by the music.","After it ended, everyone went back and couldn't help but spontaneously write short essays.","Not paid posts, but those insights that accumulated in their chests, lingering for a while. They especially wanted to share them.","Who would have thought that in the city, there would be such a purifying spiritual oasis?","The post this person wrote was so sincere that everyone who read it was moved! For a while, the posts being shared in the local area were discovered by the administrator and manually made hot.","More people saw it, and even those who had never been to the Starry Sky Flash Store all coveted it.","This Starry Sky Flash Store was like a utopia in the adult world.","Making everyone yearn for it.","But on the other end, Shen Qingqing was scrolling through her phone and came across this sincerely emotional post. She felt indignant.","Why was a post written by someone from the Starry Sky Flash Store made a featured post, while her paid posts were deleted? How was that fair?","Shen Qingqing was failing at everything she did now. She had already been mocked, and even her Boss Lu was a bit angry at her, so she didn't dare show off recently.","She didn't want to know about the Starry Sky Flash Store and Starry Sky Kindergarten's affairs.","But she couldn't avoid seeing them because they were so popular.","Every time she scrolled past them, she clicked \"Not interested.\" But she still intermittently saw various posts about the dance teacher Qi Yuan and the blind singer Zhang Song.","Shen Qingqing was fuming. In the past, Shen Wei was inferior to her in every way.","Now she had so many capable people helping her. Needless to say, Shen Qingqing was extremely jealous."]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116: Saving the Third Villain","paragraphs":["Shen Wei received the latest mission: \"Save Villain No. 3 with an antisocial personality disorder.\"","Immediately after, Shen Wei's mind was filled with a long account of Villain No. 3's life!","He had been homeless and destitute. Not only was he bullied, but sometimes when he was very hungry, he had to fight stray dogs for food!","Moreover, the critical turning point in his life was only three days away!","If Shen Wei did not appear in time, he would be bullied by a group of children and have one of his eyes blinded. From then on, he would become gloomy and resentful of everyone.","When Shen Wei saw Villain No. 3's age, she couldn't help but question: \"System, are you sure you haven't made a mistake? This child is only three years old?\"","Nowadays, she dealt with many children at her kindergarten, and a three-year-old who had just learned to walk and run had ended up in such a dire situation?","The System's cold, mechanical voice replied: \"No mistake, time is running out, please take action immediately.\"","Previously, the System had always given ample time for past assignments. When she had saved Mu Zhixing, there was still more than half a month until the critical point in that child's story.","With so much time, she could have done plenty of preparation work beforehand.","But now, there was only a short period of time.","Even for someone like Shen Wei, she was starting to feel anxious.","Three days was one thing, but more importantly, the System had given her a rather strange mission this time.","There was also a bundled task to help Villain No. 3 find his biological parents.","Villain No. 3 had been kidnapped. But he was just a baby when he was abducted. On top of that, there was no DNA registration for kidnapping cases at that time, so there was no way to trace his origins.","The difficulty of this mission was more daunting than her previous assignments.","And Villain No. 3 wasn't even in their city. He was in the neighboring city! It would take six hours to drive there now.","Shen Wei set off immediately.","She couldn't wait a single minute. As she left, she called Liu Chef and Su Jun, saying she had some errands to run.","She hurried out.","Her heart was pounding the entire way.","A three-year-old child wandering homeless on the streets. She couldn't imagine what the child must have gone through!","When Shen Wei left in a hurry, she only called Liu Chef to let him know she had something to take care of.","Everyone else was worried that something had happened and wanted to call her. But Shen Wei was driving and couldn't answer the phone!","All she said was that she needed to go out for a bit and asked them to watch the house. Nothing more was said.","When Shen Wei received the System's notification, it was already four o'clock in the afternoon. She drove for a full six hours.","Driving for such a long time while being highly anxious and worried took a toll on her. On top of Shen Wei's urgency, the double fatigue caused her to have a headache towards the end.","But she still persevered and endured it.","When she arrived at the neighboring city, Shen Wei booked a five-star hotel directly! At that moment, her stomach was already growling with hunger. She found a small noodle shop by the roadside and went in to have a few bites.","While eating, she worried whether the child would be able to eat or not.","All of a sudden, she lost her appetite.","After forcing herself to have a simple meal, she hurried to look for the child! She continued driving, and the navigation led her to a factory! The location was very remote, and being there alone at night as a woman made Shen Wei feel a bit scared.","Moreover, the street lights in the area were dim, barely illuminating five meters ahead. Shen Wei kept driving forward until she was stopped by the factory's security guard.","A vehicle arriving so late at night looked very suspicious.","\"Hey, what are you doing here?\"","Shen Wei wanted to summon the System.","But the System was persistently playing dead. As the security guard approached, Shen Wei rolled down her window and said, \"Sorry, I took a wrong turn with the navigation. What is this place?\"","The security guard was initially on high alert but relaxed considerably when he saw that Shen Wei was a woman.","He visibly let out a sigh of relief and said, \"Oh, I see. This is a detergent factory. It's pretty remote. A young lady like you shouldn't be out so late. You'd better head back.\"","The security guard uncle was quite friendly.","Shen Wei nodded.","As the security guard was about to leave, they suddenly heard a chorus of barking. Each bark louder than the last.","Shen Wei quickly shone her car lights in that direction and saw several dogs barking fiercely at a small child. The child was filthy. The color of their clothes was indistinguishable.","The System, which had been playing dead earlier, immediately spoke up: \"Congratulations, you have found Villain No. 3.\"","Shen Wei got out of the car immediately. The pack of stray dogs, being bullies who only picked on the weak, quickly ran away upon seeing Shen Wei approach!","Only the child remained standing there.","The security guard said, \"Oh, this little rascal is here again today.\"","Shen Wei asked, \"Has he been around here all this time? Where are his parents?\"","The guard replied, \"I don't know.\"","He then explained to Shen Wei that the child had only appeared in the past few days. At first, he thought the child was from a nearby village. But after some time, he realized something wasn't right.","But the guard was the type who preferred not to get involved in anything unnecessary, so he simply didn't care.","The child would always come running over. Sometimes, he would give the child a sausage.","Shen Wei said, \"This child must be homeless. I'll take him to the police station.\"","The guard had been annoyed by the little rascal all along, so he was more than happy for Shen Wei to take care of it: \"Sure, sure, take the kid with you. Women really are kind-hearted!\"","As he spoke, they heard a growling sound coming from the child's stomach.","Shen Wei picked up the child and put him in the car. The child didn't struggle at all.","When Shen Wei held the child, her heart sank to the bottom. This child was too light.","Having grown accustomed to seeing well-fed, chubby children, the sight of one in such a condition was truly unbearable."]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117: Take a bath first","paragraphs":["Shen Wei first took the child to a hotel.","All the way, the little child was very well-behaved.","Shen Wei kept trying to talk to him, but the child mostly didn't respond.","When they arrived at the hotel, she took the child into the room.","It was only then that she saw how dirty this little rascal was.","The dirt on his hair seemed to have caked on his scalp.","His clothes were completely indistinguishable in color, looking dull and gray.","Dirt was everywhere on his body and face, and he had an unpleasant odor.","Shen Wei took the child to the bathroom to bathe.","This \"Villain No. 3\" seemed to fear the bright and clean room, his body trembling slightly.","Shen Wei's voice softened, \"Good child, you need to take a bath first. Being so dirty, you might get sick.\"","She then called for housekeeping to bring a set of clothes for a three-year-old.","As soon as the little one was placed in the water, he started thrashing about.","He had been quiet and obedient earlier, but now he was resisting. Although young and lightweight, he still caused Shen Wei quite some trouble.","This child must have thought someone was going to hurt him.","He let out strange cries, like those of a wild beast.","Shen Wei struggled with him for a while, but to no avail. After driving for over six hours, she was highly tense and now extremely exhausted.","The child's struggle made Shen Wei feel drained.","At that moment, Shen Wei's phone rang.","Shen Wei answered with suppressed fatigue, \"Hello.\"","It was Gu Qingyan on the other end. He carefully asked, \"What's wrong? You left in such a hurry today.\"","At the time, he sensed Shen Wei's expression change drastically, and wanted to catch up with her, but didn't dare.","As evening approached, he finally asked tentatively.","Shen Wei briefly explained the situation to him.","Gu Qingyan said, \"I'll come over. At least I can lend a hand.\" He then asked for the address and came.","He bought a high-speed rail ticket. Within an hour, he arrived and took a taxi straight to the hotel.","Shen Wei was still bathing the child.","The child had also exhausted himself from struggling, and with the water temperature being suitable, he no longer fought as vigorously. Shen Wei quickly seized the opportunity to bathe the child.","The first tub of bathwater was completely muddy. It was hard to imagine that such a small child could be so dirty.","Shen Wei applied shampoo and carefully washed the hardened dirt clumps from the child's scalp, being careful not to use too much force. The little one squinted his eyes in comfort.","Though a little boy, the child had shoulder-length hair, likely never having been trimmed.","When Gu Qingyan arrived, Shen Wei had just finished the third rinse.","The child's previous clothes were thrown away.","The child had resisted Shen Wei earlier.","Children are always the most perceptive, and he must have sensed that Shen Wei meant no harm.","As Shen Wei bathed him, the child fell asleep.","Shen Wei had to support his little head, afraid he might accidentally choke on the water.","Gu Qingyan's arrival was a great help for Shen Wei.","When Gu Qingyan entered and saw Shen Wei's clothes stained with dirty water and her exhausted expression, he said, \"Let me do it.\"","Shen Wei responded, \"Together then.\" She then bathed the child two more times.","The water finally became clear, and the child was clean.","Although not as good-looking as He Lingfeng and Mu Zhixing, he was still a handsome little boy.","Shen Wei explained, \"I plan to take this child for a medical examination tomorrow, then ask around about his situation. After that, I'll report him as a missing person to the police.\"","For such an adorable child to be wandering outside, those human traffickers are truly inhumane.","Gu Qingyan said, \"I'll go with you tomorrow.\"","He glanced at the time, already past midnight.","Assuming Shen Wei must be exhausted, he said, \"I've booked another room. You can take the child and go sleep there. You should rest too.\"","Although Shen Wei was the principal of Starry Sky Kindergarten, she had never actually taken care of a child before, let alone a child as wild as this one.","With the child around, it would be difficult to rest properly.","Shen Wei said, \"The child has seen me today. If he goes with you, he might get scared when he wakes up in the middle of the night. I'll stay here.\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"Alright then, I'll stay in the room next door. Call me if you need anything.\"","Though a handsome and dignified young master, he unexpectedly proved to be reliable and down-to-earth.","Shen Wei, exhausted, simply said, \"Okay.\" She then put the little one on the bed, changed into her nightgown, and lay down.","Shen Wei was truly exhausted and slept very soundly. When she woke up, it was already 9 AM.","The first thing she did upon waking was to look for the child.","The child, who had been bathed the night before, looked much cleaner and was still asleep.","When Shen Wei woke up, the child also opened his eyes. Upon seeing Shen Wei, his sleepy eyes widened.","The child's stomach grumbled. Shen Wei ordered room service breakfast to be delivered.","Soon, a delivery robot arrived with a rather sumptuous breakfast of bread, ham, small rice porridge, and buns.","Shen Wei fed the child some of the rice porridge. The child must have been starving for a long time, as he wolfed down the food, seeming to not even chew, which was heartbreaking to watch.","Soon after, Gu Qingyan knocked on the door. He had already finished eating. Shen Wei wanted the child to eat more slowly.","After eating, Gu Qingyan said, \"Let's go. I've arranged a private car. The driver is waiting downstairs. We'll take the child for a medical examination directly.\"","The Gu family not only had businesses in this city but also in neighboring cities.","The Gu family manager received the young master's call early in the morning and was stunned, afraid of not providing adequate service, so he arranged the best driver and hospital.","Shen Wei said, \"Thank you for your trouble.\" She skillfully carried the child in her arms.","Though the little one seemed resistant at first, this embrace was too warm, and he didn't struggle.","Gu Qingyan immediately took the child from Shen Wei's arms.","Although a pampered young master, he was still a man and could handle physical tasks like this.","But the little one was clearly not so obedient, immediately scratching Gu Qingyan's face, leaving three claw marks.","Gu Qingyan couldn't help but quip, \"Hey, are you part cat or something?\"","Ironically, this child's claw skills were indeed like those of a stray cat.","If Shen Wei hadn't complained about this child being too dirty yesterday, with mud even lodged in his fingernails which she trimmed with scissors, the force of his swipe today could have easily drawn blood on his face.","Now, there's only a faint trace left, which is already much better.","Shen Wei said, \"Let me do it.\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"No need, I'll handle it.\" He then held the child facing him.","His broad arms encircled under the child's armpits, making it difficult for the little one to turn around, let alone hurt anyone.","Gu Qingyan boasted smugly about his cleverness, \"See, he's not ferocious now.\"","Even Shen Wei couldn't help but smile, \"Childish.\""]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118: The Strength of the Young Master of the Gu Family","paragraphs":["Upon arriving at the hospital, the director was already waiting for them.","\"You must be Young Master Gu and Miss Shen. Young Master Gu's instructions were hasty, so please forgive any shortcomings in our hospitality. Although our hospital is private, we have the best equipment and staff. Many celebrities come to us. You can rest assured about our confidentiality and professionalism.\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"Thank you for your trouble.\"","He had been a golden child since childhood. Having seen many such situations, he was long accustomed to them.","\"So, may I ask, who is...\" The director inquired with his eyes.","Shen Wei said, \"This child was rescued. We'd like to do a thorough physical examination.\"","\"Oh, I see. Please, follow me,\" the director replied. Then, to Shen Wei, he added, \"Indeed, it's the ladies who have the kindest hearts. This child is truly fortunate to have met you both.\"","Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan were both quite young. Faced with such an awkward compliment, they simply smiled.","The director seemed to sense that the young people weren't accustomed to such pleasantries and quickly fell silent. However, he assigned an intern doctor to assist them with the examination and run errands if needed.","After the director left, Shen Wei finally breathed a sigh of relief. She knew Gu Qingyan came from a good family, but seeing the attitude of the private hospital director from the neighboring city today made her realize just how much.","Her previous understanding had been too superficial.","The two of them took the child for a day of examinations.","The doctor initially didn't think much of it, but when the test results came back, he was completely stunned. This child actually had roundworms in his stomach. This was due to poor hygiene causing parasites.","It was common in earlier years but had now become a rare condition, yet this child had it. Moreover, it was accompanied by anemia and severe malnutrition.","Shen Wei asked cautiously, \"Can it be remedied?\"","The doctor replied, \"At this young age, it can still be remedied. If left untreated for much longer, it could affect the child's lifespan.\"","Shen Wei said, \"Then please prescribe the medication. We'll cooperate with whatever treatment is necessary.\"","Seeing their positive attitude, the doctor felt relieved, \"First, we'll give deworming medication. Then we'll prescribe some nutritional supplements. In the future, focus on nutritious food. The child is too young, so it's not advisable to use too many medications.\"","\"Understood,\" Shen Wei replied.","The child was quickly taken to receive the deworming medication.","With a dedicated nurse, he was admitted to the hospital. That same day, the roundworms were expelled from his stomach. A subsequent X-ray showed they were gone.","Shen Wei didn't dare to look, but she told the little one to pay attention to hygiene in the future and not to put dirty hands in his mouth.","Shen Wei stayed at the hospital with the child while Gu Qingyan went to investigate the child's identity.","He utilized some of the Gu Family's resources.","Soon, information about the child was uncovered. Such a small child living from hand to mouth had left a deep impression on many people.","\"I know that child. I heard he couldn't speak at three years old. Seems he was abandoned. How heartless.\"","\"An old lady who collected scraps wanted to adopt him before. But her son disagreed, so it didn't happen.\"","\"This child looks so pitiful. Whoever has food would give him a bite.\"","\"Name? We don't know his name, we just call him 'that child'.\"","\"Oh, you mean those wild dogs? Yes, they bullied the child. Those dogs are so fierce that even adults are afraid, let alone children. No one dared to intervene.\"","Gu Qingyan brought back all the recordings along with the results of his investigation.","Knowing Shen Wei's kind heart, Gu Qingyan asked, \"What do you plan to do with this child?\"","Previously, children like He Lingfeng, Mu Zhixing, and Ning Fubao were all rescued children. For Shen Wei to come so far to rescue this child, she must have been moved by compassion.","Shen Wei said, \"I want to take this child back with us. But first, we need to report the case and also register the child's DNA as a missing person.\"","\"Alright. I'll handle that.\" With Gu Qingyan's help, everything went much more smoothly. The police came specially to conduct an investigation and registration.","After going through some complicated procedures, the temporary custody of the child was granted to Shen Wei.","The child stayed in the hospital for three days. Finally, when his physical indicators were adjusted to normal levels, the doctor agreed to discharge him.","After leaving the hospital, Gu Qingyan drove while Shen Wei sat in the back with the child.","They took the child back with them. On the way, Shen Wei was trying to organize her thoughts, wondering how to tell everyone about rescuing a child.","Going out and coming back with a child seemed too shocking; she was afraid others might not accept it.","However, everyone accepted it surprisingly well.","\"Oh, I see,\" said Liu Chef. \"Then I'll prepare a stomach-friendly meal plan for the child, poor thing.\" He still remembered what He Lingfeng looked like when he first arrived.","But he firmly believed there was no child he couldn't fatten up.","Before they even returned, he was already discussing meal plans with Doctor Lu.","Doctor Lu had studied all the way to a Ph.D. Coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten was good, but his wealth of knowledge had no place to be applied. Now that a sick child was coming, he suddenly became energized, asking Shen Wei to send him all the child's examination results and pathology reports.","Education expert Weng Lan had also prepared early, ready to guide the child's psychological health.","All the children at Starry Sky Kindergarten were lively and cheerful.","Now faced with a challenging case, everyone welcomed it with open arms.","When Shen Wei returned with the child and Gu Qingyan, everyone was lined up to welcome them.","Seeing so many people, the child nervously hid behind Shen Wei.","After several days together, the child had already come to see Shen Wei as his own people.","Shen Wei said, \"Don't scare the child.\" She then took the child to the small room prepared for him. But the child huddled in a corner.","Weng Lan had been observing him the whole time.","Shen Wei told her about the child's background. Weng Lan's eyes lit up, \"My graduation thesis was about the animalistic nature in children. I never thought I'd encounter a living example.\"","This child had grown up wild. Although in the city, he was like a savage.","His agility and reflexes were honed by wild cats and dogs. Moreover, the child couldn't speak, only making guttural sounds like a wild animal.","Raising such a child properly would not be an easy task.","Weng Lan said, \"Principal, leave this task to me. I'll teach him to speak.\" Starry Sky Kindergarten's first three-year-old who couldn't speak.","It would require adults to be extremely attentive.","Education expert Weng Lan usually had too little to do. Seeing the calligraphy teacher and art teacher so busy, she had been quite envious.","However, young children are too innocent, and rarely have psychological issues.","He Lingfeng had some problems before, but now he's fully focused on computers, and those minor issues have long since faded away.","Now they've encountered a little \"wild beast\" of a child, and she also wants to do something for the kindergarten, so she volunteered enthusiastically.","Shen Wei understood her intentions and immediately agreed."]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119: Searching for Family (Part 1)","paragraphs":["The little boy was unanimously named Ping An by everyone.","When Ping An watched the children going to kindergarten, the little fellow was stunned for the first time.","His eyes were wide open.","Before coming here, Ping An was like a tenacious, slightly ferocious little wild wolf pup.","But after arriving, Weng Lan held the child in her arms all day long.","The little fellow's gaze gradually became gentle.","He also liked to snuggle his face against Weng Lan's shoulder.","Although he had been wandering alone for a while, he was still young after all, and he actually liked the warm embrace.","Weng Lan and Doctor Lu took care of him separately, one providing companionship and the other assisting with health monitoring.","Shen Wei would also always buy some supplementary food suitable for a three-year-old child.","Now the baby's supplementary food tastes good. Although not very nutritious, it can improve the child's condition.","The little fellow treasured those supplementary foods! After finishing eating, he would use his little hands to put the lid back on.","Weng Lan said to Shen Wei: \"This child still hasn't spoken, but children are very smart and understand everything.\"","He is already three years old, and it is late for a child to not have spoken yet. But Doctor Lu has examined him, and this child's development has no issues. He just hasn't been in an environment where he can speak.","He simply doesn't know how to speak.","Weng Lan provides enough stimulation for him every day, but the time has been short, and she cannot rush it.","Shen Wei nodded, not as worried about this matter as others.","Ping An is one of the certified villains in the system. His intelligence is unquestionable, as he can even intuitively understand the complexities of the human psyche. Speaking, on the other hand, is the simplest thing for him.","Just as Shen Wei was leaving, she saw Gu Qingyan running over from afar.","There was a different gleam in her eyes: \"Good news. Ping An's parents have been found!\"","Shen Wei quickly stepped forward: \"Really?\" She had been very worried about this matter. After all, without any clues, finding someone in a crowd was like finding a needle in a haystack.","Many people have carried this regret for their entire lives.","Although Shen Wei has the system, the system is unwilling to budge on certain matters!","Helping Ping An find his parents is not only a task given by the system, but even without this task, Shen Wei wanted to help him make up for this regret.","The child is truly too pitiful!","Gu Qingyan's Gu family still has considerable influence, and they didn't simply give up after reporting the case. Instead, they called people to thoroughly search through adoption organizations first before looking further.","They really found a clue. The person who lost the child had placed an ad in a previous newspaper.","They also went to find professional police officers to create a composite sketch, as a few-month-old baby would look different from a three-year-old child.","After identifying potential parents, they went door-to-door to verify.","They were quite fortunate, and through this method, they found five or six families, with the sixth family being the right one! A DNA comparison of hair samples confirmed they were a family.","As soon as Gu Qingyan received the news, she immediately came to tell Shen Wei.","Shen Wei was indeed delighted: \"That's great!\"","Shen Wei continued: \"Let's take the child to meet his parents first. They must be worried sick.\"","After being cleaned up, Ping An is a very handsome little boy. With their child lost, who knows how anxious the parents must have been.","Gu Qingyan seemed hesitant, as if unsure how to start speaking.","The smile on Shen Wei's face faded slightly, tinged with curiosity: \"What's wrong?\"","\"Their financial situation is not very good.\"","Shen Wei responded: \"Ah!\" To the wealthy Gu family, everyone else's financial situation would not be considered good."]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120: Searching for Family (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Shen Wei pondered for a moment but ultimately decided to go and have a look first!","She called Weng Lan and they took the child with them, sitting in the back row. Gu Qingyan drove, Shen Wei sat in the passenger seat. Now they had found Ping An's address!","For the time being, they would go down and check it out first. If there was no problem, they would call the child down.","Along the way, the car drove through the streets, out of the city, and onto a path leading to the countryside. At first, the road was still relatively flat, but after driving further, there were only large trees and farmlands on both sides, with very few houses.","The child had been good with Weng Lan these past few days, probably wanting to make up for the lack of \"hugs\" before. This child particularly liked being held. Even when sleeping, if they didn't sleep too soundly and were placed on the bed, they would immediately wake up.","The child's dependence made Weng Lan even more attentive!","Now Ping An was leaning against Weng Lan's embrace, the little face looking up at her. To have a child trust them like this was truly healing for a teacher.","The car had driven for three full hours before finally finding the place.","Shen Wei now understood what Gu Qingyan meant by having a poor family background – the houses here were all made of mud. The small courtyard wasn't big, just some vats and piles of miscellaneous items.","After getting out of the car, they went straight into the house.","\"Is this Song Laosan's family?\" According to the information, it should be this household.","A man came out of the house with a hint of sickness on his face, \"It's me!\" It was hard to imagine that a man could be that thin. His face also showed an abnormal flush.","Accompanying him was a woman who didn't look particularly young.","\"Are you also volunteers from the family-finding organization?\" They had come into contact with many people over the course of searching for the child, one after another.","Yet each time, they were filled with hope, only to be disappointed again.","Shen Wei said, \"Yes, we also want to inquire about the details of the child's disappearance.\"","Song Laosan sighed. For him, every recollection was a wound. With his body condition, he doubted he had two more years to live. He had no prospect of having other descendants, and the lost child was his only child in this life.","The woman beside him mocked Song Laosan, \"Even at this point, you still won't tell the truth?\" Her voice suddenly rose.","Song Laosan painfully covered his head.","Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan exchanged a glance. Their eyes held a hint of complexity. Fortunately, they didn't call the child down directly – it seemed there were other hidden circumstances surrounding this matter.","The woman said, \"Back then, I was married into his family for a dowry of 100,000 yuan.\" This woman was no longer young. She had been married before and had three children from her previous marriage, the eldest already 17 or 18 years old! And her previous three were all sons. After her divorce, many people tried to introduce her to others, aiming for her ability to bear children.","Song Laosan's family offered the most sincere dowry of 100,000 yuan. At the time, it shocked the villagers. Moreover, Song Laosan was more than ten years younger than her and had never been married before. So they became a couple with an older wife and younger husband.","They had a son named Song Baobao, showing just how doted on he was.","But after giving birth, Song Laosan developed tuberculosis. He was treated at a small hospital, and the disease was cured, but he was left with a persistent cough. His health declined. His mother said it was because the child had brought misfortune upon him.","Villagers were superstitious, and some gossiped about it, but it was just rumor-mongering.","Later, his mother took the child out to the market, and when she came back, she said the child was lost. The two of them didn't believe it at first. But no matter how hard they searched, they couldn't find him.","His mother took this opportunity to demand that the couple divorce and return the dowry!","This woman didn't tolerate her either. She went up and slapped her mother-in-law hard. The cries of her mother-in-law that day were heard throughout the entire village. But the child was still lost.","She was furious! Under her torment, her mother-in-law treated her like a rat in front of a cat. Her husband's health also deteriorated day by day – this was their punishment!"]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121: Reunion (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Shen Wei didn't expect their days to be so miserable.","However, seeing the anguish on the child's parents' faces was not feigned, and they were still full of affection for this child.","Shen Wei told them, \"This time we came here is actually because we have good news to tell you—the child has been found.\"","In an instant, the previously furious mother became dazed.","With a sense of disbelief, \"Really? Is it really true? You're not lying to me, are you?\" She repeatedly used these words to confirm the situation.","Shen Wei then took out a document from her bag, which showed that the DNA match rate between the two people was 99.99%, confirming their parental relationship.","\"Where is the child? Where is the child?\" The mother asked anxiously. The child's father was dumbstruck.","It was as if a great joy had overwhelmed his mind, leaving him momentarily stunned.","Finally, Shen Wei asked Weng Lan to bring the child down.","The child's mother immediately hugged the child tightly, startling the little one, who then made animal-like threatening sounds.","But how could a mother be afraid of her own child? She hugged the child close and kissed them repeatedly.","Feeling the tiny warmth in her embrace, she experienced the surprise of regaining what she had lost.","The child's mother burst into tears.","Anyone who heard it would feel their heart ache.","It was as if the pain ingrained deep within her had finally been released.","At that moment, quite a few people in the village were attracted by the cries.","They had known before that the couple was very distressed after losing their child, but they had never cried like this before.","They initially thought it was either a TV station or some online volunteers filming a program.","But this time, they discovered an astonishing fact—they had actually found their own child.","Ping An looked very much like the villager Song Laosan.","At a glance, it was clear that he was their own flesh and blood. Song Laosan couldn't help but shed tears, as even his illness hadn't made him lose composure like this. But seeing his long-lost child, he couldn't hold back.","At that moment, the shallow-hearted villagers couldn't help but shed tears as well.","Some busybodies in the village went straight to find Song Laosan's mother, who was said to have lost the child back then.","She was slapped in the face by her own daughter-in-law, and the incident became a hot topic.","But most people didn't sympathize with her, after all, it was true that she didn't like the child.","They didn't expect this child to be found again.","The busybodies just wanted to know her reaction now.","After a while, an old lady came running out.","She was running too fast and even had her shoes on the wrong feet, \"Is this little Bao?\"","The old lady took a look, and the child's mother immediately hugged the child protectively, like a mother animal guarding her cub.","This time, no matter what, she wouldn't let the old lady take the child away. The old lady also cried.","\"All these years, you've been misunderstanding me. The child was actually snatched by human traffickers on the street.\"","She said, but no one believed her. Everyone suspected that the child might have been abandoned by her.","For the sake of a dowry, this was simply heartbreaking.","After the child went missing, she claimed it was because the child was bringing misfortune to her family members. If a child just a few months old was thrown out, could they really survive?","This child was snatched by human traffickers on the street.","The traffickers must have been lurking and gathering information for some time.","Knowing her reputation in the village, if the child was in her hands, everyone would suspect her.","She thought she would never find the child again at her age, but unexpectedly, the child's fate was great, and they came back.","At this point, what the old lady said might be true.","But the rift between mother-in-law and daughter-in-law had already formed.","Regardless of whether the child was abandoned or abducted,","it couldn't conceal the fact that the child went missing.","Even if she had initially misunderstood her mother-in-law, the daughter-in-law didn't want to forgive her.","The surrounding villagers said, \"Thanks to those volunteers.\"","For any parent, whose heart wouldn't ache if their child went missing? Now that the child has been found, it's all good. Everyone offered comforting words.","Shen Wei saw that their days were indeed difficult.","So she said that the child could be provided for, and for now, they could stay at the kindergarten.","They would cover the costs of elementary, middle, high school, and university education. Finally, she introduced her own kindergarten.","In the village, they had to go to the next village for kindergarten.","There was hardly any educational quality, just childcare.","They had some small toys, but the environment was far inferior to that of the city.","The woman knelt down, \"Thank you, thank you so much. If it weren't for you, I wouldn't have found my child. If you hadn't come, we wouldn't know what to do with this child!\"","Shen Wei quickly helped her up.","To her surprise, the man next to her also knelt down, saying, \"Thank you, thank you.\"","Shen Wei pulled one up and then the other.","It was fortunate that they acted quickly; otherwise, these two would have kowtowed.","Seeing that their living conditions were too difficult, Shen Wei gave them around 20,000 yuan and told them to buy some good food and medicine!","Now that the child had been found, and she was providing all the necessary expenses for raising the child,","this family could maintain a good life. But to their surprise, the woman said, \"Divorce is a must.\"","Initially, she didn't divorce because she had one lingering attachment—to find her own child.","Now that the child had been found, she could no longer endure such a life.","If it weren't for his mother, the child wouldn't have gone missing.","When she gave birth to this son at an advanced age, it was an enormous risk.","She didn't expect that after risking her life to bring a new life into this world, she would be treated like this.","Fortunately, they met kind people who helped them find their child.","This was her lifelong regret, a huge obstacle in her heart that she couldn't get over.","The man looked at his wife and said, \"This incident is my fault. I agree to the divorce!\"","The nearby villagers couldn't help but say, \"Now that the child has been found, live a good life!\"","But this family had already become riddled with problems because of the child's disappearance.","The child's mother had spent so much time with this man, and there was some affection between them. The kind person left the 20,000 yuan for them to buy medicine and didn't interfere further.","She hugged the child tightly and kissed them again.","After all, blood ties run deep. Ping An didn't like being held by others, but he didn't mind being kissed by his birth mother.","Instead, he even smiled sweetly, not to mention the child's mother bursting into tears; even Shen Wei felt a pang of heartache.","\"By the way, what's the child's name?\" the child's mother asked.","\"Ping An.\"","The child's mother murmured: \"Ping An is good, Ping An is good.\"","Previously, the name Song Baobao was changed to Song Ping An.","The child has been found.","The system started rewarding madly.","\"Congratulations on helping Song Ping An find her biological parents. System reward: 1 million yuan.\"","\"Space upgraded to 20 square meters.\"","\"Unlocked the mall roulette, two spins.\"","\"Reward: alter the original life trajectory by 15%. Special hint: find Qin Shu and sever his connection to Shen Qingqing.\""]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122: System Rewards 02","paragraphs":["Shen Wei was particularly concerned about the System's final reward.","The sudden appearance of this name felt vaguely familiar to Shen Wei, but she couldn't quite place it.","She immediately flipped through the original book in the System space.","This book was based on the love story of Shen Qingqing and Boss Lu.","Most of it described how they fell sweetly in love, with some content not suitable for children.","Shen Wei wasn't particularly interested.","After seeing her own character's demise, she had been blinded by anger and hadn't looked closely at the later plot developments in the original book.","However, Qin Shu played a significant role in the story.","Qin Shu was the illegitimate son of the wealthy Qin Family. But he was never acknowledged, couldn't show his face in public, and was openly mocked and insulted by the family matriarch.","He became a huge joke within the upper-class circles.","The book described how Shen Qingqing helped Qin Shu, and he became her subordinate in return.","He helped her gain publicity, portraying her as an innocent and pure-hearted person.","This allowed Shen Qingqing to establish a firm foothold in the wealthy circles.","After all, the upper class was where the social hierarchy was most evident.","Shen Wei suddenly understood the System's intention. Without Qin Shu, it would be like Shen Qingqing losing an arm.","Even if she couldn't use him for her own purposes, she absolutely couldn't let Shen Qingqing keep him.","At this moment, while Shen Qingqing was immersed in competing with her, it was the perfect opportunity to find out more about Qin Shu's situation.","Shen Wei had resolved the matter with the child.","Song Ping An's parents accompanied the child to the kindergarten to see it for themselves.","The environment at Starry Sky Kindergarten and the children's living quarters were both excellent.","With so many teachers around, the couple, being from the lower rungs of society, seemed somewhat awestruck and nervous.","They repeatedly expressed their gratitude, and if it weren't for Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan's quick reactions, the couple would have knelt down and kowtowed again.","Shen Wei looked at the child's mother and asked, \"So what are your plans for the future?\"","The child's mother replied, \"I'll go to the county to find some work.\" She would come back to see the child every few days.","As for the child's father, who cared what happened to him.","Over the years, their relationship had become mutually torturous.","The child's father said that finding his son was more effective than any medicine he could take.","He didn't want to hold the woman back any longer, so this was for the best.","Since both parties agreed, Shen Wei didn't say anything more.","Afterwards, the parents left, agreeing between themselves.","One would come to see the child on days 1, 3, and 5, while the other would come on days 2, 4, and 6. They would only visit the child, with no plans to interact much with the child's other parent.","Weng Lan looked at the confused Song Ping An and said, \"Sometimes it's good that children don't understand everything.\"","At least he wouldn't suffer too much emotional harm.","Shen Wei nodded.","Gu Qingyan was also delighted; the situation had developed better than he had imagined.","After everyone left, only Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan remained. She couldn't help but say, \"Thanks so much for your help this time.\"","She really couldn't have managed it alone.","Gu Qingyan's face immediately turned red: \"It's no problem, I'm just glad I could help.\"","Shen Wei had always been so capable that Gu Qingyan often worried about being useless.","He was very happy to have been able to help Shen Wei this time.","With Shen Wei nearby, he didn't dare to show his excitement too much, afraid of appearing childish.","Shen Wei said, \"I'll treat you to a meal next time.\"","Gu Qingyan nodded eagerly.","As if afraid that a moment's delay would make the offer disappear.","Shen Wei couldn't help but laugh: \"You're quite amusing.\"","Gu Qingyan became even more careful not to make a fool of himself.","Seeing that Shen Wei had fallen silent, Gu Qingyan inched closer to her, little by little.","He said, \"If you need any help in the future, please don't hesitate to ask me. Don't be polite with me, we've known each other since we were little!\"","Ever since finding that photograph, he had felt quite proud of himself.","Shen Wei replied, \"Alright, I'll remember that.\"","Liu Chef came over to call Shen Wei, saying he wanted to discuss some matters about the vegetable garden with her.","Gu Qingyan told them to go ahead with their business.","After the two left, Gu Qingyan couldn't contain himself any longer. He jumped up in excitement."]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123: Lottery","paragraphs":["This scene was actually live-streamed.","Gu Qingyan's father, mother, brother, and sister were all loyal fans of the live stream room.","They quickly sent him a message: \"You silly boy.\"","The outdoor camera didn't capture their conversation, only Gu Qingyan's reaction.","It looked as if Shen Wei said something to him, making him this happy.","Gu Qingyan didn't expect it to be live-streamed, almost forgetting there were cameras here.","He slunk away, his face flushed red.","The internet was full of teasing remarks about him.","\"So when will Gu Qingyan finally be able to win over the goddess?\"","\"At this rate, it'll take 100 years.\"","In the live stream room, Gu Qingyan's family members all agreed with that comment.","This guy who has never dated before is just hopeless, with no experience in handling things, not even a bit composed.","Only his face is somewhat outstanding.","But at Starry Sky Kindergarten, Gu Qingyan is absolutely the most handsome.","Yet if compared to the rugged handsome type, he still has a lot of room for improvement.","Gu Qingyan's relatives were worrying about him, but he was completely oblivious.","His heart was fully focused on Shen Wei.","Shen Wei's vegetable garden was almost finished.","Shen Wei went over to take a look. There were two greenhouses, while the remaining areas were all exposed, with workers laying down a few truckloads of soil from the mountain.","Liu Chef pinched the soil on the ground. This soil layer wasn't very thick after being compacted.","Although the land had been tilled before, this was still a construction site area.","The soil quality was somewhat too hard. It might not be good for growing crops.","Liu Chef couldn't help but say, \"I shouldn't have done such a good job.\"","He loved to show off, eager to tell everyone about any good deed.","Now that everyone knew he had done a great job with the vegetable garden.","It made him puff up with pride.","He was even more invested in the vegetable garden than Shen Wei.","The vegetable garden had now taken its basic shape.","But he was hesitating. With the soil lacking fertility, could it yield good produce?","It wasn't him worrying over nothing.","There were quite a few people with gardens on the first floor in the city too.","These people originally just wanted to experience the joy of country life.","But what they grew were all deformed melons and cracked persimmons.","They had never seen such ugly cucumbers. The persimmons looked malnourished.","Just looking at them was an eyesore.","Not to mention putting them in your mouth to eat.","They had no appeal whatsoever.","He used to mock those people.","Now, looking at this land, he was suddenly worried too.","After all, Shen Wei had invested 2 million in this.","If the vegetable garden wasn't done well, he would feel guilty towards Shen Wei.","\"It's no problem!\" Shen Wei said.","This former construction land might have some heavy metal contamination that damaged the soil. Let me check the system's merit mall to see if there's a solution.","Shen Wei's calmness made Liu Chef feel ashamed.","He, an adult, couldn't keep his composure as well as this young person.","\"After some time, we can plant the seeds in the ground. The kids can come and observe.\"","This was a common scene in the village but rarely seen in the city. It would be a special outdoor class.","Shen Wei immediately agreed.","Since this was the case, the timing for planting became crucial, and they needed to improve the soil.","Shen Wei immediately went into the system space to check the system's merit mall.","Apart from the discounted and high-tech sections, everything else was sold at exorbitant prices.","Shen Wei's 200,000 or so merits weren't enough for anything.","She found some fertilizers for improving the soil and increasing yields, but they cost a whopping 780,000 merits each.","And now the system had become smarter, giving out cash rewards but being stingy with merits.","Agricultural products in the merit mall had become ridiculously expensive.","Shen Wei was at a loss.","The system prompted: \"Why don't you try the merit roulette?\"","This time, for saving the third villain Song Ping An, the system had added a new feature: the merit roulette. Shen Wei took a look - there were 20 slots in total, with 10 slots containing fertilizers and the other 10 saying \"Thank you for participating.\"","Shen Wei still had two free spins remaining.","If she could just draw a fertilizer, that would be great.","The odds were about 50/50. Shen Wei's confidence surged, and she immediately spun. The first spin landed on 50 pounds of fertilizer!","When the golden light flashed, Shen Wei was overjoyed.","She was ecstatic. But then she realized that 50 pounds of fertilizer could only cover 1/10 of the land area after mixing it into the soil.","The 2 million she had invested wasn't a small plot of land.","That meant she still needed 450 more pounds of fertilizer.","Moreover, this was the first time nourishing the land, so it had to be thoroughly nourished.","Shen Wei felt that the system had dug a trap for her.","She still had one more chance.","She then asked the system, \"How many merits is one spin?\"","The system replied, \"5,000 merits per spin!\"","\"As expected.\"","But there was no other way. The land had already been bought, and she would have to buy the fertilizer eventually. This fertilizer not only nourished the soil but also removed heavy metals and other impurities, making it an essential need."]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124: System Gone Bad","paragraphs":["It cost 5,000 points to draw once, and Shen Wei still felt a bit heartbroken about it.","The System recently stopped rewarding points, so all her daily points came from exchanging online reputation.","She earned only a few hundred points per day, and this draw cost the equivalent of 10 days' worth of reputation.","Moreover, her kindergarten had already established a solid online presence, and her base was fixed.","She had created a miracle in the kindergarten field, but online, video sites could not promote her forever. Her traffic was declining, affecting her point acquisition.","Now there was only a 50% chance of winning a prize in the draw.","But she had no choice but to spend, as drawing was still better than redeeming from the points mall.","Shen Wei had drawn once before, successfully obtaining a 50-pound bag of fertilizer.","She still had one free chance remaining. So she locked herself alone in her room, feeling a bit nervous - draws always had an element of mysticism!","She immersed her entire mind and soul into it, clicking the draw button once.","Her heart leaped up.","Soon, she felt a slight tremor in the mall, followed by a flash of golden light, and the System's calm electronic voice sounded.","\"Congratulations, Shen Wei has won one 50-pound bag of fertilizer.\"","With her current land area, she still needed 8 more bags.","This fertilizer could thoroughly improve the soil environment, isolate heavy metals, and completely change the soil quality. Otherwise, it would take at least 20 years for natural metabolism and decomposition!","She had to buy it, and the System offered no discounts.","There was only a 50% chance, and she wouldn't be so lucky every time.","Shen Wei felt a bit anxious.","The pressure of the remaining 8 bags weighed heavily on her heart. With a slight tremor and the familiar golden flash, she drew another one successfully.","Her free quota was used up, and she spent a hard-earned 5,000 points.","Now she only needed 7 more bags.","Shen Wei's confidence inexplicably increased, so she chose to do a 10-draw.","She had played card games before, and a 10-draw had a higher probability.","She directly recharged 50,000 points.","After the System successfully deducted the points, Shen Wei felt a pang - she had used up a quarter of her points just like that.","Shen Wei thought that as long as she drew 7 bags in these 10 draws, it would be enough.","She had already obtained 3 bags and wasn't greedy - she only needed enough for herself.","She clicked the 10-draw, and this time the tremor was even stronger.","Flashes of light flickered in Shen Wei's mind, accompanied by the shaking of the entire points mall. Shen Wei couldn't contain her joy, but when she looked at the result, she was dumbfounded.","She drew 6 bags, and 4 times it was \"Thank you for your patronage.\"","Only one bag was left.","Shen Wei had a bad feeling, as if this was the System's trick to lure more spending.","It was always like this in previous paid games - the closer you got, the farther away it seemed.","Rationally, Shen Wei thought she could make do with the 9 bags of fertilizer first.","She could try again when she felt particularly lucky, but she couldn't resist.","After all, she was just one bag short.","Even though she knew there might be a trap ahead,","Shen Wei's OCD kicked in, and she clicked heavily, only to get \"Thank you for your patronage\" again. She had already spent 60,000 points.","The points mall used to be quite friendly.","Shen Wei had never redeemed anything too expensive before, but now she had spent so much, and her heart was bleeding.","Just one bag short, and dawn seemed so close.","So she clicked again, silently praying that if this didn't work, she would take the 9 bags of fertilizer to improve the soil and leave some land for other uses.","This time, she felt a tremor and her heart leaped with joy.","She looked over eagerly and anxiously, and indeed a golden light flashed: \"Success!\"","The System's cold voice said: \"Congratulations, Shen Wei has successfully obtained one bag of fertilizer.\"","A total of 10 bags of this high-tech fertilizer cost 65,000 points.","Regardless, Shen Wei had resolved this issue.","The fertilizer was currently stored in her private space.","After the last upgrade, the space was now 20 square meters.","She called someone to transport it to the vegetable garden next door.","Workers were loosening the soil.","Shen Wei instructed them to mix the 10 bags of fertilizer with the soil in the proper proportion and spread it evenly over the land to nourish it.","These former farmers were experts at the task Shen Wei assigned them. They finished it quickly and skillfully.","They were paid promptly, and the work was light.","When they were done, they were reluctant to leave. The foreman said, \"Call us if you have any more work in the future. We'll definitely give you the best price.\"","Shen Wei noted down their contact information.","After they left,","Liu Chef came by after getting off work.","He had always taken a keen interest in this small vegetable garden.","It was his words that initially prompted Shen Wei to spend a fortune buying it.","Seeing the 2 million investment about to go down the drain, Liu Chef would get furious and develop large mouth ulcers every day.","But today, for some reason, as soon as he entered, he felt something different. The formerly dry and barren land had suddenly become rich and moist.","Although he didn't know what had happened, he was inexplicably excited.","The land had turned fertile again, and there was hope for the vegetable garden."]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125: Children's Intuition","paragraphs":["The soil quality of the vegetable field improved, making Liu Chef overjoyed.","He kept taking photos with his phone, afraid that it was just a dream.","The next morning, the first thing he did was rush to the vegetable field to take a look.","He found that today's vegetable field had an even better luster than yesterday's.","This soil was clearly fertile and nutrient-rich.","Liu Chef's worries were instantly lifted, and he wanted to quickly share this good news with Shen Wei.","But no matter how he searched, he couldn't find Shen Wei, and eventually learned from others that Shen Wei had gone out, apparently to take care of some matters.","Liu Chef nodded and then asked about how Song Ping An was doing.","Song Ping An was a child recently rescued by Shen Wei. Due to his tender age, he was a bit clingy to Weng Lan.","He had heard that the child could now call for dad and mom.","The last time his father came and heard the child call him, he broke down in tears.","The next day when his mother came and heard the child call her mom, she reacted the same way as the father, hugging the child and weeping.","The parents were extremely grateful to Weng Lan and the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Song Ping An's eyes were bright and intelligent. Previously, he didn't speak due to lack of a language environment, but once he could open his mouth, he learned faster than most children.","Perhaps it was due to his experience of wandering.","He had an innate animal instinct.","For those who were friendly to him, he would grin happily.","For those who were unfriendly, he would bare his teeth at them.","Although this trick was learned from animals, it worked really well.","Once when someone was delivering supplies, he growled directly at a rice delivery worker.","Weng Lan found this person strange.","After investigation, it was discovered that the rice he delivered was of poor quality, and some even contained aflatoxin.","Shen Wei always bought the highest quality and most expensive rice.","Who would have thought that the rice would be adulterated?","They immediately reported it to the store, and the store owner was terrified.","The Starry Sky Kindergarten was a major customer, and the owner usually served them personally.","This time, he had just sent a worker to deliver the rice.","Who knew this person would be so unscrupulous?","He had taken spoiled rice from the inventory and passed it off as good rice.","Worse, some of the rice had gone moldy.","Moldy rice can be fatal.","The owner was deeply shaken.","He then personally reported the case and had the worker arrested.","This batch of rice was clearly meant to be discarded.","Who would have thought the delivery worker would take it back for personal gain?","He might have felt guilty, so he scolded the kindergarten children.","Little did he know this child would be so fiercely protective.","Weng Lan immediately sensed something was amiss.","After this incident, Liu Chef was deeply impacted.","He couldn't recover from the shock for a long time.","He told everyone that if any food was found to be problematic, they should report it immediately.","Although they had previously had a good partnership with this rice supplier, after this incident, no one dared to use their products anymore.","So they inspected all the products from this supplier.","Any products without issues could remain in use, but any problematic ones would be returned immediately.","After that, they would switch to other suppliers.","This time they were fortunate thanks to Song Ping An.","Liu Chef himself loved children dearly.","And now that Song Ping An had done such a great deed, Liu Chef doted on him even more, using his own money to buy the little one treats.","Liu Chef was already quite plump, and his cooking skills were highly acclaimed in the kindergarten.","Now, in front of little Song Ping An, even his own grandchildren had to take a back seat.","Facing Song Ping An, Liu Chef's voice became high-pitched: \"Oh my, so clever, this baby is so smart!\"","Although Song Ping An didn't quite understand what Liu Chef was saying,","he could tell from the tone that it was praise,","so he grinned widely.","Liu Chef couldn't resist kissing his chubby little face and picking him up to weigh him, still finding him too light.","Little Song Ping An had gained nearly 10 pounds.","But in Liu Chef's eyes, he still wasn't plump enough.","Liu Chef went to find Doctor Lu again, asking for dietary recipes.","Doctor Lu had a nutrition certification.","This matter required \"following medical advice.\"","Doctor Lu said, \"Shen Wei doesn't allow him to eat too much yet, because he had a stomach injury before, so the priority is to heal his stomach first.\"","This child had been malnourished from a young age, and without intervention, it would affect his lifespan.","So they had to take it slow.","This statement terrified Liu Chef: \"Okay, I'll listen to you.\"","After all, Doctor Lu was the professional.","Liu Chef's love for children was pure.","But he couldn't be too hasty; there would be plenty of time later.","Liu Chef didn't know where Shen Wei had gone.","But whenever Shen Wei was mentioned, he couldn't help but say, \"Our young boss is good in every way, just too kind-hearted!\"","Every time a child was rescued, the parents' respect for the kindergarten became evident.","They might not do the same themselves, but that didn't stop them from admiring such actions.","The children at the kindergarten were happy every day.","They ate well, dressed well, slept well, and played well, and their parents were all grateful.","Ever since their children went to the kindergarten, relatives became more attentive.","Many asked when the next enrollment would be, hoping their children could attend the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Initially, the Starry Sky Kindergarten was a commoner's kindergarten, but it adopted an aristocratic kindergarten's admission process.","Many people didn't come at first.","The first admission had 1,000 applicants, far exceeding the kindergarten's capacity.","But most people were just observing, and now the first batch of observers regretted it.","Compared to those expensive and unsatisfactory kindergartens,","the Starry Sky Kindergarten was truly excellent.","The only issue was that it had been established for too short a time.","Some wealthier parents felt a sense of superiority over this \"internet-famous\" kindergarten.","And that was their undoing, as the more they learned, the more they regretted it.","They wished they had sent their children to the Starry Sky Kindergarten from the start.","Every so often, someone would ask when the Starry Sky Kindergarten would open a second location.","Not to mention the previous price of 260, even if it was now 1,600, everyone would consider it a great deal.","The kindergarten was now under intense public scrutiny, and all the employees were on their best behavior.","It was fortunate that Shen Wei had a big heart; otherwise, like them, just bearing such high expectations would have crushed them.","Liu Chef thought Shen Wei would be gone for a while and then return.","But unexpectedly, Shen Wei was gone the entire morning and didn't come back.","Everyone had gotten used to it by now.","After all, the entire management team of the kindergarten was now in place.","Shen Wei coming here is like a good luck charm. Whether she comes or not doesn't affect the operation of the kindergarten.","At the moment, Shen Wei, whom Liu Chef had been eagerly anticipating, was drinking tea with Qin Shu.","Qin Shu is the person the system heavily reminds about. In the original book, he was Shen Qingqing's right-hand man.","This is the first time Shen Wei has met Qin Shu.","They are both in the same circle, so getting each other's contact information wouldn't be difficult.","It was Shen Wei who called and wanted to meet him for coffee, and although Qin Shu didn't understand why, he still came.","This is the first time Shen Wei has met Qin Shu.","Qin Shu is a gloomy and depressed person, and even someone as open-hearted as Shen Wei could sense it.","To be honest, Qin Shu is very handsome, and his intense sense of brokenness is actually quite attractive.","It would arouse others' protective instincts.","Shen Wei had intended to discuss some matters with him, but she didn't expect his state to be so poor, as if he were about to shatter."]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126: Recruitment of Talent","paragraphs":["Qin Shu had heard of Shen Wei.","After all, in the high society nowadays, the most talked about was this rising star, Shen Wei.","Her family was originally a nouveau riche, looked down upon by many.","In the aristocratic circles, she was simply not accepted at their tables.","But she had managed to carve out a bloody path by opening a kindergarten.","The Young Master of the Liu Family attended Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Gradually, more and more children from aristocratic families also chose Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The entire aristocratic kindergarten scene was put on the fire.","The previously arrogant aristocratic kindergartens began to advertise extensively.","They built equestrian facilities and even opened classes for the general public.","The kindergarten was a game-changer. Even more surprising was the second pop-up store.","Everyone witnessed a miracle.","The kindergarten was her \"charity\" work.","But the pop-up store made Shen Wei's formidable influence even more apparent.","The pop-up store was a dream space for adults, and it went viral instantly.","Afterward, more and more people besides Shen Qingqing started to open large-scale immersive entertainment venues.","But no matter how luxurious the decor, none of them were as popular as the pop-up store.","The pop-up store had 10,000 people online at the same time, but only 500 tickets were released.","Even the aristocratic tycoons, after visiting a few times, directly sponsored Shen Wei with 50 million without asking for anything in return.","For a tycoon to take the initiative to curry favor, this was simply an unbelievable thing.","Although Qin Shu couldn't make it into the inner circles of the aristocracy, he was particularly adept at gathering information online.","Although he had never met Shen Wei, news about her kept reaching his ears.","It was unexpected when Shen Wei contacted him.","But after meeting her in person, his first reaction was that Shen Wei was too young.","She was just a college graduate, and he didn't expect her to have such great ability to leverage capital.","Whether it was her old kindergarten business or the pop-up store, her strength was not to be underestimated.","Every person in high society could keenly perceive the value in it.","Qin Shu just didn't know what Shen Wei wanted from him.","But he could stay calm.","They sat facing each other for ten minutes, the atmosphere so awkward it seemed to freeze, but he didn't open his mouth to speak.","Finally, it was Shen Wei who took the initiative to say, \"Are you willing to join our kindergarten?\"","Shen Wei had carefully reviewed the original work and knew that Qin Shu was a very capable person.","Shen Wei was now expanding her business scope.","She actually needed quite a few people.","Moreover, she had been thinking about opening a second Starry Sky Kindergarten.","With her current influence, it wasn't difficult to recruit professionals, but to hire management, she needed to find someone she trusted.","A capable and talented person like Qin Shu was a good choice.","Of course, Qin Shu was unaware of Shen Wei's thoughts.","At this moment, faced with the olive branch extended by Shen Wei, Qin Shu was taken aback.","Then a mocking smile appeared at the corner of his mouth, \"Why choose me? You already have everything.\"","Qin Shu's appearance was not bad, but he was the illegitimate son of an aristocrat, and he was not favored by the aristocratic lady.","Although he was raised in an aristocratic family, he had always been a guest, like a rat in the gutter.","His identity, coupled with the impression he gave off, meant that no one from the aristocracy could look upon him favorably.","Shen Wei immediately understood why Shen Qingqing could be with him.","It was because the two of them spoke the same language.","When Shen Qingqing was with Boss Lu, she was also disliked and rejected by others, so she and Qin Shu were essentially the same kind of person, making it easier for them to resonate with each other.","Shen Wei's heart skipped a beat.","In fact, Qin Shu looked down on Shen Wei because, to him, Shen Wei had been too lucky and smooth-sailing.","That's why he said, \"You already have everything,\" as soon as they met.","Shen Wei had interacted with so many people and could vaguely sense the different personalities of each person. \"I really hope you'll join us.\"","\"Everything was created by my own hands, and this feeling is truly fascinating. Don't you want to try it?\"","Qin Shu didn't understand Shen Wei's words, but they were clearly very appealing.","Anyone who has been overlooked and uncherished has fantasized about suddenly becoming powerful, and those who once looked down on them would now bow and scrape before them.","Apparently, Shen Wei's ship was large enough to carry him.","Qin Shu's heart wavered, but only for a brief moment. \"I don't like it.\"","But Shen Wei heard his words contradict his heart.","No one doesn't crave acceptance.","If he truly disliked it, he wouldn't have come.","Shen Wei also knew that this kind of prickly talent couldn't be changed with just one conversation - they had their own convictions and thoughts.","Shen Wei said, \"Here's what we'll do. I'll give you two tickets to our pop-up store. If you like it, we can talk again. If not, just consider it a chance to relax and have fun.\"","Qin Shu looked at Shen Wei and said, \"Why me?\"","He didn't have a good reputation in aristocratic circles.","Shen Wei said, \"I think you're capable.\" Obviously, talented young people were susceptible to this kind of flattery. Qin Shu then nodded and said, \"Okay.\"","He took the pop-up store tickets and left.","Shen Wei wondered if he would go.","Every time the pop-up store released tickets, many people couldn't get them.","Shen Wei had specially made fifty paper tickets to give away.","This was the first time she was giving them out.","The odds of getting pop-up store tickets were low - about the same as a housing lottery or car plate auction.","Most people chose to go themselves. Some couldn't resist the temptation and resold their tickets before registration, with each one going for over 10,000 yuan in scalped sales paid instantly.","The Starry Sky pop-up store was a hot commodity.","Many people opened stores imitating hers, with new themes like zombie, hospital, and endless themes.","But none of them could replicate the advantages of the Starry Sky pop-up store, like their food, atmosphere, and even the \"lively\" patrons.","A group of interesting people in an interesting place made it even more enticing.","It was truly fascinating. Qin Shu invited his old friend, \"I have two tickets to the pop-up store. Do you want to go?\"","Qin Shu's friend was a neighbor he had met when he was living on the streets years ago.","They had kept in touch over the years. \"Is it the Starry Sky pop-up store?\" The friend was quite excited.","Qin Shu let out a light laugh: \"Yes, the Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","Qin Shu's close friend said: \"You're going to take me with you?\" His tone carried a hint of surprise and delight.","Qin Shu said: \"Are you going or not?\"","\"Going, going, going! How did you manage to get tickets? I've been trying to get them for months. I haven't been able to get any. You're really something.\" He went on babbling.","Qin Shu didn't say a word, but kept listening.","After hanging up the phone, Qin Shu felt an unfamiliar smile and an unprecedented sense of lightness creep onto his face.","His mood suddenly became complicated, with Shen Wei having mixed feelings.","He hadn't even gone yet, but he was already filled with anticipation."]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127: The Charm of Pop-Up Shops","paragraphs":["Qin Shu had heard of pop-up shops before, but this was his first time visiting one.","Unlike his Close Friend who meticulously planned their outing, Qin Shu wore a huge cosplay costume and people outside were taking pictures with him.","Qin Shu felt embarrassed.","His Close Friend seemed addicted to it, randomly turning their tourist visit into a role-playing experience.","Once inside the park, a kindergarten teacher affectionately called them little friends.","Then everyone found their class based on the names listed.","Following their class, they could choose to attend an art class or act in a play first.","He and his friend were assigned to the same class.","This place was a 1:1 recreation of the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","As mature adults, it had been a long time since they were treated like children.","It was quite touching for them, as students had student pressure, office workers had office pressure, and everyone seemed surrounded by immense pressure, except here where they could be treated as little friends.","The play they were assigned this time was a spy drama.","Unlike previous experiences, they didn't even know their own identities. There were three factions, and each had to eliminate members of the other factions while finding their own comrades.","Additionally, each person had 2-3 professional identities, such as a rickshaw puller or a waiter.","This was an advanced version of the game.","The play was originally intended as a TV series, but the scriptwriter had been refining it for a long time.","However, due to the long production cycle, it was repurposed as an immersive play for them.","Manager Su Jun couldn't bear to see such a great script wasted.","The youth were full of ideas, and with the guidance of professional drama instructors, they planned out the script.","They had internal tested it fifteen or sixteen times.","They were very confident in this script, and its effect was explosively successful.","Online, people were stunned: \"I really want to play this game.\"","\"I've always known Shen Wei was wealthy, but this time she's really exceeded my imagination. Using such a premium script for an immersive experience.\"","\"I envy those who managed to get tickets.\"","\"In recent years, no spy drama has been as rich as this.\"","\"I wish I could go too, I love watching spy dramas, but the scripts nowadays are mediocre. Who knew the best script would be used for a game?\"","Online, people were buzzing.","In reality, the players were also thoroughly engrossed.","Although Qin Shu had never played before, he was highly intelligent.","With his calm demeanor, no one could discern which faction he belonged to.","As he played, Qin Shu's aura gradually changed.","The small leaders of the three organizations were all trying to recruit him.","But only the omniscient audience knew that he was actually a member tasked with delivering medical supplies, sought by the righteous faction while the opposing faction wanted to eliminate him.","Everyone was tense because his identity card had such a minor role.","But he was a true expert. Several times he emerged undefeated, displaying incredible wit not written in the script.","Viewers watched with bated breath.","\"I was wrong, I'm not worthy of this game.\"","\"Thank goodness I didn't play, just watching terrified me!\"","In the end, he successfully delivered the medical supplies to the front line, then heroically sacrificed himself.","Although it was just an immersive game, his expression was so rich that everyone present was moved.","\"Why watch acting variety shows when you can watch this?\"","\"Each time, you discover all kinds of acting prodigies.\"","\"They're just regular people with no acting training, but their performances, their eyes, make you feel like there's a story in them.\"","Qin Shu's Close Friend was the first to be eliminated.","He exposed his identity too quickly and was discovered, swiftly dealt with by the opposing faction.","Those eliminated could watch the play on a big screen in another room.","Qin Shu's \"death\" made his Close Friend cry.","When everyone took their curtain call after the play ended, his Close Friend's eyes were red from crying.","He immediately hugged Qin Shu, too overwhelmed to speak.","The live audience was similarly affected, and online viewers cried en masse.","This patriotic theme was far more moving than petty romance.","After the performance, they found it quite enjoyable.","But the 4-hour immersive play was extremely exhausting.","It wasn't until lunchtime that they recovered.","There were master chefs on site, and the food was delicious.","Qin Shu, born to a wealthy family, had never been deprived in food and drink.","He had dined at many renowned restaurants but was still astonished by the food here.","No wonder this place initially gained fame for its cuisine.","They truly did charitable work.","Even he, usually uninterested in food, ate a lot.","Eating such satisfying food brought an unfamiliar sense of fullness, truly gratifying.","In the afternoon, everyone discovered Qin Shu was a talented all-rounder.","He had studied street dance before and danced gracefully with the dance instructor.","Afterward, he even performed a solo, stunning the entire audience.","After excelling at dance, the next class was art.","Using oil pastels, he painted Monet's Water Lilies from memory without referencing an image.","The oil pastels captured the texture of oil painting.","Even Qi Zhong watched him intently, and when he added just a couple of strokes to Qin Shu's already impressive painting, it immediately felt alive.","Expertise truly requires specialization.","Those two strokes were the finishing touches.","Qi Zhong rarely helped others with paintings, doing so this time because he genuinely felt it was good.","The third class was singing, taught by a blind music teacher.","Qin Shu had some inner troubles, but seeing a truly disabled person gave him a different perspective.","He realized he shouldn't be so self-pitying but face life more positively.","The final class was calligraphy, and by the end, everyone was reluctant to leave.","They knew getting tickets for the next event would be difficult.","The pop-up shop provided an unprecedented sense of exhilaration.","Qin Shu's Close Friend kept saying: \"What do you think? Didn't I tell you this place is great? If only we could come every day, it's really stress-relieving!\"","Qin Shu remained silent, but there were people arguing in front of him.","Close Friend went over and found that a customer insisted on taking away the buffet food, but Su Jun refused. Unexpectedly, the customer lost his temper and started swearing loudly.","As the manager, Su Jun quietly listened and apologized. Close Friend was furious in an instant.","\"The forest has grown too large, harboring all kinds of birds!\"","They paid 400 yuan for a day's experience here, and received such great service, showing how much effort all the employees had put in silently.","Yet someone still came to make trouble.","Clearly, they had already provided services worth more than the money, but the customer still wanted to take away food greedily, which was unreasonable."]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128: Niu Niu is very cute","paragraphs":["Qin Shu's personality was such that he preferred not to meddle in other people's affairs.","However, when his childhood friend rushed over, he had no choice but to follow.","They saw Su Jun repeatedly apologizing, but the other party was unyielding: \"I spent 400 yuan here. Just for one meal? What's wrong with taking some back to taste?\"","Su Jun said, \"I'm sorry, but the buffet items cannot be taken out.\"","\"I paid for it, dammit.\"","The childhood friend chimed in, \"If you can afford 400 yuan, then spend it. If you can't, don't try to punch above your weight.\"","\"What, you think spending a bit of money makes you God? If everyone was like you, taking this and that, next time there'd be nothing left to enjoy.\"","The man, embarrassed and angry, raised his hand to strike the childhood friend.","But Qin Shu was right there, and there was no way he'd let that happen. He firmly grabbed the man's arm and said, \"I'm calling the police.\"","The other party, being a coward, saw the situation and left, cursing under his breath.","The childhood friend said, \"What a jerk.\"","Su Jun, not expecting customers to stand up for him, was touched and said, \"Thank you both.\"","Qin Shu's childhood friend said, \"Don't let them upset you. You find idiots like that everywhere.\"","Su Jun wiped the sweat from his forehead and said, \"They're indeed rare. Let me pack some of our Shine Muscat grapes for you!\"","Their fruit was exceptionally sweet, with a unique floral aroma, and very delicious.","Each grape was even larger than a one-yuan coin, making for a truly satisfying eating experience.","The taste was even better when chilled.","The childhood friend wanted them but pretended to be modest, saying, \"Oh, there's no need, we didn't really do much!\"","Su Jun smiled and said, \"Wait here, I'll go get them right away!\"","He then returned with two bags of fruit and handed one to each of them.","Qin Shu looked at Su Jun and said, \"It wasn't your fault. Why did you apologize to him?\"","Su Jun was taken aback, quickly realizing he was referring to the earlier incident. Su Jun said, \"I didn't want to cause trouble.\"","Their Starry Sky pop-up store had always attracted a lot of attention, and he didn't want to risk having the incident posted online and affecting the entire business due to mishandling the situation.","After all, apologizing was just a matter of moving his lips.","Qin Shu looked at Su Jun without speaking, his face showing unprecedented bewilderment.","He could sense that all the employees exuded confidence and gentleness from within.","No wonder everyone wanted to come here for the experience.","After returning home and having some barbecue skewers with his childhood friend outside, Qin Shu went inside.","This short period had stirred up more emotions in him than the entire previous year.","It was already 9 PM when he called Shen Wei.","He worried it might disturb her rest, but he couldn't help himself.","When he called, Shen Wei answered immediately.","Qin Shu asked, \"Does your previous offer still stand?\" Referring to the job offer.","Shen Wei said of course: \"If it's convenient for you, you can come tomorrow!\"","\"Alright!\" This time, Qin Shu agreed even more quickly.","Early the next day, he arrived at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","His emotions were incredibly mixed.","It was only after entering the kindergarten that he understood the source of this complexity.","Because he had never really liked children.","In his mind, children were the embodiment of little devils.","Crying at inappropriate times, making noise, and using various means to attract adult attention.","And precisely because they were children, there was no way to hold it against them.","When he first came to his father's house, there were several children who frequently broke his things.","As an illegitimate child, he didn't even have the right to be angry, which led to his intense dislike of children.","He must have been bewitched.","Why would someone like him come to work at a kindergarten? He couldn't even understand it himself.","But since he was already here...","Shen Wei had instructed him to go straight to complete the onboarding process upon arrival.","After finishing, he found that Shen Wei hadn't arrived yet, so he waited outside. Soon, a soft little child hugged his leg.","Qin Shu looked down to see a chubby little girl. The child reached up with her short little arms: \"Up.\"","Chef Liu quickly ran over, saying, \"NiuNiu, don't bother others. We've talked about this before, remember?\"","They didn't know who their child took after.","She couldn't resist any handsome young man she saw.","Every day at the kindergarten, she recognized countless \"older brothers.\"","When she met a good-looking male teacher, she would cling to them, wanting to be held.","Qin Shu stiffened a bit, feeling uncomfortable, but after a moment's thought, he still picked up the child.","The little one knew exactly what to do, burying her entire face in his chest.","Her chubby little hands wrapped around his neck.","The milky scent wafted straight into his nostrils.","If every child were like this little angel,","He might not dislike children anymore.","NiuNiu loved being held more than anything.","Especially by handsome young men.","She would look up at Qin Shu and giggle secretly.","Children, especially girls this age, become incredibly cute no matter what they do.","Qin Shu asked, \"Where do you want to go?\"","NiuNiu said, \"To the kitchen.\"","She was young, and every time she went to the kitchen, the uncles and aunties there would give her some treats.","So, under NiuNiu's guidance, Qin Shu quickly found the kitchen.","Sure enough, everyone gave them each a prepared sausage and other snacks.","This time, he benefited from the child's presence.","After they finished eating, NiuNiu, familiar with the routine, said, \"Don't tell grandpa, he's been urging me to lose weight.\" The child spoke in her sweet, childish voice.","\"Okay,\" Qin Shu said, then looked at NiuNiu.","NiuNiu seemed to realize something. Girls are conscious about their figure from a young age, so she sucked in her protruding little belly hard, making it suddenly flatten.","Qin Shu couldn't help but laugh out loud.","Children could be so adorable after all. He immediately said, \"You're not fat at all!\"","Hearing this, NiuNiu promptly let her round little belly out again: \"I don't think I'm fat either!\" Finally, humming happily, she asked Qin Shu to take her back to the classroom.","Shen Wei returned just in time to see this scene.","She hadn't expected Qin Shu, who usually didn't like children much, to be so good with NiuNiu.","After sending NiuNiu back to the classroom, Qin Shu felt a bit empty inside.","When he turned around and saw Shen Wei smiling at him, he felt a bit embarrassed and said, \"This child is quite adorable.\"","Shen Wei said, \"NiuNiu is indeed very cute!\"","Since she arrived, she had been worrying her brother to pieces.","Her brother was a typical sister complex.","Every day, his biggest concern was finding NiuNiu.","NiuNiu was always either in this handsome guy's arms or that handsome guy's arms.","Netizens jokingly referred to him as the most pitiful brother in history: \"This little kid is only a few years old, yet his heart is already so burdened. What if he grows up and gets lured away by some bad boy? His brother would surely cry himself to death!\"","Shen Wei shared these little anecdotes with Qin Shu.","Qin Shu couldn't help but smile: \"Indeed, I would cry myself to death.\"","Shen Wei hadn't expected him to play along with this.","It seemed Qin Shu wasn't as cold and unfeeling as the rumors suggested."]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129: Some People Are Just Asking for It","paragraphs":["As they were talking, they saw Lin Rui storming over angrily.","Lin Rui was Boss Lu's former fiancée.","Her arrival had attracted quite a few high society people who came to watch the drama unfold.","After all, Lu Zheng and Shen Qingqing's passionate affair was the talk of the town, to the point where he had abandoned his fiancée.","Now that the former fiancée had arrived at Starry Sky Kindergarten, everyone started mapping out the relationships in their minds.","They realized the women were in a showdown, a situation even Qin Shu had heard about.","Lin Rui knew Qin Shu as well. She had initially planned to greet him on his first day, given her position as the manager, second only to the principal in importance.","But she was too angry to bother now.","She said to Shen Wei, \"Don't you think Lu Zheng is sick in the head? He's the one who cheated, yet he claims he's found true love. If that's the case, why doesn't he just stick with his true love? Why does he keep coming back to torment me?\"","Ever since Lu Zheng found out Lin Rui was working at the kindergarten,","He'd been calling her every other day, asking if she could quit.","Lin Rui had blocked his number, until yesterday when she discovered Lu Zheng waiting for her after work.","She was furious on the spot. What was wrong with this man? He was never this enthusiastic when they were together.","Now that they've broken up, he's putting on this act.","Or maybe he just enjoys being the third wheel. He doesn't want a proper relationship.","Now that their breakup was public knowledge, he comes back pretending to be devoted.","Lin Rui had left through the side door.","When she arrived at work today, she found his car still parked outside the kindergarten. Lin Rui immediately started cursing.","Qin Shu hadn't expected to hear such juicy gossip on his first day. He chuckled softly.","Lin Rui was like a firecracker, ready to explode at the slightest spark.","Hearing Qin Shu laugh, she snapped, \"What are you laughing at? Do you have any solutions? Speak up if you do.\"","Qin Shu asked, \"Are you sure you don't want to be with him anymore?\"","He was just confirming the situation, but Lin Rui exploded immediately: \"Even if I never have another man in my life, I wouldn't get back together with him. What a piece of work!\"","Now, whenever she saw the disgusting things Lu Zheng did and thought back to their past relationship, she felt sick to her stomach, like she had swallowed a fly.","Qin Shu said, \"If that's the case, I have an idea for you. Men can be perverse creatures. Why don't you put on an act? Just tell him you're already with another man.\"","For a golden boy like Lu Zheng, he surely couldn't handle such a blow. This would solve the problem once and for all.","Lin Rui said, \"Alright!\" Then she asked Shen Wei, \"Lend me someone.\"","Shen Wei immediately agreed.","This time, Lu Zheng's pursuit was mainly because she had come to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","So Shen Wei was determined to fully support this act.","However, there weren't many men around.","Those who drove the internet wild were mostly in the pop-up shops. Here, there were only a few art teachers and some young men in the kitchen.","Shen Wei didn't know who could help out.","To her surprise, the person Lin Rui suggested was Qi Zhong.","Shen Wei immediately called Qi Zhong, asking him to come over, and explained the situation on the phone.","Qi Zhong was dumbfounded. \"Huh?\" Though he didn't quite understand, he still came.","But he kept frowning the whole time.","Lin Rui said, \"If you agree, I'll buy you paints. I'll even sell my jewelry to get you art supplies if necessary.\"","Qi Zhong said, \"That won't be necessary!\"","The mineral paints Shen Wei had prepared for him were already more than enough. He still had 24 kilograms in storage.","He hadn't even had the heart to use them yet.","Lin Rui didn't expect him to refuse her offer: \"I'll pay you!\"","Qi Zhong said, \"I don't need money.\"","Lin Rui was the type of person who wouldn't easily give up once she set her mind on something. She said, \"How about I arrange an exhibition for Mu Zhixing in America?\"","Qi Zhong's eyes lit up.","Lin Rui sensed an opportunity.","Sure enough, he quickly agreed.","This man had principles.","But not many.","Once it involved his precious student, all bets were off.","Mu Zhixing was indeed a genius. His previous \"Star\" painting had been borrowed for exhibition many times.","In the end, someone leaked his student's identity.","Although the painting had received widespread praise, no one had shown interest since then.","Qi Zhong understood that his past reputation was holding his student back.","If they could hold an exhibition abroad and then return, it would be like exporting and reimporting.","It would also raise his status in the art world.","Although Mu Zhixing hadn't been studying for long, his talent was even more astonishing than his teacher's. He was sure to make a splash in the art world.","Holding an exhibition would be a great experience for the child.","It wasn't cheap though.","Usually, you'd need to rent a museum, a celebrity's former residence, or some large venue.","He couldn't afford these expenses right now.","But Lin Rui was a socialite heiress, and money was no object to her.","Her promise became very compelling.","In the kindergarten, when people heard that Qi Zhong was going to pretend to be Lin Rui's boyfriend, gossip spread. Everyone except the teachers in class came out.","They craned their necks to see, but couldn't catch much.","So they hurried to the conference room.","The kindergarten was covered by surveillance cameras.","And Shen Wei's cameras, provided by the system, were state-of-the-art.","They used a wide-angle camera with 20x zoom. Crystal clear.","These people gathered in the conference room.","Lin Rui deliberately wore high heels, applied bright red lipstick, and styled her hair in big, bouncy curls. She walked arm-in-arm with Qi Zhong.","The colleagues in the conference room suddenly got excited.","This was more thrilling than watching a TV drama.","Of course, this camera feed wasn't broadcast publicly. Only they could see it.","Everyone watched the two of them.","Liu Chef couldn't help but say, \"Hey, this guy is quite handsome!\"","Qi Zhong had a very artistic air about him. Usually scruffy-looking, but standing next to Lin Rui, he didn't look out of place at all. In fact, his aura really added to his appeal.","Lin Rui had a triumphant look as she addressed Lu Zheng in the car: \"Don't call me anymore. Let me introduce you - this is my boyfriend!\"","Lu Zheng's face immediately darkened.","Although they had broken up amicably, men's hearts are strange things. He hadn't treasured her much before, but now seeing his ex with a new love interest, he felt inexplicably uncomfortable.","Lu Zheng said, \"You don't need to lie to me.\"","Lin Rui hadn't found anyone new even after studying abroad for over a year, how could she possibly have a new boyfriend after just a month or so at this kindergarten?","Qi Zhong had long disliked Boss Lu, and now Lin Rui was his sugar mama.","At this moment, looking at Lu Zheng's inexplicably confident expression made him angry: \"What, you're allowed to go out and find someone, but others aren't? We're young men and women attracted by hormones. In the future, stop bothering my girlfriend, or I'll beat you up every time I see you.\"","Lin Rui looked at Qi Zhong in surprise.","She hadn't expected him to perform so well, and gave him an approving glance. Qi Zhong almost lost his balance.","This scene, in Lu Zheng's eyes, looked exactly like they were flirting right in front of him. He felt increasingly uncertain.","Lu Zheng said coldly: \"When did you two get together?\"","Lin Rui improvised brilliantly, suddenly holding her waist: \"Not bad, the baby's only a month old. You'll have to be called uncle soon!\"","This completely darkened Boss Lu's face, and he left immediately.","He couldn't stand to stay there for another day.","The thought of his ex-girlfriend working for his arch-rival, and even getting pregnant with an employee, each step challenging his anger.","After he left, Qi Zhong was speechless: \"You're really letting yourself go. What if we're exposed?\"","Lin Rui said: \"It's fine, we'll just say NiuNiu is mine when the time comes.\"","Instantly, everyone watching the surveillance turned to look at Liu Chef.","NiuNiu was his granddaughter, after all.","Liu Chef rubbed his hair, not expecting his granddaughter to be so popular.","When the two of them returned, everyone's gazes became meaningful.","They were both shrewd people and could easily see the teasing in everyone's eyes.","Qi Zhong was unusually embarrassed and angry.","Qin Shu, having watched the whole show, exclaimed it was brilliant. He said to Lin Rui: \"See? I told you men are just despicable.\"","The others' gazes became even stranger, not knowing how Qin Shu, as a man himself, could say such a thing."]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130: Noble Kindergarten Seeking Death","paragraphs":["In the original book, Qin Shu was Shen Qingqing's right-hand man.","Now he's at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","After staying there for a few days, he found that he quite liked the place.","He hadn't crossed paths with Shen Qingqing in this life, but that didn't mean Shen Qingqing would let him off the hook.","After all, Shen Qingqing was keeping a close eye on Shen Wei.","Whenever Shen Wei made any move, she would immediately follow up.","Even though she had been burned several times already, she still hadn't given up.","At this moment, she took the initiative to contact Qin Shu, saying, \"Let's go out and have a meal together.\"","Qin Shu found it amusing.","Previously, he had been invisible in the world of the wealthy.","No one ever noticed him.","Since he started working at Starry Sky Kindergarten, several people had begun to inquire about him.","Now even Shen Qingqing was seeking him out.","He had suddenly gone from being universally disliked to being in high demand.","He didn't mind stirring up some excitement, curious about what she wanted to tell him.","It was the first time he saw Shen Qingqing.","Shen Qingqing wore a white shirt and was meticulously groomed, exuding an aura of an innocent, delicate flower.","She appeared even more pitiful and vulnerable. Although she already had Lu Zheng,","She knew well that men fell for this act.","This time, she had dressed up carefully.","Qin Shu spoke first: \"Why did you come to find me?\"","As soon as Shen Qingqing saw him arrive, she gained confidence. She said, \"I've heard about you before. Actually, we're the same kind of people!\"","She immediately started trying to build a connection.","In the past, he would have certainly been moved by this.","But after coming to the kindergarten, his negative feelings had gradually been healed. Seeing the sweet smiles of the children,","Life had gained a sense of purpose.","Hearing those depressing words from before now only made him laugh.","Shen Qingqing didn't understand Qin Shu at all. She said, \"I think we must have a lot in common. Can you come and help me?\"","This tactic was also learned from Shen Wei.","Shen Wei had managed to bring Lin Rui to her side.","It was a clear slap in the face to her and Lu Zheng, so she wanted to imitate it.","If she could sway someone close to Shen Wei, that would be ideal.","Unfortunately, she had tried many times before. Those old employees who followed Shen Wei seemed to have a filter for her, and couldn't be swayed at all.","But Qin Shu was different. He was new there and didn't have such a strong sense of belonging to the kindergarten. There might be a chance.","Although Shen Qingqing didn't know what Shen Wei saw in Qin Shu, she wanted everything Shen Wei had.","Qin Shu said, \"So what do you want to do?\"","Shen Qingqing said, \"Work for me. You don't need to quit your job, just tell me everything that's going on over there!\"","Qin Shu looked at Shen Qingqing, his gaze filled with obvious mockery: \"You want me to be a mole?\"","Shen Qingqing laughed awkwardly, \"Don't put it so harshly.\"","But she didn't deny his words.","Qin Shu said, \"I appreciate your consideration, but I'm a terrible actor. Let's forget about it, shall we?\"","With that, he stood up and left, without even paying for the two cups of coffee.","Shen Qingqing was furious. She didn't care about the cost of the two cups of coffee.","She could afford much more expensive coffee.","It was the feeling of being ignored that angered her.","Shen Qingqing became increasingly panicked.","Even a newcomer was so loyal to Shen Wei. Why?","She hadn't seen how Shen Wei was better than her before.","Qin Shu returned to his apartment, where a fluffy little Bichon Frise came to greet him. He crouched down, his beautiful hands stroking the dog's head.","The little Bichon licked his hand.","His irritated mood calmed once again.","On a whim, Qin Shu brought the little dog to the kindergarten.","His dog was very well-behaved and never jumped on children.","He played with the dog outside.","A class from the kindergarten happened to be playing on the outdoor big slide and merry-go-round.","When they saw the dog, they all flocked over.","The children adorably asked, \"Can I pet him?\"","Qin Shu said, \"No, you can't.\"","The children weren't upset by the refusal. They gathered around, repeatedly saying how cute the dog was.","Qin Shu lowered his head, realizing that children who grow up surrounded by love don't become gloomy or insecure even when refused.","His heart was filled with mixed emotions.","The little dog had never been liked by so many people before. Its tail was wagging like a windmill.","The people watching the livestream were amused: \"This little dog is so soft and white, like cotton candy!\"","\"The children are so well-behaved too. They don't touch when told not to, and they're all standing in a circle observing the dog.\"","\"I actually think having a pet at home can help children understand what love is, what it means to take responsibility, and what commitment is. I don't have children now, but if I did, I'd get a little dog to grow up alongside the child.\"","Seeing how happy his dog was, Qin Shu felt healed as well.","He used to be depressed, which affected his dog too.","Now things were better.","The bell rang for the children to return to class.","The children reluctantly said goodbye to the dog, saying they had to go back.","The dog's tail drooped.","After everyone left, the dog suddenly became dejected.","Qin Shu patted his dog and said, \"I'll walk around with you for a bit.\"","There's no dog that doesn't like walks. Soon, the dog was happy again.","\"You like it here too!\" Qin Shu asked.","The dog whimpered a couple of times.","Soon, they saw Shen Wei rushing in, full of energy.","Doctor Lu followed behind her, his face beaming with excitement.","\"What's going on?\" Qin Shu asked.","Doctor Lu said, \"Something's happened at Noble Kindergarten.\"","Noble Kindergarten had been suppressing them before.","They thought they'd need to open a second branch to compete, but who knew Noble Kindergarten would shoot itself in the foot.","It started like this:","A teacher looked down on students from the general class and said some unpleasant things during a lesson.","As it happened, this child had brought a voice recorder, and when the parents heard it later, they were furious and demanded an explanation from the teacher.","Who would have thought the teacher would become even more arrogant, saying poor people just cause trouble.","This statement immediately sparked outrage.","This time, the general class had enrolled 2,000 students.","The parents who sent their children here wanted to experience premium service at a lower cost.","Who would have thought the teachers would be so careless with the children.","They even resorted to hitting and scolding frequently.","Several children already didn't want to come to school anymore.","Even if a child comes from an ordinary background, they are still their parents' treasures.","Now the parents were angry.","What angered them even more was a video circulating online, showing that not only did the teacher not reflect on her actions, but she also complained to the principal, saying, \"We shouldn't have opened the general class. These people just have poor quality!\"","This news was clearly leaked from inside.","Their internal factional struggles were also very severe.","However, this internal strife was like adding frost to snow for the Noble Kindergarten, making an already difficult situation even worse."]},{"number":131,"title":"Chapter 131: Unconventional Operations","paragraphs":["Noble Kindergarten is facing its biggest crisis ever","Learning from the experience of Giraffe Kindergarten, they decided this issue couldn't be allowed to escalate further. So the school administration spent a hefty sum to remove the topic from trending searches.","They immediately issued an apology on their official platform, offering all students a month's worth of tuition as compensation, and promptly fired the teacher involved.","It must be said, Noble Kindergarten has some skilled individuals in their PR department.","This combination of actions quickly quelled much of the public's anger.","After all, the parents' protests were aimed at resolving the issue, not removing their children from Noble Kindergarten.","However, trust is a fragile thing. Once cracks appear, it's difficult to rebuild.","As a result, the teachers at Noble Kindergarten now face more questions from parents than ever before.","Previously, Noble Kindergarten catered exclusively to children from wealthy families.","The teachers, accustomed to this, had developed quite an attitude and were openly snobbish. Now that they had to serve children from more diverse backgrounds, they were already quite disgruntled.","If it weren't for the recent incident serving as a warning, they would have exploded in frustration long ago.","The teachers were trying their utmost to restrain themselves.","Everyone knew that this restraint couldn't last forever.","Consequently, complaints about various issues started pouring in every day.","\"Principal, we've found five or six voice recorders hidden during nap time in our class again,\" one teacher reported.","The teachers were terrified when they saw these devices.","The previous incident had been exposed by a voice recorder.","No teacher wanted to be secretly recorded.","When they discovered the recorders, they were both angry and scared, rushing to report to the principal.","The principal said, \"Just pretend you didn't see them. The parents are suspicious of us right now. We can only try our best to dispel their doubts.\"","Another teacher complained, \"Recently, parents have been bombarding us with questions even after school hours. The volume of inquiries has exceeded our daily workload. We need the principal to either hire customer service staff or increase our salaries.\"","The principal, clearly irritated, retorted, \"Can you do the job or not? If not, you're free to leave.\"","As others tried to speak up, the principal snapped, \"Can't you all give me a moment's peace?\"","Things used to be different, but since the incident, everyone had been complaining to her.","This time, they had admitted 2,000 new students, greatly expanding their enrollment.","The plan was to emulate Starry Sky Kindergarten, but it had backfired spectacularly.","It wasn't just the staff who were unhappy; even the investors and shareholders were displeased.","Yesterday, when the major shareholder called her, he berated her, saying she would have been better off doing nothing.","Her recent string of poor decisions had made them a laughingstock.","She could have maintained her position as the top kindergarten by simply staying put.","Now, her position seemed precarious.","Between compensating accounts, removing trending topics, dismissing PR staff, and appeasing angry parents, they had spent millions.","With the year-end approaching, the principal had no idea how to present her annual report. The mere thought gave her a headache.","Teacher Zhang from the admissions department came to see the principal.","As someone the principal had personally promoted, she was considered loyal. She tried to console her boss: \"What's done is done. Let's focus on finding solutions instead of getting angry.\"","The principal, bottling up her frustrations, finally opened up: \"Now they're saying I've been too ambitious, but that's not what they were saying before.\"","Previously, everyone had pressured her repeatedly, pointing out that the young heirs from wealthy families were no longer choosing Noble Kindergarten.","Additionally, their reputation among the general public had been declining, forcing them to take drastic measures.","Everyone had agreed to the increased enrollment at the time, but now that problems had arisen, they were all shifting the blame onto her. What was that about?","Though the principal of Noble Kindergarten said this, she too harbored regrets.","The constant need for new hires meant that costs were now exceeding revenue.","If this continued, forget about year-end bonuses – she might not even keep her position as principal next year.","Teacher Zhang from the admissions office looked at her and said, \"I have an idea, although it's a bit risky.\"","The principal's curiosity was piqued. After hearing the idea, she found herself genuinely intrigued.","...","Shen Wei couldn't fathom why the principal of Noble Kindergarten had called her.","Noble Kindergarten had repeatedly antagonized her before. Shen Wei wasn't without a temper.","The fact that she hadn't kicked them while they were down during this recent incident was already a testament to her good character.","Curious about the purpose of this call, she decided to meet the principal alone.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten was a middle-aged woman.","She usually dressed elegantly and properly, resembling a wealthy socialite.","As the face of Noble Kindergarten, she carried handbags worth over 300,000 yuan and drove luxury cars.","Shen Wei had seen her at a banquet before, but due to their unique positions, they hadn't interacted.","At that banquet, she had been radiant, laughing and chatting with VIPs. Now, just a few months later, her face bore signs of weariness.","It was clear that the recent incident at Noble Kindergarten had taken its toll on her.","Shen Wei got straight to the point: \"May I ask why you wanted to meet?\"","She had no time for false pleasantries with Noble Kindergarten.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten looked at Shen Wei with mixed emotions.","Shen Wei was incredibly young. To be outmaneuvered by someone so junior, with no way to fight back, left her feeling conflicted.","It gave her a sense of being outshone by a newcomer.","Hearing Shen Wei speak, she couldn't help but say, \"I've heard about your pop-up store before. Originally, you were planning to open a second branch of Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","This was something many Starry Sky employees weren't even aware of.","But the fact that the principal of Noble Kindergarten knew didn't surprise Shen Wei.","After all, with years of connections in the city, it wasn't difficult for her to learn such information.","Shen Wei responded, \"And?\"","The principal of Noble Kindergarten said, \"You young people are so full of ideas, and you're capable too. Everything you touch turns to gold.\" She offered a few simple compliments.","Then the principal continued, \"We've run into some issues, and I'm hoping for something that could divert public attention. I'm willing to offer you 10 million yuan if you open your second branch now.\"","Starry Sky Kindergarten was incredibly popular.","If they announced their enrollment, it would significantly divert attention away from Noble Kindergarten.","They had calculated earlier.","After this recent incident, the damage to Noble Kindergarten's brand far exceeded 20 to 30 million yuan.","Launching various advertisements now is clearly not very useful.","Giving money to Starry Sky Kindergarten, although a bold move, is quite effective.","It's much more cost-effective than advertising.","But Shen Wei didn't agree: \"No need, I'm not short on money here!\" Shen Wei said this with great confidence.","The 50 million given by the big shot earlier hasn't been spent yet.","Plus the donations from the live streaming room, tickets from the pop-up store, tuition fees from the kindergarten, and subsidies from the system.","It's not worth taking this 10 million and risking gossip.","Moreover, she had a feeling that there were pitfalls waiting for her ahead."]},{"number":132,"title":"Chapter 132: Participating in an Art Exhibition","paragraphs":["The director of Noble Kindergarten was getting desperate.","She had struggled earlier when she wanted to give Shen Wei 10 million yuan. At present, having Shen Wei come out to divert attention was the best solution.","However, she hadn't expected that Shen Wei, being from a wealthy family, didn't need the money.","10 million was a tempting figure for many people, but Shen Wei had flatly refused it.","At this moment, the director of Noble Kindergarten truly envied Shen Wei a bit.","Only children from rich families could cultivate such confidence.","The two parted ways unhappily.","Shen Wei went back and told Lin Rui about the incident.","Lin Rui immediately said, \"If you need money, I can invest in you. Don't ever use her money. That woman clearly has ill intentions!\"","Coming from a business background herself, she quickly did the math: \"Noble Kindergarten just wants to use 10 million to divert everyone's attention. Right now, they'd have to spend at least 20 to 30 million on advertising, and besides, this whole situation is their own fault.\"","Then Lin Rui told Shen Wei, \"When it comes to money, you can completely rely on me!\"","She was a true heiress from a wealthy family. The luxury cars, designer watches, diamonds, jewelry, and various handbags at her home were countless.","Moreover, if the kindergarten needed investment, given Shen Wei's current influence, money wouldn't be an issue at all.","The other party might use this money for who knows what kind of publicity stunt.","Shen Wei said, \"Don't worry, I didn't accept the money.\"","Lin Rui replied, \"Good. Oh, and there's another very important matter. I might need your help with it.\"","\"I had previously promised Qi Zhong to organize an art exhibition for Mu Zhixing in the United States. It's all arranged now, at a museum. Why don't you take the child to participate?\"","Shen Wei was surprised, \"It's been arranged so quickly?\"","Lin Rui smiled, \"With money, what can't be done?\"","She had expedited this matter, and media coverage and various promotions were already in place. Even large billboard advertisements had been purchased.","Qi Zhong had helped her successfully irritate Boss Lu and Shen Qingqing, and she was feeling quite pleased. Spending some money was nothing to her.","Shen Wei quickly shared this good news with everyone.","Especially to Mu Zhixing: \"How about we go abroad to participate in an art exhibition?\"","Qi Zhong wanted to go too, but he was afraid of flying. There was no way for him to go.","Now it was just Shen Wei accompanying Mu Zhixing.","When Gu Qingyan heard about it, he quickly came forward, volunteering: \"I'll go with you!\"","He had attended middle school and high school in the United States.","He was quite familiar with the place, and his English level was very high. There would be absolutely no problem with him acting as an interpreter.","When Liu Chef heard about this, he became worried: \"What will you eat over there?\"","He had a customer who had gone abroad before.","When that customer came back, he ate two pork knuckles in one sitting, which deeply shocked Liu Chef.","The customer looked as if he hadn't eaten for days, and then described his food and accommodation experiences abroad in a way that made listeners heartbroken and observers tearful.","Since then, Liu Chef had a stereotypical impression that there wasn't much good food abroad.","Liu Chef was concerned that Shen Wei and Mu Zhixing wouldn't eat well over there.","He wanted to prepare some food for them to take along.","But Gu Qingyan refused: \"It won't get through security!\"","Besides, this art exhibition would last 7 days, and they would stay abroad for 9 days. They would manage somehow.","This finally persuaded Liu Chef.","Liu Chef kept cooking various dishes for them. He was determined to give them a good nutritional boost before their departure.","Shen Wei said with a mix of amusement and exasperation, \"We can have our nutrition boosted when we come back too.\"","They had bought first-class tickets.","Mu Zhixing was a bit nervous, as she had never been on a plane before. Shen Wei said, \"Don't be afraid, I'll sit next to you.\"","Originally, Gu Qingyan had wanted to sit next to Shen Wei.","But because Mu Zhixing had experienced trauma before, she still had a faint fear of men.","So Gu Qingyan had to reluctantly sit in the row behind them.","Seeing Shen Wei there, Mu Zhixing felt much more at ease.","Before departure, Qi Zhong couldn't even focus on painting, repeatedly giving Mu Zhixing instructions and reminders.","He also told her to observe carefully at the museum, and to paint whatever she saw when she came back.","Mu Zhixing obediently nodded.","Qi Zhong was truly anxious about the child's departure.","In his heart, Mu Zhixing was no longer just a little apprentice.","She was like his own daughter.","If it weren't for his poor health, he would definitely want to go and see for himself.","Shen Wei could sense his separation anxiety and said, \"I'll take care of her, don't worry.\"","Qi Zhong was reluctant to part: \"Then I'll leave her in your care!\"","After the two separated.","Qi Zhong turned around and ran into Lin Rui, not knowing how long she had been standing there watching.","The two of them had, after all, put on a show in front of Boss Lu before, so they weren't as unfamiliar as before.","Lin Rui couldn't help but joke, \"Oh my, you're so reluctant to part.\"","Qi Zhong said, \"She's my only little apprentice. It's thanks to you that she can go to the United States for this art exhibition.\"","Lin Rui said, \"It's nothing!\" She still had a big gift to give Qi Zhong.","However, at the moment, no one except Shen Wei knew about it.","Soon, Shen Wei, Mu Zhixing, and Gu Qingyan boarded the plane headed for the United States.","The first-class cabin was indeed quite nice, with very spacious seating.","They could even lie down. Shen Wei had downloaded several animations for the child in advance.","The little girl neither cried nor made a fuss, and when she got bored, she would take out her pencils and sketch the airplane.","During the flight of more than ten hours, Shen Wei had originally planned to take good care of Mu Zhixing.","But she found that the little one could happily entertain herself.","She didn't need much looking after.","After they arrived, they immediately went to sleep to adjust to the time difference.","The next day, when the exhibition officially opened.","Mu Zhixing's works had already been shipped over.","Now they realized just how powerful Lin Rui's capabilities were. She had directly opened a new painting exhibition in the entire gallery, a place with a daily flow of 8,000 to 10,000 people.","Almost everyone who came would stop by this area.","Although the paintings were ordinary, children's paintings were innocent and full of imagination.","People couldn't help but smile as they looked at them and continued walking. Until they saw Mu Zhixing's works.","Then they understood what it meant to be utterly outclassed.","Mu Zhixing's use of color was excellent, and since learning sketching from Qi Zhong, her line work ability and perspective were at a genius level.","It was hard to imagine that such beautiful paintings were actually created by a 6-year-old child.","People had just finished looking at normal children's paintings. The sudden impact of seeing a genius's work made them gasp in amazement.","So everyone stopped there. Some were taking photos, others were carefully appreciating it. Everyone was muttering, \"Unbelievable.\"","On the very first day, many people saw it.","By the second day, even foreign artists were flocking to see it.","On the third day, television stations began conducting special interviews.","On the fourth day, large advertisements on the walls started playing on a loop.","By the fifth day, all foreign information began flooding into the country, creating another wave of publicity and hype.","Mu Zhixing was truly a genius.","Her first immature work, \"Stars,\" had already been very popular.","Now she was famous even abroad. With such overwhelming publicity, plus outsiders looking at the spectacle and insiders examining the technique, it was truly remarkable.","Her work had already become very mature. Add to that her astonishing age of just 6 years old.","Everyone drew in a sharp breath.","Mu Zhixing had become a sensation."]},{"number":133,"title":"Chapter 133: Flowers bloom inside the wall, fragrance spreads outside the wall","paragraphs":["Mu Zhixing's paintings were beautiful, and she was even being interviewed abroad.","She suddenly became popular on foreign forums.","\"What an incredible little Eastern darling. My goodness, it's hard to imagine someone so young creating such amazing works.\"","\"A contemporary artist has decided to buy her painting for $500,000. So, is it too late for me to start learning how to paint?\"","\"This painting is truly spirited, especially that one of the planet. It gives a sense of vastness. How can such a young child express such complex emotions?\"","After these foreign comments were translated and spread on the domestic internet, the art world was in an uproar.","Of course, they knew about Mu Zhixing.","Previously, when \"Stars\" was on loan for exhibition, people didn't know much about her.","But later, they found out she was Qi Zhong's last disciple.","After Qi Zhong's incident, he was essentially expelled from the art world.","Naturally, they wouldn't allow his student to rise to prominence.","So, under intense suppression, she indeed faded from view.","But unexpectedly, the flower that withered inside the wall bloomed fragrantly outside.","They actually went to the United States to hold an exhibition.","And it caused such a sensation.","Even renowned contemporary American artists publicly expressed their desire to collaborate.","They were even willing to purchase her works, which provided tremendous promotional opportunities for art dealers.","Moreover, Mu Zhixing's paintings were accessible to everyone.","Her control of color was innate.","This exhibition made people directly perceive the gap between her and ordinary children.","Not only was Mu Zhixing recognized at this exhibition, but the other kindergarten children were also very happy.","The parents were thrilled, never imagining their children's works could be exhibited abroad.","This kind of exposure opportunity was like a stroke of ancestral luck.","Shen Wei even sent back photos of everyone's works one by one.","Now, when the kindergarten teachers refreshed their social media, it was all about this.","Some parents even wrote this special experience on their profiles: \"Child participated in an art exhibition in the United States.\"","A painting fever began, with everyone wanting to cultivate their children's talents.","Qi Zhong received numerous invitations, with many offering hefty sums to hire him as their children's private tutor.","The entire trip lasted 9 days.","Shen Wei and Mu Zhixing were exhausted when they returned.","This commotion abroad attracted reporters who gathered to interview them upon their return.","\"Hello, how do you feel about this trip to the United States?\"","Shen Wei said beside her, \"Thank you all for your attention. We're truly very happy that the child could get such training. Mu Zhixing received widespread love this time, and she deserves it.\"","The reporter then asked the little girl, \"How did you start liking painting, and who taught you?\"","Mu Zhixing was very pretty, and with her soft and adorable nature, she spoke in a sweet, childish voice.","Although she hid in Shen Wei's arms, she firmly said, \"Qi Zhong is my teacher.\"","These days online, people also knew about what happened to her teacher before.","The reporter then asked, \"Do you know? A domestic painting master said he's willing to take you as a disciple. Would you like that?\"","Having already received such widespread acclaim abroad, if she were to add the endorsement of a domestic master, the child's future would certainly be limitless.","A child might not understand these things, but Mu Zhixing did.","As a girl, she was somewhat precocious, so upon hearing this, she said, \"I only have one teacher, and I'm truly grateful to him.\"","Shen Wei finally said, \"I'm sorry, the child is really tired. After all, we've been on a long flight and need to adjust to the time difference. So, let's have another interview when we have the chance!\"","Then she led the child away.","Along the way, Gu Qingyan was waiting for the luggage.","This was an experience the young master had never had.","His status was different. He used to travel with assistants and bodyguards.","This time, taking care of the two of them from start to finish was really not easy.","Shen Wei didn't know that the interview they just had at the airport had already gone viral online.","Qi Zhong almost cried when he saw this.","He knew his position was somewhat awkward.","If Mu Zhixing had chosen someone else, he would have accepted it.","But he never expected the little one to move him in another way.","By the time Shen Wei returned, it was already kindergarten dismissal time. Some long-time employees voluntarily stayed behind to welcome Shen Wei and the others back.","When Shen Wei and the others got out of the car, they saw Qi Zhong with reddened eyes.","He had obviously been crying earlier.","When Mu Zhixing saw this, she asked, \"Teacher, why are you crying?\"","She gave him a hug and then said, \"I bought you a fridge magnet!\"","Teacher Qi Zhong couldn't hold back and hugged the child, saying, \"How can you be so good?\" His voice trembled slightly as he spoke.","Shen Wei said, \"This child wanted to pick out a gift for you at every place we visited!\"","For a child, Qi Zhong was the enlightening teacher.","He had invested a lot of effort.","Given Mu Zhixing's previous family situation,","she treasured every bit of kindness from others.","The little one was also trying her best to give back.","Tears welled up in Qi Zhong's eyes as he said, \"You should go rest now.\"","After such a long flight, they must be tired.","Liu Chef and Chef Chen had started buying groceries and cooking early.","They wanted to prepare a proper welcome-back feast for them.","Everyone at the kindergarten felt that Shen Wei had worked hard.","They initially thought it was just participating in an art exhibition there, interacting with colleagues in the art world. They didn't expect Lin Rui to have organized such a grand event.","Each day required extensive socializing.","And there were media interviews overseas.","Even Lin Rui hadn't anticipated this; if she had known, she should have assigned a team to accompany Shen Wei.","It was their first time, without experience, but they still performed excellently.","Shen Wei took the child and had a good sleep at the kindergarten.","When she woke up again, she first checked the system messages in her consciousness.","She had muted the mechanical voice of the prestige value, with over ten thousand points being credited each day. The gains were considerable.","Mu Zhixing also woke up soon after, and the two changed clothes and took a shower.","When Mu Zhixing came out, she was once again a fragrant little baby.","Although they had these conditions while abroad, it was still more comfortable at home.","When they came out, Liu Chef had even bought the child's favorite Napoleon and strawberry cake.","The aroma wafted over once again.","Those who weren't hungry before suddenly felt their stomachs growling.","Before leaving, they had wondered how they would manage for eight or nine days.","Only after going abroad did they realize how much they truly missed home.","The desserts abroad are really too sweet.","One can only choose some fast food to eat.","Upon returning, seeing braised pork trotters and stir-fried pork intestines, along with dishes like \"Buddha Jumps Over the Wall\" and charcoal-grilled lobster, it's impossible to hold back the saliva.","Thus, Liu Chef once again experienced the shock after returning from abroad.","Just these few people were eating so deliciously, he felt a bit heartbroken.","From the main course to fruits and after-dinner desserts, Liu Chef had prepared many things, which were all swept clean."]},{"number":134,"title":"Chapter 134: Generous Rewards","paragraphs":["After dinner, everyone gathered around to chat.","In Shen Wei's mind, the System's cold mechanical voice came: \"Congratulations to Shen Wei for leading Mu Zhixing to participate in an art exhibition abroad. 10,000 points awarded.\"","\"System rewards 1 million yuan\"","\"System upgrades space to a 35 square meter portable space\"","\"System rewards 100 jin of beef!\"","\"System rewards 1 kilogram of vegetable seeds.\"","It had been a long time since Shen Wei had experienced such generous rewards from the System.","This time, the online reputation points accumulated to about 80,000 to 90,000.","Adding the System's rewards, the total points finally reached 300,000.","Recently, the System had been incredibly stingy with points. She had spent 65,000 points on fertilizer earlier, which had really pained her.","This time, it made up for it. Indeed, these points were truly useful.","Moreover, Shen Wei had a plan to give Gu Qingyan a gift.","This trip out was largely thanks to Gu Qingyan's assistance.","This young master had never done any work serving others before.","His care for Shen Wei this time was clearly visible.","She had previously found out that Gu Qingyan liked sneakers and games.","He had an entire wall of shoes at home.","Basically, if he wanted it, he would have it.","As for computer games, he was a big spender, reportedly having spent over 10 million in games.","What Shen Wei wanted to give might not necessarily hit the spot.","So this time, the points would come in handy.","Shen Wei planned to use the customization area in the points mall to specially customize a gift for Gu Qingyan.","First was a pair of sneakers personally signed by three world-class superstars.","Such sneakers couldn't be bought anywhere.","They were privately collected by top-tier wealthy individuals.","Shen Wei used 10,000 points to exchange for this top-level limited edition sneaker.","For a shoe lover, this would be incredibly cool.","Besides this, Shen Wei also bought a complete e-sports room from the System.","It came with an immersive gaming pod.","This concept was first proposed in science fiction novels.","The so-called holographic gaming.","Currently, headsets have been developed, including 3D and AI naked-eye technology.","But they can't achieve holographic capabilities. Both domestic and foreign researchers have been working on it, but the results aren't satisfactory.","The set Shen Wei purchased was provided by the System. It was at least 20 years ahead of current technology.","Moreover, 20 games were downloaded into it. These included post-apocalyptic games, farming games, fighting games, and shooting games.","They seemed to be products of the future world. This was very cheap, only costing 1,000 points.","Now, after dinner, everyone was still chatting casually.","Shen Wei noticed that He Lingfeng wasn't there.","Upon asking, people around said, \"He Lingfeng was taken away by Professor Liu and Professor Gao to attend a computer science conference.\"","The previous computer science conference was hosted by Professor Gao.","Professor Liu didn't want to overburden a prodigy before.","But He Lingfeng's talent was truly too high.","There was a feeling that he would be wasted under their tutelage.","So they wanted to let him go to a higher field, a higher platform.","This time, Mu Zhixing shone brightly, which also made them determined to let He Lingfeng make an appearance.","The local genius Zhao Jie didn't go.","He had always benchmarked himself against He Lingfeng.","Now he deeply realized his own inadequacy.","There are always people better than you, heights yet to be reached.","This made Su Jun both amused and exasperated: \"There's no need for such self-deprecation.\"","This child had already learned high school curriculum.","Although he couldn't reach He Lingfeng's heights, he was already very outstanding.","Yet he still wasn't satisfied.","Feeling the pressure from the children's competitiveness, Su Jun suddenly felt that his own achievements didn't amount to much. Children truly are one's best teachers!","As for Song Ping An.","He was younger and could now speak haltingly.","Although the child had grown up with wild animals while homeless, coming here seemed to have truly released his nature. The whole child became very cheerful.","This time when Shen Wei returned, Song Ping An saw her and couldn't help but approach her.","Shen Wei held the child in her arms, and the little one smiled smugly.","Weng Lan beside them said, \"This child likes you the most.\"","At the dinner table, Liu Chef also said, \"Children's eyes are the brightest, they know who is a good person.\"","Shen Wei was considered the most popular teacher among the children in the kindergarten.","This time Shen Wei left suddenly.","Little Ping An searched for her for several days, and when he couldn't find her, he even cried once.","Shen Wei hadn't expected the little one to cry for her.","She lowered her head to comfort him, and the little one kissed her face, his soft lips feeling very special.","Children are truly adorable.","It was just a simple gathering, with all the diners being old employees.","But everyone was great and relaxed.","As they chatted, they said that they never expected the blind teacher Zhang Song to be such a meme king. He was called the lark by the children in the kindergarten.","Children are the most innocent and pure. They wouldn't bully him just because he's blind and can't see.","Every time Zhang Song comes to work, he's very happy.","His mother said these words with tears in her eyes: \"It's really good that my child can come here.\"","Over the years, there have been some job opportunities here and there.","Most of them wanted him to be an influencer, which in essence meant exploiting fans.","People liked to hear him sing, which was already a great encouragement for him. He didn't want to make money from fans anymore.","But apart from this, he had no other means of making a living.","The olive branch from Starry Sky Kindergarten was redemption for him.","Not just him, even the street dance teacher was now holding a drink and smiling happily, no longer looking like the cool guy he was at the beginning.","He now shuttles between two places, also coming to teach children street dance.","His personal account has now reached 200,000 followers.","He also regularly posts some popular dances on newcomers' accounts.","The same dance, when he performs it, becomes particularly alluring.","His rapid increase in followers has even made his former management company start contacting him, asking if he still wants to be a performer.","They had taken the wrong path before.","Everyone was aiming to be a performer.","Now with the prevalence of the internet, internet celebrities can also earn a lot of money.","If they had known earlier, his positioning should have been towards becoming an internet celebrity.","But he doesn't want that anymore.","Because here, he has a stage.","Doctor Lu couldn't help but say, \"It's so interesting, last time I passed by, I saw two kids challenging each other to a dance battle!\"","The dance performed by the two children was jerky and halting, almost as if they had learned their moves from zombies.","It made him double over with laughter at the time.","When Doctor Lu brought this up, the street dance teacher blushed and said, \"I'll teach them properly.\"","Children dancing is both adorable and amusing.","Although the kids were slow learners, each of them had stars in their eyes when they talked about how cool dancing was.","They said they loved dancing and wanted to keep doing it forever.","The street dance teacher truly adored this aspect of the kindergarten.","He had long yearned for the stage and fame.","But in this moment, the light in the children's eyes made him feel that the meaning of life was somehow different.","It was as if he saw his younger self, the one who simply loved to dance.","The simplest life is often the happiest."]},{"number":135,"title":"Chapter 135: Shen Wei's Gift","paragraphs":["Shen Wei said she wanted to give Gu Qingyan a gift.","Gu Qingyan was thrilled but tried to contain his excitement, forcing himself to say, \"You really don't have to.\" However, his eyes were filled with anticipation.","Shen Wei replied, \"I've already prepared it for you!\" She then handed him a shoebox.","Gu Qingyan suppressed his joy. He had never told Shen Wei about his love for shoes.","The fact that Shen Wei knew about this, did it mean she cared about him quite a bit?","Gu Qingyan said, \"You're too kind!\"","He didn't even want to open it, thinking he'd unwrap it when he got home.","Shen Wei asked, \"Don't you want to take a look?\"","Gu Qingyan hastily replied, \"I love it, I love it. No need to open it, I already know.\"","His thoughtless response made Shen Wei blush deeply.","Gu Qingyan, seeming to realize something, also turned red instantly.","He had no choice but to open the shoebox to ease the awkwardness.","The moment he saw the gift, Gu Qingyan's expression changed dramatically.","These sneakers were the most coveted by shoe enthusiasts worldwide.","It was a limited edition, with only 500 pairs released globally.","Every sneakerhead dreamed of owning these.","They had no set price on the black market.","Because all those who collected this model came from extremely wealthy families.","Limited editions were notoriously hard to buy.","His heart was pounding, unable to imagine the impact if he were to show these off.","Gu Qingyan stared at Shen Wei for a long time, speechless.","Finally, he said, \"I really love them!\" They were exactly his size, and the thoughtfulness behind the gift was enough to bring tears to his eyes.","When he took the shoes out, another shocking discovery awaited him.","Because there were signatures from three football superstars.","Getting one would have been difficult enough, let alone three.","These were world-class celebrities.","Even he found these shoes utterly amazing.","\"How did you get these?\" he asked, his voice unconsciously softening.","Shen Wei said, \"I pulled some strings!\"","She had used 10,000 points.","The system hadn't conjured this out of thin air.","It had actually used various means to channel this high-value gift into the market.","Then it had circled back to the system's hands, making it legitimate if traced from the source.","Shen Wei didn't collect sneakers herself.","She hadn't realized how passionate men could be about sneakers.","But seeing Gu Qingyan so moved that his eyes were reddening and his body slightly trembling.","\"Thank you. This gift is far too precious,\" Gu Qingyan said.","Shen Wei replied, \"Don't mention it. You've helped me a lot lately!\"","This included rescuing Song Ping An recently, and then accompanying Mu Zhixing to the overseas art exhibition.","Gu Qingyan, being a young master from a wealthy family, rarely took care of others.","His actions touched Shen Wei deeply.","So she wanted to give him something special, not hesitating to use so many points to exchange for this gift.","This present hit the mark perfectly for Gu Qingyan.","Shen Wei added, \"That's not all. There's also a gaming room. I heard you like playing games, so I've had one set up for you here!\"","Their kindergarten had several floors with only a few classes. There were many empty rooms.","Some were used as dormitories.","Others were left vacant.","\"That's great!\" Gu Qingyan exclaimed.","He knew many people treated the kindergarten like home.","He quite liked the atmosphere of the kindergarten too.","But he didn't have his own private room here.","He hadn't dared to bring it up with Shen Wei.","But now this custom gaming room was specifically designed for him.","And she had put so much thought into it. He felt incredibly grateful to Shen Wei.","When he left, his mood was overflowing with happiness.","As Gu Qingyan passed by Doctor Lu.","Doctor Lu whispered to Liu Chef beside him, \"What do you think of the progress between those two?\"","As the kindergarten's number one gossip, Doctor Lu had been caught off guard by the romance between the security guard and Teacher Tang last time.","Now he was keeping a close eye on Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan. If they slipped past him again, it would be a major blow to his gossip skills.","The two hadn't had much interaction before.","But recently, it was always Gu Qingyan accompanying Shen Wei on outings, showing he was clearly making an effort.","Liu Chef said, \"We don't know about that!\" He wasn't interested in the mysterious love affairs of young people.","\"Why don't we go tend to the seedlings?\" The seedlings in the field had already sprouted.","They had planted extra seedlings before. But after germination and transplanting to the field, they didn't need as many.","Now with the high germination rate, they couldn't bear to throw away the extra seedlings.","The field was Liu Chef's domain.","Although they had hired two people to help manage it.","Liu Chef cared more than anyone, checking on it four or five times a day, putting all his heart into it.","Liu Chef even said, \"When I'm no longer working as a chef here, I'll dedicate myself to tending the land.\"","Doctor Lu, who had just been captivated by the gossip about Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan, was alarmed upon hearing Liu Chef's words: \"No way, we can't do without you.\"","Their palates had become quite refined now.","Suddenly switching to an ordinary chef would be torturous for them, wouldn't it?","All thoughts of gossip were pushed aside; Liu Chef couldn't leave.","His outcry caught the attention of others, who looked at Liu Chef with eyes mirroring Doctor Lu's concern: \"What's this about you leaving?\"","Liu Chef said, \"Nothing, don't listen to his nonsense. I'll definitely work until retirement.\"","Ever since receiving the pair of shoes, Gu Qingyan had been showing them off to everyone at home, explaining the significance and value of the sneakers, emphasizing that they were his size and a gift from Shen Wei.","His family was indeed happy to hear that Shen Wei had given him a gift.","They hadn't expected this silly son of theirs to make such progress.","However, Gu Qingyan had boasted about it so many times that everyone was getting annoyed.","\"Aren't you an adult now? Why are you jumping around like a child just because you received a gift? No wonder Shen Wei doesn't choose you. You're so immature.\"","Gu Qingyan's beaming face instantly fell: \"What did you say?\" This felt like a knife to his heart.","\"I think Shen Wei just sees you as a little brother.\"","Gu Qingyan flew into a rage: \"Impossible. We're the same age.\"","Gu Qingyan was too angry to continue his boasting. He took the shoes back to his room.","The brand-new sneakers seemed out of place no matter where he put them.","Finally, he couldn't resist placing them by his bedside, wanting to see them as soon as he opened his eyes.","After his childish behavior was discovered by the nanny, she told the whole family.","The next day, everyone started teasing him.","But he didn't mind, because he hugged his sneakers and went out with his best buddies again.","Gu Qingyan's best friends also collected sneakers. When they saw the pair Shen Wei had given him, with three superstar signatures, which should be one-of-a-kind in the world, they said, \"You lucky dog. If you don't offer yourself in marriage to her, it would be inexcusable.\"","Gu Qingyan's face reddened, but he then proudly lifted his chin and said, \"Of course I will.\"","The value of this pair of sneakers was worth more than offering himself in marriage.","Gu Qingyan's best friend continued, \"Why don't you put us in line too? If we could receive sneakers like these, we'd be willing as well.\"","Gu Qingyan angrily retorted, \"Get lost, all of you!\"","With the air of a victor, he hugged the sneakers like a treasure and took them back home, placing them at his bedside."]},{"number":136,"title":"Chapter 136: Exclusive Love for Him Alone","paragraphs":["Shen Wei set up a gaming room for Gu Qingyan.","Since there was often construction work going on in that area, it didn't attract too much attention. However, Gu Qingyan was quite the attention-seeker.","Whenever Shen Wei did something for him, he wanted to broadcast it to the whole world. As a result, not only did Gu Qingyan's entire family know about the gaming room Shen Wei was creating for him, but he had also spread the news to all his close friends. He even posted boastful messages about it on various social media platforms.","Ever since Starry Sky Kindergarten became famous, the social media accounts of Teacher Tang, Doctor Lu, Shen Wei, and Gu Qingyan had all been discovered by fans.","Many of these followers were fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten. Seeing Gu Qingyan showing off like this, netizens couldn't help but tease: \"We get it, bro. You've finally made it official.\"","\"You're the principal's favorite.\"","Gu Qingyan secretly liked these comments.","There were already quite a few fans shipping them as a couple, and now that one of the main parties had liked these comments, the discussions became even more heated. Almost every minute, dozens of new comments were added.","Gu Qingyan would pick out messages wishing him and Shen Wei well and like them frantically.","A mysterious smile played on his lips.","He couldn't be happier.","Previously, Shen Wei had told Gu Qingyan that all her attention was focused on running the kindergarten. She didn't have time for romance.","He respected her wishes.","But Gu Qingyan longed for some progress, and now that progress had finally come, he was like a strutting peacock, wanting to show off his tail feathers at every moment!","Shen Wei was being very secretive about the gaming room she was setting up for him, not letting him see it.","But Gu Qingyan had already made up his mind. No matter what it looked like, he was going to praise it extravagantly.","The thought behind it was what mattered most.","On Shen Wei's end, many of the items for the gaming room were ready-made. They just needed to be assembled.","Shen Wei didn't want Gu Qingyan to know, and he was surprisingly obedient.","He didn't come to look even once. It took half a month for the renovation to be completed.","Finally, Gu Qingyan was allowed to come over.","He didn't just come by himself. He told everyone at the kindergarten.","As a result, many people came to see it.","The room was truly impressive, a blue-gray gaming room with a futuristic feel.","The most eye-catching features were a body pod, two computers, and a bed.","It was suitable for both gaming and resting.","Moreover, the computers here had the most high-end graphics cards available on the market.","Just one graphics card was worth 50,000 yuan.","As for the body pod, it was impossible to estimate its value.","Everyone was stunned.","Doctor Lu said from the side, \"What's this? It couldn't be a holographic game, could it?\"","They had only read about such holographic games in novels before.","It was said to be an immersive experience.","But with current technology, even some 3D or 5D movies weren't quite there yet.","However, Shen Wei bringing this equipment felt so sci-fi, it was like a dream come true.","Gu Qingyan had planned to praise Shen Wei profusely.","But when he saw the actual setup, all words seemed to be stuck in his throat, unable to come out.","He touched the holographic game pod, his heart surging with emotion.","Beside him, Doctor Lu was itching to try it out and asked, \"Can I play for a bit?\"","Gu Qingyan immediately said, \"This is for me!\" Then he glanced at Shen Wei, \"Right?\" He still sounded a bit unsure.","Mainly because the gaming room was just too good.","Shen Wei said, \"Of course, feel free to play.\"","Under everyone's watchful eyes, Gu Qingyan lay down in the pod and put on the special helmet.","All of Gu Qingyan's operations were projected in the air.","They could see his game progress through his actions.","He set up a new account and chose a shooting game from among 20 available games.","Gu Qingyan's experience was completely 3D.","Once he entered the game, he could even feel the gentle breeze on his face, such minute sensations were present.","Moreover, in the bushes, the feeling of grass brushing against his body felt incredibly real.","Soon, enemies appeared.","Gu Qingyan swung his gun and immediately charged forward.","Whether it was due to the 3D effect or not,","His reaction speed was incredibly fast.","There was no sense of lag at all.","Bang bang, two shots, and he eliminated two enemies.","He continued moving forward.","Gu Qingyan had never played a game with such amazing tactile feedback.","Even the recoil in his shoulder from those two shots felt exactly like the real thing.","And the sudden tension when enemies appeared, the immediate surge of adrenaline.","After playing intensely for 20 minutes, he was completely exhausted.","When he came out and took off the helmet, he felt a bit disoriented.","Doctor Lu had been asking from the side, \"How is it? Is the game fun?\"","He had been very eager to try it since he saw it earlier.","He wondered if playing it for real would give that 3D feeling.","Gu Qingyan said, \"It's amazing!\" It was hard to imagine that a game could be made like this.","Simple praise was not enough to express his excitement at that moment.","Looking at Shen Wei, he was speechless for a long time, then suddenly hugged her. Doctor Lu couldn't bear to watch, thinking, \"What are you doing in front of everyone?\"","\"I love it so much!\" He invited Doctor Lu and others to play.","Only by experiencing it could they truly understand how good it was.","Doctor Lu chose a fishing game, and every cast of the rod felt incredibly realistic.","And after a while, including the force needed when reeling in,","The fish leaping out of the water, its tail splashing water droplets onto his face.","He could feel the dampness on his face.","He seemed to be able to smell the faint fishy scent coming from the fish.","When he put the fish in the bucket, there was a splash.","The tactile feedback was incredibly well done.","Importantly, there was also a farming game, which tempted Liu Chef to try it out. He spent twenty minutes farming in the game pod.","When Liu Chef came out, he was still reluctant to leave: \"This game is so interesting, where did you buy this game? How much does it cost?\"","Shen Wei said, \"It was sent from the laboratory, it's not for sale yet, there's only one.\"","When everyone heard this, thinking it might be confidential, they immediately nodded in understanding.","\"If it's not too expensive in the future, I'd like to buy one too!\"","Doctor Lu had made some money at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","If there really was such a game pod available, he would be willing to spend 200,000 yuan on it.","Moreover, it came with 20 built-in games, which he had carefully looked at, and they all seemed very fun.","Gu Qingyan looked at Shen Wei with stars in his eyes.","Shen Wei had given him such an amazing gift, he didn't want to let anyone else touch it, but he also wanted to show off so badly, wanting everyone to know just how incredible this gift was!","Indeed, now everyone knew how truly impressive his gift was.","Everyone crowded around Shen Wei, eager to buy one as well.","However, upon learning that the product's release was still far off in the future, they soon turned their attention to Gu Qingyan. They hoped Gu Qingyan would let them play for a while, even if they had to pay.","Gu Qingyan felt a mix of excitement and pain, but still agreed. Each person could play for 20 minutes per day.","As a result, Gu Qingyan's gaming room became the most popular spot during lunch breaks.","Gu Qingyan felt some regret. What was meant to be his personal gift had turned into something shared by everyone.","Yet, the thrill of it all kept a smile tugging at his lips. After all, Shen Wei had still shown her special favor to him alone."]},{"number":137,"title":"Chapter 137: The Professor Team Doesn't Want to Leave","paragraphs":["He Lingfeng was taken away by Professor Liu and Professor Gao to attend a computer conference.","The other professors at the conference thought the child was their grandson. They didn't expect that he could answer several questions they asked. They heard that He Lingfeng could even write code by himself.","Everyone was skeptical and tested him on the spot. He Lingfeng, truly worthy of being personally guided by Professor Liu, answered quickly and well.","Suddenly, everyone was shocked. How could a child of just a few years old understand so much?","People became interested. One by one, the big shots all gathered around He Lingfeng. Some tested him, while others taught him.","Computers are an emerging industry, and it's not that the older you are, the better you are at it. On the contrary, some theories from young people shine brightly in the field of computers.","They had never seen such a young genius in their lives.","They couldn't help but gather around Professor Liu: \"Hey, where did you find such a good seedling?\"","Professor Liu laughed: \"It's a long story.\"","\"No worries, take your time!\"","So Professor Liu recounted how he discovered He Lingfeng, from beginning to end.","The people around became more and more shocked as they listened. To think that they discovered a genius at a Third-tier university because of one audited class.","Upon further inquiry, they learned that He Lingfeng had already completed the entire high school curriculum and had started learning calculus at the university level.","He Lingfeng, this little kid, spoke seriously about computer theory, code writing, and so on with a straight face.","It really gave them a sense of bewilderment.","Though it's said that the rear waves of the Yangtze River push the front waves forward, these rear waves were too fierce; the front waves could hardly take it.","Professor Gao added from the side: \"This is nothing, they have a few more good seedlings there.\" This included the local genius Zhao Jie.","The people around brightened their eyes when they heard this: \"This kindergarten is full of hidden talents, it's quite something.\"","They immediately wanted to follow up and inquire.","Professor Liu said: \"Let's have the meeting first. Afterwards, I'll take you to have a look. That kindergarten is indeed excellent!\"","They were from out of town.","Many hadn't heard of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","So Professor Liu specifically called Shen Wei.","Shen Wei welcomed these doctoral supervisors with open arms.","She invited them to give a few public lectures.","The lecture fees would be paid according to market rates.","So everyone came over excitedly.","They arrived at Starry Sky Kindergarten to livestream.","The online viewers were all shocked.","\"Oh my god, am I seeing things? That's my brother's doctoral supervisor. How come he's teaching at a kindergarten?\"","\"I've long known that this Starry Sky Kindergarten had some tricks up its sleeve, but now I realize I still underestimated this kindergarten.\"","\"Starry Sky Kindergarten, I'm warning you, if you keep this up, I'll have no choice but to take remedial classes at kindergarten.\"","\"Goodness, all the people coming to lecture on computers are big shots.\"","For an entire morning.","Everyone was shocked again and again.","The prestige value in Shen Wei's mind kept rising. These big shots brought her over 10,400 points.","At lunchtime.","They were shocked once again.","These big shots were all quite old and liked to eat those strong-flavored dishes.","But schools often recommend light, healthy foods.","Some partners, to cater to their tastes, serve increasingly plain food.","It was different here. There were braised pork trotters, large pork knuckles.","All kinds of yogurt drinks.","Even the red and green peppers in the stir-fried pork liver were delicious.","That crispy spiciness, followed by a big mouthful of rice, was heavenly.","These old professors had all experienced hardships when they were young and loved these flavorful dishes.","In the past, when conditions weren't good, it was understandable. Now that they could afford it, they didn't know why they still had to eat bland food.","But the advice to eat vegetarian was well-intentioned, so there was nothing they could do.","Coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten, Liu Chef, who was also of their age, understood their psychology thoroughly.","Liu Chef personally cooked for them, making rich and savory dishes that immediately won them over.","The other professors ate with relish, looking at Professor Liu and couldn't help saying: \"Well, well, so you came here for the food!\"","Professor Liu smiled: \"Not at all, I have a little disciple here!\"","Then he \"sold out\" Professor Gao.","Saying that Professor Gao indeed came for the food.","He had even bought a house locally.","Everyone was tempted after hearing this. These professors weren't short of money.","And the local housing prices weren't too expensive, so buying one was feasible.","If they could come here every now and then for a meal, it would be much better than eating at restaurants outside.","They thought the meal was the highlight, but they didn't expect there was also a vegetable garden next door. Starry Sky Kindergarten had hit all their sweet spots.","These people had all experienced going up to the mountains and down to the countryside in the past.","They felt close to the land.","Plus, as they got older, it was as if their blood awakened. Seeing little green sprouts emerging from the soil in the planter boxes, they became full of energy.","\"It's so nice here. Are you still recruiting?\"","More than half of the old professors present were tempted.","Professor Gao quickly said: \"No, you all still have positions at universities. Not like me, I'm free!\"","He was clearly trying to dissuade them, but his colleagues somehow heard a hint of superiority in his tone.","Well, well, he was enjoying himself here, not caring about others' situations.","But everyone knew he had a point.","They had to give up reluctantly.","Today had already brought them too many shocks.","Unexpectedly, when they returned to the kindergarten, many people were stopping at the door of a room.","They wanted to take a casual look inside. What was this? A holographic game.","All present were big shots from the computer conference.","Although they were a bit old in age.","Their sensitivity to such things was even higher than young people's.","The old professors immediately rushed in.","Inside, they saw immersive game pods.","They were all scratching their heads in bewilderment. Had domestic technology advanced so much?","Holographic games? That was something only seen in science fiction movies.","Their hearts suddenly became passionate.","Several old professors immediately called their assistants to cancel their tickets, deciding not to leave.","They had to stay and see exactly what was going on.","So the old professors, relying on their thick skin, also managed to get 20 minutes of game time.","After 20 minutes were up, the other professors gathered around: \"How was it?\"","The old professor felt a mix of emotions.","It was indeed a holographic game.","And those 20 minutes passed too quickly, he hadn't played enough.","He had only caught two fish while fishing.","Looking at the fishing record, Doctor Lu could catch up to 20 fish in 20 minutes.","That's equivalent to one fish per minute!","This game is incredibly fun, suitable for everyone from 99-year-olds down to those who have just learned to walk - all can find enjoyment in it.","Every sensation feels completely real, including that faint fishy smell.","It's entirely different from those helmet-based games you find in shopping malls.","Shen Wei only mentioned that it was a customized version from the lab, and that it wasn't convenient to discuss further at the moment.","Even the old professor [didn't fully grasp] the value in this.","Both the hardware and software were worthy of their research."]},{"number":138,"title":"Chapter 138: The Peach Blossom Spring","paragraphs":["The professors refused to leave.","Shen Wei decided to let them stay.","However, this gaming pod was a futuristic product rewarded to her by the system.","Its industrial standard was extremely high.","The entire exterior didn't even show a single screw mark.","It looked as if it was molded in one piece, and the professors couldn't figure out how it was made no matter how much they studied it.","Shen Wei didn't reveal much, and the old professors present were all aware of confidentiality.","They gave up when they couldn't get any research results.","But every day spent here, they would teach a calculus class at the kindergarten.","Then they would enjoy a hearty meal, tend to the garden, check on the seedlings, and play games for 20 minutes.","These old professors became even more reluctant to leave.","They never knew before that this was what life should be like.","Moreover, the little ones at the kindergarten were all very polite, addressing them as \"grandpa\" every time they saw them.","This made the professors' hearts bloom with joy, feeling there was no better place than this.","Professor Liu had intended to bring back two university professors to help look after the kindergarten.","He didn't expect things to get so out of hand.","Everyone wanted to stay.","This made the event organizers blame him.","These professors represented half the computer science departments in the country.","There were department heads, doctoral supervisors, and leading experts. Now they had all been lured to a kindergarten. How would the universities manage their classes?","So Professor Liu tried to persuade them to leave one by one, but it's easier to invite gods than to send them away.","They all made excuses, asking others to leave first.","They just wanted to stay for two more days.","Liu Chef was using all his culinary skills every day to cook, and the professors were extremely satisfied with the meals.","Once people relax, it becomes difficult to return to their previous lifestyle.","Those who were living comfortably here became a bit angry when they saw Professor Liu and Professor Gao so actively persuading them to leave.","\"Well, well, you've had your fill of good food and comfortable living, and now you don't care about us brothers, is that it?\"","Professor Liu said, \"You can come back next time.\"","Over the past few days, the old professors' lectures at the kindergarten were both profound and interesting.","This caused the number of online viewers in the live streaming room to suddenly exceed 300,000.","There were even college students coming to attend online classes.","Considering they were teaching children, the professors used the simplest language possible.","This was very challenging, requiring them to break down all complex technologies.","Only then could they explain things in such a simple and easy-to-understand way.","After much persuasion, and also because they really had teaching duties to attend to, they finally left reluctantly.","After everyone had gone, Professor Gao said with relief, \"It's good they left. Otherwise, the Principal might have had to come personally to fetch them.\"","When these people left, their reluctance was almost tangible.","Seeing Professor Gao's schadenfreude, Professor Liu said, \"Why don't you go back too? One of me is enough for the kindergarten!\"","Professor Gao immediately bristled, \"You want to keep all this to yourself? That won't do!\"","He was now very happy at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","After buying a house, he had even moved his wife and children here.","He looked like he was planning to stay for good.","He was a high-level talent. Many government officials were keeping an eye on his movements.","After discovering he had bought a house, local schools tried to poach him with high salaries. They would be happy to have him as an honorary professor even if he didn't want to be a department head!","But Professor Gao refused all offers.","He just wanted to stay here, to be an ordinary old man, or maybe a doorkeeper.","But when he learned that the doorkeeper at Starry Sky Kindergarten was a former special forces king, he immediately felt intimidated.","He couldn't compete, really couldn't compete.","...","In the vegetable garden, they grew seedlings and then transplanted them to the field. Who knew that this time the germination rate would be 99%? There were too many seedlings.","They didn't want to throw them away but didn't know what to do with them.","So Liu Chef discussed this issue with Shen Wei. Qin Shu, who was nearby, saw this and said, \"It's simple. Give a pot to each student's family and let them grow it themselves.\"","Liu Chef said, \"Great idea!\"","He was mainly worried about wasting the seedlings, so giving them to parents was no problem.","Initially, when each student's family received a pot, it was just small green vegetables. They just needed to water it and it would grow. Seeing the green leaves made them happy.","These vegetables grow fast, ready in 10 to 15 days.","They had become like houseplants.","The children at home would check on them every day, and their families became reluctant to eat them.","Until one day, a student's parent suddenly ran out of vegetables while making noodles.","With no choice, they picked a couple of leaves to cook with the noodles.","The result was a bowl of noodles with a unique fragrance.","They had made these noodles many times before.","The only difference this time was the addition of two green vegetable leaves.","It tasted incredibly refreshing, so they enthusiastically praised it in the class group chat.","\"Starry Sky Kindergarten is really generous. When they give something, it's always something good.\"","\"These vegetables are so delicious. You can't even buy vegetables this tasty.\"","Parents in the group chat would often praise the kindergarten.","Praising Starry Sky Kindergarten had become a habit.","But when parents praised this dish so enthusiastically, others became curious.","So that day, many people made noodles.","When they tasted it, it was indeed extraordinarily fragrant and refreshing.","Especially the vegetables, which were cooked to perfect tenderness. Everyone was amazed.","They had never bought vegetables this fresh and delicious from the market before.","\"Ever since I cooked those noodles, they were so fragrant. Now my wife treats that pot of vegetables like a treasure, afraid I might casually pluck a couple of leaves.\"","Other parents laughed and said, \"Can't blame your wife for being so protective. Mainly because this small pot of vegetables doesn't last long. I haven't even dared to stir-fry them.\"","They had initially thought it was just a potted plant from the school.","To let the children observe plant growth, as kindergartens often like to do such things.","They didn't expect Starry Sky Kindergarten to use the best seeds to grow seedlings that could not only be observed but also eaten.","And they were especially delicious.","This time, the parents couldn't sit still. After tasting these delicious vegetables, they kept craving them every few days.","These vegetables indeed regrow after picking a leaf.","However, they didn't grow as fast as they were being eaten.","One pot wasn't nearly enough, so many parents started pleading in the group chat: \"Could we buy a couple more pots? We're willing to pay.\"","Meanwhile, they were praising the kindergarten frantically on various social media platforms.","Earlier, when other kindergartens tried to imitate Starry Sky Kindergarten by giving out vegetables, it backfired.","They didn't understand why their vegetables didn't receive any praise.","Starry Sky Kindergarten gave out just one pot of seedlings and received so much praise.","They felt bitter, thinking all the good parents were at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Now, all the parents wanted to buy these vegetables.","They had plenty of vegetables.","Because they had only given away about 100 seedlings before, there were still tens of thousands of plants that hadn't been planted in the field.","Qin Shu said, \"Let's do this: we'll sell them online for 20 yuan per pot, pickup only.\"","20 yuan per pot wasn't expensive.","In just three days, the tens of thousands of seedlings were sold out.","Many people bought them without knowing much about them.","It was mainly because parents of students online were raving about them.","Everyone wanted to give it a try. After 10 days, when they started eating them, they suddenly felt they hadn't bought enough.","If only they had known to buy ten or eight pots from the start.","This Starry Sky Kindergarten really had something special going on."]},{"number":139,"title":"Chapter 139: Rich Kids Class","paragraphs":["In the original book, Qin Shu was Shen Qingqing's right-hand man.","Now, having arrived at the kindergarten where Shen Wei worked, it took him less than a month to detect the problems within.","Subsequently, he approached Shen Wei with a business plan in hand.","\"I've carefully calculated the income and expenses of our kindergarten, and we're currently operating at a loss each month.\"","Shen Wei was paying high salaries to all the staff.","The food provided was also of very good quality.","Add to that various other costs, and the current tuition fee of 1,600 per student simply couldn't cover the kindergarten's expenses.","The pop-up store was doing a bit better, with daily revenue of 200,000.","Only the kindergarten wasn't making money.","Qin Shu knew Shen Wei was wealthy.","The traffic and reputation gained couldn't be measured in monetary terms alone.","Many industry bigwigs couldn't achieve this effect even if they threw money at it.","But Shen Wei's success was unintentional, and indeed not something that ordinary people could emulate.","Since Shen Wei's kindergarten became popular, many people wanted to open kindergartens.","But a trend is just a trend. The first person might make money.","But those who follow don't have such good luck.","Shen Wei's path was not replicable.","It was hard to evaluate whether she had lost or gained.","In terms of money, she had lost, but in terms of reputation, she had gained, and this kind of reputation couldn't be bought with money.","But Qin Shu didn't want the kindergarten to continue operating at a loss.","So in his plan, he proposed opening a \"wealthy class.\"","The tuition for this class would be 20,000 yuan per month per student, focusing on happy education.","Although it was positioned as a wealthy class, it was still aimed at middle-class families, just with a fancy name.","Given the appeal of Starry Sky Kindergarten, opening this class could greatly improve the cash flow situation.","Shen Wei was hesitant about the 20,000 yuan per month fee: \"Will this work?\"","But Qin Shu confidently replied, \"We can give it a try!\"","So the enrollment announcement was posted on the short video platform's homepage.","Within an hour, the phone lines were jammed.","Getting into Starry Sky Kindergarten was no easy feat.","Parents who hadn't gotten in before had been waiting for a long time, and now finally a chance had appeared.","It was a wealthy class with a monthly tuition of 20,000 yuan, which not everyone could afford.","This eliminated a large portion of applicants.","The class was limited to only 30 students.","Not everyone who could pay would get in; there would be a simple interview process.","It was simpler than the previous kindergarten's live-streamed interviews, mainly to see if the child had been spoiled.","Currently, there were two trendsetters among kindergartens in the city: Noble Kindergarten and Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Now these two kindergartens seemed to have switched roles.","Noble Kindergarten was aggressively recruiting students for its general classes, even lowering the tuition to 1,500 yuan.","They were directly competing with other kindergartens for business.","Meanwhile, Starry Sky Kindergarten was now recruiting for its wealthy class, charging 20,000 yuan per month per child.","Many in the kindergarten industry couldn't understand this move.","In the kindergarten group chat, people mocked Starry Sky Kindergarten: \"Isn't this just blatantly ripping people off?\"","\"Will anyone really pay 20,000 yuan to attend this class? That's no small sum!\"","\"Excluding summer and winter breaks, kindergarten runs for 8 months a year, meaning the annual tuition would be 160,000 yuan.\"","\"Forget Starry Sky Kindergarten, even Noble Kindergarten couldn't charge this much.\"","Noble Kindergarten's main selling point was their investigation into family backgrounds.","Their tuition was quite affordable.","But Noble Kindergarten's principal would attend various events.","They would attract investments and sponsorships.","Wealthy people, considering their children attended the school, would invest some money. In other words, Noble Kindergarten's strategy was to funnel people into their private domain.","Combined with cultivating connections in wealthy circles.","Noble Kindergarten wasn't as strict about tuition fees.","This time, when Shen Wei announced the 20,000 yuan fee, many people were waiting to see her fail.","They thought Shen Wei had become arrogant.","Indeed, Starry Sky Kindergarten had been doing well.","But that was when they hadn't raised prices.","Now, before they had fully established themselves, they were asking for 20,000 yuan. Weren't they afraid of falling flat on their faces?","The incident with Noble Kindergarten was still fresh in everyone's minds.","It seemed that people's greatest experience was that they never learn from experience.","Shen Wei's wealthy class would involve a small interview process.","If a child was truly badly behaved, Shen Wei wouldn't accept them even for 40,000 yuan, let alone 20,000.","After a week of interviews, the 30-person class was full. Shen Wei was stunned, not expecting so many people to apply.","After Shen Wei's class was full, she issued an announcement, shocking all the other kindergartens.","\"No way, she really recruited that many suckers.\"","\"Where did she find so many rich people?\"","\"It's 20,000 yuan per person, with 30 people in the class, meaning a monthly revenue of 600,000 yuan for just this one class.\"","In the kindergarten group chat, everyone was buzzing with discussion, all feeling bitter after hearing this.","How could she find such good parents when they couldn't?","Those who had mocked Starry Sky Kindergarten before were now speechless: \"Conspiracy, this must be a huge conspiracy.\"","They increasingly felt that Shen Wei was deeply calculating, first losing money to provide benefits.","After building user stickiness and reputation, she started to cash in.","Everyone was grinding their teeth in anger.","But Shen Wei's mood was completely different from theirs.","With this one class, she had covered the entire kindergarten's expenses in one go. Not only were they not losing money, but they were even making a profit.","Shen Wei was deeply grateful that she had brought Qin Shu under her wing.","Shen Wei's system had been too generous with money, and she had been caught up in the happy atmosphere of the kindergarten, not rushing to make money.","How long had Qin Shu been at the kindergarten? He had already figured everything out.","Now with just this enrollment, they were starting to make money. Calculating this way, every month, after expenses, they could even profit over 100,000 yuan.","This wealthy class focused on happy education.","It was aimed at the middle class.","In any city, the rich are truly rich. Those who successfully enrolled in this class were eager to pay two or three years' tuition at once.","They didn't want the hassle of paying monthly.","These middle-class parents were competitive about their children in every aspect.","So Shen Wei's kindergarten, focusing on happy education, really struck a chord with these people.","Excelling academically requires both natural talent and a solid foundation.","Not everyone can keep up with the intense academic competition.","Rather than struggling to compete, it's better to give children a happy childhood.","Moreover, Shen Wei's kindergarten is far from ordinary. They've had professors with doctoral advisors teaching calculus before. The teachers for various subjects are all top experts in their fields.","Many kindergartens emphasize the concept of \"joyful education.\" But while others may focus primarily on the \"joyful\" part,","Shen Wei manages to balance both \"joy\" and \"education.\"","And this time, both Shen Wei and the parents were quite satisfied with the student recruitment process."]},{"number":140,"title":"Chapter 140: Special Students","paragraphs":["In the newly opened class for wealthy families, there was a rather special child.","The little boy was named Cheng Wen. His family was in the aluminum mining business.","The child was particularly adorable, but his reactions were slower than those of other children his age.","Most kindergartens were reluctant to accept him.","After Shen Wei took him in, he was placed in the same class as Song Ping An.","Song Ping An, at three years old, didn't speak much, so having him and ChengWen together allowed the two children to encourage each other's learning.","Moreover, with the daily guidance of education expert Weng Lan, it was essentially a private small-group class.","Cheng Wen was a very sensible child, with a chubby appearance.","His large eyes were exceptionally bright, with long eyelashes that were quite beautiful, making people's hearts melt.","Doctor Lu had specifically examined him and found that this child's development was somewhat delayed.","In other words, by current standards, he was a bit slow. Although he was 5 years old, he had the intelligence of a three-year-old child.","But he loved to smile!","Everyone loved to tease him.","Over time, the teachers noticed that it was always the family's nanny who came to pick him up, never his parents.","Cheng Wen's parents were also celebrities, and Shen Wei specially asked Qin Shu to inquire about them.","Only then did they learn that Cheng Wen's parents had a standard business marriage.","When Cheng Wen was born, there were some complications during delivery, and his mother suffered greatly.","His father was at the mining site and didn't return. When the child was born, due to prolonged amniotic fluid retention, he didn't cry immediately. His lung development was poor. By the time he was two years old, it was discovered that the child had some congenital intellectual issues.","The family had never had much affection for this son.","Later, they had another son.","The younger son was healthy and intelligent, and most of the family's love was poured into him.","Shen Wei felt somewhat melancholic after hearing this, but it was a family matter, and others had no right to comment.","The wealthy class that Cheng Wen was in attracted a lot of attention from netizens.","While other children were eager to show off, Cheng Wen always remained quiet and well-behaved.","The kindergarten teachers would ask small questions every day for everyone to answer, such as who they loved the most.","When it was Cheng Wen's turn, he said, \"I love Mommy and Daddy the most!\" He then flashed a brilliant smile.","The teacher pinched Cheng Wen's cheek, and Cheng Wen even leaned in closer, making it easier for the teacher to do so.","Cheng Wen, with his intellectual deficiencies, lived next door and was cared for by the nanny.","In contrast, Cheng Wen's younger brother, only three years old, was surrounded by luxury in everything he ate and used.","Even his baby crib cost over 300,000 yuan.","The nanny, seeing Cheng Wen's eyes light up as he spoke of loving his parents, felt a mix of emotions.","For a moment, she even had the uncharitable thought that it was fortunate Cheng Wen was the way he was. If he were a normal child, wouldn't he be heartbroken seeing his parents' favoritism?","Cheng Wen attended Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was known for its daily live broadcasts.","There were always people who would cater to others' interests. For instance, one of Cheng Wen's father's business partners saw the broadcast, cut out the child's part, and sent it to his father.","At that moment, the child's father was smoking outside the mining area.","Suddenly, he received a video from his business partner. He opened it and saw it was his son.","His reaction was indifferent.","For an ordinary family, 20,000 yuan a month might be a significant expense.","But for them, not just 20,000, even 200,000 a month wouldn't be an issue.","This child had already been given up on by the family. His low intelligence was seen as a disgrace to the family. Many times, they had forgotten they even had this \"eldest son.\"","Now, watching the edited clip of the child, he viewed him as he would a stranger's child.","He was cute, but there was no emotional response.","It wasn't until the child said in his sweet voice that he loved Mommy and Daddy that Cheng Wen's father fell into an unusual silence.","He watched it only once before being called away for business at the mining site. He finished his cigarette and went back to work.","It was just a slow son, they were wealthy enough to support him for life, but that was the extent of it.","Originally, the child's father didn't have deep feelings for him; parental love is often cultivated over time.","Given the child's condition, he didn't want to waste energy on him.","But seeing the child's eyes full of filial affection, saying he liked his daddy, the feeling grew slowly.","It wasn't until the evening, when no one was around, that Cheng Wen's father returned to the villa.","He was surprised to find that the aftereffect was quite strong.","Every time he closed his eyes, he could see the child.","He then opened a short video platform and searched for Cheng Wen.","Cheng Wen's slow reactions hadn't been publicized by the teachers.","So netizens didn't know, and many liked him, saying the child was handsome.","But there was very little material, because while many children were eager to show off, his son just stood quietly with one hand behind his back, listening attentively to the teacher.","This made Cheng Wen's father mutter, \"What a little fool.\"","This little fool was his son.","The son he had never cared about since birth.","He had never missed any of his younger son's growth milestones, so in his mind, he had always thought he only had one son.","Now seeing this silly child say he liked Mommy and Daddy,","The words echoed in his mind, and late at night, he opened his business partner's WeChat and watched the video several more times.","When the child spoke, his eyes seemed to shine with light.","The current project was almost finished anyway, so he decided to return home early.","He specifically went to the villa complex where his eldest son lived. The child was playing with building blocks at home.","There was no one to play with him, just a lonely little figure.","The sight made his father's heart ache.","He went over, and when the little one saw his dad, his eyes immediately lit up and he said, \"Daddy!\" Then his soft, chubby body lunged forward.","Cheng Wen's father had never been this close to Cheng Wen before and didn't know how to react for a moment.","But when Cheng Wen jumped towards him, he instinctively reached out to catch him.","The baby was chubby, and Cheng Wen had never been in his father's arms before. This time, he showed an unusual dependence.","Cheng Wen's father's body was a bit stiff: \"What are you playing?\"","\"I'm playing with building blocks.\"","Cheng Wen's father said, \"Daddy will make you fly.\"","Cheng Wen was already 5 years old, and it was only thanks to his father's regular workouts that he could lift his son.","As he lifted him up, the little one's laughter almost became continuous, both scared and excited, just like when he was younger.","The nanny found it amusing and took a picture to send to the lady of the house.","Cheng Wen's mother was in the villa next door.","She didn't want to see her foolish son, but saw the video sent by the nanny. Her husband was actually playing with their eldest son, which felt incredibly unfamiliar.","It was just an ordinary video, but Cheng Wen's mother watched it many, many times.","\"What's going on?\" She felt somewhat puzzled.","The nanny said, \"I'm not sure. When the master came back, he's been accompanying Young Master ChengWen, playing here.\"","Cheng Wen's mother snorted. Then she casually asked, \"How is he now?\"","The nanny replied, \"Young Master Cheng Wen is now in the internet-famous kindergarten. They have daily live streams there, and sometimes Cheng Wen's class is featured. It's quite interesting!\"","The lady impatiently snorted again. The nanny didn't dare to say more and subsequently ended the call.","However, the next day, the lady deliberately watched the child's live stream.","The little boy was happily running and jumping around in the kindergarten. Though his face showed innocence and naivety.","But the parents knew that this child had few playmates since he was young. He had always been lonely.","This realization made both husband and wife feel a bit uncomfortable. Their intentional neglect had hurt the child. Fortunately, there was Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Looking at ChengWen online, as innocent as any child, NiuNiu liked to play with him.","The child hadn't been this happy for a long time."]},{"number":141,"title":"Chapter 141: All Good Babies","paragraphs":["Cheng Wen was a polite little boy.","He was also exceptionally sincere.","Both adults and children enjoyed playing with him, and Mu Zhixing even took the initiative to draw with him.","Cheng Wen's artistic talent was average, but he was very well-behaved.","He stayed put after finishing his drawing.","Cheng Wen's drawing was a bit crooked and messy.","But Mu Zhixing's drawing was exceptionally good.","He felt embarrassed to show his own drawing. Seeing this, Mu Zhixing said, \"It looks very nice.\"","Cheng Wen knew that Mu Zhixing had held art exhibitions abroad.","He wanted to say something but was afraid of being rejected. After a long hesitation, he finally mumbled, \"Could you help me improve it a bit?\"","Mu Zhixing used to be quite timid, but during his time at the kindergarten, he had become much more outgoing and generous.","He actually made modifications to Cheng Wen's original drawing.","Mu Zhixing truly lived up to his reputation as a prodigy.","The few strokes he added really showed the difference between an ordinary child and a gifted one.","In an instant, it transformed from a casual doodle into a piece of artwork.","Moreover, it still preserved the essence of Cheng Wen's original drawing.","It now had an added artistic flair. This collision of childlike innocence and genius was truly fascinating.","Right then, someone in the livestream room offered to buy the drawing.","The price was 5,000 yuan.","Even others felt a twinge of envy, realizing how lucrative drawing could be.","Cheng Wen really liked Mu Zhixing.","After He Lingfeng returned from the computer science conference, he was whisked away by several old professors for intensive study, treating him like their collective pet.","When he emerged after a period of learning, he found that there were more children at the kindergarten.","Although he was young, he had been at the kindergarten the longest and subtly saw himself as one of the adults.","He Lingfeng had already begun to show his astute nature, developing some small games for Cheng Wen to play.","Cheng Wen was truly exceptionally well-behaved, spending entire days playing on the tablet.","Moreover, every time he achieved a high score, he would boast to He Lingfeng.","The little one wouldn't say much, just stare at him with his beautiful eyes, blinking continuously until He Lingfeng said, \"Well done.\"","Only then would the little one run off happily.","When Cheng Wen was with Song Ping An, both of them spoke more fluently than before.","Cheng Wen's parents truly realized that they had been neglecting their child.","In recent days, the couple spent more time with their child, which made Cheng Wen very happy.","Especially when drawing or writing, the little one would anxiously look back to see if his parents were still there.","When he saw they were, he would turn back with a secret smile.","The parents knew this was a sign of a child lacking security.","They had neglected his childhood, and now the child had grown up.","Cheng Wen's father discussed with his mother, \"Should we let the child come back to live with us?\"","Although the two villas were not far apart.","But this side was a bit quieter, with only the driver, nanny, and chef, and no one else.","In their villa, there were over ten staff members including nannies, cleaners, and various servants.","Plus, he had his younger brother, whom he should get closer to.","Cheng Wen's mother agreed, \"Alright!\"","Cheng Wen happily moved to his parents' home and then wrote in his diary. He didn't know how to write many characters.","He had to ask the nanny for help with one character at a time, and many were still replaced with pinyin. He wrote crookedly: \"Today was really too happy. I came to Dad and Mom's house...\"","The nanny who had raised Cheng Wen since he was little saw this and couldn't hold back her tears.","She truly felt that if it weren't for this kindergarten, and if the lady and sir had continued to neglect the young master,","This child might not have turned out entirely foolish.","He had a heart and emotions, and his emotions were richer and more delicate than most people's.","Fortunately, the Starry Sky Kindergarten's livestream allowed everyone to see Cheng Wen's good qualities.","...","In the wealthy class of Starry Sky Kindergarten, the most popular child was Cheng Wen, but the most disliked was Hu Guang.","He was a little boy, 6 years old this year, originally scheduled to start first grade next year.","He was very dissatisfied about coming to kindergarten and always frowned.","When the teacher led them to play together, Hu Guang always stood aside and didn't participate.","Moreover, he kept his brows furrowed, and after a while, the teacher couldn't help but approach him and ask, \"What's wrong?\"","Hu Guang said, \"I don't want to play, I want to study.\"","This was the first time the kindergarten teachers had encountered such a child.","The games here were very fun, especially the large-scale role-playing games.","Many children were reluctant to leave after they ended. It was rare to have so many children together. It was more fun with more people.","The children were all very engrossed in playing, only Hu Guang remained indifferent on the sidelines.","The teacher reported Hu Guang's situation to Shen Wei.","Shen Wei said, \"Alright, then let him study!\"","Shen Wei had special insights into nurturing geniuses.","She asked Su Jun to tutor the child.","They discovered that Hu Guang could solve math problems at a second-grade elementary school level.","After finishing, the child raised his chin proudly, waiting to be praised.","But beyond that, he couldn't handle third-grade problems. This was normal, after all, the child was only 6 years old.","Hu Guang was very proud of Shen Wei's praise.","While others were playing games, he was solving problems.","Even during meals, he was solving problems. He seemed determined to pursue learning to the very end.","Even the kindergarten teachers were shocked that nowadays, some children started competing academically from such a young age.","They specifically communicated with Hu Guang's family about the child's situation.","Hu Guang's mother received the teacher's call and couldn't help but tell the teacher about their family situation.","\"My marriage with his father isn't very stable, and his father already has a child with another woman outside.\"","\"And that child is only a few months younger than Xiao Guang.\" This would be a fatal blow to any woman.","\"His father doesn't come home now and wants a divorce. He said something that deeply affected our child, saying that the child born to that woman outside is very excellent and good.\"","Originally, when couples divorce, they say harsh things to each other.","Unexpectedly, the one who got hurt was the child.","Since then, he has been studying like a madman every day, just to get more praise.","Actually, even if his parents divorced, his conditions wouldn't be bad.","Although his mother didn't have much else, she had 6 properties before marriage.","Plus, their marital assets far exceeded what an ordinary working person could accumulate in several decades.","The reason the parents chose Starry Sky Kindergarten was because of the slogan in their advertisement that children could learn happily here.","Hu Guang's mother angrily cursed, \"I never imagined that beast would cause such great harm to my child.\"","The teacher said, \"Please don't get upset, parent. We will take good care of this child.\"","After everyone understood, they became more concerned about him. But he didn't feel any relief at all.","Instead, that tense feeling grew even stronger.","In terms of learning and progress, he even showed signs of \"reluctance.\"","Children's little thoughts are too transparent to adults.","The online fans just wanted to see what the children looked like, and suddenly seeing one like this, they really didn't like it.","The kindergarten had many extracurricular activities.","Children of this age need to run and jump a lot, to get excited, which is good for the development of the cerebellum.","During the tug-of-war in PE class, their class lost.","Hu Guang couldn't bear it at all and burst into tears for a full 40 minutes.","His entire face turned red from crying.","Everyone took turns trying to comfort him, but to no avail.","The comments section was filled with criticism.","Previously, they had only seen angelic babies in the kindergarten.","Even if ChengWen was a bit silly, he was still a smiling child.","This kind of child who cries at the drop of a hat was truly annoying from the bottom of their hearts.","\"My goodness, why would they admit a student like this?\"","\"It's just a game, isn't it? He's such a sore loser. You can tell a child's future at three, this kid won't amount to much when he grows up.\"","\"I watch the livestream to relax, but I encounter this ear-piercing noise. I'm really done.\"","\"Unfollowing.\"","Because of his crying, over 4,000 followers left immediately.","But Doctor Lu, as the livestream's moderator, explained to everyone that there was a reason for this child's behavior. It wasn't attention-seeking.","After repeated reassurances, the anger of the livestream viewers gradually subsided.","In the end, it was Shen Wei who arrived in time and took the child in her arms.","The little one had cried for over 40 minutes and was tired, gradually stopping his tears.","But having cried for so long, he couldn't stop completely, so he continued to sob and hiccup.","Shen Wei carried the child away from the livestream area: \"It's okay, children are allowed to lose.\"","Hu Guang loved attention, which was natural for children and nothing to worry about.","But crying so hysterically over a loss made even education experts frown, clearly realizing that his state wasn't right.","Hu Guang's mother, seeing her child cry on the livestream, rushed over immediately.","The child had stopped crying, but upon seeing his mother, the feeling of grievance welled up again. With a wail, he started crying once more."]},{"number":142,"title":"Chapter 142: Starlit Kindergarten has Education Experts","paragraphs":["Hu Guang's crying broke his mother's heart. \"What's wrong, sweetie?\" she asked.","Hu Guang, nestled in his mother's arms, couldn't help but say, \"I want to become stronger. I don't want Mom to be bullied anymore.\"","No one expected such words from a small child.","Instantly, tears fell from Hu's mother's eyes. Suppressing her sorrow, she said, \"Mom hasn't been bullied.\"","Hu Guang was quickly comforted. Afterwards, education expert Weng Lan took the child away.","Shen Wei asked Hu's mother, \"So what do you plan to do?\"","Hu's mother replied, \"I'll get a divorce as soon as possible.\"","Previously, Hu Guang's father had wanted a divorce.","But Hu's mother refused, feeling that since he had an affair during their marriage, why should she make way for the mistress?","Out of spite, she consistently refused to divorce.","However, this stubbornness only intensified Hu's father's aversion towards her and their son. Now, it had escalated to verbal abuse.","There was no point in keeping such an unfaithful husband, but the child shouldn't suffer any more harm.","Shen Wei assured her, \"You can rest easy about your child at the kindergarten. We have dedicated education experts here. We'll take special care of him.\"","Hu's mother kept expressing her gratitude.","When she left, her eyes were red.","At that time, her mind was entirely focused on the divorce, somewhat neglecting her child.","By the time Hu's mother realized something was wrong, the child had already become obsessive.","The words the child had just spoken felt like a knife twisting in her heart.","Hu's mother didn't know how to raise such a child, and she was grateful that Starry Sky Kindergarten was willing to take on this heavy responsibility.","The parent spent over an hour with Hu Guang.","A mother's presence can make a child feel safe.","As soon as Hu's mother left, Hu Guang's spirits dampened a bit.","Shen Wei called the child over and asked, \"Do you want to become stronger?\"","Hu Guang nodded emphatically.","He was just a child, not a fool.","He had heard that the mistress's child was attending a very good school.","That child was studying very well, and he also wanted to excel and make his father regret his actions.","Even Hu Guang's mother hadn't realized that such a young child could have so many complex thoughts.","Shen Wei said, \"We have a separate class for nurturing Little Geniuses. You can study in this class, but it might be extremely challenging!\"","Su Jun had evaluated Hu Guang and found that he was just an early bird, knowing a bit more than others, but certainly not a genius like He Lingfeng.","It's very difficult for ordinary people to enter the world of geniuses.","But since he had this desire, Shen Wei didn't want to suppress it.","She gave him some good advice: \"The study pressure will be immense. Don't cry if you lose once; the process of becoming stronger is full of difficulties and obstacles.\"","\"Also, don't care too much about what others think. You're actually much luckier than other children because your mom loves you, and your teachers and classmates love you too.\"","\"Okay!\" the child replied.","It was uncertain how much the child had absorbed.","But this kind of equal communication truly gave the child a great sense of security.","Sometimes, it's better not to treat children entirely as children.","Treating them like adults can give children an inexplicable feeling of respect.","That same day, Hu Guang's mother signed the divorce agreement with the child's father.","They also divided all their property.","When Hu Guang returned home, his father was moving things out.","Hu Guang watched silently from the side.","Although Hu's father had gotten what he wanted, seeing the coldness of his ex-wife and child still upset him.","He said to Hu Guang, \"I bought shoes and a schoolbag for your little brother.\"","Hu Guang's eyes darkened.","Before the child's father could say more,","Hu's mother grabbed an ashtray and smashed it hard against him. There was a loud bang, and blood started flowing.","Hu Guang's mother wanted to tear the man apart.","Even if they couldn't be husband and wife anymore, the child was still his own flesh and blood.","Using the child to hurt the mother - he was no longer fit to be a father; he was a beast.","Holding his injured forehead, Hu's father said, \"You crazy woman, no one will ever like you.\"","Hu Guang said, \"I like her. I like Mom!\" His voice was firm, and he repeated it twice.","In fact, this child cared a lot about his father.","But at this moment, he still stood up to protect his mother.","His father, covering his head, said, \"I need to go to the hospital,\" and ran off with his things!","It looked quite like he was fleeing in panic.","Hu Guang's mother said to him, \"Mom will buy you a schoolbag and shoes. You'll have everything others have.\"","She was afraid this incident would cause further psychological harm to Hu Guang, and her hatred for Hu Guang's father reached its peak.","Hu Guang remained silent for a while, not saying anything more.","The next day, Hu Guang's mother told the kindergarten teachers about the incident.","The class teacher was a very attentive person.","She discovered that it was Hu Guang's birthday that week.","The parents, preoccupied with the divorce, had forgotten to mention it.","So the kindergarten decided to throw a grand birthday party for the little one.","Shen's father personally made a cake for Hu Guang.","Others at the kindergarten prepared a beautiful birthday room.","Shen Wei bought him shoes and a schoolbag.","They were from top brands known for making excellent children's shoes.","Other teachers bought chocolates and snacks, all things that children love.","On Hu Guang's birthday, the teacher couldn't help but announce, \"We have a little birthday star in our class today. Can anyone guess who it is?\"","Hu Guang was excited.","But he had been so focused on studying lately that he hadn't played much with his classmates.","His eyes dimmed once again, fearing that no one liked him.","Soon, the teacher revealed, \"It's Hu Guang!\"","Then everyone burst into applause: \"It's your birthday? Happy birthday!\" The children's cheerful wishes made Hu Guang's eyes turn red.","But that wasn't all. Everyone crowded around Hu Guang and led him to that special room.","There was a huge birthday cake.","It had five tiers in total.","Every child would be able to have a piece of cake.","The little fellow blew out the candles and made a wish, then opened his presents.","Hu Guang was so excited his face turned red.","He was especially thrilled when he opened the schoolbag and shoes.","He also ate longevity noodles.","The teacher edited the entire video and sent it to Hu Guang's mother.","Hu Guang's mother felt somewhat regretful. As a mother, she had been so busy dealing with her ex-husband's affairs these past few days that she had forgotten her child's birthday.","Thankfully, there was Starry Sky Kindergarten.","That evening when they returned home, his mother held another small birthday celebration for him.","Only the two of them remained, and they had even added a gift.","Hu Guang said, \"Today was truly wonderful.\" With so many people wishing him a happy birthday, he realized he wasn't an unloved child after all.","Hu Guang's mother, hearing this, burst into tears: \"You are Mommy's most precious baby.\"","As she embraced her child, she felt genuinely grateful to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","She could sense the tension that had always been present in her child's body gradually relaxing.","The psychological education at Starry Sky Kindergarten was indeed highly professional.","Giving her child such a warm and heartfelt birthday celebration. A thousand thank-yous couldn't express her gratitude, so it all transformed into generous tips.","The next day, she went on a tipping spree in the livestream room, sending multiple extravagant virtual gifts.","Various tipping special effects dazzled viewers in the livestream.","Everyone was stunned by this sudden appearance of a wealthy benefactress.","So this is what it means to be rich?","The rich truly spare no expense when it comes to showing their appreciation."]},{"number":143,"title":"Chapter 143: Planting vegetables is better than planting flowers","paragraphs":["After retirement, Old Master Xu took up gardening as a hobby.","To indulge in his passion for plants and flowers, he specifically bought a first-floor apartment with a garden.","Every summer, the area outside his garden became a popular spot for neighbors to visit and take photos.","Various flowers bloomed in a dazzling display, seemingly endless. This earned him quite a reputation in the neighborhood.","Come summertime, polite neighbors could even ask for a few flower stems, which the old man would cut fresh for them. He had no choice; there were simply too many flowers, and this was no exaggeration.","If the flowers weren't trimmed, the large blooms would absorb all the nutrients.","The smaller flowers beneath wouldn't be able to blossom. Old Master Xu's pruning skills were top-notch.","He even had a special online group for flower enthusiasts. After a few years, he had become an administrator.","All sorts of novices would join to ask about soil composition,","nutrient ratios, which flowers were cold-resistant, which were easy to grow, and which were suitable for beginners. He answered all these questions with expertise.","His children, catering to his interests, would bring a few potted plants each time they visited.","Old Master Xu's collection of flowers grew ever larger, both inside and outside the house.","He loved gardening, but his wife wasn't particularly fond of it.","Mainly because there were too many flowers, and seeing them every day made them lose their charm.","Instead, they attracted ants, which was incredibly annoying.","Mrs. Xu said, \"Why don't you grow some vegetables instead? At least we could eat those. What use are these flowers?\"","Old Master Xu immediately retorted upon hearing this, \"Haven't you heard? 'To present a rose to others is to leave its fragrance on one's hand.' What do you know?\"","Old Mrs. Xu mocked, \"I think you're just showing off. Look at the other old ladies, they grow vegetables every day. Their sons and daughters don't even need to buy vegetables, there's enough for the whole family. But you? You're growing these useless flowers. The neighbor on the second floor even complained that if your flowers keep climbing up the wall, they'll have to talk to you about it.\"","It was troublesome when the flowers grew too well.","The flowers he had nurtured for over a decade had grown as big as trees, blocking the sunlight for the second-floor neighbors.","The second-floor residents were unhappy about this.","Old Madam suggested he give the flowers away.","But Old Master Xu had raised these flowers from seedlings.","He couldn't bear to sell or give them away.","These days, Old Madam had been nagging him incessantly. Old Master Xu wore a dark expression, not knowing what to say.","He just silently fumed.","As the elderly couple was arguing, their Son came home, carrying a small flowerpot with something green growing in it.","Before Old Master Xu could see clearly, he redirected his anger towards his son: \"I told you not to bring any more. You keep bringing things home every day, making your mother unhappy.\"","Old Mrs. Xu, surprised by her husband's shamelessness, exclaimed, \"You old fool!\"","The Son interjected, \"This isn't for you, it's for Mom. It's a vegetable plant. I bought it specially from Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","Hearing it was a vegetable, Old Madam immediately went over to look, and indeed it was.","The pot contained lush, green lettuce, a vibrant emerald color that gave off a fresh, appetizing scent.","Seeing it wasn't for him, Old Master Xu began to sulk: \"Fancy growing vegetables in a flowerpot. How precious.\"","The Son explained, \"Indeed, these vegetables are quite hard to come by. When Starry Sky Kindergarten announced they were selling vegetables, it seemed like the whole city rushed to buy them. I'm lucky I rode my electric scooter; otherwise, I wouldn't have found a parking spot. I managed to buy ten pots.\"","\"One for you, one for my father-in-law, one for my office, and a few for home.\"","\"It's convenient. When you want to eat some, just pluck a few leaves to add to your noodles. They say the taste is excellent!\"","\"Do you know about Starry Sky Kindergarten? My wife has been following them for half a year, hoping to enroll our child there. But since they're not accepting new students, we could only buy some of their vegetables.\"","\"A kindergarten that grows vegetables, how novel,\" Old Madam found it intriguing.","\"Indeed. My wife treats these vegetables like they're precious gems. She's only willing to give them to you and my father-in-law. She won't even sell them to neighbors who offer money.\"","Hearing it was from their daughter-in-law, the elderly couple didn't say much, though Old Master Xu pursed his lips, clearly unimpressed by the vegetable.","In the market, this type of lettuce costs 2.5 yuan per 500 grams.","This single plant didn't even weigh that much.","But Old Madam was overjoyed.","She had always liked vegetables.","Receiving a vegetable plant from her son, Old Madam immediately moved the most prominent potted flower from the indoor plant stand and replaced it with her new vegetable, as if to say, \"Make way for the VIP!\"","Old Master Xu was somewhat displeased.","But his wife had been arguing with him for days, so he didn't dare voice his objections.","He could only let it be.","At lunchtime, the Son insisted that his mother make noodles and add some of the lettuce.","He had heard how delicious it was.","But his wife wouldn't let him eat it.","They just kept it as a plant, and he had been craving it for days.","Seeing how green and crisp the leaves looked,","Now that he was at his parents' house, he made his request.","\"That's hardly enough to eat!\" Old Master Xu commented sarcastically.","Old Madam, annoyed, immediately retorted, \"Fine then, the two of us will eat it. You don't get any!\"","In the end, she made noodles for her son, deliberately plucking two leaves.","Old Master Xu saw that there really wasn't any for him, and kept trying to catch his son's eye.","The Son laughed and said, \"Mom, add some for Dad too!\"","Hearing her son's words, Old Madam reluctantly added some for her husband.","When the noodles were ready, the aroma filled the room as they ate.","The vegetables were crisp yet tender, with an unprecedented sweet fragrance.","The elderly couple perked up immediately, feeling refreshed after the meal.","Combined with the hot noodles, their mood improved significantly.","No wonder these noodles tasted so good.","Suddenly, Old Master Xu looked thoughtfully at the vegetable plant. Perhaps his wife was right – was growing vegetables better than cultivating flowers?","He hadn't given it much thought all these years, but after tasting the noodles, his attitude changed dramatically: \"Can you bring more of these vegetables?\" One pot wasn't enough.","\"Of course, why not? I still have seven pots at home. How about this – I'll bring four more pots next time.\"","\"Can you buy even more?\" Old Master Xu asked.","\"That might be difficult, but I'll check later!\"","Old Master Xu said, \"If you can buy them, get 20 more pots.\"","\"Where would we put them all?\" the Son wondered aloud.","Old Master Xu said, \"What's the problem? Let's clear out some of my flowers for him. From now on, your mother and I will each have our own side of the courtyard. One of us will grow flowers, and the other will grow vegetables.\"","Old Madam's face lit up with joy when she heard this. \"Are you sure about that? Once you've said it, you can't go back on your word.\"","She had no idea that eating this small bowl of noodles would have such a big impact on him. If she had known, she would have eaten them much sooner."]},{"number":144,"title":"Chapter 144: Vegetables are Good","paragraphs":["All the seedlings at Starry Sky Kindergarten started from seeds.","They had sold a batch earlier at the entrance of the vegetable garden.","Who would have thought that tens of thousands of pots would disappear in an instant, even blocking the road.","Not only did the traffic police come, but also the local police station, asking why such a large-scale event wasn't reported.","The staff at Starry Sky were also bewildered, not expecting so many people to come.","They apologized profusely and didn't dare to do it again.","Previously, there were mostly leafy green vegetable seedlings.","Now, cucumber, pepper, and tomato seedlings had also sprouted. Looking at the lush little seedlings, ah, Liu Chef was somewhat troubled.","Liu Chef placed the utmost importance on the vegetable garden.","He hadn't encountered such a situation in all these years.","The seeds would sprout quickly as soon as they were buried and watered.","The scene looked truly delightful, but even this large area wasn't enough for planting.","Moreover, after what happened before, they didn't dare to sell seedlings now.","However, the kindergarten parents and previous buyers kept asking about repurchasing in the comment section.","Those who had tasted their leafy greens knew how truly delicious they were.","Vegetables bought elsewhere just couldn't match this flavor. Even using these greens in a bowl of noodles would enhance it significantly.","But as Old Master Xu had said, vegetables grown in pots really weren't enough to eat.","Picking just one leaf would make you feel regretful for half a day. Rather than that, it was better to have several more pots.","Everyone wanted to buy seedlings and flocked to Teacher Tang and Doctor Lu's accounts. They didn't dare to answer much on this topic.","Liu Chef loved to respond, but being older, he didn't go online much.","Old Master Xu's son made a special trip to the vegetable garden.","He happened to catch Liu Chef there, sighing about the abundance of seedlings.","Just then, a man came in, and Liu Chef said, \"You can't come in here.\"","Originally, there was a security guard, but he had taken leave due to family matters.","They were supposed to lock the door, but since Liu Chef had come in, the outer gate wasn't locked.","As soon as Old Master Xu's son entered, he saw the neat rows of fresh seedlings arranged together.","He was truly amazed and said to Liu Chef, \"Liu Chef?\"","His wife was a devoted fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Consequently, he had become familiar with the older staff at the kindergarten.","\"I bought 10 pots of vegetables from you last time, ah, it's really not enough to eat. Can I buy a few more? My parents really like these vegetables.\"","Previously, there were only various leafy greens here.","Such as cilantro, lettuce, and bok choy.","But now he saw peppers, eggplants, and string beans.","Old Master Xu's son was no longer satisfied with just leafy greens.","Liu Chef was just worrying about having too many vegetables when he suddenly saw him and asked, \"How many do you want?\"","Old Master Xu's son immediately beamed with joy upon hearing this: \"About half a small garden's worth.\"","\"Eggplant, string beans, potatoes, cucumbers, tomatoes, peppers, let's have some of each. How about 10 pots of each?\"","Liu Chef, hearing this, prepared 60 pots for him: \"Can you transport all of that?\"","Old Master Xu's son said, \"No problem, I'll go find a tricycle.\"","This was truly an unexpected delight.","It was also fortunate that Liu Chef was there to be so accommodating.","So he went to the accountant to pay, hired a tricycle, and directly transported these vegetables to the old man's house.","The old man had indeed been somewhat interested in vegetables before.","But he hadn't finished dealing with his flowers yet, and now the vegetables had arrived.","Forced to deal with the flowers, he complained a bit: \"Why did you do this so quickly?\"","Old Master Xu's son also had his own intentions. If the previous leafy greens were so delicious, wouldn't tomatoes, peppers, potatoes, string beans, and eggplants be even better?","If the old lady really started growing these, they wouldn't need to buy vegetables in the future.","So he said to Old Master Xu, \"Why don't you send these flowers to the flower market to sell? The flowers I've seen aren't as good as yours!\"","This way, they could also earn some money.","The father and son busied themselves for a full two days.","They were so secretive that even his wife didn't know what he was doing every day.","When it was over, Old Master Xu's son happily said to his wife, \"Guess what I've been up to these past few days?\"","His wife said, \"I can't guess.\"","So Old Master Xu's son told his wife about accidentally meeting Liu Chef at Starry Sky Kindergarten and buying a bunch of vegetables.","His wife immediately got excited when she heard this: \"There are other vegetables too?\"","She also wanted to buy some. She wanted eggplants and string beans too.","Old Master Xu's son said, \"No way, those things can't be grown in flowerpots. Once mom and dad's harvest comes in, we'll have enough for both eating and taking home.\"","\"So that was your plan.\"","His wife suddenly understood. How should she put it, her husband really knew how to think ahead.","Otherwise, as a daughter-in-law, even if she had thought of it, she couldn't have said it out loud.","Afterwards, she checked Starry Sky's account again, but there was no mention of selling vegetables a second time.","She saw that everyone in the comments section wanted to buy these vegetables again.","Suddenly, it felt like she was carrying a huge secret.","His wife simply couldn't contain herself, so she secretly posted online saying, \"Guess what happened to me!\" and told the story of opening a mystery box at Starry Sky's vegetable garden.","She went to watch some TV series in the afternoon, and when she came back to check her messages, there were 99+ notifications.","For a moment, she thought she was being cyberbullied.","But when she opened them, many people were asking, \"Where did you buy this?\"","\"Can we still buy it if we go now?\"","Some of the more proactive ones had already set out.","Some even shared pictures, showing off what they had bought.","Everyone realized that Starry Sky was still keeping this hidden.","People had already managed to buy some, so how could others resist? Thus, a large group of people prepared to set out.","Shen Wei was monitoring public opinion on this side.","Seeing another large group of people coming, she immediately asked Liu Chef what had happened.","Liu Chef was also a bit dumbfounded: \"I just sold a few pots of vegetables!\"","They hadn't intended to create such a big commotion.","But learning from their previous experience, they immediately reported the activity to the local police station.","Then they quickly sent some idle staff over to maintain order.","Those who came early could still choose what they wanted.","Those who came late basically had to take whatever was available.","In an instant, people were scrambling to queue up just to spend money.","Many people just stuffed money into Liu Chef's hands, grabbed a few pots of vegetables, and quickly left.","Concerned that more and more people would arrive soon, Liu Chef and the others began digging frantically.","They didn't even take a break. Thankfully, this event had been reported in time, otherwise they would have been reprimanded.","Liu Chef was experiencing a mix of pain and joy. Indeed, their vegetable garden had grown exceptionally well, which was evident to everyone. Liu Chef proudly raised his chin!","They had an abundance of vegetables on their side.","From noon until afternoon, they had only sold half of their produce.","But all the staff at Starry Sky Kindergarten were already exhausted.","It was incredibly tiring. Liu Chef saw that there wasn't much left. They could probably sell it all in one more round.","There was no rush for these remaining vegetables. In the future, they would pack them in advance. This way, people could take them and go, saving the effort of digging and packing on the spot, which was too labor-intensive."]},{"number":145,"title":"Chapter 145: Chili Seedlings","paragraphs":["Little Cat was a die-hard fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","She had just graduated and started working this year, suddenly feeling like she had become an adult.","Life came crashing down on her, leaving her feeling breathless.","Add to that her entry into the workforce, where she had to deal with various complex interpersonal relationships.","It felt like she had barely become an adult before being thrown into a chaotic environment, making her extremely uncomfortable.","Her greatest hobby was watching the livestreams of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","She loved every little baby in the kindergarten.","She truly found healing through Starry Sky Kindergarten.","After watching the livestreams for a full six months, she knew every baby in the kindergarten!","Her fan club level had already risen to level twenty-three.","She had never given a single paid gift, at most sending two free popularity votes.","Recently, she had just been promoted with a pay raise, transforming from a workplace novice into a career woman.","She had a bit more disposable income now.","She also wanted to buy something for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","But she didn't like giving tips. Half of the tipped gifts would be deducted by the platform. For someone as frugal as her, this was really not cost-effective.","She had missed out on the first batch of vegetable sales.","Now she saw locals in the comment section going to Starry Sky Kindergarten to buy the second batch of vegetables.","The fact that the second batch was secretly put on sale without any announcement caught many old fans off guard! But it suited Little Cat's wishes perfectly.","So in the afternoon, she went to Starry Sky Kindergarten!","Although she relied on them for companionship every day, this was her first time actually coming here!","But when she arrived, everything felt familiar.","Liu Chef was selling seedlings here. His trouser cuffs and face were smeared with soil, but he didn't seem to mind at all. He was still asking everyone what they wanted.","Everyone around was chattering away!","Little Cat's sharp eyes spotted many chili seedlings! She was from Sichuan Province!","She couldn't do without chili in any meal.","But the local chilies weren't really spicy. Her mom always mailed her a lot!","Now seeing the familiar chili seedlings felt so comforting, she said, \"Grandpa Liu, I'd like ten pots of chili peppers.\"","Liu Chef was used to being called \"Grandpa Liu,\" and didn't find it odd for an adult to address him this way.","Moreover, seeing that Little Cat was a young woman, his voice became much gentler. He said, \"That's fine, but can you eat ten pots? These chilies are quite spicy.\"","\"I can manage it,\" Little Cat's eyes lit up at hearing these chilies were spicy.","She actually didn't come here to buy things.","She just wanted to thank Starry Sky Kindergarten for their long-term companionship.","Although she had just graduated half a year ago and didn't have much money, she wanted to support Starry Sky Kindergarten financially.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was very considerate. After buying ten seedlings, there was an electric tricycle available for hire. She transported these seedlings back home.","Her home was immediately filled with greenery.","Little Cat had never grown plants before. She just watered them.","But the next day, the leaves of the little chili plants became even more lush green, glossy and appealing.","She took two pots to the office as small potted plants, not knowing if the office was particularly suitable for chili growth.","The little chili plants in the office grew even more pleasingly, faster than those at home.","In less than half a month, they had grown chilies. Although the seedlings weren't very sturdy, they bore many small peppers.","People in the office hadn't seen anything like this before.","They came to look every day, and some bored colleagues even named each chili pepper. Whenever they were bored, they would start counting the peppers.","Under everyone's careful watch, suddenly one day seven or eight peppers disappeared!","The bored colleague was furious: \"Ruth, Jerry, Nanami... they've all been snatched away!\"","Little Cat laughed when she heard these names: \"Where did you get all these names from?\" Just as the bored colleague wanted to investigate,","The boss came over, saying he wanted to buy her chili seedlings. He said the spiciness was too authentic!","Suddenly the bored colleague didn't dare to speak, oh my, it was the boss who had \"stolen\" them!"]},{"number":146,"title":"Chapter 146: Kindergarten Branch Two","paragraphs":["The Boss worked late that day and happened to notice some bright red chili peppers on the office desk, looking particularly tempting.","Unable to resist, he picked a few to take home.","At home, he made scrambled eggs with chili peppers as a topping for noodles.","This dish was simple, filling, and didn't require much cooking time.","It had always been the Boss's favorite meal at the dinner table.","Today, with the new chili peppers, his first bite was fiery hot.","There was a burning sensation in his mouth.","But as the pain quickly dissipated, it transformed into a tingling, numbing feeling.","It was incredibly stimulating, making him crave more.","Usually, he could eat two bowls of noodles in an evening.","But because of this spicy topping that made him feel so good, he couldn't help but eat three bowls, successfully stuffing himself.","When he told the Boss's Wife about it, she was shocked: \"You picked and ate the chili peppers belonging to our company's employees?\"","The Boss was instantly embarrassed; he thought they were bought as decorative plants.","He didn't realize they were company property, let alone personal belongings.","But these chili peppers were exactly to his liking.","The peppers sold in markets before were spicy but lacked flavor.","However, these peppers were spicy, fragrant, crisp, and numbing - simply delicious.","Even a simple dish of scrambled eggs became so aromatic; imagine how good it would be with meat.","He could barely sleep that night, craving more.","So the next day, he quickly called Little Cat to his office.","His intention was to buy these two pots of chili peppers.","Little Cat, having worked there for a while, couldn't possibly accept money from the Boss.","She said she'd give them to him as a gift.","The Boss felt awkward and insisted on giving her 200 yuan.","But she refused. The Boss didn't want to push too hard with a female employee, fearing gossip from other staff.","So he asked the Boss's Wife to send her a gift instead.","The Boss's Wife said, \"What's there to give? This girl works hard and diligently. Why don't we give her a raise?\"","Little Cat still had 8 pots of chili peppers at home.","So she didn't think much of these two pots.","But soon she received a private message from the Boss's Wife.","It said they would increase her monthly salary by 500 yuan.","She never expected two pots of chili peppers could lead to such a connection.","She suddenly felt grateful to Starry Sky Kindergarten. Apart from the finance department, no one knew about the raise.","Little Cat brought two more pots of chili peppers from home to the office.","The company's feng shui must have been excellent because the peppers grew faster there than at home.","Since the new peppers arrived at the office, they grew abundantly and turned bright red. Several brazen colleagues frequently visited her desk.","They'd ask for a pepper or two to try, and all wanted to buy more, finding them a thousand times better than store-bought ones.","They were indeed fragrant and spicy, but she wouldn't sell them.","The Boss wanted to buy these two pots as well.","Mainly because he was now addicted to eating them. The previous two pots weren't enough.","Since the Boss had already given her a raise, she felt obliged to give him these two pots as well - it was all part of maintaining good relationships.","After hearing that Little Cat had given the peppers to the Boss, other colleagues felt a bit resentful. They all asked her where she bought them.","Little Cat told them about Starry Sky Kindergarten selling vegetable seedlings.","By the time everyone excitedly went there, Starry Sky Kindergarten had already sold out of vegetables.","The others could only feel disappointed, unable to do anything about it.","Who could have imagined a kindergarten branching out like this?","So after following their short video account, they quickly left comments.","They wanted to buy more vegetables.","Little Cat wasn't willing to bring the remaining 6 pots of chili peppers to the company.","Mainly because she also loved eating spicy food.","If she ate them this year, she could save the seeds for next year.","Then she wouldn't need to buy chili peppers anymore.","She called her mother, saying she didn't need to send her express deliveries anymore. She had found the best-tasting chili peppers.","No wonder people said Starry Sky Kindergarten's vegetables were delicious; they really knew what they were doing.","Even she couldn't resist wanting to taste the Starry Sky chef's cooking.","Now it was only available at pop-up stores. But when tickets for the pop-up stores went on sale, there were 250,000 people online.","It was even more than before; people who couldn't get tickets before had an even slimmer chance now.","...","On Liu Chef's side, he had successfully sold vegetables a few times.","He had whetted the appetites of everyone who had bought seedlings.","Now people didn't want to grow them anymore; the process from planting to harvesting was just too long.","They only wanted to buy ready-to-eat produce.","Some time had passed, and the vegetables in Starry Sky's garden had grown. Everyone wanted to try their luck.","Some who lived nearby would wait for Liu Chef at the kindergarten gate. Others would leave messages online.","They had all become loyal fans of Starry Sky.","Everyone knew that leaving comments in the comment section was pretty useless.","The main thing was to find Shen Wei and Liu Chef.","Shen Wei wasn't easy to catch.","But Liu Chef came to the vegetable garden early every day, so waiting for him was sure to succeed.","\"Can you sell us some vegetables?\"","\"Your vegetables are really delicious.\"","\"I haven't eaten such good vegetables in years. I have a relative in the countryside who sends us vegetables every year. I used to think they were quite good, but they can't compare to yours.\"","Liu Chef knew they were flattering him.","But hearing everyone's praise still made him grin from ear to ear: \"Really? I'm still not sure if we can sell them!\"","He could only use such words to fend off everyone.","People said a few more words and then dispersed.","Liu Chef returned to the small kitchen of Starry Sky Kindergarten, feeling relieved.","He was about to sort out today's vegetables when he turned around and saw Chef Chen with a cold expression.","Liu Chef was startled, \"What's wrong?\"","Chef Chen said, \"I hear you want to sell vegetables again?\" His tone was icy.","Selling seedlings before was one thing.","Because they couldn't plant that many in their plot.","Selling seedlings could also save some costs and recoup some losses.","But the money earned was a drop in the bucket.","Chef Chen even regretted it a bit, wishing he hadn't let him sell.","If he had known, he should have rented a plot in the countryside to grow these seedlings himself.","Now that the seedlings were sold, more and more people were eyeing their vegetables.","Even old customers were calling him, showing how influential this had become.","To make matters worse, Liu Chef was soft-hearted.","He found it hard to refuse anyone who asked to buy vegetables.","Chef Chen guarded these vegetables jealously.","Now it wasn't just for Starry Sky Kindergarten, but also for the pop-up stores.","\"You know how much produce we use every day. Do you know how much we'd have to buy if we didn't have this vegetable garden?\"","Liu Chef could do this math clearly.","Liu Chef whispered in a voice as soft as a mosquito's: \"I just think we can sell the dishes that we have the most of!\"","The main reason was that he had previously invested 2 million yuan in the vegetable garden.","He felt guilty about it.","He wanted to find another way to recoup some of the money.","Moreover, with people buying and praising the dishes, he was somewhat tempted.","Chef Chen said, \"I've already made arrangements for these. You're not allowed to sell them. If you keep making decisions on your own like this, I might just quit.\"","Liu Chef was shocked to hear this: \"Please don't, brother! I was wrong!\"","His apology came out smoothly.","Chef Chen's cooking skills were even better than his.","Now Chef Chen was shouldering the main responsibility. If he were to leave, how could Liu Chef ever enjoy the leisurely life of hugging his grandchildren and tending to his garden?","He would definitely be stuck in the kitchen all the time. Now that his senior was taking on the main workload, he couldn't let him go.","Seeing how quickly Liu Chef apologized, Chef Chen wasn't sure if he truly understood his mistake.","He felt both annoyed and amused, so he ignored him.","Liu Chef knew he had angered his senior colleague.","Fearing that his apology might not be enough to make amends,","He called his grandchildren over and whispered something to them.","A moment later, two little ones appeared at Chef Chen's feet, each hugging one of his legs.","\"Grandpa Chen, my grandpa knows he was wrong. Please don't be angry with him!\" came the children's sweet, childish voices.","Chef Chen was known for his stern expression.","But somehow, the kindergarten children didn't seem to fear him at all. Whenever they saw him, they would cheerfully call out, \"Grandpa Chen, Grandpa Chen!\"","Although Chef Chen usually maintained a serious demeanor, he actually enjoyed being around these little ones.","He just wasn't as expressive with his emotions as Liu Chef.","Now, with two little ones hugging his legs, his heart softened immediately.","He shot Liu Chef a fierce glare afterward, knowing that the old fox had targeted his weak spot.","What he had said earlier was just out of anger. Starry Sky Kindergarten had truly captured his heart, so how could he bear to leave?","Seeing Chef Chen pick up the two children, one in each arm, Liu Chef finally breathed a sigh of relief. It was true that there was no adult who couldn't be won over by children!","Liu Chef was grateful he had a grandson and granddaughter.","Having passed this hurdle, he breathed a sigh of relief and then went to ask the kitchen staff, \"Where's Shen Wei?\"","\"Boss is in the office with Doctor Lu!\"","Liu Chef was now the deputy director of the kindergarten, responsible for many things.","He felt a bit embarrassed, realizing he had been dedicating most of his energy to the vegetable garden.","He had lost track of what was happening at the kindergarten and felt guilty for neglecting his main duties. So, he made a special trip to the meeting room.","He found that besides himself, Teacher Tang, Doctor Lu, education experts, Shen Wei, and Gu Qingyan were all there.","It was quite a full house. Seeing Liu Chef arrive, Doctor Lu said, \"We were just about to call you, and here you are.\"","Liu Chef felt a bit embarrassed and said, \"Yes, I'm a bit late. What have you been discussing?\"","Doctor Lu's eyes were sparkling with excitement: \"Good news, incredible news. We just had visitors from the government.\"","\"They said that in the East Lake Economic Development Zone, they've bought a large piece of land. If we open a kindergarten there, they can provide us with 50,000 square meters of land. It's enough for us to build a luxurious kindergarten, and they're only charging 400 yuan per square meter.\"","This was an incredible honor.","Even elite private kindergartens had never heard of such preferential treatment.","It was mainly because everyone had witnessed how popular Starry Sky Kindergarten had become.","The government was developing a new district.","They wanted to attract some well-known supermarkets, businesses, and kindergartens to help develop their new area, which would also allow them to sell properties at higher prices.","It was a genuine offer with real benefits.","\"This is great news!\"","Now, every day, many people were leaving comments asking when they would start admissions.","Many children were already taking preparatory courses.","They were just waiting for the kindergarten to start admissions and interviews.","Apparently, there were now courses specifically designed to train children in interview skills and public speaking for kindergarten admissions.","These were spin-off projects that had emerged after Starry Sky Kindergarten became so popular.","The staff at Starry Sky Kindergarten hadn't realized just how famous they had become.","But in reality, they were extremely popular.","Liu Chef looked at Shen Wei and asked, \"They must have some requirements too, right?\"","It couldn't be that they were getting all the benefits without any conditions.","There must be other aspects to consider.","Shen Wei admired Liu Chef's perceptiveness. He really did hit the nail on the head. Indeed, older people had seen more of the world.","Shen Wei nodded and said, \"They require us to complete construction within a year, and we must reserve 200 spots for them.\"","\"So, are you going to accept?\" Liu Chef asked.","Everyone looked at Shen Wei.","Without realizing it, Shen Wei had become the backbone of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Not a single person viewed her as a young person anymore.","She was the pillar of the kindergarten.","Shen Wei was still hesitating, unsure if this opportunity was as good as it seemed.","At that moment, the electronic voice in Shen Wei's head spoke again: \"New task issued. Please proceed with opening the second branch of the kindergarten.\"","Seeing the expectant looks on everyone's faces, Shen Wei said, \"Let's do it.\"","Everyone's faces lit up with excitement and enthusiasm.","These people were all veterans of the kindergarten.","Their emotional connection ran deeper than anyone else's.","Especially Liu Chef, who had been the only one there before all this began.","Now they had developed into a key project that the government was eager to attract.","That sense of pride welled up naturally within them."]},{"number":147,"title":"Chapter 147: The Influence of Stars in the Sky","paragraphs":["The news about Starry Sky Kindergarten opening a new branch in the new district had just been confirmed.","Local people immediately started buying houses in the new district.","When buying a house, the first priority was to discuss enrollment spots, then discounts.","The district leaders here had reserved 200 spots, saying they would cooperate with real estate developers.","As soon as someone showed interest in buying, the sales staff became excited.","They first promoted a 160-square-meter large flat.","The contract explicitly mentioned a spot at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","After the purchase, both parties were quite pleased.","The buyer felt that the apartment was excellent in terms of layout and location.","The seller was happy too.","Currently, housing prices across the country had started to plummet.","A strange phenomenon occurred: the more expensive the houses, the more people bought; the cheaper they became, the less people bought.","The new district was initially priced as a high-end neighborhood.","The opening price was 20,000 yuan per square meter.","Now it had dropped to 14,000, with fully furnished interiors ready for immediate occupancy.","However, if no one bought, the prices would have to drop further.","This was a constant worry for both the developers and the new district leaders.","Now, as soon as the news was out, smart people came to buy houses.","As some did this, others followed suit.","But few were as decisive as the first buyer; most just came to inquire.","At first, the staff confidently said there would be spots available.","But buying a house is not a simple decision for any family.","They hesitated, and when they came back to ask again, the staff could no longer guarantee spots.","After allocating 10 spots through house purchases, the leadership cut it off.","This made the sales staff somewhat anxious.","How could they restrict spots when so many people were finally buying houses?","This was a golden opportunity that doesn't come often.","But once the leaders spoke, the sales staff didn't dare say they had spots anymore.","So every time they were asked, they gave vague answers.","Seeing this, others suspected something fishy and became even more hesitant to buy.","Those who wanted to buy but weren't sure about getting a spot kept obsessing over Starry Sky Kindergarten's moves.","The more this group focused on the kindergarten, the more they realized how powerful Starry Sky Kindergarten was.","They had professors teaching calculus. This kind of lineup was rare even in middle schools, let alone kindergartens.","Not to mention various art classes, where teachers came from the top of their respective fields.","Even if they didn't understand the industry well, the difference was glaringly obvious.","Teachers from other art schools weren't even qualified to be assistants here.","Moreover, they had nurtured many excellent students. For instance, the well-known Mu Zhixing, who participated in an art exhibition in the United States.","He was considered a rising star in the industry, and because of Mu Zhixing, the art circle had to accept Qi Zhong.","Both master and apprentice were geniuses, and Qi Zhong's past was brought up again. Many people gave him positive evaluations.","Many people wanted to learn from Qi Zhong.","But Qi Zhong didn't need much money, and his salary at Starry Sky Kindergarten was quite high.","Plus, various kindergartens provided mineral pigments for free use, so he didn't need to teach extra classes elsewhere for additional income.","To study under him, entering Starry Sky Kindergarten was the best choice!","There were also street dance teachers, classical dance teachers, and singing teachers. Not just children, even adults wanted to learn from them when they appeared.","People were willing to pay high tuition fees, but they only charged the kindergarten's monthly fee of 1,600 yuan.","Only pop-up stores offered a slight taste of their teaching.","But the pop-up stores were too popular. Those who had been there wanted to come back, but there was no exclusive channel for returning customers. They had to compete with 250,000 people for tickets simultaneously.","It was frustrating. The more people learned about it, the more they felt that 1,600 yuan was incredibly cheap, almost like charity.","Later, Starry Sky Kindergarten opened a luxury class with a monthly fee of 20,000 yuan, and spots were immediately filled.","Those who had previously been admitted through interviews were all proud. The classes they attended were worth 20,000 yuan.","The 1,600 yuan was really a benefit for families.","Starry Sky Kindergarten's reputation was now soaring.","Meanwhile, Noble Kindergarten frequently made poor decisions, showing signs of decline.","Noble Kindergarten used to have a higher status than Starry Sky Kindergarten, but now it was falling behind.","If this new district could really have Starry Sky Kindergarten move in, it would instantly become a holy land in the hearts of young mothers.","In ancient times, there was a story about Mencius's mother moving three times for better education.","The learning environment is very important for children.","The more parents thought about it, the more restless they became.","After a few days, some parents who already had school district houses elsewhere still wanted to buy one here. As long as they could get a spot, they would find a way to pay any price. It's all for the children!","The sales staff felt like they were sitting on hot coals.","Now people were coming with money to buy houses.","This feeling was like returning to the peak of the housing market five years ago.","They knocked on the manager's door, but the manager had a tearful face, saying, \"Don't mention it, there are no spots at all!\"","These spots were only available through cooperation with the government.","But now the officials there were tightly controlling the spots and not releasing any. Nobody could do anything about it.","Even the manager was a bit panicked.","He was a bit more perceptive than the average salesperson.","With so many people wanting kindergarten spots, this must be a good thing.","He even regretted not reserving one for himself earlier when they were available.","Now, forget about customers, even he didn't have one.","The sales staff had to regretfully convey this news to the house buyers.","They thought this deal would surely fall through, but surprisingly, the buyer still purchased a unit.","They just said it was fine as long as Starry Sky Kindergarten was nearby.","Although they didn't get a guaranteed spot, living in the area would allow their child to interview.","The new district was quite far from the old one, and no parent was willing to drive back and forth for an hour to drop off and pick up their child. It would be too tiring for the kids.","This works too? The sales staff were stunned.","Starry Sky Kindergarten's status rose sharply again in the minds of the sales team.","Many people also left comments on live streams or account pages, asking if the new district branch was real.","The popularity of Starry Sky Kindergarten in this city was simply too high.","Since interviews can be risky, securing a spot in a wealthy class early on is a viable option.","Not everyone these days is without money.","The developer went directly to the functional department to inquire about available spots.","Now even the big boss of the developer has heard about it.","They're hoping more spots will be released, at least to keep some big clients on board.","But the government department just won't release any more spots.","An employee familiar with the developer said, \"Don't even mention these spots! It's not that I won't give them, there really aren't any left now.\"","He didn't consider it a good thing from the beginning.","After letting go of 10 spots for the developer to use, others came flooding in.","Many big businesses that had initially rejected the new district suddenly changed their tune, saying they could consider moving in after all.","These were shopping malls, hospitals, large fruit and vegetable supermarkets, and chain brands.","The new district's staff had approached them before but were ruthlessly rejected.","They needed to conduct on-site inspections, even if the new district offered some preferential policies.","Once operations begin, the maintenance costs would also be substantial.","They would need to hire a large number of staff.","If it didn't take off, they'd lose money.","So they were all very cautious.","They had already refused, but unexpectedly, because of the kindergarten spots, they made a U-turn and said they could move in. They just required a certain number of spots.","If it were just one or two saying this, it would be fine.","Now all the businesses had this demand.","The functional staff loosened up once and gave out 10 spots.","Later they gave 5, then 3, and half the spots were already used up.","But the businesses they attracted were high-end ones that made the leaders beam with joy.","They actually agreed because of the kindergarten spots.","Now the few spots in hand were treated like precious gems.","If negotiations weren't going well, a little temptation with spots might still work.","The new district leaders were fired up, feeling that at this rate, the new district would soon prosper.","Some of the functional department staff regretted it, thinking if they had known these spots would be so useful, they should have asked Starry Sky Kindergarten for 300 instead.","What good were 200 spots?","That's what they thought, and that's what they tried to do.","But they were mercilessly rejected by Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The previous 200 spots were already enough for 7 classes.","They still needed to conduct normal admissions, plus some wealthy classes and special feature classes.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had built its current reputation bit by bit.","They absolutely couldn't become like Noble Kindergarten.","The functional department was convinced by Shen Wei's reasons.","However, when it came to giving out spots in the future, they would have to be even more stringent in their selection.","But even so, Starry Sky Kindergarten's spots were all taken!","A few units wanted to hold onto some, but couldn't!","Starry Sky Kindergarten was the ultimate kindergarten in the hearts of young mothers.","But in others' minds, it was just a kindergarten with a slightly bigger reputation.","However, after this episode, everyone knew that inviting Starry Sky Kindergarten to settle in was the most correct decision the new district had made.","The district leaders reciprocated by specially allocating a 10,000 square meter plot of land next door.","They gifted it to Starry Sky Kindergarten for free, as a token of gratitude."]},{"number":148,"title":"Chapter 148: Youth in Perfect Harmony","paragraphs":["These big merchants all had inside information","It wasn't until all the spots were taken that the new district began to heavily promote Starry Sky Kindergarten's impending arrival. And the building area was incredibly large!","It was already written on the promotional pages.","There were so many international luxury brand malls moving in, as well as chain membership stores, but this kindergarten was singled out and placed in the center position.","This shows how much importance the district leaders attach to it.","Other kindergartens were completely stunned.","Noble Kindergarten was especially bitter, as they had clearly been much stronger than Starry Sky Kindergarten before.","How did it come to this?","If Starry Sky Kindergarten was recruiting for common classes for ordinary people, that would be one thing.","But Noble Kindergarten had also started recruiting for common classes.","They just wanted to improve their image among the general public, but it backfired unexpectedly.","This time, the new district chose Starry Sky Kindergarten and didn't cooperate with Noble Kindergarten, which really hurt them.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten has been furious these past few days.","It all boils down to the failure of recruiting for the common classes.","And since the children have already enrolled, there's no way to dismiss them now.","Add to that the dissatisfaction of the teachers and mass resignations.","Some parents venting their frustrations online with frenzied posts, now Noble Kindergarten is facing troubles both internally and externally.","Even the reputation they've painstakingly built over many years is on the verge of collapse.","The shareholders invested another 10 million to stabilize the current situation.","Although the money helped settle things down, the principal's position within the group has suddenly declined.","Even more anxious is the dramatic female supporting character, Shen Qingqing, who wants to open a kindergarten and is already halfway through the process.","She wants to have a fair competition with Shen Wei.","This time, she's using only the best of everything.","She's also learned from Shen Wei's methods, promoting heavily through live streams.","She's already started enrollment.","She wants to defeat Shen Wei in her area of expertise.","But she didn't expect Shen Wei's second branch to be so grand.","She directly obtained a large plot of land in the new district.","It's said to be in the best location in the new district, surrounded by high-end residential areas.","If she manages to crush Shen Qingqing in one fell swoop.","Shen Qingqing is fuming, her mouth breaking out in huge blisters from anger.","But Shen Wei doesn't know about this at all.","Even if she knew, she wouldn't have time to care.","Shen Wei really doesn't lack money now, whether it's from system rewards or investment from big shots, and the kindergarten itself has started to turn a profit.","This time, with the endorsement of the new district leaders and a large plot of land,","Many people are closely watching this matter, and Shen Wei just wants to show everyone her true capabilities.","She said to Liu Chef: \"Let's recruit chefs!\"","Starry Sky Kindergarten first became popular because of its food.","Although Liu Chef and Chef Chen can both hold their own,","They're already stretched thin between the pop-up store and the kindergarten.","Now they need chefs of their caliber.","But it's very difficult to find chefs who can match their level and convince them to join.","Liu Chef said: \"I can ask around for you.\"","The chefs he would approve of are all very skilled veteran chefs.","It's difficult to get them to work regular hours.","Previously, the pop-up store only invited them to take turns at the stove, without regular shifts.","Shen Wei also understands Liu Chef's difficulties. She was just worrying about this.","Lin Rui and Qin Ye came in, both from wealthy families. Lin Rui is a proper business woman, and Qin Ye is a business prodigy!","They've joined Starry Sky Kindergarten and have done quite well on several projects.","This time, for the second branch, both of their ambitions are practically written in their eyes.","\"I have an idea,\" Qin Ye spoke first: \"Let's post a hero's invitation online!\" Recruiting chefs this way is rather old-fashioned, but it can generate a certain amount of traffic online!","Since they're going down the route of an internet-famous kindergarten.","There's no need to distance themselves from the term \"internet celebrity\".","Starry Sky Kindergarten naturally brings this kind of traffic, which others can't buy even with money, and they can use it for free.","Lin Rui's eyes showed approval. Although Qin Ye's background is special and she rarely played with him before.","But he really has skills.","Now that Qin Ye has spoken,","Lin Rui doesn't hold back either: \"How about this, let's make a show? Let them know what it means to be a rich second generation!\"","Back then, Shen Wei also started the kindergarten under the banner of being from a rich family, spending her own money.","Lin Rui is also wealthy. She has no concerns about money.","She just wants people to know where the money is being spent. Netizens' understanding is still one-sided.","Lin Rui said: \"Instead of live streaming now, why don't we do a live interactive broadcast, and then edit it into a slow-paced reality show.\"","\"I have some contacts at the TV station, we can get approval for a web series.\"","That's why they say young people think alike. As soon as Shen Wei heard this, she immediately agreed, their ideas were almost perfectly in sync!","After Shen Wei agreed, they immediately sprang into action.","Although they don't understand variety shows, they've been live streaming for nearly a year and a half.","These people have all appeared on live streams before, so they don't have any aversion to filming a reality show.","They've already gotten used to cameras over the past year and more.","It's absolutely no problem!"]},{"number":149,"title":"Chapter 149: Mr. Lu Makes People Feel Disgusted","paragraphs":["Ever since Lin Rui proposed the idea of creating a slow-paced reality show with live streaming online, many key staff members at the kindergarten became quite excited!","Other places might shy away from internet popularity, fearing loss of control and potential negative impacts on their brand.","But Starry Sky Kindergarten had always grown with the support of online traffic.","Everyone was quite familiar with the concept of live streaming.","Lin Rui had both money and capability.","Previously, her talents were somewhat wasted at Starry Sky Kindergarten, but now with the opening of the second branch, she had many ideas, wild and creative ones, which she was eager to discuss with her partners.","As it happened, Qin Ye was also a person full of ideas.","People with practical abilities often click instantly.","While everyone was still excited about the second branch of Starry Sky Kindergarten,","Lin Rui noticed her phone ringing.","When she picked it up and saw the name displayed, her expression suddenly changed.","She made a shushing gesture near her mouth.","The people present, who had just been discussing enthusiastically, gradually lowered their voices.","Finally, it became completely silent as Lin Rui pressed the answer button.","She then turned on the speakerphone.","\"Hello!\" It was a man's voice. At first, the group couldn't recognize who it was.","But they saw Lin Rui's lips curl into a mocking smile: \"What made Boss Lu think of giving me a call?\"","The people present immediately became gossipy in their expressions.","They had almost forgotten about this person.","Wasn't Boss Lu Lin Rui's former fiancé? Later, he was snatched away by Shen Qingqing.","Rumor had it that he was also planning to compete with them in the kindergarten sector.","In the past, everyone might have been a bit wary.","After all, Boss Lu had resources at his disposal.","But after working in the kindergarten business for a while, Starry Sky feared no one.","Even the high-end noble kindergartens couldn't match them in terms of popularity, traffic, and reputation now.","Let alone a kindergarten that hadn't even materialized yet.","Wasn't Lu Zheng supposed to be all lovey-dovey with Shen Qingqing? What was the purpose of this call?","Actually, Boss Lu made this call because he had heard about Starry Sky Kindergarten receiving strong support from the new district.","People in business always had more timely information.","Lu Zheng was in a state of frustration.","In the past, Lu Zheng was a golden boy, handsome and considered by many to be a top-tier boss.","He was well-liked by everyone, but ever since he got together with Shen Qingqing, he first made a critical mistake, failing to succeed in the Lu Group and being sent back by his father.","This alone was embarrassing enough.","Because Shen Qingqing always wanted to compete with Shen Wei, they had jumped on the bandwagon of several businesses.","Their previous arcade venture had already failed, and now they had placed their bets on Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Lu Zheng had returned from a business school abroad.","He was also determined to put all the skills he had learned to use.","He had even analyzed Starry Sky Kindergarten with his professional eye.","He thought Starry Sky was just lucky.","But the support given by the new district had already made him feel like he was gradually losing control.","Add to that the fact that his former fiancée Lin Rui was now with Starry Sky, and Boss Lu became even more conspicuous.","The better Starry Sky Kindergarten did, the more it seemed to prove how blind he had been!","This phone call was meant to have a chat with Lin Rui.","But before he could say anything, Lin Rui had already adopted this sarcastic attitude.","Lu Zheng's voice sounded displeased: \"Do you have to talk to me like this?\"","Lin Rui rolled her eyes dramatically in front of the Starry Sky Kindergarten employees.","She really didn't know how she had ever liked such a person.","Now it seemed he wasn't worth wasting time on: \"Do you have anything else to say? If not, I'm hanging up.\"","Boss Lu said: \"Haven't you had enough, Lin Rui? Why have things become like this between us?\"","Lin Rui didn't have time to listen to him talk. Now, ever since he had shown that self-righteous and stubborn male chauvinism behavior, even talking to him felt extremely uncomfortable.","Lin Rui said: \"You know very well why things have become like this.\"","If it had been an ordinary breakup, the two could have parted on good terms.","Lin Rui wasn't the type to hold grudges either.","However, Boss Lu chose to end things in a way that tarnished her reputation.","So he couldn't blame her for retaliating.","How dare he ask her why things had become like this, as if trying to shift all the blame onto her.","This man's lack of responsibility made even her feel disgusted.","Lu Zheng said: \"Give it up. I can accept you back. Just don't let Starry Sky Kindergarten continue operating.\"","He had been mocked by other rich second-generation heirs lately, and even his father kept giving him disappointed looks.","Last time he went to his father's hospital, he accidentally overheard that his father was planning to hand the group over to a professional company.","At that time, he would only receive some trust fund money, with no share in the vast Lu Group, which instantly crushed his spirits.","Just receiving money without any real power was simply unbearable for the proud Boss Lu.","In the past, no matter how disappointed his father was in him, he knew he was the sole heir to the Lu Group.","But now it seemed everything had changed.","Lin Rui laughed in genuine anger: \"Who do you think you are, choosing a concubine? Get lost. How come I never realized how disgusting you were before?\"","Doctor Lu, standing nearby, could hardly bear to listen anymore: \"How can your ex-boyfriend be such a person?\"","With Doctor Lu's lead, others also chimed in.","\"This kind of person seems to have no self-awareness.\"","\"He has way too high an opinion of himself.\"","\"Exactly.\"","Lu Zheng had originally wanted to reminisce with his ex-girlfriend.","But upon hearing everyone's chatter, his face changed, and he became furious, immediately hanging up the phone.","He then sent Lin Rui a message: \"Woman, how dare you.\"","She had put their conversation on speakerphone, and there seemed to be quite a few people on the other end.","Originally, this was supposed to be a private conversation, but other people had heard it. It was too much.","But as soon as this message was sent, he received a red exclamation mark. He had been blocked.","Boss Lu never imagined it would turn out like this. He was left fuming, unable to vent his anger.","\"Fine, fine, fine!\" Did they all want to make a fool of him?","His face darkened, and he slammed his fist on the table with a loud bang.","The anger in his heart grew stronger: \"Lin Rui, Starry Sky, you've done it now.\"","...","Everyone at Starry Sky saw Lin Rui hang up the phone and swiftly block all of his accounts in one go.","From the beginning, there was a hint of sympathy for her in everyone's eyes.","After spending so much time together, they truly felt that Lin Rui was a wonderful person.","She didn't have any of the superiority typical of upper-class young ladies, but was instead polite and well-mannered.","In her relationship with Lu Zheng, it was ultimately Lu Zheng who had married above his station.","The only things Lu Zheng could boast about were his education and family background.","But as it happened, Lin Rui was his equal in these two aspects as well.","She wasn't inferior to him in any way.","So it was unclear where Lu Zheng's constant air of superiority came from.","\"Don't be angry anymore!\"","Lin Rui's face was flushed red, not from embarrassment, but from anger.","\"Three-legged frogs may be hard to find, but two-legged men are everywhere,\" everyone in the room consoled her.","Lin Rui said, \"I should have blocked him long ago!\" She felt disgusted with herself again. \"By the way, where was I just now? That idiot interrupted my train of thought.\"","Everyone said, \"Making the program, focusing on authenticity.\"","\"Right, right, right, let's continue with our discussion and ignore that kind of person.\"","Lin Rui had originally wanted to do well with the second Starry Sky location. Now that she had been so disgusted by someone, she was determined to make it even better.","If Lu Zheng liked to disgust people, then let him see what it feels like to be trampled under Starry Sky's feet a few times.","Lin Rui's competitive spirit was suddenly ignited."]},{"number":150,"title":"Chapter 150: Chef's Heroic Post","paragraphs":["Starry Sky Kindergarten launched a recruitment campaign for chefs, dubbed the \"Chef Hero Challenge.\" It was to be live-streamed in its entirety.","They announced that after the event, it would be edited into a slow-paced reality show.","The successful candidates would be offered contracts to work at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","When the news broke, it caused quite a stir in the culinary world.","Many people started calling to ask for Liu Chef and Chef Chen's contact information.","These two had been quite famous in the chef community before.","To be honest, many people didn't understand why they had joined Starry Sky Kindergarten earlier.","Given their status and reputation, they could have earned more by opening their own private restaurants.","But then, when Starry Sky Kindergarten started pop-up stores, they found themselves overwhelmed.","So they invited some of their close friends to help out.","And what do you know, everyone suddenly understood why they loved working there.","It was mainly because it was so comfortable.","What do chefs cook for? People like them do it for the praise they receive for their delicious food.","At Starry Sky Kindergarten, many people praised them in person, behind their backs, and online.","It directly maximized their emotional value.","Plus, the ingredients were exceptionally good.","The children were all adorable, sweetly calling them \"uncle\" and \"auntie,\" and there was even a vegetable garden that the two chefs treated like their own child.","Playing with the kids, growing vegetables, and cooking – it was the life everyone dreamed of.","If those big-name chefs didn't have their own businesses to run, they would have loved to work at this kindergarten for a while.","After they finished helping out, they were feeling regretful, but then unexpectedly, Starry Sky Kindergarten announced this live \"Chef Hero Challenge.\"","Some of the top chefs couldn't resist calling Liu Chef to inquire about what was going on.","They also took the opportunity to congratulate him: \"Your boss is really something!\"","Before, they didn't know much about Starry Sky Kindergarten, but later they found out that Shen Wei, an outsider to the industry, had managed to dominate the kindergarten sector.","Indeed, one should never underestimate young people.","She was savvy with online strategies.","Now, this chef recruitment event...","It did catch the industry by surprise.","Liu Chef said, \"Well, we can't keep asking you guys to come help out. We need more full-time chefs.\"","When he met his old friends, he couldn't help but gush: \"You know, I've worked many jobs in my life, but working at Starry Sky Kindergarten is the most comfortable and satisfying one yet.\"","\"We've known that for a while now. Even someone with your senior apprentice brother's temperament has been able to work there for so long. It's really beyond everyone's expectations. Some people even lost bets on this.\"","Chef Chen wasn't as easy-going as Liu Chef. He was known for his great cooking but also for his strong personality.","Mentioning his senior apprentice brother, Liu Chef couldn't help but smile. His brother had been so carefree for years, but ended up finding a job and working diligently.","\"Want to get involved?\" Liu Chef couldn't help but ask his old pal.","\"Of course. Don't worry, I'll send one of my talented apprentices to compete. Alright then, you go ahead with your work. We'll catch up another time.\"","Liu Chef said, \"No, no, no. Why don't you come and be a judge?\"","The other chef was tempted: \"But if I send my apprentice to compete and also judge myself, wouldn't that be inappropriate?\"","Liu Chef replied, \"What's wrong with that? You won't be the only judge. I've sent messages to Old Xu and Old Zhang too.\"","\"Alright then!\" The other chef pretended to reluctantly agree, but his tone was clearly excited.","Some of the big names in the culinary world had agreed to come as judges.","This news sent another shock through the chef community.","Now, when chefs met, they'd ask each other, \"Are you going to participate in that competition?\"","\"Of course! It'd be a shame to miss out on this publicity.\"","In the past, there used to be cooking competitions and TV shows for chefs.","But in recent years, these had been overshadowed by talent shows and studio-based reality programs.","The niche world of chefs hadn't received much attention for a long time.","Now, even though Starry Sky Kindergarten was only doing an online show, it was still a chance to get exposure.","These days, fame is important too – even the best wine needs a bush.","Moreover, upon closer inspection, all these culinary bigwigs were going to be judges.","Getting their guidance would be invaluable.","Some people simply wanted to go to promote themselves.","If they missed this wave, who knew when the next culinary show would come along.","The live stream fans were also very excited.","\"I knew it, our kindergarten is stirring things up again.\"","\"This time, I'm begging you, can we please have a Starry Sky Kindergarten-style restaurant? My kid has been craving it for over a year, but we never managed to get a spot at the pop-up store.\"","\"I second that.\"","\"I'm a longtime fan of the live stream. Can I be selected for a taste test?\"","\"Wow, is there such a segment? I want to sign up too.\"","\"Me too, me too.\"","\"I've heard before that the food at Starry Sky Kindergarten is delicious. Every time I see the kids eating, I can't help but salivate. The color, aroma, and taste – it makes me crave it just by looking!\"","Many parents wanted to send their children to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","It was because these little ones ate so heartily.","Their own children had to be chased around to be fed.","But at Starry Sky Kindergarten, they never had any trouble with mealtimes.","Now they're making such a big fuss about recruiting chefs. That's so like Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Since it was an online show, and he had put together the team himself,","it required a lot of money.","Gu Qingyan directly brought in Gu Corporation as a sponsor.","Gu Corporation had many industries, from jewelry to real estate, stocks, finance, and manufacturing.","But this time, they splurged two hundred million on the naming rights.","Netizens all knew that Gu Qingyan liked Shen Wei and was constantly trying to impress her.","Every time Gu Qingyan was too enthusiastic,","Everyone would dig up the old live stream segment where \"Shen Wei clarifies her relationship with Gu Qingyan\" and circulate it.","Then they would receive private messages from Gu Qingyan, asking them to delete it.","The masses would be overjoyed, finding this young master from a wealthy family quite interesting.","\"Wasn't he too loud before?\"","\"Now he's eating his words, isn't he?\"","Whenever someone posted these clips, Gu Qingyan would catch them without fail.","And spending two hundred million on such a show – now that's earth-shattering true love.","Many people left comments on Gu Qingyan's account: \"Little brother Gu, why are you sponsoring this slow-paced reality show?\" They asked, knowing full well the answer.","\"Is this the power of money that rich people have?\"","\"How's the progress now?\"","Gu Qingyan couldn't resist commenting on that sponsorship post: \"Just a little money.\"","Netizens burst out laughing when they saw it.","\"Your 'little' and my 'little' probably aren't the same concept.\"","\"You're still being too modest.\"","\"I've always said, when the old man arranged your childhood betrothal back then, he wasn't choosing just anyone!\"","\"But come on, you're a diamond bachelor after all. Can't you show a bit more confidence? You're being too humble.\"","Gu Qingyan replied, \"I'm not being humble at all. She accepted my sponsorship!\" His tone revealed a hint of excitement.","This quickly went viral, pushed to the top of trending topics by amused netizens. Everyone saw this exchange.","To think there was such an adorably contradictory rich heir among the upper class.","He really was quite lovable.","Netizens: Nice.","Gu Corporation employees: Nice.","Even Gu Qingyan's parents couldn't help but comment: Nice."]},{"number":151,"title":"Chapter 151: The Young Man with Character","paragraphs":["Starry Sky Kindergarten released an open call for chefs that started a hero craze.","Just a day after the announcement, over 20,000 replies had poured in via short video platforms, and views soared past a million.","In recent years, chef-themed shows had faded from grand TV screens. The project that Shen Wei and his team had spearheaded caused a stir in the culinary world.","At first, a few individuals had been aloof, uninterested in participating.","However, once the panel of judges was announced, any lingering doubts evaporated in an instant.","Just looking at the lineup of judges was enough to elucidate the vast connections Starry Sky Kindergarten held within the chef community.","When applications opened, the form was downloaded over 200,000 times within mere hours.","In a claustrophobically tiny, pitch-black room, Jiang Xun downloaded an application form too.","Despite having it in hand, however, he hesitated.","His recent days had been exceptionally rough.","Once a handsome young man, he now sported a scruffy beard, appearing sullen and despondent.","While he was still contemplating whether to join the contest, he received a phone call.","\"Big Brother, did you see the chef competition at the Starry Sky Kindergarten? Are you going to participate?\" His Junior Brother sought his thoughts.","Jiang Xun asked, \"Did Master send you to ask me?\"","His Junior Brother faltered slightly, \"No, I wanted to ask personally! If you are participating, I won't. Who could beat you? If I participate, it will be in vain.\"","Jiang Xun responded, \"I'm still deciding.\"","His Junior Brother tried to alleviate his concerns, stating, \"I will try to convince the Master about the misunderstandings with him, so don't be too disheartened.\"","He could hear the comfort in the words of his Junior Brother, but something still felt off.","After exchanging some pleasantries, they hung up.","His current state of mind had become problematic.","Living in this lightless little room was not out of frugality, but rather out of an aversion to sunlight.","He yearned to hide away in the darkness, which felt safe.","To share more, Jiang Xun had been considered a prodigy among young chefs in the past.","Well-known masters in the industry had complimented his cooking for its natural aptitude.","There is a saying about prodigies in the culinary world. It might sound funny, but it's true.","Even with the same ingredients, same seasonings used in the same sequence, the delicate nuances and timing can't be learned merely by instruction. It requires meticulous adjustments repeatedly.","Not only was Jiang Xun talented, but he was also incredibly dedicated.","Once, he was the favored disciple of his Master.","Everyone believed that he would eventually inherit his Master's legacy.","Despite the Master having two sons and a daughter, none had any interest in the culinary world.","Often, the Master would express his sentiment that his legacy would eventually belong to Jiang Xun.","Having heard it reiterated so many times, Jiang Xun almost started believing it.","However, he didn’t expect a curveball.","The Master’s wife took a fancy to him and insisted on marrying their daughter to him.","The Master's daughter, a brash tomboy known for neglecting her studies and having questionable boyfriends, was someone Jiang Xun had long seen as a neighbor’s kid. He had no fondness for her.","For other matters, Jiang Xun might relent.","But for significant life decisions like marriage, one cannot ignore fate.","So, he respectfully declined the advances of the Master's wife.","Unexpectedly, Master's wife held a grudge against him, cursing him as an ungrateful, faithless wolf. Although the Master didn't say a word, his attitude towards him gradually cooled off.","Accusing him of being ungrateful!","In the end, they forced him to leave. That alone would have been enough.","However, they continued to tarnish his reputation online, portraying him as a soft rice man.","It was as if he had toyed with others' feelings and deceived them to obtain the recipes, only to later refuse the agreed marriage proposal.","Such actions led those unaware of the truth to curse him online. This issue was a hot topic at the time. Many people found his phone number online and even sent him excessive parcels.","Everyone was biting their teeth in hatred towards him, wishing they could punish him.","Not everyone can endure being exposed online.","During that time, he realized that his own state was very wrong.","He refused to see the sunlight, only feeling secure in the darkness. He didn't understand why they claimed he was ungrateful.","After going there, he worked diligently for three years without any rewards.","He adhered to all the old traditions and rules faithfully.","Moreover, he didn't just work for free for three years; he had already done so for five.","When Master was teaching, there was no particular favor towards him. Everyone was taught the same. However, the abilities of Jiang Xun stood out a bit more.","Involuntarily, Master paid a bit more attention to him, and that was it.","If he knew beforehand that the condition was to become his son-in-law, he would rather not learn.","Frustrated, Jiang Xun thought, could a man like him be driven to death by this affair?","But, indeed, he could be.","He had been shut in this small room for over a month.","He would always close the private message area when going online, afraid to see any related videos. He knew his state was off, but this was the only way he felt temporarily comfortable.","But while his mind was at ease, his body was not.","The cramped little dark room was too damp and cold.","He started getting a rash on his body. Probably due to many sleepless nights, his complexion didn't look good.","He wanted to open a shop.","But his capital was very limited; he would inevitably have to show his face initially.","Although the heat of the situation had just passed, some people still remembered the incident.","He didn't want to meet people, just wanted a decent job.","But his Master had some sway in the chef world.","Most big restaurants would politely reject his resume.","The smaller restaurants couldn't afford a chef like him.","When he saw an online contest, he was indeed tempted for a moment.","Moreover, among the judges was a teacher who once praised him endlessly.","All this made him feel secure.","He had already decided to go until a call from his junior brother left him instantly alert.","Perhaps the Master was also watching; he didn't want any contact with Master and his network.","He thought about leaving the city if things didn't work out.","To go elsewhere. After all, the world is vast, and he will surely find a place for himself.","But he felt a sense of injustice. Why should he become destitute simply for rejecting an arranged marriage?","Vexed and caught in a dilemma, he was truly in distress.","After spending a full two days, he finally filled out the application form and sent it in.","There would be a small written test beforehand.","He would have to go on site to confirm for the written test.","After more than a month, he was exposed to the glaring sun once again.","For an instant, he even felt disoriented.","He adjusted to the sunshine soon enough.","He then proceeded to Starry Sky Kindergarten's pop-up store.","The furniture such as tables and chairs were already present when they arrived.","Upon entering, he looked around and didn't spot anyone familiar. He then partook in a simple exam, filled mostly with multiple-choice and true or false questions!","Having learned cooking from a young age, these questions were simple for him.","Within less than 30 minutes, he submitted his exam.","Among all, he was the first to turn in his paper. Upon leaving, he saw Chef Liu.","Chef Liu was a plump figure, he probably had been with kindergarten for a long time, rendering him a benevolent and kind-hearted vibe.","Even though Jiang Xun had never interacted with him, he had heard about Chef Liu's reputation before.","As time passed, it seemed as if Chef Liu was also a part of his life.","He thought about greeting him.","However, concerning his reputation at the moment, he felt a bit downcast.","Chef Liu, with his sharp senses, noticed this immediately and said, \"You were the first to hand in the paper, not bad at all, be sure to perform well in tomorrow's competition.\"","Tomorrow there would be two rounds of elimination competitions. The first round would consist of every competitor making their signature dish, and the second round would require everyone to prepare a dish based on specific instructions.","Moreover, from tomorrow, the event would be broadcast live.","Jiang Xun wanted to express his thanks to Chef Liu.","However, he hadn't spoken with anyone in over a month.","It felt as if his ability to speak had regressed.","In the end, he left abruptly in an embarrassing situation.","Chef Liu didn't mind, he just thought that this young man had some personality."]},{"number":152,"title":"Chapter 152: The Cruel Competition System","paragraphs":["The live stream channel has already begun announcing the results. Over 10,000 people came to participate in the written test, but only about 400 passed.","Each round is an elimination process, with only 15 people ultimately being selected to sign employment contracts directly with Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The official competition starts tomorrow.","Viewers in the live stream couldn't help but comment:","\"Wow, why is this competition schedule so brutal?\"","\"I heard there are even out-of-town chefs coming to challenge the locals.\"","\"It's so professional.\"","\"I've always loved watching chef competition shows. I watched that chef battle show from when I was a kid several times. I'm definitely following this one.\"","\"I wish I could go taste the food.\"","As people were chattering away online, Shen Wei suddenly appeared on camera.","It had been a while since everyone had seen Shen Wei.","They couldn't help but feel excited.","Shen Wei's beauty was magnified infinitely on camera, giving them a sense of awe.","\"I used to think Gu Qingyan was too much of a simp, but now I realize if I had a girlfriend like that, I'd be a simp too.\"","\"That guy really lucked out.\"","\"He must regret it now, saying before that she wasn't his fiancée.\"","\"Please stop, or young Master Gu will cry himself unconscious in the bathroom again.\"","\"Ah, the folly of youth.\"","\"Just seeing Shen Wei makes me go 'sha sha' (infatuated sounds). She's going to be my wife from now on.\"","\"Hey, you stole all my lines!\"","Shen Wei suddenly appeared on the live stream to announce some good news: \"I've noticed that many of our viewers in the live stream want to come and taste the food.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, the comment section became excited: \"What does that mean? Could it be what I'm thinking?\"","\"My goodness, is this a dream come true?\"","\"Shen Wei, she really... I'm crying, she's too good to her fans.\"","\"Pick me, please, I really want to eat.\"","\"I'll pay! Can I buy a seat? I'm afraid I won't be chosen, I have such bad luck.\"","Shen Wei had only said one sentence, but the comment section had already guessed most of it.","Shen Wei continued: \"You've all guessed correctly. We will select 10 people to be on-site judges, who will be able to score the dishes. And of course, they'll get to taste the food. There are 10 seats available. They will rotate daily. Just click on the upper right corner to enter the draw. The results will be announced in 10 minutes.\"","As soon as Shen Wei finished speaking, the comment section quieted down.","Many people quickly left, only to return a moment later with a large group of others.","Some people even brought four or five accounts simultaneously to increase their chances of winning.","After 10 minutes, there were 500,000 people participating in the live draw.","It seems that people are truly passionate about food. They quickly clicked to enter the draw.","The text on the big screen scrolled rapidly, quickly resulting in a: \"Sorry, you were not selected.\"","But there were a few people frantically spamming in the comments: \"I won! I won!\" Their excitement made it seem like they had passed the imperial examination rather than won a food-tasting opportunity.","Even Shen Wei was amazed at these lucky few who managed to win among hundreds of thousands. The system staff would later arrange entry passes and verification codes for the winners.","The second day marked the official start of the chef competition.","Even the live stream's topic had changed.","Previously, it was a kindergarten live stream, and their viewership was always high. Now, with the addition of the culinary theme, the live stream's traffic became even higher.","And it wasn't just organic traffic.","Lin Rui placed great importance on creating buzz online.","She bought another large wave of traffic.","The number of simultaneous online viewers exceeded 1 million.","Shen Wei had never seen such numbers before.","The system in Shen Wei's mind was blocked, but in no time at all, her prestige value points had skyrocketed by 200,000.","Shen Wei had never been this well-off in all these years, and she became excited all at once.","The host for this event was hired from the local TV station.","He was somewhat famous locally, and there was a female host paired with him.","However, this male host felt that their event was too lowbrow, so he politely declined.","With no other choice, Lin Rui found a local wedding emcee.","She was initially quite nervous about this decision.","But wedding emcees are the most experienced in hosting live events.","Their ability to react and play off each other is top-notch.","The female host was particularly sweet, and the two of them had great chemistry, making for a very entertaining duo.","The live stream reached 1 million simultaneous viewers.","It instantly topped the charts for live streams.","The host who had initially declined was secretly following this grand event.","He had only intended to take a casual look.","But when he saw the comment section praising the male host for being handsome, witty, and humorous, and the female host for being beautiful, sweet, and cute, he felt a bit uncomfortable.","He wanted to find fault, after all, he was a host from Miao Hong's TV station.","How could he be outdone by a mere wedding emcee?","With this critical mindset, he continued watching.","Soon came the introduction of the guests.","Professionals see the essence, while amateurs see the excitement.","Apart from those in the industry, many people didn't know how impressive these judges were.","But after the introductions, they discovered that many were masters who had participated in state banquets. Then there were masters who had been featured on \"A Bite of China\".","Some had even created dishes that were recognized as intangible cultural heritage in their province!","Some of their apprentices had opened restaurants that were always fully booked.","If these people were to enter culinary schools, they would all be at the professor level.","With this realization, everyone's perception of this online live stream's status suddenly elevated.","Initially, everyone was just watching for fun, not expecting it to be so professional.","Netizens laughed: \"If you do it like this, it's going to be hard for TV stations in the future.\"","\"Bring it on, I love watching shows with real talent.\"","\"Setting an example for other niche variety shows.\"","\"In the future, I see online shows dominating.\"","\"400 people cooking at the same time. I've never seen such a spectacle.\"","After the introductions, the camera panned to the 10 tasting seats.","They were all young girls.","Sitting there, waving at the camera to greet everyone.","The live stream fans erupted again: \"Are these the ones who beat us?\"","\"These people look like they can't eat much. Let me come, I can eat three buckets of rice.\"","\"How come no male comrades won a spot? Don't tell me our single guys' hand speed can't beat theirs?\"","\"We can't compare. They've honed their skills through countless online shopping festivals.\"","Many people were following this live stream.","Jiang Xun's master, Si Jing, was originally busy with other matters.","But suddenly, he heard his apprentices say: \"The senior apprentice is on the show!\"","He immediately cast the phone's program to the TV screen, wanting to see what exactly was going on."]},{"number":153,"title":"Chapter 153: Choice is Greater than Effort","paragraphs":["Si Jing's face darkened the moment he saw his apprentice on the show, and he immediately began calling his acquaintances.","However, all the bigwigs he knew were already seated at the judges' panel.","The host had just announced the start of the show. With cameras pointed at them, these people had preemptively silenced their phones.","There were 400 contestants, and this round would eliminate 1/4 of them, leaving 300.","This competition format was undeniably brutal.","Everyone was on high alert, their senses heightened to 200%.","These culinary masters had gathered here.","Surprisingly, the pop-up store had specially constructed a culinary arena.","For this event, the pop-up store, usually raking in money hand over fist, had halted its regular business to focus on this reality show.","Before arriving, they thought it was just another TV program. But faced with the live broadcast and the growing number of participants,","Combined with the frequent interactions in the comment section, they felt a sense of responsibility well up inside them.","This time, they truly intended to identify some promising talents.","The first challenge required them to prepare their signature dishes.","They had to report their ingredients in advance.","Starry Sky Kindergarten would handle all the purchasing. Now, it was time to marinate what needed marinating and prepare what needed preparing.","Many of the master chefs present were pioneers of fusion cuisine. Some opportunistic contestants aimed to recreate these signature dishes.","Others chose to make representative dishes from various regional cuisines.","Some even decided to prepare their masters' signature dishes.","Just by looking at their chosen dish, one could often guess whose apprentice they were.","The culinary world was that small; even if they hadn't met, they vaguely knew of each other.","The only outlier among them was Jiang Xun. He had chosen to prepare iron plate beef tendon.","In fact, his master's specialty was pan-seared beef.","Chefs who made a name for themselves indeed had skills, searing the beef to perfection.","The milky aroma fully released, that bite of pan-seared beef was a fond memory for many.","Anyone who had tasted it felt that other beef dishes, whether stir-fried, deep-fried, or stewed, were somewhat lacking.","Jiang Xun could recreate this pan-seared beef dish so perfectly that even his master's wife couldn't tell the difference.","The pan-seared beef had reached its pinnacle.","It was this culinary skill that had brought countless job opportunities knocking at his door.","But Jiang Xun hadn't taken any of them.","Later, after that incident,","Making pan-seared beef seemed like evidence of his betrayal of his master.","So in this culinary competition, he abandoned this dish.","Instead, he chose another dish he rarely made before: iron plate beef tendon. This was a dish he selected after learning about Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The chef judges were different from other judges; they moved around.","When the first judge discovered that Jiang Xun was making iron plate beef tendon, he cast a thoughtful glance at Liu Chef.","This dish was Liu Chef's specialty.","At one point, iron plate beef tendon was Starry Sky Kindergarten's most popular menu item.","It was said that Liu Chef had grown tired of making this dish.","But people hadn't grown tired of eating it; it always appeared on the must-eat list during every major review.","When others made it, it always seemed to lack something!","If Jiang Xun could make this dish exceptionally well, Liu Chef would surely be pleasantly surprised.","Liu Chef wasn't just a culinary world bigwig; he was also the deputy principal of Starry Sky Kindergarten. His opinion carried significant weight!","Others assumed Jiang Xun was just trying to curry favor, but in reality, it was a display of his skills.","He had his own pride.","This was the elimination round for 1/4 of the contestants, with 400 people in total. This format alone could eliminate 300 people.","Everyone else was preparing their best and most skilled dishes.","He, however, chose one he was least skilled at.","If he was eliminated, it would prove his skills were lacking, and he would have no complaints about leaving for distant lands in the future.","If he succeeded, it would mark the beginning of another glorious chapter in his life.","Countless cameras were focused on them; he had no time for melancholy reflections.","All he could do was give his best effort to this dish.","True experts reveal themselves at first glance.","Jiang Xun's handling of this dish was incredibly deft.","Everything needed to be prepared by himself. The cameramen swept past quickly, spending no more than three seconds on each person among so many.","But in those three seconds, Si Jing, watching from the screen, noticed something.","Jiang Xun was actually making iron plate beef tendon; it seemed he wanted to sever ties completely. This realization darkened Si Jing's expression.","The other disciples present, seeing their master's displeasure, didn't dare to breathe loudly.","Meanwhile, the live stream viewers were busily engaged.","Some were watching the handsome young men, others the capable young women.","Some were focusing on which dishes interested them, their eyes darting all over the place.","People who work diligently are the most charming!","Soon, the chefs were ready to start cooking their dishes.","Some were steaming, others frying, and the aromas began to burst forth almost simultaneously.","With so many people cooking at once, even the individual aromas blended together.","This chaotic mixture of smells might cause discomfort to those unfamiliar with kitchen environments.","But at that moment, an unexpected aroma suddenly wafted through the air.","The camera happened to pan across the ten online judge seats.","All ten girls simultaneously turned their heads in one direction, their eyes filled with anticipation.","The online viewers' hot comments:","\"They look like my cat waiting to be fed.\"","\"The girls are so cute, their eyes are sparkling.\"","\"I want to feed them too.\"","Some viewers began to get frustrated: \"What dish is attracting them?\"","More viewers started to feel hungry.","\"Damn, why haven't they invented cameras that can transmit smells? I suggested this to scientists ten years ago. Did they ignore my request?\"","\"Exactly, if we can't eat it, at least let us smell it!\"","Soon, everything was finished.","The camera panned over each dish; they all looked appetizing.","But when it swept over the iron plate beef tendon, both the on-site audience and online viewers erupted in excitement.","\"Iron plate beef tendon, isn't this the dish I've been dreaming of?\"","Since Liu Chef started focusing on his culinary garden, he rarely made this dish: \"I want to eat it so badly. I had it once at the pop-up store, and I can't forget it.\"","\"This person can make iron plate beef tendon? Could he be Liu Chef's apprentice?\"","The judges used chopsticks to taste each dish one by one, immediately scoring after tasting.","The process was very fast.","After they finished, the remaining dishes were brought to the online judges' table.","Everyone could choose the ones they were interested in to taste.","As it turned out, everyone unanimously chose the iron plate beef tendon.","At first bite it was crispy, then soft and tender when chewed, with a unique sweetness.","This was where Jiang Xun differed from Liu Chef.","Jiang Xun liked to use sugar to enhance flavors.","But Liu Chef preferred to use a rich stock for seasoning.","However, this slightly sweet taste made the iron plate beef tendon more appealing to younger palates.","Among the multiple dishes, the young ladies managed to finish the entire plate of iron plate beef tendon.","Seeing how much they enjoyed it, the camera gave them several close-up shots. This made the audience at home salivate uncontrollably.","\"This person will definitely advance to the next round, no doubt about it!\" viewers confidently declared.","\"His dish was completely cleared from the plate.\"","Some viewers commented sourly: \"This just shows that sometimes choice matters more than effort. If he hadn't chosen iron plate beef tendon, he might not have attracted so much attention.\"","\"That's not quite right. It's precisely because more people have tasted the iron plate beef tendon that the evaluation will be even more stringent!\"","As everyone discussed animatedly, the on-site judges announced the names of those advancing. Out of 300 people selected, Jiang Xun was indeed among them."]},{"number":154,"title":"Chapter 154: Promotion Quota","paragraphs":["After a short break, the photographers will take the eliminated contestants to record some brief clips, which will be edited into the show later. The advancing contestants will also discuss their thoughts on the other participants and the judges' evaluations of them.","The selected contestants are all from the popular group, and Jiang Xun's ability to prepare braised beef tendon on an iron plate naturally garnered everyone's attention.","In the afternoon competition, 100 out of the 300 popular contestants will be eliminated.","The judges carefully deliberated and selected 10 dishes, writing them on bamboo sticks.","The contestants will take turns drawing these dishes at random.","They must prepare the dish they draw on the spot.","This is the best way to test their basic skills and professional abilities.","It seems this round of the culinary competition was recruited online.","Most of the participants are young.","Few of them have shown truly impressive skills.","However, young people have their own unique ideas. Many of their fusion dishes were highly praised even by the fusion cuisine masters present.","Jiang Xun was also among the most discussed contestants.","When Liu Chef tasted Jiang Xun's dish, he was quite impressed.","Upon learning that Jiang Xun created the dish purely from imagination, Liu Chef became even more convinced of the young man's extraordinary talent. He definitely had some real skills.","Just then, someone called Liu Chef aside and said, \"You really don't know about Jiang Xun's background, do you?\"","Hearing this, Liu Chef's heart skipped a beat. He immediately said, \"Tell me the details!\"","His expression changed slightly because he had been quite impressed with Jiang Xun.","In their line of work, they often deal with young people, so personal character is of utmost importance.","Sensing there might be some juicy gossip, Liu Chef didn't dare to act rashly.","The chef beside him quickly explained Jiang Xun's relationship with Si Jing and carefully outlined the online buzz surrounding it.","Liu Chef rarely goes online, and with his busy schedule at the kindergarten and tending to the vegetable garden, he really doesn't have much time to browse news online.","So this was the first time he had heard about this incident.","He had never met Si Jing personally, but being in the same industry, he had heard of him.","After listening to the whole story, Liu Chef was at a loss for words: \"What kind of situation is this?\"","He had initially thought it was another case of an apprentice betraying their master. He didn't expect it was just about refusing an arranged marriage.","Marriage is a serious matter and shouldn't be taken lightly. It should depend on the compatibility between the two young people, not forced upon them.","The Qing Dynasty is long gone; there's no such thing as arranged marriages anymore.","True, Si Jing was the master, but the master-apprentice relationship nowadays is different from the old times.","To cause such a fuss just because Jiang Xun wouldn't marry his daughter – it's embarrassing for the culinary community.","Forcing Jiang Xun to leave, enduring public insults and cyberbullying – why create such unnecessary trouble?","Liu Chef didn't agree with this.","As he was about to leave, someone stopped him. \"Si Jing is a petty person. He's previously warned many people not to hire his apprentices. If you support Jiang Xun, aren't you openly challenging him?\"","\"We're all in the same circle, bound to run into each other. I've seen quite a few promising talents here today. Why not just give up on Jiang Xun?\"","Liu Chef replied, \"I can't do that kind of thing.\"","\"Maybe there's just a misunderstanding between the master and apprentice. If someone could mediate, the misunderstanding might be resolved.\"","He could see that Jiang Xun was a promising talent.","Moreover, Jiang Xun seemed straightforward, without ulterior motives.","Unlike the shifty eyes of his previous apprentices, Liu Chef truly wanted to nurture this talent.","Seeing that he couldn't persuade Liu Chef, his friend could only sigh.","But thinking about it, Liu Chef and Si Jing weren't really in the same league anymore.","Liu Chef had moved into the kindergarten sector.","Si Jing was still catering for private events.","If they didn't cross paths, there shouldn't be too many problems.","Indeed, as he got older, he too had started to dislike trouble.","In the afternoon, during the draw, the bamboo sticks were inscribed with various popular online snacks. There were spicy beef, boneless chicken feet, spicy tripe, and so on.","Jiang Xun drew duck necks.","The online audience went wild: \"I just ordered a portion. Whoever came up with these dishes must have been looking at my takeout order history!\"","\"This is great! I can immediately tell which ones are good or not. I consider myself a duck neck connoisseur.\"","Jiang Xun first braised the duck necks.","After they were cooked, he deep-fried them briefly.","The result was a crispy exterior with a slight reddish sheen.","Still not satisfied, he cut up the duck necks and stir-fried them one more time, creating a spicy stir-fried duck neck dish.","The reddish color was dotted with sesame seeds, making the online audience's mouths water.","\"With my 20 years of duck neck eating experience, I can tell these duck necks are definitely delicious.\"","\"He also added a bit of sugar. Is it sweet and sour? I've never had sweet and sour duck necks before.\"","\"It should be sweet, sour, and spicy. He sprinkled some chili powder on top. Actually, everyone can follow along and make this. His steps are quite clear.\"","\"Forget it, I'll just buy some. It's too much trouble. When is he opening a shop? I want to buy this.\"","Soon, everyone started tasting.","His spicy duck necks received the most praise. The sugar and vinegar weren't as pungent as people had imagined.","Instead, they added a very subtle umami flavor to the spicy duck necks.","It was delicious, and the meat texture was like air-dried duck neck. The meat came off in strands, and one small section could be savored for a long time.","At the judges' table, some were eating boneless chicken feet, others spicy crispy tripe.","But most people's favorite was still the duck neck series.","They all forgot about their image. Despite being dressed up like delicate fairies, when it came to eating duck necks, they showed a 'leave no one behind' attitude.","The online audience was so tempted that they started urging for their orders: \"Why hasn't the duck neck I ordered earlier arrived yet?\"","\"I'm dying of hunger here.\"","After the second round, Jiang Xun was among the 200 people selected.","This time, Si Jing couldn't sit still anymore. He directly called someone to pass a message to Liu Chef, insisting that Jiang Xun must be eliminated."]},{"number":155,"title":"Chapter 155: The Nice Guy Chef Liu is Angry","paragraphs":["Liu Chef was known for his good temper.","When his workplace urged him to retire, it was only to avoid paying the n+1 compensation.","Out of consideration for their past relationship, he didn't pursue the matter.","Now that Liu Chef had come to Starry Sky Kindergarten, spending every day with children, his temperament had become even better and gentler.","However, upon receiving the message passed on by Si Jing, he frowned.","He went to inquire about their master-apprentice relationship from other big shots in the industry, and it was indeed as the first person had told him.","Liu Chef, who was usually good-tempered and gentle, now wore a cold expression.","Previously, he had hoped that there might be some misunderstanding between the two.","If the misunderstanding could be cleared up, everything would be fine.","But now it seemed it wasn't a misunderstanding at all.","Si Jing simply didn't want his apprentice to do well, a realization that Liu Chef couldn't understand and which also sparked a bit of anger in him.","In the past, when people joked about blacklisting, he thought that in today's inclusive society, who could really have that much power?","Now he truly felt sorry for Jiang Xun.","According to his industry peers, Jiang Xun was a mild-mannered person with excellent skills.","That's why his master and master's wife had been keen on taking him as a son-in-law.","To think that such an honest kid would be pushed to this point.","Liu Chef suddenly understood why Jiang Xun had chosen to make a dish in the competition that he wasn't skilled at, but Liu Chef excelled in.","It was probably a gesture of allegiance.","Liu Chef immediately told Shen Wei about this matter.","Shen Wei said, \"I understand. Do what you think is right.\"","Shen Wei's support gave Liu Chef the motivation he needed.","He then had someone relay a message to Si Jing, saying, \"This won't do. They will still be ranked according to their performance.\"","He flatly rejected Si Jing's unreasonable request.","When Si Jing received the message, he was furious.","Although he wasn't very close to Liu Chef, they had mutual friends in their circle.","He never thought that Liu Chef, known for being such a nice guy, would refuse his request.","It was said that he angrily smashed several bowls at home.","...","The next day, another 10 people were brought in as online judges. There were two crucial competitions: one to narrow down from 200 to 100 contestants, and another from 100 to 50.","More people watched the live stream online. Despite it being a workday, somehow over a million viewers were online simultaneously, pushing the stream to the top of the live broadcast rankings.","The on-site dishes included ice cream, braised pork trotters, duck tongues, meatballs, and stir-fried vegetables.","In the minds of top chefs, it wasn't particularly impressive to create amazing flavors with high-end ingredients.","The real skill lay in making delicious home-style dishes.","Some people specifically wanted to record the reactions of the 10 online judges.","So Shen Wei asked He Lingfeng to create a program.","They added a permanent camera position within the large live streaming frame.","Viewers could click to see the lucky fans eating on-site.","They could also choose a picture-in-picture mode.","This allowed them to watch the chefs cooking while also seeing the judges eating in a small window.","It made the online fans drool with envy.","These 10 people were eating on behalf of all the viewers.","They looked like slim young girls, but they kept eating non-stop.","Even the internet viewers were curious, wondering if girls' stomachs were bottomless pits.","They seemed to have endless capacity.","But it still made the viewers' mouths water.","Especially the braised pork trotters, eaten with a dipping sauce.","The soft and tender pig skin and tendons, with the gelatinous soup, paired with a pot of spicy oil dipping sauce. Sprinkled with sesame seeds and green onions, the rich color after dipping made everyone salivate.","This was unfair.","Even though they weren't hungry, their stomachs were protesting furiously.","As if they had suffered a great injustice.","In the live stream comment section, people said, \"I'm going to use 10 phones to enter the draw for the tasting seats. I refuse to believe I won't win.\"","\"I've never been this excited even when passing by big streamers' channels giving away phones or grand prizes. These eating spots are really hitting my weak spot.\"","Just after posting the comment, they saw that the live stream had announced another draw for 10 lucky viewers for tomorrow.","They immediately sprang into action, sharing the live stream link with their group chats.","They asked their family members to help enter the draw to increase their chances of winning.","There were no restrictions on this prize; everyone could enter.","The viewers happily waited for the results, but after a while, the number of online viewers in the live stream reached 1 million.","The number of people entering the draw surprisingly exceeded 1.2 million.","\"What are the odds?\"","\"Even buying a lottery ticket has better chances than this, right?\"","The netizens' hearts sank.","Hoping to win a chance to eat there seemed less likely than Starry Sky opening a branch restaurant in the future.","So after this suggestion was made in the live stream, everyone started to enthusiastically respond.","When the results were announced, most people were indeed lamenting that they hadn't won.","After all, Starry Sky was known for pampering its fans.","As long as enough people voiced their opinions, there was bound to be a response.","As a result, the comment suggesting opening a branch restaurant received over 500,000 likes.","It firmly secured the top spot on the hot comments list."]},{"number":156,"title":"Chapter 156: New Advertiser Seats","paragraphs":["The culinary recruitment program was sponsored by Gu Corporation.","At the time, Gu Qingyan's love-struck behavior even trended on social media.","People were used to seeing love-struck girls, but a love-struck boy was a first.","Netizens found him both pitiable and endearing.","With such high online popularity, clips of the show were constantly being edited and posted online.","Some even had commentary added.","Public accounts reposted them, causing the popularity to soar.","A small online variety show that hadn't even officially launched, and was only being live-streamed, suddenly became a hit.","Within two days, Gu Corporation's stock heat increased by 2%.","This title sponsorship was truly worth it.","Even the Gu family parents' friends were telling them how clever their son's move was.","It was all part of their plan. Young people really know how to leverage the internet.","The Gu family parents smiled mysteriously without saying a word.","Only the couple knew that their son wasn't actually that calculating. He had simply fallen in love for real.","The Gu Family Older Brother approached his parents and said, \"I have some important business partners who'd like to go and eat there. Could they go as food tasters?\"","This business deal was quite important to them.","Otherwise, he wouldn't have asked his parents for this favor.","After all, as the title sponsor, surely they could enjoy some small perks.","The Gu family parents' eyes widened as they looked at each other, wondering why they hadn't thought of this before.","They immediately said, \"Good idea, son.\"","The Gu Family Older Brother didn't understand what they meant, but he saw his parents contacting Shen Wei to arrange a visit.","Well, well, it seemed they had inadvertently given them an idea.","Shen Wei quickly agreed and thoughtfully asked if they wanted to appear on the live stream.","Usually, entrepreneurs prefer to keep a low profile and avoid public exposure.","Especially now, with such high popularity.","But the Gu family parents weren't ordinary people.","When they heard they could be on a live stream watched by over a million people, they happily agreed.","The next day, netizens discovered that there were special seats for some diners.","They were outraged: \"What's this? People using connections to get in? That's too much!\"","\"If they can do it, why can't I?\"","Just as everyone was angrily expressing their discontent, they suddenly noticed there was a placard on that table.","After zooming in frantically with two fingers, they deflated. No comparison - these were the big sponsors.","The ones who had splashed out 200 million.","The netizens who had just been righteously indignant and protesting suddenly said, \"I guess I didn't want to eat there that badly after all.\"","\"I can just have some instant noodles.\"","\"Actually, my fried rice isn't bad.\"","Some Gu Corporation employees recognized their bosses: \"That's our chairman and his wife. I've only seen them once from afar at the annual company party. I can't believe they came to the live stream. They must be helping our young master chase his wife.\"","\"Big brother above, how did you see that? They clearly just wanted to eat there themselves.\"","\"If even big shots at this level are enjoying the food so much, it must be really good.\"","\"These rich people, what good food haven't they tried before?\"","\"If even they think it's good, how delicious must it be?\"","\"Can't compare. If it was 10,000 yuan sponsorship, I might grit my teeth and consider it. But 200 million? I'd have better luck dreaming about it.\"","The playful comments left by netizens were picked up by public accounts, instantly boosting the popularity again.","At the same time, many business tycoons called Shen Wei, requesting sponsorship opportunities. Preferably with two food taster seats thrown in.","Now that popularity had surged, they couldn't let Gu Corporation monopolize all the traffic. They had products too and could do some ad placements. More importantly, they wanted those two tasting spots.","Their advertising departments had been watching for days, drooling with envy.","How could Shen Wei refuse when people were offering money?","So 20 new seats were added.","Their entire program budget suddenly increased to 2 billion yuan.","This was more than enough to produce not just an online variety show, but even a studio-based one.","Lin Rui was overjoyed.","She never imagined they'd be so well-funded.","She even went to Shen Wei and said happily, \"I was thinking earlier, if we ran short on money, I'd ask my dad to sponsor us a bit!\"","After all, she came from a wealthy family. They would surely support her business venture.","But before she even had to use this trump card, people were already lining up to throw money at them.","These wealthy people's resources were all about connections. If you wanted them to invest, you couldn't skimp on the flattery.","Shen Wei said, \"We just need to do a good job. People will see it. Sincerity is the ultimate killer move.\"","\"That makes sense!\"","Shen Wei glanced around and asked, \"Where's Qin Ye?\"","Qin Ye and Lin Rui were the main drivers behind this project.","Now, even Shen Wei rarely saw these two.","Every day, no one knew what they were busy with.","Lin Rui was now mainly responsible for various offline matters.","Lin Rui said, \"Qin Ye went to find various master chefs around the country!\"","He wanted to invite them for challenge matches, to make things more exciting.","With popularity so high now, this would be a win-win situation.","Many of the master chefs weren't local.","To persuade them, he had to visit in person.","Fortunately, Chef Chen and Liu Chef were veterans in the culinary world.","They could make introductions.","Even if they didn't know someone personally, their friends would.","At the very least, meeting with Qin Ye shouldn't be a problem.","As for whether they could reach an agreement, that would depend on his own abilities.","Shen Wei nodded, \"Mm.\"","The two were chatting in the conference room, where a large screen was projecting what was happening in front.","Suddenly, they saw a little girl run into the frame.","Lin Rui and Shen Wei exclaimed simultaneously, \"NiuNiu?\"","Today, Starry Sky Kindergarten was closed, so all the children were at home.","Plus, this was a pop-up store, children wouldn't normally come here.","Seeing a child enter, both women felt their hearts jump.","Because NiuNiu had run into the cooking area.","With oil and hot pans, it was very dangerous.","Ignoring the live stream for now, Shen Wei immediately ran over, intending to bring the child back.","The netizens watching the live stream didn't know what was happening. They just saw an adorable little baby enter the frame.","\"Wow, how did NiuNiu get there?\"","\"It's dangerous over there!\"","Some people were aware of the danger, but most were just happily amused.","They thought it was some kind of Easter egg arranged by the live stream.","Then everyone witnessed a heart-stopping moment.","The child almost touched a pot of soup on the ground.","That pot had just been brought to a boil.","If the hot soup inside were to spill, it would be no laughing matter.","All the onlookers felt their hearts skip a beat.","When Shen Wei approached, her face had turned pale, but someone quick-witted had already scooped NiuNiu into their arms.","To everyone's surprise, it was Jiang Xun.","Jiang Xun had been in the back row.","When he saw NiuNiu, it was as if he reacted instinctively, immediately taking her into his arms.","NiuNiu usually loved being held.","At that moment, she hadn't realized the danger she'd just been in.","She simply thought a handsome big brother had picked her up.","Then her soft little face nestled against his neck.","Her warm breath tickled his jawline.","When Shen Wei came over, her face was still pale. She reached out, and NiuNiu naturally transferred to Shen Wei's arms.","The children at the kindergarten all adored Shen Wei.","Even Liu Chef, sitting at the judges' table, was stunned.","He immediately stood up and exclaimed, \"How did you get here?!\"","NiuNiu said, \"This morning, I secretly got in the car with Grandpa and came here!\"","Later, when Grandpa got out of the car, he didn't notice her. She stayed in the car for a while, got bored, and then got out.","She had only walked towards the bustling area, nearly causing this disaster. Liu Chef felt his heart clench with fear.","He immediately scolded her sternly, \"You little rascal, I told you to stay at home obediently. Why didn't you listen?\"","Liu Chef rarely showed such a severe expression. NiuNiu, who had been smiling cheerfully, was suddenly scolded by her dear grandfather. Tears immediately welled up in her eyes.","She looked pitifully at Liu Chef and Shen Wei.","As if filled with endless grievance.","Shen Wei usually couldn't resist when children cried or threw tantrums.","But this time, she steeled her heart and didn't comfort her.","It had been far too dangerous earlier. If Jiang Xun hadn't intervened, NiuNiu would certainly have been in danger.","Finally, the little one burst into tears, burying her face in Shen Wei's embrace, looking utterly heartbroken, as if she had been terribly wronged.","When NiuNiu's temper flared up, she insisted on finding the handsome big brother, referring to Jiang Xun who had just saved her.","Shen Wei had to patiently coax her, \"The handsome big brother is in a competition. He'll come to see you later, okay?\"","NiuNiu reluctantly nodded.","Shen Wei had initially wanted to keep a stern face and explain the gravity of the situation to the child, but hearing NiuNiu cry for the handsome big brother even through her tears...","She really couldn't help it.","Indeed, NiuNiu's character as a little flirt remained unshaken."]},{"number":157,"title":"Chapter 157: Niu Niu's Scare","paragraphs":["That previous scene was absolutely thrilling.","The live streaming room was so scared that there were moments when the bullet screen was frozen.","\"Why would NiuNiu run here?\"","\"Thankfully Jiang Xun appeared and lifted NiuNiu, otherwise the consequences would've been unthinkable.\"","\"I have a neighbor's child who fell into a hot water basin because no one was watching her. She suffered 30% burns all over her body and it was very painful.\"","\"Thank you, Jiang Xun.\"","Many in the live broadcasting room have followed the Starry Sky Kindergarten's live broadcasts before and many really like little beauty like NiuNiu.","In addition, NiuNiu has a sweet mouth, many fans in the live broadcast room are her mom fans.","That scene just now really frightened quite a few people.","Shen Wei and the host immediately came over to apologize, promising to look after the child better next time.","This appeased some of the situation.","However, many people began to fawn over Jiang Xun's looks.","Jiang Xun has a look that mothers-in-law would love.","\"He's not an instant handsome guy, but his good looks are enduring.\"","\"It turns out that when men are caring, it really does add to their attractiveness!\"","\"At first, I thought he was just average. Starry Sky spoiled us too much, all kinds of security teams. All of them are tall people over 1 meter 80.\"","\"When I saw his action of rescuing NiuNiu just now, I was really crying. Now no matter how I look at him, he is handsome.\"","\"Since nobody has discovered his charms, then I will not be polite. Regard him as my new husband.\"","\"Nonsense, he is clearly my husband.\"","\"I can't even imagine how loving he would be if he had a child.\"","The discussion online suddenly went off course, the scales got bigger and bigger.","These are definitely old fans who often follow the live broadcasts, even scaring the new fans. In broad daylight, what is going on.","Chef Liu didn't return to his judge seat immediately, he held NiuNiu and said to her, \"Apologize to brother.\"","\"Sorry brother!\" NiuNiu said in a milky voice, extending her little hand for a hug.","Jiang Xun had been having a hard time recently, there was always a sense of depressive air about him.","He didn't expect that a child would want to get close to him willingly.","So he held the child in his arms quite stiffly.","His body was too straight, and it was uncomfortable for the child.","But NiuNiu was gracious, even proactively pressing her little face against his chest.","The soft and fluffy little girl, truly adorable.","Chef Liu also repeatedly said, \"Thank you, thank you so much!\"","It was his precious granddaughter, he was still not over the shock of what just happened.","Jiang Xun said, \"There's no need to thank me, anyone who saw it wouldn't just stand by and watch. I have to go back.\"","He still had a competition on his end, he couldn't delay too long.","Besides, Chef Liu's other identity was a judge, that was a bit sensitive.","NiuNiu was still reluctant, saying, \"I want more hugs!\"","She was pulled back forcefully by Chef Liu.","The little one was originally resisting, but one glance from Chef Liu made her quiet.","She knew she had caused trouble.","So she stayed, looking a little sulky.","Jiang Xun was praised in the live room as if he was a blooming flower.","Many people accompanied the thrilling scene of him rescuing a person with music and posted it.","He was quickly recognized, he was the one who was synonymous with a jerk some time ago.","Some people then started being sarcastic, \"Could it be a publicity stunt?\"","\"Using a child for publicity, there are no limits to what they'll do.\"","\"Just think, would anyone so heartless as to use their own mentor as a stepping-stone, ever be this kindhearted? I find it hard to believe.\"","The fans in the live chat grew irate. \"What's wrong with saving someone now?\" They retorted.","\"Everything is tainted for those with hearts as black as soot!\"","\"Who would use NiuNiu's life as a gamble in their game?\"","A person responded, \"You naysayers must be jobless, your whole day consists of peeping and prying into others' lives.\"","\"Well, I don't care what you say. I believe in what my eyes have shown me. He did save that person.\"","The online community was ablaze with debate.","Those detractors had thought that making Jiang Xun's deeds public would bring him a catastrophe.","However, netizens, having witnessed several workplace reversals, were no longer easily fooled.","\"The Qing Dynasty has long been over, yet you still use the mentor-disciple code to constrain others.\"","\"Children have the purest vision. If a child decides that he is a good person, then he must indeed have a kind heart.\"","The detractors, outnumbered, left in a huff.","Only then did the quarrel cease.","The fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten had survived through similar challenges.","The so-called victory over netizens no longer excited them.","This conflict soon ended as Chef Liu left first.","He had been upset since the mishap occurred with NiuNiu.","Only when he returned and saw NiuNiu playing alone with blocks in the classroom did he breathe a sigh of relief.","He was ready to scold her, but then NiuNiu's mother rushed in.","Chef Liu’s daughter-in-law had a fiery temper.","They lived in a different district of the city, and most of the time the child was under the care of Chef Liu and his wife.","Regardless, a child’s concern weighs heavy on a mother’s heart, and she visited two or three times a week.","NiuNiu's mother even set the live streaming room as a special follow, she could not resist watching it every time a broadcast began.","Mothers are always finding new ways to understand their children.","The day was meant for NiuNiu's mother to pick up NiuNiu to take her home.","She left early and arrived at her mother-in-law's house, only to find NiuNiu absent.","She tuned into the live-streaming channel, and saw the scene where NiuNiu almost got scalded.","In an instant, her face went pale.","She hastily drove over.","Upon finding NiuNiu, she hugged her tightly - the girl was visibly shaken.","NiuNiu was taken aback, but obediently let her mother hold her, looking at her mother with a tilted head.","After inspecting NiuNiu quickly, her mother exploded in fury and spanked NiuNiu hard.","NiuNiu, the precious gem of the family, was rarely scolded, let alone hit.","This was unprecedented.","The main point was that NiuNiu was really disobedient.","If the situation had turned for the worse, it would have been her mother's death too.","The last thing NiuNiu expected was a scolding from her mother who had travelled all the way here. She burst into tears.","A child's cry has a heart-rending tone.","It was hard to hear.","Chef Liu was filled with pain. The little gal knew who her saviour would be, so she started calling out to Chef Liu.","Chef Liu wanted to give NiuNiu a major lesson from this incident, he could not let her continue her reckless actions. Thus, he turned a deaf ear to her cries.","The reaction of being scolded by her mother and ignored by her grandfather made her wail even louder.","Her little face turned bright red, and the crying shook the house.","Chef Liu, being advanced in age, was soft-hearted when it came to children - especially his beloved granddaughter.","At this very moment, she was wiping her tears behind her back.","She hardly dared to face her daughter-in-law.","However, her daughter-in-law was still reproaching, \"Do you realise how dangerous it was just now? What did mother tell you before? If you continue like this, mother will not want you anymore.”","NiuNiu was sobbing so hard that she was quickly going hoarse.","This time, NiuNiu's mother merely intended for the child to learn a lesson.","After stopping, she still asked her, \"Do you know you were wrong?\"","NiuNiu, still crying, turned around and paid no attention to her mother.","Only when she saw her mother about to take action again, did the little one reluctantly say, \"I know.”","Only then did NiuNiu's mother hold the child back in her arms.","Then she saw Chef Liu and said, \"Dad, we are leaving first.\"","Chef Liu responded with a sound of agreement.","Seeing his precious granddaughter crying like this.","He thought to himself, when he comes back, he must buy her the most expensive doll. The child had really been terribly frightened today."]},{"number":158,"title":"Chapter 158: The Great Humanity","paragraphs":["When Shen Wei rushed over, NiuNiu's mother was carrying NiuNiu down the stairs.","Although NiuNiu was crying pitifully, she still managed to greet Shen Wei: \"Hello, Principal Sister.\"","Seeing NiuNiu in such a state made Shen Wei's heart ache. She said, \"Baby, you mustn't do this again. Next time, if you come to work with grandpa, you must tell him you're here!\"","At least there was someone watching the child; today had been far too dangerous.","NiuNiu nodded and said, \"Mommy already spanked me. I know I was wrong.\"","Shen Wei said, \"NiuNiu is a good girl. Next time, I'll give you an extra piece of cake!\"","Only then did NiuNiu happily respond with an \"Mm-hmm.\"","NiuNiu's mother said, \"I'll take the child home now!\"","She was also grateful to Shen Wei.","She had heard NiuNiu praise her kindergarten principal countless times. When children like someone, adults tend to like them too.","When Shen Wei went to find Liu Chef, she saw that he was still crying sorrowfully.","Shen Wei pretended not to notice and knocked on the door.","Liu Chef hurriedly wiped away his tears, but his nose was still bright red.","He was getting old, and now he couldn't bear to see his granddaughter cry. Back when he was raising his son, he hadn't hesitated to use the belt on them. It's true what they say about grandparents being closer to their grandchildren than to their own children.","Seeing Shen Wei, Liu Chef perked up and said, \"What's the matter?\"","Shen Wei said, \"I've just been in touch with the best construction company in the city. The blueprints for the branch school are already done. Our Starry Sky Kindergarten will have three floors in total. We've also planned a small vegetable garden for you!\"","The outdoor playground also needed to be planned in advance.","Then Shen Wei pulled up the blueprints on her phone to show him, asking if there was anything that needed to be changed.","For this Starry Sky Kindergarten, the government department had directly contacted the best construction company in the industry.","Without connections from higher-ups, it would have been impossible to find such an impressive company to build Shen Wei's kindergarten.","Liu Chef took a look and thought it was excellent: \"The efficiency is quite impressive!\"","It hadn't been long since they acquired the land, and the chef competition here hadn't even finished yet.","But the construction blueprints were already done. No wonder these companies make money; their execution ability was impressive.","Even he had to admire it.","Shen Wei asked, \"Is there anything else you need to add on your end?\"","Everyone else had already reviewed it; Liu Chef was the last one.","Liu Chef said, \"No, that's fine. Oh, just make sure the kitchen is a bit larger!\"","Shen Wei said, \"Don't worry, we've already planned for that!\"","Then she brought out the kitchen blueprints.","They had planned for three cafeterias in total.","Liu Chef asked, \"How much is this going to cost?\" The design plans for the renovation looked very good.","Shen Wei said one hundred million yuan.","All the money she had added up to exactly one hundred million yuan.","After building this, she would be out of money again. However, her financial strength still shocked the banks and the people in the new district. They had seen plenty of rich people these days.","But they had never seen someone who could directly produce one hundred million yuan without needing a loan.","Shen Wei's cash flow was very stable. The money from those idle positions was just sitting there, so she put it all into this.","It gave all the upper-class society a little shock.","Now they didn't dare to call themselves rich anymore. They did have more assets, but when it came to cash, they were strapped.","Shen Wei had more plans. She said, \"I want to build a large restaurant on the adjacent area given by the government.\" There had been quite a lot of online calls for it.","These were all things she needed to discuss with Liu Chef.","Liu Chef said, \"If we're going to open such a big restaurant, we'll need to hire quite a few people.\"","Liu Chef had originally thought they only needed staff for the second Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He hadn't expected they would also open a Tongyuan Restaurant here. Shen Wei said, \"So if we find any good talent now, we can bring them on board.\"","This was also the purpose of holding the chef competition.","If they only needed three to five people, there would be no need for such a grand event.","Since they were doing this, it meant they wanted as many people as possible.","Liu Chef expressed his understanding, then said, \"I think Jiang Xun is quite promising!\"","Although the competition wasn't over yet, Liu Chef was already planning to recruit this young man.","Not only did Jiang Xun have solid fundamentals, but he had also had a falling out with his master. Liu Chef couldn't stand this kind of bullying.","Plus, he was his granddaughter's savior.","With all these factors combined,","He was already one of Liu Chef's key talents to cultivate.","Shen Wei had no objections to this.","Liu Chef mentioned this and also said, \"Do you remember a pastry chef named Gao Qian? Her pineapple cakes are sweet but not greasy, very delicious.\"","Every time Gao Qian participated in the competition, she presented desserts.","Including things like croissants, tiramisu, and pineapple cakes.","She was versed in both Chinese and Western desserts.","Looking at her resume, she was genuinely self-taught.","After growing up, she specifically went to a university for Chinese pastry.","Her pastry skills had already surpassed Liu Chef's.","Since they wanted to open a big restaurant, a pastry chef was indispensable.","So she was also put on the list of potential hires.","Especially her pineapple cakes, which had a taste reminiscent of a century-old shop.","Particularly the filling, which had a very granular texture.","For these traditional pastries, some people now try to innovate by adding things like cheese or glutinous rice to create a stringy texture.","But that tends to make them too rich and greasy.","Gao Qian's version had a crispy outer layer with a rich milk fragrance, and large chunks of fruit inside that were absolutely delightful.","Liu Chef joked, \"Everyone can spot good talent. If I hadn't given my old friends a heads up in advance, those other judges would have snatched them up!\"","They all had various restaurants under their management.","Liu Chef thought that although the competition wasn't over, they needed to ask about the intention to join early for the people they had decided on.","Otherwise, in the end, the chosen people might end up working for others.","Shen Wei said, \"You're more professional at this than I am. You have free rein to handle it, and I fully support you.\"","Liu Chef knew that Shen Wei supported him.","But every time he heard Shen Wei delegate authority like this, he was still deeply moved.","Fortunately, he had come to Starry Sky Kindergarten. This was the most fulfilling job he had ever had in his life.","Liu Chef said, \"Then I'll get right on it!\"","Then he took the contracts and went to ask if they had any intention of joining. His efficiency in getting things done was like that of a young person.","...","Shen Wei was thinking about starting construction as soon as possible.","Because the new district had only given her a year's time.","Now Starry Sky Kindergarten was even more popular.","So once the design draft was completed on one side, the other side needed to start work immediately.","However, Shen Wei knew nothing about this. So she couldn't help but ask Gu Qingyan about it.","As soon as Gu Qingyan heard this, he immediately patted his chest and promised, \"You can rest assured leaving this matter to me. I'll definitely oversee the whole process beautifully for you.\"","Shen Wei said, \"Thank you so much!\"","Gu Qingyan's ears grew a bit hot, and his eyes couldn't quite meet Shen Wei's: \"There's no need for thanks between us. Just watch and see.\"","Shen Wei said, \"Alright!\"","Gu Qingyan waved his hand: \"You seem quite busy with things on your end, so you should head back first.\"","Shen Wei indeed had a lot on her plate right now.","Hearing Gu Qingyan's words, she had no choice but to leave.","However, just five minutes after walking away, she suddenly realized she hadn't given Gu Qingyan the blueprints yet, so she turned back. Unexpectedly, she overheard Gu Qingyan making a phone call behind her back.","\"Brother, I want to ask how exactly do I oversee this project? What do I need to do now? Who should I contact?\"","He nervously fired off three questions in a row: \"You've got to help me with this.\"","The voice on the other end of the phone was quite loud: \"That's what you get for taking on this job without understanding it first. Now you're in a panic!\" His brother was teasing him a bit.","But the Gu Corporation did have construction-related businesses under its umbrella, so they could definitely help. Still, he couldn't resist teasing Gu Qingyan a little.","After being mocked, Gu Qingyan wasn't angry and said, \"I had no choice, I'm a man after all. A man can't say he's not up to the task.\"","Shen Wei fell silent after hearing this.","She knew Gu Qingyan was someone who cared about saving face, so she quietly left.","She didn't let Gu Qingyan know she had overheard.","She sent the blueprints to him via WeChat instead.","In her heart, though, she felt she owed Gu Qingyan an enormous favor."]},{"number":159,"title":"Chapter 159: The Dazzling Little Peacock","paragraphs":["Shen Wei went to a trendy brand store to buy a necklace for Gu Qingyan.","Boys of Gu Qingyan's age typically like luxury cars and shoes. They're also frequent visitors to trendy brand stores.","However, since he started working at Starry Sky Kindergarten, he hasn't had time to go shopping.","Shen Wei visited one of the most recommended stores among young people these days.","She immediately bought their signature piece, a men's necklace set with real diamonds.","Men's necklaces are generally simple and elegant. But this particular necklace had a main stone.","Along with countless smaller diamonds, it was incredibly dazzling.","The thick, diamond-encrusted collar cost over 2 million yuan.","This necklace had been on display as the store's prized piece for over two months. Many people liked it, but were deterred by the price tag.","When Shen Wei gave it to Gu Qingyan the next day, she simply wrapped it in a plastic bag.","Gu Qingyan's eyes sparkled: \"Is this for me?\"","He thought it might be fruit or something similar.","Shen Wei said, \"You might have to work hard for a while.\"","Gu Qingyan had already carefully inquired about the details of supervising construction from his brother.","He had even borrowed a special assistant from his brother.","Now, full of confidence, seeing Shen Wei being so polite and giving him a gift, he smiled broadly: \"It's not hard at all. I'm very happy to be able to help you.\"","Gu Qingyan was the youngest in his family. He never had much pressure to excel academically and had always been a poor student. This time, he was truly putting his heart into it.","Even his mother said that if he had shown such dedication in school, he wouldn't have worried about getting into a good university.","Indeed, motivation is the best teacher.","Shen Wei smiled and then left.","Only then did Gu Qingyan open the plastic bag.","Inside was an exquisite box. When he opened it again, he was instantly dazzled.","It was a trendy men's necklace.","This brand was one he used to buy often, and this necklace perfectly matched Gu Qingyan's aesthetic.","He truly loved it. He hadn't expected Shen Wei to read his mind so well and buy this particular piece.","Gu Qingyan felt a lump in his throat, overcome with emotion. He really wanted to go ask Shen Wei why she had given him this gift, but he didn't dare. Loving someone can make you timid.","Gu Qingyan couldn't help but take out the necklace and admire it from all angles.","The diamond cutting was indeed very beautiful, and the trendy style suited the tastes of young people today.","In fact, Shen Wei had stumbled upon Gu Qingyan's favorite brand by chance.","But it wasn't hard to guess that Gu Qingyan would like this necklace.","Because Gu Qingyan usually showed off like a little peacock. Anything shiny was irresistible to him.","After receiving this gift from Shen Wei, Gu Qingyan immediately posted a picture of the necklace in his family group chat.","He even added a note saying it was from Shen Wei.","The usually quiet family group chat exploded with this bombshell news.","\"Is this for real? You didn't buy it yourself and lie about Shen Wei giving it to you, did you?\" His sister was the most blunt.","Seeing this message, Gu Qingyan puffed up indignantly: \"What are you saying? This is called 'sincerity can pierce through metal'.\"","He hung the necklace around his neck with one hand: \"Look how well it suits me.\"","Gu Qingyan chattered on: \"I fell in love with it at first sight. I didn't expect Shen Wei and I to be so in sync.\"","He was happily showing off.","The others seemed a bit skeptical.","But they didn't want to burst his bubble, so they just gave vague responses.","Gu Qingyan felt their reaction wasn't satisfying enough.","So he sent pictures of the necklace to each of his close friends and buddies, showing off thoroughly one more time.","Finally, he posted it online.","On Weibo, he wrote: \"Thank you for your gift. I really love it.\"","Although he didn't mention who gave him the gift,","All of young Master Gu's social media posts were related to Shen Wei, so it wasn't hard to guess.","Sure enough, netizens came out in droves.","\"I used to think he was a pure love warrior. I even laughed at his lovesick behavior!\" Now, seeing this necklace, netizens were all in a tizzy.","\"Wow, could this be mutual love?\"","\"This necklace costs over 2 million yuan. I couldn't even count how many zeros there were when I passed by it before.\"","\"I can't believe someone actually bought it as a gift. The beautiful sister is not only successful in her career and good at making money, but also so generous. Oh my God, marry me instead.\"","\"From now on, Shen Wei is my husband.\"","\"So Gu Qingyan is just a little flirt.\"","At first, Gu Qingyan thought everything was normal, but as he read on, he became confused: Wait, what's going on?","Everyone had turned into sour grapes: \"Just giving gifts like that. Don't spoil him too much.\"","\"How much does a kindergarten even pay? Their regular class only costs 1,600 yuan.\"","\"I'll never call Gu Qingyan lovesick again. If someone gave me such an expensive gift, I'd be devoted too.\"","After reading all this, Gu Qingyan felt something was off. It sounded like they were implying he was after her for gifts.","He felt a bit angry and wanted to reply.","But then he remembered the last time he trended on social media, and how his close friends had all mocked him.","His account was being monitored by many public accounts that reposted his content.","After some thought, he held back. After all, time would tell who would have the last laugh.","So he focused all his attention on supervising the construction!","He initially thought that with a special assistant guiding him, the supervisory work wouldn't be too demanding.","But he soon discovered that there were many intricacies involved.","To ensure everything complied with regulations, he had to be present throughout the entire process.","Gu Qingyan was an elegant young master who had never experienced hardship before.","In just a few short days of supervising the construction, he quickly became tanned and thin.","Meanwhile, a post suddenly appeared online: \"I have a friend working in construction in the new district. He says there's a house being built to the highest standards currently available. They're investing all the money in quality! But this quality isn't visible to the naked eye. It's truly a conscientious enterprise.\"","The new district was quite buzzy at the moment.","For instance, Starry Sky Kindergarten, along with other large commercial complexes and various high-end luxury brands were set to move in.","Suddenly, more people were interested in buying property in the new district.","Hearing about this conscientious construction standard, people immediately inquired: \"Who is it?\"","\"Which property is it?\"","\"It's so hard to find a conscientious developer these days.\"","\"Brothers, didn't you read the post carefully? It clearly says it's an enterprise.\"","\"Is the original poster still here? Can you please answer the question?\"","But the original poster had dropped a bombshell and then disappeared without a trace.","The discussion among the crowd grew increasingly heated.","People started guessing one by one. Some even went to the official social media account to inquire.","Even government agencies received phone calls asking about it.","Finally, with no other option, the staff had to publicly announce on the website that the name of the enterprise was Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Suddenly, everyone had a feeling of \"So that's what it was.\"","It was as if those few words represented reassurance and quality.","No wonder so many people were flocking to Starry Sky Kindergarten."]},{"number":160,"title":"Chapter 160: Living in Hot Searches","paragraphs":["Starry Sky Kindergarten seemed to be living in the trending topics.","This time, its construction standards far exceeding market standards once again made it to the hot search.","These days, many people are willing to spend money on appearances, letting everyone see how grand and luxurious things look.","But few are willing to spend money on the inside.","For example, improving the quality of the project costs a lot and doesn't appear prestigious.","These things were exposed.","Otherwise, they wouldn't have known that Starry Sky Kindergarten could achieve this level.","Even such details were done so perfectly.","Everyone again raised the idea of going to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","After all, the second branch was now a done deal.","So people trying to secure a spot in advance by various methods became especially numerous.","The new district would receive all kinds of big clients every day.","In the end, they all hoped to get a spot at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Only parents with children of the right age know how precious these spots are.","But when the new district first started giving out spots, they were too loose.","Now all 200 spots have been given away.","Currently, even bigger clients want spots, but there are none left.","And they can't get any more from Starry Sky.","Thinking of the spots given away so casually in the past, their hearts were bleeding.","Since they couldn't get spots from him, everyone started harassing the people at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","It was said that each employee also had two spots.","So getting a spot became the most popular topic now.","Noble Kindergarten was feeling sour about it.","She had been in wealthy circles and knew what kind of status Shen Wei held among the rich.","She was just a nouveau riche, hard to compare with those old-money rich people, but she had forcefully carved out her own path.","Come to think of it, Noble Kindergarten was wealthier than Starry Sky Kindergarten.","But Noble Kindergarten had too many shareholders above.","Every large sum of money needed approval from above before it could be used.","In comparison, Starry Sky Kindergarten was Shen Wei's sole decision.","This gave them more executive power.","Now the shareholders of Noble Kindergarten were all anxious.","They could only release the pressure on the principal's head.","It made her lose hair in handfuls now.","Noble Kindergarten was already declining day by day.","If this continued, they didn't know what to do.","But the path Starry Sky took was very difficult to replicate.","Now many people were losing money trying to do it, but they couldn't find top industry professionals willing to follow them.","And now parents everywhere were comparing ordinary kindergartens with Starry Sky Kindergarten.","This invisibly brought them tremendous pressure.","After the Starry Sky Kindergarten brand became successful.","Whether it was pop-up stores or the current culinary competition, the three words \"Starry Sky\" became like a golden signboard.","As long as it was associated with these words, it became popular.","Even the principal of Noble Kindergarten felt a bit sour. It's not difficult to organize an event.","But to get so many industry insiders to respond actively, that was her ability.","It just so happened that Starry Sky Kindergarten had this ability, isn't that irritating?","...","Starry Sky Kindergarten eliminated 350 people in three days, leaving 50 people.","Those who were selected all had some foundation.","They originally wanted to show their faces here.","And see what live streaming and slow variety shows were like.","Unexpectedly, it was very professional when they arrived, with every judge being an industry bigwig.","They suddenly became nervous.","Many people participated and failed, advancing level by level.","Being able to reach the top 100 was already quite good.","Before coming, they thought they were just casually participating, but after arriving, they felt they gained a lot from this trip.","And everyone who left received a parting gift.","This they hadn't expected.","However, Starry Sky Kindergarten's parting gifts were too down-to-earth.","A bag of vegetables and a package.","They weren't convenient to open outside, so they took them home.","Only when they got home did they can't resist opening them.","Inside was a 200 yuan shopping card, a small 1.3-gram golden ruyi, and a set of high-end skincare products worth 2000 yuan.","Just looking at these gifts, you could tell who picked them.","The vegetables were specially selected by Liu Chef. Picked in the morning and delivered to their hands by noon, no more than 4 hours, very fresh.","The golden ruyi was chosen by Teacher Tang.","Although small, it had very good meaning.","And now gold is hot. After reaching a certain age, it's like they've unlocked a love for gold.","The current craftsmanship is very special, making it very eye-catching despite the low weight.","The skincare products were picked by Shen Wei.","This set of skincare products was from an international luxury brand, very well-known.","Whether for personal use or as a gift, it was very good.","As for the 200 yuan shopping card, it was from Lin Rui.","For others, nothing was as practical as this.","It could be spent like cash.","Altogether, the total value was about two to three thousand yuan.","Suddenly, the resentment from being eliminated disappeared, and they couldn't resist taking photos and posting on their social media.","Everyone already knew that Starry Sky Kindergarten was wealthy.","But every time they saw their performance, they still felt they had underestimated their financial strength.","This set of parting gifts was really attractive.","Many people wanted to have them, especially that bag of vegetables.","\"These aren't grown by Starry Sky Kindergarten, are they? They're super delicious.\"","\"I was fortunate enough to buy a cucumber potted plant from Starry Sky Kindergarten, now it's almost become a first-class protected species in our home. Those cucumbers are crisp, refreshing, and sweet, better than fruit, but everyone's craving them, mom's about to put up a wire fence.\"","\"Is the person above monitoring my house? We're growing tomatoes, and they're also delicious.\"","\"How many pounds did they give you? If you can't finish them, I can buy them for 100 yuan.\"","\"I'll offer 200.\"","Even the original poster hadn't expected that he just wanted to show off these tempting little gifts.","Unexpectedly, people were auctioning in his comments.","He replied: Not for sale, thanks.","Thinking to himself, it's just vegetables, is it necessary?","But at noon, he stir-fried some cucumber slices for himself and made a bowl of noodles.","Just while cooking, he felt the aroma was overwhelming.","When he started eating, he suddenly understood why everyone praised Starry Sky Kindergarten so much. Their vegetables were truly delicious.","The everyday dish suddenly exuded an indescribable fresh fragrance.","This hint of freshness added an incomparable flavor to the entire dish.","It was, after all, just a simple stir-fry.","Yet it unexpectedly awakened his appetite.","What would normally last for two meals was now devoured in one sitting.","After finishing, his stomach felt unfamiliarly full, but his mouth still craved more.","From then on, he treated those dishes with much more reverence.","He immediately stored the leftover food in the refrigerator.","Even a drop of moisture lost outside would be an enormous waste."]},{"number":161,"title":"Chapter 161: System Rewards Little Piglets","paragraphs":["Due to the cooking competition, the pop-up store was closed for a whole week.","When Shen Wei returned to Starry Sky Kindergarten, it had already been a week.","It happened to be when the children were arriving by school bus. Upon seeing Shen Wei, they all came up to greet her, their voices sweet: \"Hello, Principal Sister.\"","Even the kindergarten teachers smiled at Shen Wei: \"The children are so happy to see you.\" They all became bouncy and lively.","Shen Wei pinched the little ones' cheeks.","Children of this age have very delicate and smooth skin, pleasant to touch.","Seeing Shen Wei come to touch them, the little babies all lined up, their little faces waiting to be caressed by Shen Wei.","The viewers in the livestream were all enviously cooing.","\"I want to touch little babies like that too.\"","\"Wow, everyone really loves Shen Wei. My nephew never lets anyone touch his little face.\"","\"Who wouldn't like a pretty sister who smells nice and is soft?\"","\"I've been watching the cooking competition recently and it's made me so hungry. I've been eating like crazy and gained 3-4 pounds in the last few days.\"","\"It's definitely better to watch the kindergarten livestream.\"","\"My internet sons and daughters are so adorable.\"","\"This must be what it's like to be a mom without the pain.\"","\"The little babies at Starry Sky Kindergarten are really little angels.\"","The other little ones were a bit shy, just letting Shen Wei pinch their cheeks.","But NiuNiu was different. As soon as she saw Shen Wei, she zoomed into her arms and refused to come out.","So Shen Wei carried her into the kindergarten afterward.","The viewers said: \"As expected, my beauty-loving sister has skills.\"","\"NiuNiu may be young, but she's so coquettish and cute.\"","Shen Wei carried her back to the classroom. Then she saw Cheng Wen and Song Ping An.","These two little ones, one from the wealthy class and one rescued by Shen Wei, both started speaking late but could make progress together.","Moreover, according to Weng Lan, these two children had no problems with simple communication now.","The parents of these two children were frantically thanking Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Especially Cheng Wen's father, who gave 2 million yuan to the kindergarten, refusing to take no for an answer, insisting on giving it!","He felt that his child had made great progress here.","The two little ones looked at Shen Wei with bright eyes.","They had seen Shen Wei carrying NiuNiu earlier.","So their faces were full of longing, and Shen Wei picked up both babies, one in each arm.","The little ones looked up at Shen Wei and said, \"Thank you, Principal Sister!\" Their voices were very soft but pleasant to hear.","These little babies were really well-behaved.","They all crowded around Shen Wei.","Shen Wei stayed there for a full half hour, only reluctantly leaving when the kindergarten's junior class was about to start.","Lin Rui rushed back to the kindergarten and found Shen Wei in the office.","Shen Wei asked, \"What's the matter?\"","Lin Rui said, \"Our cooking competition has caught the eye of the TV station. The Cake Channel wants it. They want to broadcast our content on their channel.\"","Shen Wei was pleasantly surprised. Could such a good thing happen?","Lin Rui was quite familiar with the people at the TV station.","Actually, the TV station wasn't interested in this cooking-type variety show at first.","It was troublesome to produce and required contacting various people.","The initial preparation alone might take about a year.","But they didn't expect Starry Sky Kindergarten to make a web series so popular.","The live streaming room had over 1 million people online.","Plus, each contestant's personality traits were quite distinct. One by one, they became intrigued.","Moreover, for a web series to have so many title sponsors, even the TV station's advertising department was envious.","If this program were to be launched...","Sponsors like peanut oil, rice, and seasonings would surely throw money at it, gaining both traffic and profits.","Shen Wei said, \"I'm not an expert in this matter. What do you think?\"","Lin Rui's eyes were bright: \"We can give it a try.\"","Her friend at the TV station told her that the station director was quite optimistic about it. If it goes on air, the station can upgrade it to an S-level resource.","At that time, whether it's on TV or online, the promotion and traffic would instantly rise.","The station could only have two S-level shows a year.","They had started small, initially just wanting to make a web series.","Lin Rui was a bit proud that the TV station liked it so much.","More importantly, Starry Sky Kindergarten could expand its influence.","Seeing her say this, Shen Wei said, \"Alright.\"","Lin Rui then hurried off to handle this matter.","As for Shen Wei, having made a web series that was now being upgraded to a TV S-level variety show, the system was frantically rewarding her.","\"Rewarding Shen Wei with 5 million yuan in cash.\"","\"Rewarding space upgrade to 80 square meters.\"","\"Rewarding 100,000 pieces of meat, egg, and milk contracts.\"","\"Rewarding 20,000 points.\"","\"Rewarding two chances at the lucky spin wheel.\"","This connection with the TV station was like getting rewards for free. Shen Wei had never completed such an easy task.","Seeing her points increase for no reason was really great.","The rewarded materials were already placed in the space, though 80 square meters was getting a bit small.","Shen Wei spun the lucky wheel twice.","Soon, a golden light flashed before her eyes.","She then won 1 million yuan.","Compared to this 1 million, Shen Wei was more interested in the materials.","In this round, the system only had two options on the lucky spin wheel: one was piglets, and the other was 1 million yuan.","System products are always of high quality.","The vegetable garden at Starry Sky Kindergarten had already proven this point.","The piglets made Shen Wei even more excited.","In the first round, Shen Wei won 1 million yuan.","For the second round, Shen Wei was a bit nervous.","According to the system's quirks, if you win it, that's fine.","If you don't win and have to buy from the points store, the points cost is very high.","Shen Wei still regrets the points spent on buying soil-improving fertilizer.","If it weren't for the recent increase in network prestige points, she would still be a points pauper now.","Shen Wei was very nervous for the second round.","But she still pressed the draw button.","Then she heard grunting squeals, and three little piglets appeared before her.","Shen Wei was completely stunned.","These live animals couldn't be stored in the space, so when she won them, they appeared directly beside her.","Shen Wei's office had people coming and going, and the sudden appearance of piglets couldn't be explained, so she scooped up the little piglets, wrapped them in her clothes, and left.","For the moment, no one noticed.","Shen Wei began by placing the piglets into her car.","She then called Chef Chen.","Chef Chen had some relatives in the suburbs.","Shen Wei wanted to open a pig farm. She would cover all the costs for building the farm, as long as someone could help with the careful feeding of the pigs.","When Chef Chen heard that Shen Wei wanted to start this venture, he immediately became interested.","\"My relatives used to raise pigs at home, and they did quite well. Let me get in touch with them for you!\"","After contacting his relatives, he told Shen Wei to go there directly.","Shen Wei drove for an hour and a half, bringing the piglets to their place.","She then selected a plot of land and began registering the pig farm.","The registration process could be handled by the system.","When the local authorities learned that she was coming to invest, they were very enthusiastic.","A pig farm could bring in considerable tax revenue each year.","So they made a grand gesture and approved a large piece of land.","Shen Wei had frequent dealings with construction teams.","They were already quite familiar with each other.","Building a pig farm was a small job for them, so they could start work right away.","A total of over 5 million yuan was invested.","It would be ready for use in three months. It could accommodate technical staff for commuting or living there,","The other areas could house five hundred pigs.","The technical staff would be Chef Chen's relatives.","As soon as Chef Chen received news from his relatives, he immediately called Shen Wei: \"We can't be like my apprentice brother. This time, the pigs should be provided to the cafeteria as a priority.\"","Although it was also Shen Wei's first time raising pigs,","He had an inexplicable trust in Shen Wei. These pigs would surely be good!","Shen Wei immediately agreed, and only then did a hint of a smile appear on Chef Chen's face."]},{"number":162,"title":"Chapter 162: Foolish \"Dog\"","paragraphs":["After finishing the pig farm project, Shen Wei was left with little money.","She had previously invested all her funds in the new district kindergarten.","The loose change had been spent on buying gifts for Gu Qingyan.","Although the system had recently rewarded her with quite a bit, it was all gone after opening the pig farm.","Shen Wei looked at the bills for the kindergarten. Since the introduction of a wealthy class, the monthly revenue of the kindergarten had been skyrocketing.","Initially, this kindergarten was meant to be a welfare project. Shen Wei hadn't expected to make money from it.","But earning money was indeed quite nice.","Most of the children in the wealthy class were actually from middle-class families.","Now, as Starry Sky Kindergarten became increasingly popular,","Those middle-class families who hadn't enrolled their children before were starting to regret it.","The truly wealthy people also began frantically seeking connections and relationships to get in.","Lin Rui returned after a busy morning, wearing high heels, and sat down to drink some water.","Shen Wei really admired Lin Rui; she always dressed like a fashionable career woman.","No matter how early or late, she always appeared at various occasions with impeccable makeup.","Just this ability to maintain such a polished appearance made many people feel inadequate.","With the cooking competition handed over to the TV station, she could relax a bit.","She then sat in the chair and asked Shen Wei, \"Want to go to a bar tonight?\"","\"No, thanks.\" Shen Wei didn't like places that were too noisy.","Besides, she planned to come to the kindergarten more often recently, and it wouldn't be good for the children to smell alcohol on her.","\"How have you been lately?\" Lin Rui asked.","Although they were together every day,","They were always busy with their own affairs and rarely had such leisurely moments to sit and chat.","\"Same as usual, just a bit tight on money!\" Shen Wei rarely had times when she was short on cash. Although she didn't have many expenses now, she just wasn't used to it.","Lin Rui chuckled, \"You're really something, paying for a building in full. I've never heard of such a thing in all these years!\"","Those in wealthy circles, no matter how rich they were, would always borrow from banks.","Some wealthy families might have assets worth several billion, but often owe external debts of over 10 billion.","They could hardly be considered wealthy in that case.","Paying 100 million in full to build a kindergarten had caused quite a stir and shock in high society, which hadn't subsided even now.","Lin Rui said, \"If you're short on money, I can give you some. I'm not using it anyway.\"","Shen Wei said, \"No need!\" She still had a few hundred thousand.","It was enough, and once the pop-up store and kindergarten started operating, money would flow in steadily.","Seeing that Shen Wei wasn't just being polite, Lin Rui added, \"Make sure to let me know if you need money.\"","Then they moved on to other topics.","Neither of them noticed a slim figure at the door who had overheard their entire conversation. It was Gu Qingyan.","Gu Qingyan had been diligently supervising the work recently.","But since he had an assistant to help manage things, unlike others, he could still find moments to steal away from work!","This time, he had given himself a break, wanting to come back and see Shen Wei.","Unexpectedly, he overheard this conversation.","After a while, Lin Rui was called away by the TV station staff.","Shen Wei was left alone in her office.","Gu Qingyan knocked on the door and heard Shen Wei's pleasant voice say, \"Come in.\"","Gu Qingyan hesitated for a moment before pushing the door open.","It had only been a week since they parted,","But seeing him again, he really was different.","Previously, Gu Qingyan was like a flower nurtured in a wealthy family.","But after experiencing some hardships, his skin color had darkened slightly, making him appear even more handsome.","Indeed, when someone is good-looking, they look good no matter what.","Gu Qingyan stared at Shen Wei for a long time without speaking. Shen Wei smiled and asked, \"What's wrong? Has it been tough out there?\"","Those words nearly made Gu Qingyan's nose sting with emotion.","He had never experienced such hardship before. In his limited life experience, this was the most difficult time.","But hearing this, he gritted his teeth and endured.","However, upon seeing Shen Wei, for some reason, a bit of grievance welled up in his heart.","Shen Wei naturally knew how much he had helped with this matter.","If it were up to her alone, she might not have been able to handle it, so she looked at him with a smile and even brewed him a pot of good tea.","Gu Qingyan seemed to have something to say. Shen Wei said, \"If it's not working out, we can hire someone to do it!\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"No need, I'm doing well there, and I can learn more things.\"","After saying this, he opened his mouth but didn't continue.","Shen Wei seemed to keenly sense his concerns and asked, \"Is something wrong?\"","Gu Qingyan was silent for a moment before saying, \"I have 10 million here, plus various stocks that can all be transferred to your name. Can you help me manage them? If you need money for anything, just take it from there.\"","Shen Wei was stunned, not expecting Gu Qingyan to say this: \"Why put the money with me?\"","Gu Qingyan turned his head away and said, \"I just want to leave it with you.\"","Men usually keep a tight grip on their money.","Putting money in Shen Wei's hands could only mean one thing.","Shen Wei also sensed this and finally blushed.","A strange atmosphere lingered between the two of them.","Then Doctor Lu knocked and entered, saying the kindergarten needed to purchase a batch of new toys.","He ended up looking at the two of them with a mischievous grin.","He glanced at Shen Wei, then at Gu Qingyan.","In the end, Gu Qingyan, being more shy, couldn't bear it and fled in embarrassment.","Doctor Lu wore an expression of someone who had just gotten some juicy gossip, and then leisurely walked out.","He went back to enthusiastically tell his colleagues at the kindergarten about everything he had just witnessed.","Since coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten, he had become very gossipy.","Matters of who liked whom and such never escaped his keen eye."]},{"number":163,"title":"Chapter 163: The Love Brain is the Best Dowry for Men","paragraphs":["Gu Qingyan left with a face flushed bright red.","When people from Starry Sky Kindergarten greeted him, he pretended not to hear and quickly walked away.","Back in his own room, his heart raced even faster.","He had his very own room at Starry Sky Kindergarten!","This realization made him so happy he could almost fly.","He paced around the room several times, liking it more and more with each look.","Lying on the bed, he stared up at the ceiling, and soon began chuckling to himself.","Thinking of something, his face took on a shy expression!","When his friend called, he was still rolling around on the bed in excitement.","By the time he answered, the phone had rung several times.","His friend was exasperated: \"What have you been up to lately? Every time I invite you out for drinks you never come. Are you really that busy now?\"","Gu Qingyan had been overseeing construction work recently, so it was quite noisy there. With his phone in his jacket pocket, sometimes he couldn't respond.","He knew his friend was just calling to go drinking and clubbing. In the past, he had loved these activities, but since coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten, he suddenly felt motivated to improve himself.","He wasn't so keen on those old pastimes anymore.","So he hadn't returned some calls.","His friend had called several times and was clearly unhappy, launching into criticism as soon as the call connected.","Gu Qingyan completely ignored his friend's mood: \"I'm supervising construction work right now!\"","There was a lot of pressure with the new district. He had to oversee the construction of an entire building in just six months.","This meant coordinating various deadlines for both construction and interior design.","It was a field he had never been involved in before, and entering a new domain so abruptly required a great deal of mental energy!","His friend clearly knew why he had changed like this, after all, it had been trending on social media.","\"A man in love makes the best dowry.\"","His friend was frustrated. They had all been slacking off together before, but now one of them had turned traitor and started working hard.","It made the others look bad by comparison.","\"It's just a romance, is it really worth all this? And anyway, has there been any progress?\"","Shen Wei used to be a nobody in their social circle. Now she had quietly become a new force to be reckoned with.","Among the rich kids, there weren't many as capable as Shen Wei.","Who could understand the dramatic rise from bottom-feeder to everyone's envy?","Gu Qingyan didn't catch the sarcasm in his friend's voice.","He got excited instead: \"How did you know? Shen Wei gave me a diamond necklace worth 2 million yuan.\"","His friend was speechless.","Could this show-off just go die somewhere far away?","After a moment of silence, Gu Qingyan added, \"Oh, and she had a room specially renovated for me.\"","His friend couldn't take it anymore: \"Look at you, acting like it's such a big deal. It's just a room, is that really worth bragging about? Is your family so poor they can't give you a place to live? Come to my place, I'll give you a room too.\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"This is different. It comes with a gaming pod! Yeah, the gaming pod is also a gift from Shen Wei.\"","He knew he shouldn't brag, but he just couldn't help himself.","Gu Qingyan wanted to tell the whole world about all the nice things Shen Wei did for him.","That video where he and Shen Wei had clarified their relationship kept being dredged up and mocked.","Every time, it made him furious with embarrassment.","Especially when people talked about how he had changed his tune.","He wished he could go back in time and beat himself up.","But now, who else had this gaming pod? This 2-million-yuan necklace?","His friend was thoroughly annoyed by the boasting.","He said from the side, \"It's just a stupid gaming pod, what's so great about that!\"","Though he didn't know what a gaming pod was.","But seeing the youngest son of a billionaire family repeatedly mentioning a 2-million-yuan necklace, he assumed it couldn't be anything special.","Gu Qingyan never expected his friend to think this way. Angered, he hung up and video called him on WeChat instead.","As soon as his friend answered, his eyes widened: \"What is that?\"","The gaming pod had a sleek metal exterior, formed in one seamless piece. It looked incredibly cool.","It was also surrounded by layers of dazzling lights.","It was a bit like a high-end computer case, somewhat over-the-top.","But it hit the sweet spot of male aesthetics.","Gu Qingyan's eyes were excited: \"You've never seen one, right? This is the gaming pod Shen Wei gave me.\"","His friend, apart from drinking and clubbing, loved gaming most of all.","Seeing this high-end gaming pod, he could barely stand still: \"Where are you? I'm coming over right now.\"","At first, his friend hadn't taken it seriously, but seeing it left him in awe.","For some reason, just having this thing there gave off an air of luxury and sophistication.","Gu Qingyan said, \"Come on over.\"","To outsiders, they might think Shen Wei just got lucky, riding the wave of a booming industry.","The kindergarten business had suddenly taken off for her.","But only Gu Qingyan knew how amazing this kindergarten really was.","That sense of unity and purpose was something he'd never seen before.","The Gu Corporation was already very successful.","But even there, the middle management had different factions to balance.","It was no different from the balancing act of an ancient emperor.","The art of maneuvering was something every person in power had to learn.","Just thinking about it gave him a headache.","But at Starry Sky Kindergarten, it really felt like one big warm family.","The kindergarten had many high-level talents.","There were computer geniuses, art prodigies.","And adorable kids with great personalities who would softly call him \"big brother\" and Shen Wei \"big sister.\"","The children weren't shy at all. If they didn't want to leave, they would beg to be carried.","Who could resist that?","Even a young master from a wealthy family like him was captivated by the children's cuteness.","Working there was especially healing, and there was delicious food to eat, as well as the opportunity to do some farming.","Every time Gu Qingyan told his parents about the kindergarten, they looked envious.","If they weren't worried about causing trouble for Shen Wei, they would have paid to experience this happiness themselves.","And according to his parents, many other wealthy elites felt the same way.","If Shen Wei opened up a kind of luxury farm stay experience, it would likely take the high-end market by storm.","Gu Qingyan had only contributed a little, but he really loved it.","But oddly enough, the kindergarten seemed to exist in a different dimension from everywhere else.","No matter how well he described it, people who hadn't seen it for themselves just couldn't understand.","This time, his friend's taunting had really riled him up. He was determined to teach that person a lesson right away!","Less than half an hour after Gu Qingyan sent her location, the roaring sound of a supercar could be heard approaching.","Soon after, it came to a stop just outside the kindergarten.","The security guard, having a special forces background, would never allow outsiders to enter the kindergarten premises.","Gu Qingyan specifically went to the kindergarten entrance to greet him, explaining that they were going to play in the gaming pod for a while. Only then was the visitor allowed to enter."]},{"number":164,"title":"Chapter 164: My Friend Died from Anger","paragraphs":["It was my friend's first visit to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He looked a bit like a country bumpkin visiting a grand mansion, glancing around in wonder, marveling at everything he saw.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had dedicated aunties to clean the place.","It was kept impeccably neat and tidy, a sight that would satisfy even the most obsessive-compulsive person.","Maintaining such a high standard in such a large place was no easy feat.","But it was these little details that left everyone who entered Starry Sky Kindergarten in awe.","My friend was so overwhelmed he didn't dare speak, just followed along quietly.","Gu Qingyan led him to his room, and upon entering, even he was a bit shocked.","The entire room had a blue theme, which looked incredibly stylish.","Moreover, the whole decor had a very design-forward feel.","It was clearly the work of a renowned designer, perfectly suited for young people their age.","\"This is the room Shen Wei decorated for you.\" As soon as he said it, my friend wished he could bite his tongue.","He knew he shouldn't have opened his big mouth. Sure enough, his comment seemed to flip a switch in Gu Qingyan.","He hadn't given him an opening before, but now he was going to show off his relationship.","Now that it was mentioned, Gu Qingyan's face lit up: \"That's right, this was custom-designed by Shen Wei just for me!\"","He emphasized this point specifically.","\"Isn't it cool? The moment I walked in, I felt like this room was meant for me.\"","Having an independent room of one's own at Starry Sky Kindergarten meant that the Starry Sky Kindergarten family had truly accepted him.","My friend was speechless, then glanced at the gaming pod: \"Can I play with this?\"","That gaming pod was the real reason he came.","The real thing was even more impressive than he had imagined.","\"Of course you can, there are 20 games inside!\"","Each one was incredibly interesting. If it weren't for having actual work to do, he would have been endlessly immersed in these games.","The 3D graphics currently on the market were a bit fake-looking.","The image quality really took you out of the experience.","But here, even games like fishing and farming felt incredibly realistic.","In the shooting games he liked, every shot fired had a powerful kickback.","Your hands would feel a stinging heat, making it very lifelike.","He had never played such an engaging game before.","Especially when hit by an NPC, that moment of disorientation felt just like a life-or-death situation in the game.","It was incredibly thrilling.","These rich second-generation kids had everything. Many of them were pursuing the ultimate thrill.","Things like private jets and yachts were nothing new to them.","Some even went to extremes, with rich kids committing real-world robberies just for the thrill.","They had run out of ideas for excitement.","This game would truly captivate them deeply.","Sure enough, as soon as my friend entered, he started a round according to the instructions.","He chose the same as Gu Qingyan, both opting for shooting games.","After entering,","My friend panicked immediately.","He never imagined it would be so realistic.","Even the subtle feeling of grass brushing against your face while lying in ambush was vividly recreated.","Outside, there was a large screen showing what he was doing in the game.","Gu Qingyan watched as his silly friend stood up and jumped around.","He looked like he had just grown limbs and couldn't quite adjust to them.","Then he was spotted by an NPC, shot, and the round was over.","This idiot didn't start another round, but immediately came out of the pod, excited: \"You've been keeping this good stuff to yourself, you rascal.\"","He had never experienced anything like it; even getting shot made his heart race with excitement.","\"That was intense, this game is amazing.\"","\"You've been hiding quite a secret.\"","Gu Qingyan said, \"It's alright, this is all from Shen Wei.\"","My friend chimed in, \"Does Shen Wei need another partner? I'm available!\"","His family situation was similar, and if he could get gifts of this caliber, he'd be willing to be a backup option!","Gu Qingyan immediately raised an eyebrow: \"What did you say?\"","He wanted others to be envious, but he didn't expect to gain a competitor.","These people were too shameless, all for a game?","That's what Gu Qingyan thought, and he said as much.","But my friend exclaimed: \"You call this an ordinary game? That's going too far!\"","He had never played such an exciting game in his life.","And he had just taken a quick look.","There were 20 built-in games.","If even this shooting game was so realistic,","Wouldn't the other games be even more enticing?","\"You've been hiding such a big secret, I want to record this and show everyone!\"","Gu Qingyan said: \"You're so bad at it, getting taken down as soon as you entered. You should be embarrassed to record that. If I were you, I wouldn't dare.\"","My friend replied: \"I just wasn't mentally prepared, okay?\" Who knew the game would be so intense?","Then he said: \"No, I have to record this!\"","He then took out his phone and started taking close-up shots of the gaming pod.","His phone cost tens of thousands, and the photos came out looking very cool.","Plus, he was into photography himself.","With his photography skills, the entire gaming pod looked like something from the future.","Then he went in to play and recorded a video.","This time, he gradually got a feel for the situation.","Although he was still taken out by NPCs in 5 minutes, he played for the second time, third time... He ended up playing the entire afternoon.","It was an ultra-realistic experience.","So the fatigue he felt in the game carried over into reality.","When he came out, he had been playing for 4 hours straight, drenched in sweat as if he had just been pulled out of water.","But his eyes were still shining brightly: \"That was so much fun, I want to play more!\"","If he wasn't completely exhausted, he really could have kept playing.","He suddenly understood why Gu Qingyan, with such an amazing game, wouldn't bother going out drinking or clubbing.","Those things were utterly boring in comparison.","My friend looked at Gu Qingyan and asked: \"Can I come again tomorrow?\"","Gu Qingyan replied: \"No, I have to go supervise the construction site tomorrow!\"","This was his exclusive room, and only he had the key.","Which meant that when he was there, other colleagues at the kindergarten could use his gaming pod.","But when he wasn't there, he'd lock the door and no one could enter.","My friend said: \"I can come by myself. Just let the security guard know.\"","\"No way!\"","His friend was getting a bit frantic: \"How about this? If you let me play, I'll give you your favorite pair of sneakers.\"","Those sneakers were a limited edition, with only 500 pairs released worldwide.","Getting hold of them was incredibly difficult, and the markup was severe—the price had skyrocketed by several hundred times.","Those sneakers were revered as legendary in the sneaker community!","On ordinary days, he treated them as if they were priceless.","He had a dedicated caretaker tending to them daily.","Not a speck of dust was allowed to settle on the shoes, and they received regular maintenance.","The fact that his friend was willing to offer these sneakers proved how badly he wanted to play here.","Gu Qingyan coldly refused him: \"Shen Wei once gave me a pair of sneakers!\" He raised his chin again.","Then he brought out his own pair of sneakers to show his friend.","His friend took one look and exclaimed, \"Huh?\"","If his own collectible sneakers were considered legendary, these shoes were the stuff of myths.","His friend, who had previously thought Gu Qingyan was acting as if he'd been bewitched, now felt a pang of jealousy: \"You're just lucky you're good-looking. What did you do to deserve this?\"","Gu Qingyan replied, \"Being good-looking is enough.\""]},{"number":165,"title":"Chapter 165: Everyone Knows It","paragraphs":["As his friend was leaving, he grew increasingly irritated. Was he not handsome enough?","He was still fuming as he sat in his sports car outside.","So he edited the various clips he had recorded earlier into a video and posted it on his Moments.","Sure enough, his Moments exploded!","Others kept asking: \"Where is this?\"","\"What place is that?\"","\"Oh my god, this looks so interesting!\"","\"How much does it cost? I want to try it too!\"","Many people were asking questions, and various WeChat calls came in, but he ignored them all.","He had just been utterly crushed by Gu Qingyan, so now he wanted to use this to make others jealous.","Misery loves company, after all. Others must feel this pain too.","He drove his sports car at breakneck speed in a deserted area, which made him feel slightly better.","He decided he needed to strive alongside Gu Qingyan.","They were good friends, after all. The gap between them couldn't be too wide.","Otherwise, what if Gu Qingyan didn't want to be his friend anymore in the future?","Where would he find someone to play games with then?","With this in mind, he immediately returned to his family's company and told his father he was ready to start working.","His father was quite shocked but felt his son had finally grown up and become responsible.","So he quickly arranged a position for his son, fearing the boy's enthusiasm might be short-lived and he'd forget about it soon.","Two days passed.","He only answered Gu Qingyan's call after all this time.","Just as he was about to tell Gu Qingyan about the changes he'd made recently, Gu Qingyan blurted out: \"Did you upload that video to the internet?\"","\"What video?\" His friend was completely baffled.","Gu Qingyan grew anxious: \"The video of the gaming pod!\"","His friend breathed a sigh of relief: \"No, I just posted it on my Moments!\"","His Moments were all rich second-generation friends, only about forty people he had known since childhood. It was difficult for outsiders to penetrate his social circle.","Moreover, he had set his Moments to be visible for only three days.","Most of the time, he rarely posted anything on Moments.","That day, he had only posted because Gu Qingyan had utterly infuriated him.","Gu Qingyan said: \"Somehow it got reposted online, and now netizens are talking about it everywhere.\"","His friend felt a chill and said: \"Let me check it out first, then I'll call you back!\"","He hadn't looked into it before, so he opened his Moments.","Good grief, there were tons of likes, comments, and replies.","Many people were praising it effusively, showering it with compliments.","Lots of people wanted to know where exactly this was.","He hadn't replied to any of them, as he had been busy these past few days.","Hearing what Gu Qingyan said, his friend immediately went online to check.","One glance, and he was instantly drenched in cold sweat. It was the number one trending topic.","The comments had exploded to 20,000, posted by a public account.","\"It says rich people are all playing this now,\" the post read.","Then it showed the video he had recorded.","In it, he played for 5 minutes the first time and was killed by an NPC.","The second time he played for 10 minutes.","The third time he played for 20 minutes.","The entire gaming pod looked incredibly impressive.","Netizens went wild in the comments.","\"What's going on? Did technology advance 10 years while I wasn't paying attention?\"","\"What on earth is this thing? As long as it's not too expensive, I'll sell everything I own to buy one.\"","\"Isn't this the gaming pod from sci-fi novels? My god, it actually exists in real life? I want to try it so badly.\"","\"So rich people really do live in a different dimension from us? I've never been so envious of the wealthy before.\"","After reading all this, his friend called Gu Qingyan, his voice trembling: \"I really didn't know about this. I just posted it on my Moments!\"","Now everything was clear. Someone had taken his Moments post and shared it online.","Then a public account reposted it, and it went viral on the internet.","Gu Qingyan said: \"Forget it!\" He was also feeling quite overwhelmed now.","His friend felt so guilty he wanted to shrink into nothingness.","Gu Qingyan said it was fine and comforted his friend a bit before hanging up.","He let out a heavy sigh and returned to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Gu Qingyan was such a show-off.","Whenever Shen Wei was nice to her, she couldn't help but flaunt it on various platforms.","So when they had decorated this place initially, he had bragged about it extensively on his Weibo.","That's how people had traced it back to this Gu Qingyan.","They dug up information about Starry Sky Kindergarten, and now things had really blown up.","Gaming pods were supposed to exist only in science fiction novels.","And for a game to be this immersive, it must be extraordinary.","With it being the number one trending topic, netizens were all clamoring to play this game, catching the attention of many big names in the gaming industry.","Even the national esports team took notice, expressing their desire to come and play a round.","With such endorsements, the esports and gaming communities were all focused on this matter.","Some bigwigs even called Shen Wei's father or Shen Wei directly to introduce people.","They all said there were individuals who wanted to come and see this gaming pod.","In fact, there had been ongoing research on gaming pods in China, with several projects dedicated to it.","But progress had been extremely slow.","Many problems were difficult to overcome.","So when this gaming pod appeared, the scientific community wondered if someone else had already surpassed them in their painstaking research.","This development shook the scientific community to its core.","The esports circle wanted to play, the scientific community wanted to study it.","Even the computer science community was intrigued.","The software algorithms would also provide valuable insights.","So these three groups, which originally had little overlap, found their way here through various connections, creating a tidal wave of interest.","The online buzz also intensified.","Even fans in many livestream rooms came to Shen Wei's stream, asking her how many more pieces of black technology she was hiding. They urged her to show them, saying there shouldn't be anything that her esteemed livestream fans couldn't see.","Shen Wei had no choice but to start another livestream.","She invited many big names from the tech industry, the national esports team, and computer science experts.","She simultaneously initiated an online broadcast.","This attracted even more attention.","After all, the TV station had taken over the culinary competition event, and they still needed to make some preparations. That project was on hold for now.","Many people flooded into the kindergarten's livestream room, having heard that there was a product here that transcended the times, which piqued their interest.","Shen Wei specifically opened a new livestream room. Without any promotion, the stream gained 300,000 followers as soon as it started.","As soon as people joined, they were dazzled by the various special effects.","Many effects had sound, high-quality visuals, and even vibrations.","It seemed fine at first, but became a bit overwhelming after a while.","Shen Wei directly turned off the donation feature, and the barrage of comments flew by like a blur.","\"It's unbelievable that a kindergarten would have something like this.\"","Gu Qingyan stayed by Shen Wei's side throughout, watching her cautiously.","After all, this trouble was ultimately caused by him, so now he didn't even dare to breathe heavily.","He was afraid of causing any more problems for Shen Wei.","Shen Wei directly entered the system space with her consciousness and spent 5,000 points to customize a plausible origin for the gaming pod.","It wasn't originally necessary.","Because nobody had paid much attention to this gaming pod.","They thought it was part of some secret research.","But now that the whole internet knew about it, the gaming pod needed to have a public identity.","The system could create a backstory from scratch, eventually crafting a real character.","It cost 5,000 points, but Shen Wei felt it was worth it.","The character the system created was a small-town scientist.","He had been fascinated by science fiction novels since childhood.","He had many insights about gaming pods in particular.","After developing this device, he disappeared, with the last footage of him vanishing on a street corner.","After seeing the various materials provided by the system, Shen Wei finally felt at ease."]},{"number":166,"title":"Chapter 166: Frankenstein","paragraphs":["Many people had arrived early.","The city airport was suddenly flooded with social media influencers live streaming on their phones.","Passengers from the same flight were unaware of what was happening, thinking they might be on the same plane as a celebrity. However, upon entering, they found no one they recognized, and there were no frenzied fangirls or screaming.","People were just scrutinizing them, trying to discern their identities.","An e-sports commentator was heard saying loudly, \"That's already the fifth scientist. This event has attracted so many people.\"","Many high school seniors in the live stream chat began to worship these academic elites online.","Each of these scientists was an absolute top expert in their field.","E-sports teams and computer science bigwigs had also gathered here.","Shen Wei had publicly revealed the gaming pod, and everyone wanted to take the opportunity to experience it.","After all, this thing was truly rare and seldom seen.","By the time they arrived, there were already quite a few people here.","Shen Wei had her own live stream.","She hadn't invited any more media people in.","But twenty or thirty of these people had squeezed into Gu Qingyan's small room.","It was suddenly packed.","The live stream chat was scrolling frantically: \"The value of the people in this room is off the charts.\"","\"They're all industry top-tier celebrities.\"","Mentioning industry top-tier celebrities, the long-time fans in the live stream smiled knowingly. Shen Wei had this ability to attract the cream of the crop in the industry.","As soon as they saw the gaming pod, everyone started to examine it.","First, they looked at its appearance, then each person went up to try it out.","The game choices were all different.","But when that realistic sensation hit them, everyone felt a tingling scalp and goosebumps all over their body.","They weren't mentally prepared.","Could AI really achieve this level?","It was as if it connected directly to their nerves.","Everyone came out wide-eyed and slack-jawed.","Even the national e-sports team members were outperformed in gaming.","But when they came out, everyone described the same feeling: \"Incredible, absolutely incredible! This is a surreal product.\"","The online audience hadn't expected so many people to use the same expression, and they became even more excited.","\"Oh my god, I want to go play it so badly. I wonder how many more amazing things Starry Sky Kindergarten is hiding from us.\"","\"To think that Shen Wei gave this to Gu Qingyan, I'm so jealous.\"","\"From now on, Shen Wei is my husband. Husband isn't a gender, it's an attitude.\"","\"Hubby, just give me one gaming pod. I don't want anything else.\"","\"I can hear the gears turning in your head all the way from Jiangxi.\"","Everyone was frantically scrolling through the comments.","The national e-sports gaming team wanted to play again, but they couldn't get in line.","Even though they were all medal winners.","But the others were scientists.","If they couldn't find the screws and buttons, they would have taken it apart on the spot.","Although the e-sports team members were young, they insisted firmly that it absolutely couldn't be dismantled.","This could possibly be the only gaming pod in the country.","This technology and the games inside were too valuable for others to study.","And if it was damaged, no one could bear the loss.","They were at a standstill.","Then they asked Shen Wei, \"Where did this thing come from?\"","Suddenly, the comments in the live stream slowed down a bit.","That's right, everyone wanted to know.","Shen Wei said that someone had sent her an email before, hoping she could fund their dream.","It was a bit like angel investment, but not commercial in nature.","Everyone immediately imagined the whole story.","The method this scientific genius chose looked like a scammer's, and only a rich second-generation like Shen Wei would give money.","In the end, the scientist reciprocated by sending a gaming pod.","The two had been communicating online and had never met in person.","The scientists' eyes lit up when they heard this.","\"Can you give us that email?\"","They could use technology to find this genius.","Shen Wei agreed.","Soon after getting the email, the scientists treated it like a treasure.","They immediately activated all their networks to investigate this person.","If they could really find them, the country's technological power would advance by 10 years.","The concept of a gaming pod was first proposed in science fiction novels.","Both domestic and foreign researchers were working on it.","But this was absolutely advanced.","In the fishing game, the splash of water when a fish's tail moved and the faint fishy smell in the wind were exactly the same as reality.","It was hard to imagine what level of genius could achieve this degree of realism. They had so many questions they wanted to ask.","The other scientists began to report this.","They had already positioned this talent at a very high level.","As long as they could recruit them, they could be specially admitted to the research team. They would directly enter the research project.","They would be given treatment befitting national-level talent.","In less than a day, the police had already found some clues.","They rushed to this person's home and found many design drafts.","There were also various tools and other concepts.","Including diaries.","But in the evaluation of the surrounding neighbors, this person was actually a madman.","Their parents were divorced, and they had been living alone from an early age.","Sometimes they would work part-time at convenience stores. They rarely talked to people.","Sometimes they would talk to themselves, unlike normal people.","The police looked through over 500 hours of surveillance footage, almost frame by frame.","In the end, they only saw this person walking to an unfamiliar road section, a small place without surveillance. From then on, they simply disappeared.","The scientists' hearts sank.","They had finally found a genius of this caliber.","The trail had gone cold, and more importantly, the place where they went missing was a lake.","A bad feeling suddenly arose in their hearts.","Many people would feel that everything is perfect after achieving great satisfaction and might do something extreme.","But they would rather hope that this person had just retreated from the world.","Gone to some mysterious place to live in seclusion, rather than believe that such a young genius was no longer around.","With this lead suddenly cut off, everyone returned to Shen Wei's side.","This might be the only hyper-realistic gaming pod in the whole world.","Although they hadn't found this person.","They didn't know the specific steps of how this mechanical pod was made.","But these manuscripts would give them many inspirations and clues.","The scientists, one by one, were moved to tears: \"Hold Shen Wei's hand, thank you. You saved a young man's dream and also allowed our technology to make great strides forward.\"","They had seen the email that boy sent to Shen Wei, and it truly seemed like something a scammer would write.","Most people would have dismissed it and moved on.","A potential genius might have been lost.","But Shen Wei's response gifted them with a treasure for the ages.","Shen Wei knew the system's capabilities were vast.","However, she never imagined that even under such intense scrutiny, with the vast net of investigation cast, it could still weave such a seamless narrative.","It truly lived up to its reputation as a system ahead of its time, undeniably impressive."]},{"number":167,"title":"Chapter 167: Disguised Rich Second Generation","paragraphs":["The situation was getting bigger and bigger, especially when scientists revealed the disappearance of the game pod's original creator.","Disappointment was evident in everyone's expressions.","The game pod went viral on the internet.","Both the business world and scientific community were paying attention to this matter.","The research circle wanted to obtain more advanced technology.","Businessmen saw the enormous economic benefits.","Even netizens were eagerly anticipating.","They hoped that after mass production, the price would come down.","Ideally, it would drop to the price of an iPhone.","Achieving gaming freedom for under ten thousand yuan.","Almost the entire internet was rallying to help find the original creator.","People from all walks of life put in tremendous effort.","But in the end, they got this result.","It meant that now the only game pod was at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Its value was immeasurable.","...","Gu Qingyan's friends knew this game was incredibly impressive.","Even he, a second-generation rich kid, had never seen anything like it. But for it to become so popular, it gave them a chilling feeling.","They were all children of businessmen.","From a young age, they knew to keep a low profile in everything.","Now that Gu Qingyan had caused such a big problem, things were already out of his control.","His friend sincerely approached Gu Qingyan and Shen Wei, saying: \"I'm truly sorry.\"","He had only wanted to show off a little in his friend circle of a few dozen people.","He never imagined things would escalate to this point. Now, no matter what he said, it was too late.","Gu Qingyan was also quite angry, but seeing how miserable his friend looked, he just snorted without saying anything.","Shen Wei said from the side: \"This matter, you didn't intend for it to happen. Let's just let it go.\"","All risks come with great opportunities.","For instance, this incident, although it brought her unprecedented pressure,","And attention from all walks of life.","But because of this, the name of Starry Sky Kindergarten once again became known to the public.","Many people searched for various things Shen Wei had done before, and now her reputation was rising.","There was an unstoppable feeling.","Every day, her points surged by more than 50,000.","Shen Wei's accumulated points now reached 900,000.","The points were very useful for her, as the points mall had more black technology.","Shen Wei not holding it against him showed her magnanimity.","Gu Qingyan's friend still couldn't put his mind at ease.","He then said to Shen Wei: \"How about this? I caused this trouble, so I must make it right. I want to invest 20 million. I heard you've been helping some children here.\"","\"I'm just an ordinary rich second generation, I might not be able to help much in other ways.\"","\"To be honest, I can't do what you do, but that doesn't stop me from admiring people like you.\"","\"The money is just a token of my appreciation. Firstly, as some compensation for any harm this incident might have caused you!\"","\"Secondly, it's also an appreciation of your character. With this money, you can do more good things in the future.\"","Shen Wei refused.","Gu Qingyan awkwardly said from the side: \"Just take it then.\" He didn't feel the least bit guilty about taking this money.","It was trouble he had caused.","As his friend said, in this life, he was poor in everything except money.","So under the pretext of a donation, they directly wrote up a contract, and the money was injected into Starry Sky Kindergarten's official account.","When his friend returned home, he opened his friend circle one by one, contacting everyone, and he actually managed to find the mole among them.","His WeChat was full of friends from their circle.","Many people had chatted extensively with him.","Opening the WeChat page revealed a long string of chat history.","So he confirmed one by one who exactly had done this.","The range narrowed further, and the suspect was finally locked down to one person.","It was a female profile picture, a childhood friend.","He couldn't remember how they became friends, but they weren't close.","But this time, he learned through a friend that the girl had never even had WeChat.","She had been living abroad all along.","These were some texts that appeared on Instagram.","This person had actually disguised themselves as a girl to infiltrate his friend circle.","They relied on reposting the rich second generation's friend circle content, sharing their daily lives online, and cultivating followers.","But it wasn't very popular, with less than 10,000 followers.","He never imagined someone could be this idle.","After investigation, they even found out this person's real identity - it was a male poser.","Many people believed he was a rich person, and began to praise him frantically. He lost himself in this praise.","He showed off various things like private jets, yachts, luxurious dinners, and sometimes would imitate everyone's friend circle posts, posting similar reflections.","This impersonation of a rich second generation was very successful.","Not only could he scam food and drinks, but he could even scam girls into spending money on him.","He constantly drained money from girls under the pretext of testing them as a rich second generation.","Moreover, during his investigation, there was an unexpected discovery - he was simultaneously dating seven girls.","His friend was both angry and amused after seeing this.","These rich second generations had been repeatedly warned by their families since childhood to never cause trouble outside.","Especially not to use the family's reputation to make trouble outside.","Unexpectedly, there was a fake rich second generation who did all the things they couldn't do.","In the end, he even threw the blame onto the rich second generation group.","When he told a few friends, everyone was indignant and wanted to root out this black sheep.","The result of the investigation was shocking - this person had many people's WeChat contacts.","The thought that there was such a rat in the gutter peeping into their lives sent chills down their spines.","After blocking these people,","They contacted the victims to sue this person for fraud.","They successfully sent this fool to prison.","They also exposed this matter online.","The friend told Shen Wei and Gu Qingyan the result, and only then did he heave a sigh of relief.","Playing mind games with people was more tiring than working a whole day."]},{"number":168,"title":"Chapter 168: Unexpected Joy","paragraphs":["Shen Wei spent 5000 points in the mall to purchase the identity of a game pod designer.","The system was incredibly reliable in handling this matter.","It fabricated an entire life history from childhood to adulthood.","Moreover, this identity was set up as that of an eccentric recluse.","The character had always maintained a low profile. Only when someone inquired about them did people vaguely recall that such a person existed.","Influenced by movies and other artistic works,","It was considered normal for this scientific genius to be somewhat unconventional.","No one doubted this.","However, the small town where this game designer lived had undergone a significant transformation.","The previously unremarkable town suddenly gained attention from higher authorities.","They never expected such a technologically barren place to produce this kind of technical genius.","Suddenly, it seemed that this soil might be somewhat extraordinary.","As a result, a scientific organization launched a public welfare project, establishing a national-level science and technology museum right in the town.","With an investment of several hundred million, it aimed to cultivate the locals' initial imagination for science and technology, free of charge.","Such a high-caliber science museum was rare even in big cities.","The public welfare organization could only build one museum per year.","The site selection required careful consideration, and this construction truly commemorated the emergence of a genius.","The local government officials were overjoyed.","Such a large investment could boost local tourism and economic projects.","After all, science museums of this caliber were rare even in big cities. Nearby cities would certainly make this once unremarkable small town their top choice for bringing children during summer and winter vacations.","This meant stimulating the local economy, including hotels, food, and accommodation.","There was another point.","Initially, this scientific genius had retreated to a secluded corner.","As many of the surveillance cameras in the area were old and in disrepair, the authorities specifically allocated funds for new cameras.","They wanted one every ten steps.","All the police officers began working overtime, cracking down on security issues and various problems.","The city was small, and many people still retained the habit of using cash.","So pickpocketing and petty theft hadn't been eradicated.","For instance, right now, a thief who had just succeeded in a theft","Was apprehended by two plainclothes officers and taken to the police station.","The thief was dumbfounded.","He hadn't failed in years.","This time, he had smoothly taken money and a phone from someone's pocket.","The victim hadn't even noticed yet.","He was thinking about how he'd scored a big catch and could live it up for a few days.","He never expected to be caught the next second.","Sitting in the police car, the thief trembled.","The two officers beside him were chatting casually, \"How many cases today?\"","\"Fifteen, all apprehended.\"","The thief was completely stunned.","All the petty thieves in the area knew each other.","There were only about 20 in total, and 15 had been caught. Since when did they need to arrest thieves to boost performance?","The thief wasn't highly educated. Now that he'd been caught, he relaxed a bit.","So he couldn't help voicing his thoughts.","The officer said, \"Didn't you notice the new cameras installed recently?\"","The thief was speechless. Of course he knew, but he hadn't taken it seriously.","The other officer couldn't help but sigh, \"We're in the age of technology now. Any petty theft is exposed before the cameras.\"","\"Even if you ran to the ends of the earth, we could still catch you.\"","\"After this rehabilitation, come back and be a good person. Don't do this kind of thing again.\"","The thief remained silent. When they arrived, he was shocked. The police station wasn't big, but the interrogation area was packed with people.","Many people looked at him with a kind of numb rigidity.","Especially the first person to come in, he was even more shocked.","He had thought he was just unlucky to get caught.","As soon as he arrived, he came face to face with several familiar faces.","After a while, more and more thieves were brought in, and he was bewildered.","Later, when they pieced it together, they thought someone must have ratted them out. How else could they all be caught at once?","It wasn't until everyone mentioned the cameras that they quieted down.","The town had always had cameras, but they were just for show.","No one had taken them seriously, committing crimes right under them. Now they were in trouble, no one could escape.","\"Why? Even one camera isn't cheap, now there's one every ten steps, it's like a prison.\"","Seeing them looking at each other in confusion, their heads about to explode trying to figure it out, the police couldn't help but say, \"Don't you know about the scientific genius who appeared in town recently?\"","His final disappearance had caused a huge shock in the scientific community.","Netizens repeatedly demanded that the person be found.","Although there was a lake in front of where he was last seen, and many people guessed his life had ended there,","They needed to see the person if alive, or the body if dead. So from top to bottom, everyone was extremely tense.","Even their superiors were under great pressure, with dedicated personnel monitoring various cameras every day.","As a result, they discovered these people brazenly stealing and robbing right under the cameras.","It was practically an open challenge. The higher-ups immediately issued a stern order to arrest everyone, which led to the current situation.","Because of this scientific genius, the crime rate in the entire town had dropped significantly.","This news came as an unexpected joy for Shen Wei.","The incident had attracted an extraordinary amount of attention.","Many reporters and self-media personnel were stationed near Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Scientists suddenly became addicted to the internet, experiencing the joy of gaming every day.","Although these old scientists were advanced in years,","And were considered old-fashioned fossils in many people's minds,","They were indeed the first generation of intellectuals, quick to learn anything.","In gaming, they even outperformed the national team.","Because the national team had never played such a highly immersive game before.","Young people only had the advantage in reaction speed.","But in terms of various practical life experiences, the older generation of scientists was still superior.","They were actually evenly matched.","But since the national e-sports team was professional, they were considered to have lost in the eyes of netizens.","The live streaming room was on fire every day.","Everyone wanted to watch these two unlikely groups playing games frantically. It was stress-relieving just to watch. Even the game company took notice and specially launched several similar mini-games. But people still preferred to watch the live stream.","These games were only interesting with the addition of physical sensations.","The expressions of bewilderment on everyone's faces as they emerged from the gaming pods were priceless—meme-worthy, even. It was truly amusing.","But when the scientists came out, they all rushed to grasp Shen Wei's hands tightly, declaring, \"You are a true patriot.\"","This wasn't just because she had helped an eccentric scientist. It was also because the kindergarten was so excellently run.","From the quality of meals to the content of the lessons, with classes divided by pace and progress, there were multiple dimensions supporting the children's learning.","Undoubtedly, this planted a small seed in the hearts of these young treasures.","Children are the future, after all.","These older generation intellectuals weren't just capable in their scientific research; they also had a profound love for the next generation.","As these words were spoken, many viewers in the livestream were moved to tears.","\"I'm sobbing, truly. Kindergarten may be the smallest unit of education, but it's incredibly important.\"","\"You must keep up the great work with the kindergarten. I'm still single, but I hope that in the future, my child will have the chance to attend Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"Sisters, is it too dramatic to change cities just for a kindergarten?\"","\"I was thinking the same thing!\"","\"Doesn't anyone think they're getting a bit off track? A respectable kindergarten suddenly opening pop-up shops and vegetable gardens? And now they're trending because of gaming pods?\"","\"How can these things possibly be related to a kindergarten? It's too much of a stretch.\"","\"Have you considered the possibility that their side businesses might be doing even better than their main one?\"","The critics were left speechless. This was unprecedented—a first of its kind."]},{"number":169,"title":"Chapter 169: Street Dance Teacher Qi Yuan","paragraphs":["The Starry Sky Kindergarten was at the height of its popularity.","Shen Wei, fearing that the media would disrupt the children's classes, deliberately suspended lessons for a few days. She dedicated this time exclusively to the gaming pods.","She had thought that after a while, the hype would die down.","Who knew that the excitement would only intensify?","Someone had posted the news on an international forum, and foreigners initially thought it was a movie prop.","It wasn't until people adamantly insisted that it was real that the reactions became incredible.","People were so eager that they wanted to fly for over ten hours just to witness this technological advancement firsthand.","Shen Wei's reputation score was skyrocketing.","But Shen Wei's primary job was still at the kindergarten, so she had to notify the children to continue classes despite the increased attention.","The parents were overjoyed.","\"Our Bing Bing has been constantly asking to see the teacher.\"","\"Baby Xue too. She's been wondering why we haven't been taking her to kindergarten these past few days.\"","Usually, parents have to persuade their children to go to kindergarten.","But at Starry Sky Kindergarten, the little ones were upset when they couldn't attend for a few days.","Shen Wei's heart melted upon hearing this.","The next day, she specifically arranged for security personnel to guard the school gates, preventing others from rushing in and startling the children.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had indeed become an internet sensation, but they hadn't anticipated extreme fans. In recent days, some people had actually tried to sneak into the kindergarten.","They were caught by Shen Wei and handed over to the police.","The livestream viewers were puzzled.","They just noticed that these security guards were tall, handsome, and uniformly dressed in sunglasses.","As they escorted the little ones near the kindergarten, viewers went wild.","\"I'm actually envious of these kids.\"","\"I want a man like that, sha sha!\"","\"Hey, keep it decent up there, don't get too excited.\"","\"I seriously suspect Shen Wei is obsessed with looks. How else could all her employees be so handsome?\"","The children hopped off the school bus, bouncing around and gathering around Shen Wei: \"Principal sister, I missed you! I want a hug!\"","They swarmed her like little snowballs.","Shen Wei quickly embraced them, and the little ones even snuck in some kisses.","The livestream viewers were incredibly jealous: \"Come let auntie give you a kiss!\"","\"These babies are just too adorable.\"","\"I can't even imagine how cheerful I'd be if I were surrounded by these little ones.\"","Soon, the kindergarten teachers came out to lead their respective classes away.","The children were excited to see their teachers after several days, following them energetically.","Viewers found this scene particularly heartwarming.","Recently, Starry Sky Business had been expanding rapidly.","They now had fast-food restaurants, culinary competitions, and even a dedicated account for the gaming pods.","Long-time fans of the livestream enjoyed watching different aspects, each finding their own enjoyment.","But at this moment, seeing the adorable tots waddling like little penguins, following behind their teachers step by step.","Their sweet little voices asking for hugs and kisses.","It was simply irresistible.","\"Although I watch other livestreams too, the babies' livestream is always the most healing.\"","\"Some people criticize Starry Sky Kindergarten, but seeing so many children being enthusiastic and cheerful, it's clear how good this kindergarten is for them.\"","With this comment, the critics in the livestream were immediately exposed.","Even if they dared to speak up, they would be angrily rebuked by others.","Suddenly, they all fell silent.","The morning classes varied.","Most people loved following Class 1 of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","These were the babies they had watched grow up, and now their first lesson was a street dance class. Qi Yuan came to teach them.","Previously, Qi Yuan used to wear a mask when teaching dance.","Gradually, he stopped wearing it while teaching the little ones.","His skill level was truly impressive.","Even when teaching baby dance moves, he looked incredibly cool, and his control of the camera was the best among all the teachers.","He danced in front, with the babies following behind.","There were a few boys who danced particularly well.","So Qi Yuan arranged these good dancers in the front row.","Then he led the children through the dance steps over and over.","Qi Yuan was young, handsome, and patient in teaching the little ones.","Children's learning ability varies.","At first, they couldn't immediately keep up with the rhythm.","But after repeated practice, they finally started to show some shape.","By the end of the lesson, the number of online viewers had exceeded 400,000.","Many couldn't hold back their comments in the livestream.","\"I've been learning adult street dance for two years and I'm not as good as these kids after one lesson. I'm truly humbled.\"","\"Where can I find such a handsome street dance teacher? Please tell me, I want to sign up for classes too!\"","\"Can't Starry Sky Kindergarten open a special class for adults?\"","\"I've suggested this to Starry Sky Kindergarten before, but was mercilessly rejected. I can't help but suggest it again, art exam students really need this.\"","\"Am I the only one who thinks Qi Yuan is perfect for being an idol in the entertainment industry? Seriously, those moves can only come from over a decade of dance training!\"","\"Look at the state of the domestic entertainment industry now. This guy has potential, I have high hopes for him.\"","Subsequently, the video of Qi Yuan teaching the children to dance immediately went viral across the internet.","The topic of \"the entertainment industry needs him\" quietly latched onto the tail end of the trending topics.","Originally, it didn't need to be suppressed, as it would have been pushed down by new trends after two or three hours of searching.","But unexpectedly, this trending topic rocketed up like a missile, climbing to the top dozen ranks in less than 4 hours.","And it was still rising. Clicking into it revealed big news.","A well-known industry insider directly said: \"He used to be in the entertainment industry!\"","Then they edited and shared his debut videos from before.","His debut wasn't too long ago, but for some reason, the video was extremely blurry.","It looked as if it had been filmed with a landline phone.","But even so, his dance skills were evident.","Qi Yuan stood out among the entire boy group.","Unfortunately, his outfit was tacky - a big sequined shirt that made his skin look dark, paired with thick eyeliner.","In short, it was an uncomfortable sight. The styling looked like it cost less than $50.","While good styling can enhance a person's appearance, this styling did the opposite. It severely detracted from his looks.","Subsequently, as people dug deeper, they found that this small group didn't last long and quickly faded into obscurity.","Some members of the boy band ended up working as NPCs at tourist attractions, with one going viral for a video of him touching faces.","Another opened a coffee shop.","Some were dancing provocatively at nightclubs.","He started teaching dance at a kindergarten.","Interestingly, while this minor boy band didn't have much chemistry when they were together, each member found their own unique path to success after they went their separate ways."]},{"number":170,"title":"Chapter 170: Chef Liu's Worries","paragraphs":["The news shocked those who had previously been eager to idolize Qi Yuan.","The entertainment industry is indeed hard to navigate!","After working hard for so many years, he didn’t succeed in the end.","Seeing him, who had been a trainee for so many years, fail as soon as he made his debut, many people felt a sense of shared sorrow.","Netizens, with these thoughts in mind, looked at Qi Yuan teaching children to dance with complicated feelings.","After a period of silence, there was a comment — typed, deleted, and retyped — that said, \"Actually, he is quite good at Starry Sky Kindergarten.”","This simple reply was upvoted more than 3,000 times.","...","Qi Yuan, hitting the trending news frequently, became somewhat uncomfortable in the kindergarten. He was always cautious in his interactions with his colleagues.","Afraid of their questions.","He really liked the job.","The children were truly healing. Being with them makes him very happy.","He understood why Chef Liu gave up so many high-paying jobs to come to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Ever since Starry Sky Kindergarten became popular, all of his colleagues have been poached by competitors.","Especially, the art teachers, who were being offered extremely high salaries by various institutions.","But no one has left Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Qi Yuan grooved to the strong beat of pop music over and over again. The fast tempo coupled with the strong drumbeat allowed him to let go of everything.","He danced tirelessly, until his back was soaked with sweat by the fifth time.","Sweat flowed down from his forehead, some getting into his eyes, causing a stinging pain.","But he was not satisfied. He wanted to keep dancing. Just then, there was a knock on the door from outside.","He paused before speaking up: \"Come in.”","To his surprise, the visitor was Wu Feng, the classical dance teacher.","Wu Feng and he shared a large dance studio.","They had different class schedules, and so normally they didn’t clash.","Although they were dancers from different domains, they were both at the pinnacle of their respective domains.","Wu Feng was exceptional.","Every movement, from his hair to his fingertips, looked stunning.","You could genuinely feel as if an orchid was blooming in his hand.","Even when he danced routines meant for female dancers, it did not come off as effeminate.","Instead, he carried a dignified elegance. Wu Feng could astonish everyone every time he danced.","Qi Yuan and Wu Feng shared a studio, but they maintained a courteous but distant relationship.","Seeing him come in this time, Qi Yuan was taken aback before saying, \"If I am bothering you, I’ll leave right away!”","Then, he began to gather his towel and dance clothes.","Wu Feng said, \"It's fine! I just noticed you've been dancing too much.”","Wu Feng was more experienced in the training field than Qi Yuan.","\"You might get dehydrated if you dance too much. And this kind of high-energy exercise can lead to a concussion or kneecap injury.\"","Qi Yuan, surprised, was not expecting Wu Feng’s concern. He responded politely, “Thank you, I'll be more careful next time.”","Wu Feng then asked, “Is it about that thing on the internet?”","Through his recently purchased phone, he glanced at it every now and then.","Qi Yuan simply hummed in response.","Despite his stifled feelings and inherent reticence, Qi Yuan surprisingly opened up upon seeing Wu Feng.","\"When I first entered the industry, I never made it to the trending list. I never thought I'd finally become a trend here!\"","Moreover, many entertainment companies began putting out feelers to recruit him.","The contract he previously signed barred him from the entertainment circle; otherwise, he would have to forfeit a substantial breach amount.","Now, these companies were even willing to cover his hefty contractual damages.","It was absurdly ironic that, once he gave up chasing his dreams, they came pursuing him.","Wu Feng remarked, \"Typically everyone studying here has trended!\"","This comment rendered Qi Yuan speechless. Yes, the platform provided the visibility he needed.","Wu Feng then asked, \"What have you decided to do?\"","Qi Yuan responded, \"I'm not going.\"","The entertainment circle felt like a dream. He'd put in so much effort, and despite his clouded debut, it brought a fleeting joy; he realized it was all an illusion.","Now, being with the children was real.","He was also quite satisfied with his current earnings.","He maintained some popularity online. His private account, which the kindergarten had no interest in.","Featuring his dance videos, his personal account had gathered over 300,000 followers.","He accepted some advertisements, earning him 50 to 60 thousand monthly income, something he had not even dreamt of before.","He recalled his past days living in the dormitory, unable to afford some grubs.","Those days were behind him.","Currently, he was truly enjoying this peaceful and comfortable life.","Returning to his old life felt incredibly challenging.","\"How about we grab some lunch together in the canteen?\" Wu Feng suggested.","\"Sure!\"","Even Qi Yuan looked forward to the food in the canteen.","Soon after, both went to the cafeteria, arriving early before the lunch period.","Even though the staff could come and grab their meals earlier if free.","They noticed Doctor Lu eating his third bowl already. The dish was hot and spicy soup.","The ingredients were stir-fried by Chef Liu himself.","The dish had a high online demand and made from homegrown veggies.","It was delicious.","There were also other dishes like fish-flavored pork shreds, braised eggplant, all perfect companions for rice,","Accompanied by tender and smooth steamed egg pudding.","Eating it was an absolute delight, especially the potato stewed with beef brisket, with soft potatoes and flavorsome beef.","Add some rice, a side of crunchy pickles, and it was downright indulgence.","Doctor Lu was a handsome heartthrob once.","Since joining Starry Sky Kindergarten, he had gradually put on weight.","The photos from a year ago compared to now sent shivers down their spine.","Afterward, they slowed down their eating pace.","Both of them were dancers.","They needed to maintain their body weight and figure.","This made every canteen visit a massive test.","Wu Feng got some green veggies.","And Qi Yuan barely got half bowl of rice.","Chef Liu, who was an expert in fattening up folks, was not pleased upon seeing their tiny meal portions.","\"How could you eat so little!\" he exclaimed while serving each of them a large spoonful of rice. \"This is a must-try, it is very delicious!\"","The rice was specially grown in the northern part of the country and incredibly sweet. It was topped off with a thick sauce.","The two of them didn't want to eat, but they couldn't resist the instinct of life.","However, they couldn't help but finish these dishes.","After finishing, they both felt somewhat guilty because they usually maintain their weight.","Eating a mouthful more felt like they were doing something they weren't supposed to.","\"I'm planning to run 5 kilometers later.\"","Wu Feng said, \"Let's go together.\"","He has already gained 5 kilograms, only his base weight is too small, so it is not noticeable yet.","But he was already vigilant. If he keeps gaining weight like this, he will inevitably become like Doctor Lu.","In the afternoon, when everyone was resting, only they can be seen running round and round on the playground.","Chef Liu, seeing this, was heartbroken.","They are already thin, and yet they also have more work to do.","This is really serious.","They will have to give them some extra food at night, he decided. After making up his mind, he made an effort to enhance the dinner. If these kids didn't eat, it wouldn't be good!","His colleagues, stressing him out as it is."]},{"number":171,"title":"Chapter 171: Feeding","paragraphs":["Ever since Liu Chef became the deputy director of the kindergarten, he's been tied up with all sorts of daily tasks.","It had been a long time since he'd properly cooked a meal.","This time, if he hadn't seen the two dance teachers looking so thin and still jogging outside, he might not have thought to cook a meal himself.","But as soon as he tied the apron around his waist, that familiar feeling came rushing back.","Recently, the vegetables in the garden had been ripening in large quantities, delivered to the kitchen by the basketful every day.","The vegetable garden was very close to the kindergarten.","It took less than an hour from harvest to becoming a dish.","And their vegetables were crisp and refreshing.","They were delicious, especially with Liu Chef's culinary magic added.","Everyone's appetites had increased as a result.","The two dance teachers had weight management needs,","so they requested lightly salted stir-fried vegetables.","These dishes, which even the young teaching assistants at the kindergarten wouldn't eat,","were somehow beloved by these two grown men.","Liu Chef might grumble internally, but he knew the stir-fried vegetables, just barely cooked, were at their crispest and most refreshing.","Though he only added a pinch of salt, it really brought out the flavor.","He then made a celery and shrimp dish.","While others might make a bland diet meal,","Liu Chef's touch made even diet food exceptionally tasty.","After preparing seven or eight similar diet-friendly dishes,","Liu Chef couldn't resist making some more elaborate dishes.","For instance, the \"Squirrel-shaped Mandarin Fish\" was sweet with few bones, a favorite among all his colleagues.","Fish was also a quality protein.","The fish's decorative shape was achieved through frying, crispy on the outside and tender on the inside.","Topped with a sweet and sour sauce, it was truly delicious.","Besides that, he made braised pork trotters with yellow soybeans.","The soybeans mixed with rice and topped with pork trotter were absolutely mouthwatering.","The beef, tenderized with cornstarch, was stir-fried to perfection.","Before long, the aroma wafted from the cafeteria and spread around.","Dinner was only for the staff, as the children had been dismissed early.","These \"Starry Sky\" employees had become addicted to the cafeteria food, even willing to cancel other dinner plans for it.","Today, it wasn't just the staff dining. The scientists were there too. They were the ones researching the gaming pods.","They'd been studying these gaming pods without much progress.","But they came every day to play a few games to relax and have a meal in the cafeteria. They showed no signs of leaving.","The scientists were well-off financially.","Hearing that Professor Liu and Professor Gao had bought houses nearby, they couldn't help but consider buying property themselves.","The kindergarten children had been sent home in carloads.","Many teachers escorted the children all the way home.","Only after handing the children over to their parents did they return on the school bus.","From afar, they could smell the aroma permeating from the cafeteria.","The driver, Zhang Daming, couldn't help but exclaim, \"This must be Liu Chef's cooking.\"","It had been a while since they'd eaten his food, and they were craving it.","Chen Chef's cooking was equally delicious.","But after getting used to Chen Chef's cooking, they couldn't help but crave Liu Chef's.","However, they didn't dare say this out loud.","After all, having either of these top-tier chefs cook for them was an honor.","Today, many people noticed the stir-fried vegetables.","It was clearly a diet-friendly dish, and the two dance teachers finally felt at ease.","They each took half a spoonful to try.","But the moment the stir-fried vegetables touched their tongues, the unique crispness and natural sweetness won them over.","After a few bites, they couldn't resist going back for more.","Liu Chef watched as they took spoonful after spoonful, eating heartily.","It was diet food, true, but filling up on diet food would somewhat defeat the purpose.","Some of the other scientists who came to eat said, \"These pork trotters aren't as fragrant as usual. If it weren't for my high cholesterol, I'd really dig in.\"","Reluctantly, they reached for the shrimp and crispy stir-fried greens instead.","\"A chef is a chef for a reason. It's just so delicious,\" they praised.","Liu Chef was used to such compliments by now, but he still couldn't help saying, \"It's all thanks to the quality of the vegetables.\"","The vegetables they grew themselves were indeed delicious.","Every dish had an excellent texture.","Today's soup was celery soup, perfect for cleansing the palate after some oily dishes.","The soup was quickly finished.","After everything had been eaten, there was just a bit of kitchen waste left.","Liu Chef packed it into boxes and walked quite a distance to feed the stray cats.","He first encountered the strays when he saw a kitten rummaging through garbage for food.","Feeling sympathy, he fed them once.","Who knew the cats would call all their friends?","The number of stray cats increased. Luckily, the area he fed them was an abandoned zone.","The groups of stray cats didn't disturb local traffic.","These strays weren't afraid of him anymore and would meow at him when they saw him.","Liu Chef put the leftover food in that area.","Soon, the stray cats started eating.","Some kind-hearted people had also left cat food and canned food nearby.","But clearly, the stray cats preferred what he cooked.","Every time he brought something, it would be quickly devoured from the small food bowls.","Only the cats that arrived late and missed Liu Chef's cooking would eat the cat food and canned food.","Liu Chef watched and couldn't help but smile, \"These little rascals sure know how to eat well.\"","Then, humming a tune, he happily walked home.","...","Shen Wei had received an invitation from the Liao Family recently.","It was for a birthday celebration for their young master.","They were all of the same generation.","Initially, Shen Wei didn't want to go, but several people specifically told her she must attend. They said many young heirs and heiresses who had returned from abroad wanted to meet her.","Shen Wei had to agree, and subsequently chose a simple evening gown.","When Gu Qingyan heard that Shen Wei was going, he also asked his assistant for time off early.","After work, he even got a facial treatment.","It wasn't that he was vain.","It was mainly because working at construction sites every day, exposed to wind and sun, had nearly ruined his delicate fair skin.","After the treatment, he put on a bespoke suit.","Gu Qingyan was inherently an elegant young gentleman, and with just a bit of effort, he transformed back into his previous handsome and charming self.","When he arrived,","he was immediately surrounded by people asking how he'd been lately.","Shen Wei had attended similar parties before.","Few people would interact with her.","They all treated her like she was invisible.","After all, she was the daughter of a nouveau riche.","She didn't fit in with these truly privileged young ladies and gentlemen.","Over time, she lost interest in attending such parties.","She never expected to be actively invited now."]},{"number":172,"title":"Chapter 172: Shen Wei is the Idol of the Rich Second Generation","paragraphs":["However, after staying for a short while, Shen Wei realized why these people had actively invited her.","They were all interested in Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The young people were very curious about how she had managed to run a kindergarten so successfully on the internet.","Especially those second-generation rich kids, their eyes were practically overflowing with admiration.","Although they couldn't yet access their family businesses, they had been exposed to the internet from a young age.","What Shen Wei had accomplished was beyond their wildest dreams.","They looked at her as if she were their idol.","Those who were a bit older and had children of their own were inquiring about the kindergarten.","Previously, they hadn't considered Starry Sky Kindergarten, thinking it was just an internet celebrity kindergarten that was too high-profile with its daily live streams.","They didn't like it.","But now Starry Sky Kindergarten was gradually demonstrating its strength.","It wasn't just about those special classes.","The scientists were mainly researching gaming pods.","But when they couldn't figure out the gaming pods, they started doing small science experiments to enlighten the children.","The kindergarten had been live streaming all along, and the online viewers were shocked.","Having these national-level experts provide scientific enlightenment to children was something they couldn't even dream of. The children's starting point was too high.","No one else could invite experts of this caliber.","People didn't know whether to feel sour or envious.","Anyway, more and more people wanted to come to Starry Sky Kindergarten now.","The circle had expanded to include the upper-class families.","As long as Shen Wei was willing to accept them, they were willing to pay even more money.","They even started to envy the Liu Family's young master.","He had insisted on coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten against all odds.","Many people didn't understand it at the time.","They wondered why he chose this place when there were so many good kindergartens.","But now they realized how impressive his choice had been.","Now, it was almost impossible to get a spot at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Especially those who were Shen Wei's age and had always been in the circle, they watched as Shen Wei transformed from an unknown nobody to the center of attention at industry gatherings.","This was the Liao Family's gathering, and Shen Wei's popularity even overshadowed the Liao Family's heir.","Meanwhile, the Noble Kindergarten next door was deserted.","Its principal had also come, but no one would engage in conversation with her no matter who she tried to talk to.","Previously, Noble Kindergarten had been thriving.","It was the preparatory kindergarten for many young masters.","Out of respect for this, people were willing to be nice to her.","But now Noble Kindergarten's reputation was deteriorating.","People's attitudes towards her had gradually turned cold.","The principal of Noble Kindergarten felt a mix of emotions. This upper-class circle was the most opportunistic place.","She used to be the one mocking others. Who knew she would become the one being mocked now.","Shen Wei didn't have much interest in attending the party.","She had planned to stay for only an hour or two at most.","Who would have thought she ended up staying for a full four hours.","It wasn't for nothing though. There was a mousse cake at the party that was exceptionally delicious.","It was chocolate flavored.","Not too sweet, but very rich and fragrant.","The children would definitely love it.","Shen Wei praised it a few times, and unexpectedly, the Liao Family's heir was so accommodating that he immediately had the kitchen pack up several portions for Shen Wei to take back.","By now, the kindergarten had long since dismissed for the day.","Only He Lingfeng, Mu Zhixing, and Song Ping An were staying there.","The little ones usually played well together.","At the moment, He Lingfeng was typing away on the keyboard.","Mu Zhixing was drawing on a sketchpad.","She was a genius, born with a concept of perspective in her mind. The work she was drawing now was very difficult. It looked a bit like modeling a building.","Looking at the dizzying picture, she could find every perspective point.","Song Ping An could now speak.","His favorite things were puzzle-like games.","These three children were the little antagonists that the system had asked Shen Wei to save.","Each had their own charm.","Although they belonged to different fields, the way they were not disturbing each other at this moment made even Shen Wei stare in amazement.","These little babies, because of Shen Wei's intervention, hadn't entered the dark moments of their fate.","This was probably the greatest good deed Shen Wei had done.","Mu Zhixing was the most sensitive.","She looked up and saw Shen Wei, immediately running over with a sweet voice: \"Sister Principal!\"","Her voice startled the other two little ones.","They also ran towards Shen Wei: \"Why are you here?\"","He Lingfeng was the most dependent on Shen Wei.","Now, He Lingfeng raised his chubby little face, his eyes bright with excitement when looking at Shen Wei. He couldn't contain his happiness.","Shen Wei said, \"I've brought you some little cakes!\"","\"Yay, that's great!\" These children were precocious, only showing their childish side in front of Shen Wei.","They all started eating the little cakes with spoons.","Even Shen Wei found this cake delicious.","The children were enjoying it even more.","After eating, He Lingfeng stood shyly in front of Shen Wei, seeming to have some other thoughts.","But he was too shy to express them.","Shen Wei understood, walked over and squatted in front of him, patting the little one's head.","The little one fell into her warm embrace.","That's right, he just wanted a hug.","But he was too shy to ask.","Children also compare with each other.","Seeing He Lingfeng being hugged by Shen Wei, the other two little ones even abandoned their delicious cakes, dropping their spoons and coming over for hugs too.","Shen Wei hugged each of them in turn.","The little ones laughed with pure joy.","After a while, they reluctantly went back to their activities.","Song Ping An was building with blocks. He Lingfeng was writing a new string of code.","Mu Zhixing continued to draw her difficult picture.","But the whole atmosphere had become lively and cheerful because of Shen Wei's arrival.","......","Early the next morning, as soon as Shen Wei arrived at Starry Sky Kindergarten,","She heard someone say, \"Our kindergarten is trending again.\"","Liu Chef sighed lightly as he said this.","He didn't know why they kept trending so easily.","And this time, it made him a bit angry.","The reason was that their little teaching assistant Tang Xiaowan had gone out for a blind date.","The date failed, and the other party had even posted about her online.","As soon as people saw there was gossip about Starry Sky Kindergarten, they rushed to check it out.","Liu Chef said, \"Tang Xiaowan is crying over there!\"","The young girl was already upset about what happened.","Now it had been posted publicly online and was trending.","The more she thought about it, the angrier she became. Then Shen Wei opened the post to take a look.","The other party had described Tang Xiaowan as a vain girl who worshipped money endlessly.","But Shen Wei knew she wasn't that kind of person.","Unable to resist, she went over to ask what was going on.","The young woman had been working here since graduating from university.","She had long considered the kindergarten like a second home. She loved children and was an excellent teaching assistant. She had excelled in school and gave up a secure government job to come work at Starry Sky Kindergarten. Many veteran kindergarten teachers had praised her.","Even Teacher Tang was focusing on mentoring her. Everyone could see her good character and abilities.","Seeing Shen Wei approach, Tang Xiaowan made a firm decision: \"I'll clarify things myself later. I absolutely won't let the kindergarten be disgraced.\"","Shen Wei said, \"It's alright. The internet is a double-edged sword, but no one can fool the public for long. Don't be afraid.\"","These words seemed to have a magical effect. Tang Xiaowan started crying again, but this time, she felt much more relaxed."]},{"number":173,"title":"Chapter 173: The Disgusting Oddball Man","paragraphs":["Tang Xiaowan was originally the top-ranked graduate from the preschool education college.","Upon graduation, she had the opportunity to secure a position at a city district kindergarten.","However, she resolutely gave up that chance.","Instead, she chose Starry Sky Kindergarten.","At the time, this decision seemed utterly shocking.","But now, Starry Sky Kindergarten has surpassed even the Noble Kindergarten in reputation.","In an instant, she went from being seen as a rebellious student in her teachers' eyes to a senior with incredible foresight.","These days, junior students often add her on WeChat, hoping for a chance to intern at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","She was a talent that Teacher Tang focused on cultivating.","Teacher Tang is now married to Li Yi, the security guard.","Both of them are not young anymore and are eager to try for a baby.","But during the period from pregnancy to childbirth, Tang Xiaowan might have to take over the class.","With Tang Xiaowan around, Teacher Tang feels completely at ease.","Tang Xiaowan gets along extremely well with everyone at Starry Sky Kindergarten, as if they're all one big family.","Moreover, she's young this year.","All her colleagues dote on her like a child.","It's safe to say that during her time at the kindergarten, she's been happy every day.","Who would have thought that just one blind date would lead her to encounter such an oddball?","Not only did he post very personal matters online, but he also tagged Starry Sky Kindergarten in the post.","Starry Sky Kindergarten was already a hot topic.","Seeing it trending, uninformed netizens began hurling abuse. Especially topics like girls being materialistic tend to be quite controversial.","Tang Xiaowan's eyes were brimming with tears, and several times she was about to cry, but she managed to swallow it back.","However, when Shen Wei said that the kindergarten believed in her character, she could no longer hold back her tears.","Teacher Tang found out about the news rather late.","She had taught a few classes and then rushed over as soon as she finished.","As soon as she arrived, she saw Tang Xiaowan crying.","Teacher Tang genuinely liked Tang Xiaowan.","The two of them had always worked well together.","Tang Xiaowan was understanding by nature and patient with children.","Teacher Tang truly treated her like a little sister.","Seeing her cry like this, she anxiously asked, \"What's wrong? What happened?\"","Tang Xiaowan finally sobbed out, \"My mom insisted I go on a blind date, but I refused. This time, she just said we were going out for a meal, without mentioning it was for matchmaking.\"","But when she arrived, she found a man waiting there.","Out of courtesy, Tang Xiaowan couldn't just turn and leave, so she awkwardly sat through the meal.","Liu Chef, who cared deeply about his colleagues, rushed over when he heard something was wrong. However, as a man, he felt it wasn't his place to interject on many topics.","But after listening for a while, he couldn't help but say, \"What is your mom thinking? How old are you anyway?\"","Tang Xiaowan, between sobs, said, \"Because my aunt has a sister who's over 30 and unmarried, my mom is afraid I'll end up like her. So she wants to marry me off early. She says that way she'll have completed her duty.\"","Teacher Tang hadn't realized Tang Xiaowan's family situation was like this.","She understood Tang Xiaowan; Tang Xiaowan wanted to make breakthroughs in her career.","Moreover, Starry Sky Kindergarten's expansion to a second location was set in stone.","That would be a time of massive recruitment.","Tang Xiaowan was already capable of independently leading a class.","This meant she could transition from an assistant to a full-fledged teacher.","At that time, both her salary and other benefits would improve.","But it required her to devote herself entirely to work.","Young people taking on full responsibilities are always overwhelmed at first.","So Tang Xiaowan had no intention of finding a boyfriend.","If she wanted to, she could just mention it, and people in the kindergarten could introduce her to someone, especially with Shen Wei as her boss.","Teachers from Starry Sky Kindergarten were highly sought after in the marriage market.","She really didn't need to worry about finding a spouse.","So everyone felt that Tang Xiaowan's mother was acting as if possessed.","She was in a rush to get her child married, without caring about what kind of person the match might be.","\"Then what happened?\" Shen Wei asked.","Tang Xiaowan's face showed she was reluctant to continue.","Shen Wei said, \"It's okay, you don't have to say more if you don't want to.\"","Tang Xiaowan steeled herself and immediately said, \"Meeting such a weirdo, I'm not the one who should be embarrassed. I can talk about it.\"","After a pause, she told everyone.","This guy was quite unattractive.","Not yet 30, his hairline was already receding dramatically.","Anyone who didn't know better might think he had lied about his age by ten years to come to this blind date.","Moreover, his gaze was extremely lecherous and sleazy.","Tang Xiaowan was in the prime of her youth, fresh as a water lily. Meeting such a person for a blind date made her feel nauseated.","Plus, he kept staring at her chest repeatedly, looking her up and down as if appraising goods.","She became increasingly upset and said she had been tricked into coming.","Who knew this statement would be like lighting a powder keg?","The man said, \"I heard you're just a teaching assistant. You work at a kindergarten, right? I have a formal government position.\"","His words were dripping with a sense of superiority.","Tang Xiaowan found it laughable. She was looking for a partner, not marrying a job title.","Besides, her current monthly income was already equivalent to three months of his salary.","She really didn't know where his sense of superiority came from, and she didn't feel inferior at all.","Seeing that Tang Xiaowan didn't respond, the man thought he had intimidated her and said, \"Why don't we try living together before marriage?\"","Tang Xiaowan was stunned, \"What do you mean by 'try living together'?\"","The man said, \"Let's try it out first. How else can we know if we're suitable for marriage? Some women have already had abortions before marriage, and who knows if they can even get pregnant.\"","Tang Xiaowan was truly disgusted, \"I'm sorry, but I don't want to marry you.\"","Being rejected so directly, the man suddenly became furious, as if his pride had been wounded, \"What, are you one of those types too? Are you afraid you can't have children?\"","This kind of talk would be offensive to any woman.","There was no need for her to prove anything to him, yet he continued, \"You know how to take care of children, so you should have more in the future.\"","Tang Xiaowan's face turned completely cold as she said, \"I'm sorry, but none of this is any of your business. I hope you find someone you like, but we're not compatible.\"","The man, embarrassed and angry, said, \"What are you pretending for? It's just an internet-famous kindergarten, right? We all know what 'internet-famous' really means. Do you kindergarten teachers also wear black stockings?\"","Tang Xiaowan was thoroughly angered, \"You can say what you want about me, but leave the kindergarten out of it.\"","The man seemed to have caught onto something and immediately said, \"What? Not allowed to say it? If it can't be said, then it must be true. Is that kindergarten of yours a legitimate one? It's not some cosplay thing, is it?\"","Tang Xiaowan was trembling with anger. She picked up a cup of water and threw it at him.","The water was still scalding hot. The man yelped, and Tang Xiaowan grabbed her bag and ran.","Her mood remained sour after encountering such an oddball.","But little did she know that the worst was yet to come.","As soon as she got to work today, she discovered this situation.","Everyone present was angered after hearing about it.","Who would have thought there were such peculiar people in this world?","Turning the tables on someone.","Shen Wei said to Tang Xiaowan, \"You don't need to worry about this anymore. I'll beat him to death.\"","Shen Wei immediately issued a statement, denouncing the slanderous lies and threatening to sue for defamation.","Then Shen Wei called in a private investigator to look into the matter.","This person's habit of constant lying clearly didn't develop overnight.","A brief investigation revealed that he was universally disliked at his workplace too.","He had harassed many unmarried women.","However, since they all worked in the same place and had to see each other daily, they could only swallow their anger.","Who would have thought that, relying on his job security, he would start going on blind dates.","He would viciously criticize others, and one foolish girl actually fell for his tricks. She got pregnant not long after they got together.","She thought they would get married.","Who would have imagined he'd say the child might not be his? He insisted on waiting until after the birth for a paternity test.","Little did he know that this girl was also fierce. She immediately terminated the pregnancy.","His reputation was poor in his small social circle, but in such a big city, who could know everything about everyone?","This time he had set his sights on Tang Xiaowan, thinking he could intimidate and insult an innocent young girl into submission. Who would have thought he'd hit a steel plate?","Shen Wei had built her career on the internet. She took all the investigation results and boom! Posted a bunch of evidence on the official account of Starry Sky Kindergarten."]},{"number":174,"title":"Chapter 174: Support","paragraphs":["The onlookers were stunned.","\"I never thought there could be such a shameless person in this world.\"","\"Good heavens, you may be ugly, but you sure have grand delusions.\"","\"Trial marriage with you? Who do you think you are?\"","\"Tang Xiaowan from Starry Sky Kindergarten is gentle, lovely, young, and earns a lot. Why would she choose you, a bald old gourd?\"","\"Honestly, you have nothing going for you, yet you're dreaming big.\"","\"Taking advantage of being male to harass female colleagues without restraint. These kinds of people are the worst. I had a coworker like that before, which is why I quit immediately.\"","\"This is a perfect example of bad money driving out good.\"","\"The more I look at this, the angrier I get!\"","\"A blessed woman shouldn't enter an unlucky household.\"","\"Everyone should stay far away from him.\"","The man unexpectedly gained such huge attention.","Seeing everyone ganging up on Tang Xiaowan with him, who would have thought his joy wouldn't last long? Starry Sky Kindergarten posted that they were going to sue him.","Once he got caught up in a lawsuit, he'd lose his job too.","Who would have thought this person would take it so seriously?","He immediately wanted to go over and say something nice.","But to his surprise, the other party had blocked him.","A while later, his family called him.","They said Starry Sky Kindergarten had hit him hard again.","He opened it to see that they had posted all his past misdeeds one by one online.","The more he read, the more furious he became, especially since people in the comments were cursing him to high heaven.","It was fine when he used cyberbullying to curse others.","But once that knife came swinging back to stab him, he immediately felt the pain.","He also wanted to use Starry Sky Kindergarten's methods against them. They could sue, right? So he'd sue them for defamation too.","His attitude was very aggressive, demanding that they delete these \"false\" messages.","But before the netizens could catch their breath, a second and third girl appeared online to expose and criticize him.","He was so peculiar that there wasn't just one or two victims.","These people who had been disgusted by him once would feel awful for at least half a year.","Now seeing this weirdo in trouble, they immediately swarmed in, each giving him a kick until he was trampled to death.","So this man became overwhelmed.","He was still dealing with this and that.","More and more people came to curse at him.","He had no choice but to close both the comment section and his private messages.","But soon he received a phone call from his boss.","The man answered with a fawning smile: \"Boss, good afternoon!\"","The boss said, \"Clean up this mess online before you come back to work.\"","\"What do you mean?\" He was a bit confused.","\"This incident has had an extremely negative impact on our company. Even the higher-ups have started to inquire about it!\"","\"They're all misunderstanding me!\" He pretended to look wronged on the side.","But his boss didn't give him a chance.","He just said that if this matter wasn't resolved in a month,","He would continue to be suspended without pay indefinitely. The announcement would be made soon.","He had no choice but to frantically try to contact Tang Xiaowan again.","But no matter how he tried, he couldn't reach Tang Xiaowan.","Tang Xiaowan had blocked all of his accounts.","Not only that, Tang Xiaowan had even blocked her mother's and the matchmaker's phone numbers.","Introducing her to such a person had truly broken her heart.","Fortunately, Shen Wei was backing her up in this matter.","Otherwise, given that man's thick skin and ability to twist black into white, who knows how things might have turned out.","Shen Wei had hired the best lawyers on her side. If he wanted to go to court, they would fight.","They weren't afraid at all.","When lunchtime came, many people were comforting Tang Xiaowan.","They told her not to worry too much about this matter. With Shen Wei there, everything would be fine.","When people online heard that Tang Xiaowan was looking for a boyfriend, they suddenly got excited.","Everyone could see the benefits of being a teacher at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","And she had two spots available.","Now, one spot was worth 100,000 yuan, and as soon as someone made an offer, it would be immediately taken.","This was equivalent to 200,000 yuan.","Add to that her education, looks, kindness to children, and a stable job, she was the perfect candidate.","Originally, they didn't think much of it.","But since that despicable man had exposed Tang Xiaowan's identity and background,","All the other single young men watching the livestream became interested.","Any random one of them had better conditions than that weirdo.","Early the next morning, as soon as Tang Xiaowan arrived at work, she saw several men outside holding flowers.","As soon as they saw her, they couldn't help but come over, introducing themselves and asking if they could get to know her for a while.","Tang Xiaowan jokingly said yes.","Then she added them on WeChat and put the flowers beside her when she got to the office.","She thought Shen Wei had found some handsome guys to act this out to comfort her.","When she told Shen Wei about this, Shen Wei was also shocked: \"That wasn't me.\"","This time, Tang Xiaowan's face turned completely red with embarrassment.","What a situation this was. She had naturally accepted four bouquets of flowers and added four men on WeChat.","Now thinking about it, it turned out to be a misunderstanding. What would others think of her?","Shen Wei joked, \"Well, how about it? You're both single anyway. What if you happen to meet your true love? It's still better than meeting through a matchmaker.\"","\"Mm,\" Tang Xiaowan said with a red face. Later that evening when she was sending the children home, she met many tall and handsome young men again. They were all uncles, brothers, or friends of the children's parents.","They all tried to chat with her a bit more.","Not only were her colleagues at Starry Sky Kindergarten warm, but the people in the livestream were also speaking up for her.","Especially the top comment in the livestream that was pinned: \"I'll introduce you to my 1.85-meter-tall brother later. Let that toad see what kind of man you can find.\"","\"Don't worry, we've got your lifelong happiness covered. We'll save the most handsome brothers for you, to really slap that man's face.\"","Tang Xiaowan was both moved and amused, truly speechless."]},{"number":175,"title":"Chapter 175: Chef Liu on Business Trip","paragraphs":["Chef Liu of Starry Sky Kindergarten had to leave for a trip due to a task at hand.","The two dance teachers, feeling a strange softness on their bellies, felt a sense of relief.","Chef Liu was too good at what he does.","He could even make the weight-loss meals taste incredibly good.","What's it like to feel full on a weight loss diet? He always wanted to answer that question. It didn't feel like dieting at all.","Once you put on weight, there's a sense of 'anything goes'.","They were considering whether to eat without restraint.","Because the braised pork hocks offered by the school cafeteria is too tempting.","That's when they heard that Chef Liu had to leave on a business trip!","The trip was for a culinary contest.","The flash store had to stop its operation because of the live broadcast of the culinary contest.","But then they learned that the copyright was going to be moved over to the television station.","So, they had to temporarily halt it, as the television station needed some time to prepare.","The television station is also afraid that the popularity might decrease.","So they have been preparing non-stop.","It took them more than a week to get everything ready.","There were three teams in total, each covering an 8-hour shift.","They finally got the stage and various camera positions sorted out.","Even the post-production team has been found.","Chef Liu was called in. This time, the radio station decided to use live broadcast.","Their cake station used to be very popular amongst all national television stations.","But now it has gradually dropped out of the top 10.","The high online popularity of this culinary match has everyone at the station excited.","They saw it as a great opportunity for them to redeem themselves.","They broke the tradition of recorded programming and switched to live broadcast.","The aim was to connect with the high online interactivity.","Chef Liu was one of the judges.","Shen Wei was also a special guest.","Apart from them, some online taste testers were retained as well.","The original appearance of Shen Wei was retained when she made the culinary contest, just now taking place on a more professional set.","Chef Liu had previously been a judge, but those contests were small-scale.","For example, when experienced chefs took on apprentices. He commented like a senior.","Before, he was at the flash store.","He had been working at the flash store for quite a long period of time.","He has been used to live broadcasting from his own unit.","This time he is coming to the professional set. Prior to the trip, he even unexpectedly experienced insomnia.","He dug out the most expensive suit from his home, only to find that it has become too tight.","Chef Liu was dumbfounded.","He spent more than 5000 on the suit.","He hardly wore it, saving it for important occasions. Who would've thought that it would become too small?","Chef Liu was muttering to himself.","His wife said on the side, \"You've been keeping this for over 10 years, and you've gained at least 30 pounds, naturally, you can't wear it. Go buy a new one.\"","Chef Liu said in his mouth, \"What's the point of buying it, wasting money!\"","Unable to wear this suit which cost more than 5000, he still couldn't help but cherish it.","But he still handed his wife some money, asking her to buy a high-end suit.","It was already late at night, and Chef Liu couldn't sleep.","He opened up the WeChat group, and found that many of his colleagues in the kindergarten group were craving the dishes he cooked.","Initially, they borrowed Chef Liu, thinking that Chef Chen could replace him.","But Chef Chen was at the flash store, and the kindergarten could only temporarily find another chief chef to cover the shift.","But those who have tasted the dishes made by Chef Liu know that there's a huge difference between him and other master chefs.","Everyone cherished him, because recording the programme would take at least two months.","The thought of not being able to eat Chef Liu's food for two months made all the colleagues at the kindergarten feel unbearable sadness.","She was just shy of crying in front of Chef Liu to express how much she would miss him.","Chef Liu was feeling pretty in delight. He couldn't help but reply with a voice message in the middle of the night, \"Everyone, rest assured. Although I am out on business, I have already arranged for Chef Zhang to take over the kindergarten kitchen.\"","Chef Zhang had once substituted him in the pop-up restaurant, a cook skilled with braised dishes and was especially nonchalant.","He disliked taking apprentices or adhering to formal working hours, living a laid-back lifestyle much akin to old Beijing locals.","The last time the pop-up was swamped, Chef Liu called for Chef Zhang.","Once his braised dishes hit the tables, they quickly secured a place in the hearts of the patrons.","They were simply phenomenal - no one really knew how he managed to do it.","His dishes were the kind where you'd want to suck your fingers after finishing, not wanting to waste any bit of the sauce.","Each duck neck, stripping every tiny bit of meat from the nooks and crannies.","Not wanting to waste even the slightest bit.","That braised juice, combined with a bit of potato slices and kelp.","These seemingly ordinary ingredients suddenly attained culinary divinity under the anointing of the braised juice.","Whether mixed with rice or eaten as is - they were exceptionally delicious.","Nowadays, many places sell braised duck products.","But none could compare to what Chef Zhang had to offer.","Each time everyone ate, they had blissful expressions on their faces.","After finishing, they'd want to savor one more duck neck, nibbling slowly and chewing meticulously, as if this was what life was truly about.","By the time Chef Liu responded, it was already deep into the night.","He assumed everyone had gone to bed.","That they would see his message first thing in the morning.","Who would have thought that the moment he posted his message in the group chat, there was already a lively response, \"I knew Chef Liu wouldn't abandon us.\"","\"My gosh, I'm truly lucky!\"","\"Don't worry, as long as we're here, there won't be any problems in our kindergarten.\"","Chef Liu was an extremely caring person, and his primary concern was the kindergarten.","This message warmed his heart.","Looking at his phone, Chef Liu laughed and muttered, \"These little rascals.\"","Chefs Liu and Chen were the eldest in the kindergarten.","They saw all their colleagues as younger siblings.","Just a moment ago, they were all moping about how much they would miss him.","But now that they knew there was a new chef, they'd quickly forgotten about him.","That said, everyone's response reassured him.","Otherwise, being the people pleaser he was, he might have started to feel guilty.","The next day, Chef Liu went to the broadcasting studio early in the morning.","As soon as he got there, he couldn't help but inquire about Shen Wei's whereabouts.","Despite Chef Liu's age, he spent most of his time interacting with pots and pans, and didn't socialize much.","The sight of so many people and such magnitude arrangements made him a little nervous.","Soon enough, Shen Wei made her appearance. Seeing Shen Wei, Chef Liu immediately felt a sense of relief and quickly walked over to greet her.","\"Shen Wei, you're here! I can now relax.\" he said.","Shen Wei replied, \"You're here so early! We haven't even started yet.\"","He could have taken a longer break.","Chef Liu said, \"I got worried!\"","Even though they had handed over the broadcasting rights to the TV station.","They had initiated the program. He felt a sense of responsibility towards it.","He wanted to make sure everything was done right.","After a while, he saw Jiang Xun, his prized favourite.","Jiang Xun was sitting in a corner.","Most people were aware of his fallout with his mentor.","In addition to his aloof personality, not many people proactively approach Jiang Xun.","Now that Liu Chef sees him alone, he can't help but want to ask him about his employment intentions.","\"Would you like to join us at Starry Sky Kindergarten?\" he inquires.","Liu Chef deeply feels that there are too few helping hands in the kitchen.","The moment he steps out, there's immediately a shortage in the culinary department.","It took a burst of popularity and inviting friends over to occupy the space this time.","But you can't always rely on popularity for solutions.","How wonderful it would be to have the strength of a few youths.","After years of dedicated guidance, they can gradually take on heavier responsibilities.","Then he can retire peacefully in the future."]},{"number":176,"title":"Chapter 176: The Title Sponsor Has Changed","paragraphs":["Jiang Xun had no idea that Liu Chef had so many thoughts in his mind.","Looking at Liu Chef now, there was hesitation in his eyes as he asked, \"Is signing with Starry Sky Kindergarten the only way to continue in the competition?\"","He had heard before that some competitions required signing contracts in advance, and those who didn't sign couldn't progress to the next round.","This was his first time participating in such a culinary competition, so he wasn't sure if there were similar unwritten rules.","Liu Chef was taken aback by his question, then looked at the young man and said, \"Of course not. You're free to choose.\"","As soon as Jiang Xun finished speaking, he felt a bit regretful.","After all, the other person was a senior in the culinary world, and his words had been somewhat presumptuous.","But having already spoken, and not being particularly quick-witted to remedy the situation, he could only leave feeling somewhat guilty, just as a host came over to Liu Chef to go over the script.","Jiang Xun breathed a sigh of relief.","As he walked a few steps towards the exit, he saw the girl who made desserts.","There were more male contestants in their culinary competition.","With only a few girls in total, they naturally stood out, and the two of them had exchanged a few words before.","Later, they gradually became more familiar, chatting more on WeChat.","Seeing her again, in a situation where he wasn't familiar with others, she was clearly his only acquaintance.","\"What's wrong?\" Seeing that he seemed troubled, she took the initiative to ask.","Jiang Xun told her about Liu Chef's question and his own cold response.","The girl was silent for a moment, then said, \"I might choose Starry Sky Kindergarten, if they want me.\"","\"Why?\" Jiang Xun was surprised.","\"It's not about whether I can advance or not. I've been a fan of the kindergarten before, and I just want to make desserts in a more healing environment. I don't care about making more or less money.\"","She really disliked the so-called scheming and plotting.","She had already experienced it since the competition began.","Everyone forming cliques openly and secretly,","It all made her somewhat weary.","So she preferred a simpler life. If she went to a cake shop, she'd be parachuted in.","The old employees would surely be dissatisfied.","Before even arriving, she might already invoke others' dislike.","The healing atmosphere of Starry Sky Kindergarten had made her a long-time fan.","Now that Starry Sky Kindergarten was extending an olive branch to her, she was more than willing to accept.","The girl looked at Jiang Xun and said, \"But everyone has their own choices. You should just choose what's best for you.\"","Jiang Xun pondered this.","During this time, he had also learned that Starry Sky Kindergarten was indeed quite good in every aspect.","But he had been burned before, so he wasn't sure if this goodness was genuine or just a facade.","As the two were talking, they were rudely interrupted by a male contestant: \"Hey, you two contestants can't talk to each other.\"","Then a short, stout middle-aged man appeared, frowning, with deep wrinkles between his brows.","As soon as he appeared, people nearby respectfully called out, \"Hello, Director.\"","Jiang Xun was slightly taken aback.","The short, stout middle-aged man then gave Jiang Xun a few words of advice.","Afterwards, he was surrounded by a crowd of people and left the area.","Jiang Xun couldn't help but ask those nearby, \"Is he the director?\"","In his impression, the director should be an elderly man around 60 years old.","But the middle-aged man he just saw looked only about 40 years old.","However, his skin with orange peel texture made him look particularly hot-tempered, and despite being short and stout, his presence was not at all diminished.","A lighting technician who had just become a permanent employee this year saw him ask and couldn't help but grumble, \"Actually, he's just a deputy director, but he likes everyone to call him director.\"","His tone was full of disdain.","Originally, people should just tell it like it is, but he insists on skipping ranks.","It's also because the old director doesn't manage anything and delegates power.","Nobody dares to offend him.","So they can only cater to his preferences, calling him director over and over, until even he starts to believe it after a while.","The deputy director's surname was Liu. At this moment, he had just returned to his office.","He took a sip of the strong tea brought by his assistant, then spat out a mouthful of tea leaves onto the ground.","Finally, he carefully examined the report.","But Deputy Director Liu quickly spotted the problem: \"What's going on? Our S-grade variety show has such strong online popularity, how come the title sponsorship fee is only 3 million? What is the advertising department doing?\"","Let alone an S-grade variety show, even a B-grade one would have advertising fees around 3 million.","This time, the station's publicity and distribution costs alone were over 20 million.","They were determined to do a good job.","The advertising revenue should first make a big profit.","They had inquired about those big TV stations, and their title sponsorship fees were several hundred million.","At least 20 million would be appropriate.","The assistant explained beside him, \"This is the copyright we received from Starry Sky Kindergarten. They already have a title sponsor, Gu Corporation, who gave 100 million.\"","\"Then where's the money?\" Hearing about 100 million, the deputy director's heart surged.","\"The money was taken by Starry Sky Kindergarten. This was negotiated by Little Mei. Because of their online popularity...\"","The deputy director didn't want to hear it and immediately said, \"Absurd.\"","\"We're working hard for nothing. Now immediately tell the advertising department to ask if their investment title sponsors can increase their input. If not, replace them immediately. The title sponsorship fee must not be less than 20 million.\"","\"And by the way, ask if Gu Corporation is willing to add more investment!\"","They did give money, but the money was given to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","But now it's the TV station doing this, there's no reason they should receive less money.","\"But Starry Sky Kindergarten...\" The assistant hadn't finished speaking when Deputy Director Liu rudely interrupted.","\"What does Starry Sky Kindergarten have to do with us? Do they expect everyone at our station to work for them for free?\"","\"But...\"","Deputy Director Liu slammed his cup on the desk with a bang.","The assistant didn't dare to say anything more.","Then, fearing that this young fellow would mess things up, Deputy Director Liu personally went to call and negotiate with the advertising department.","The advertising department was also confused. They immediately started discussing sponsorship with companies.","After all, it was an S-grade variety show.","A 20 million title sponsorship wasn't much, and they quickly secured it.","But Deputy Director Liu was still unsatisfied.","The kindergarten had taken the lion's share. It was really frustrating.","The young assistant couldn't help but leak the news to Little Mei: \"What should we do? The deputy director has already changed the title sponsor.\"","\"What? This was all agreed upon in advance,\" Little Mei said.","Although Little Mei was a young woman, she was exceptionally driven.","In just a few short years, she had become a producer at the television station.","She had originally planned to venture out and explore opportunities elsewhere,","To experience the atmosphere at some larger stations.","But the old station director saw great potential in her and repeatedly persuaded her to stay.","This time, being able to capitalize on the popularity of Starry Sky Kindergarten was already a favor from friends. She never expected Deputy Director Liu to secretly undermine her efforts."]},{"number":177,"title":"Chapter 177: “Strength is Paramount Anywhere”","paragraphs":["The sudden change of title sponsor was something no one had experienced before.","Little Mei was so anxious that sweat was about to drip down her face.","She was also part of the rich second generation group, in the same circle as Lin Rui.","However, her interest was in being a producer.","This time, she had pulled some strings to get the show on Cake TV Station.","She knew Lin Rui's personality well.","Back when Lin Rui's engagement to Su Zheng caused a huge stir, she was able to cut it off decisively, showing her strong will.","Moreover, the Lin Family held a significant position in society.","Offending her over this matter would truly be more trouble than it's worth.","The show was originally in Lin Rui's hands and could have been successful.","She just wanted some buzz, and she had already reported the sponsorship issue to the old station director.","Many people at the station knew about it at the time.","Now the deputy director had boldly replaced the title sponsor directly.","It really made her anxious.","The person who tipped off Little Mei asked, \"So what do we do now?\"","The opening music could already be heard from the other side, indicating that it had likely started. Little Mei's forehead was covered in sweat.","The best solution would be to negotiate with the deputy director.","As soon as she said this, someone nearby immediately rejected the idea: \"The deputy director is arrogant and proud. Saying this would be like slapping him in the face.\"","The old station director was about to retire.","The deputy director had taken over many of the station's affairs.","Those with keen eyes didn't dare to offend him.","Because he would be the future station director, and offending him would lead to no good outcomes.","If it were in the past, Little Mei wouldn't want to offend him either, but now she couldn't afford to worry about that. After some thought, she said, \"Then I'll go to the old station director.\"","Skipping levels to report was a major taboo in any workplace.","But at this point, there was no time to worry about such things.","If the old station director didn't take charge of the situation, there would really be big trouble.","Others might not know, but she was clear about it.","The legal team of Lin Group was top-tier in the industry.","She had previously signed a contract and even stamped it with the company seal.","Now that things had turned out this way, forget about making money, they might even have to pay compensation.","Little Mei immediately went to make contact.","Meanwhile, Shen Wei's show was starting.","Soon, the TV station began the live broadcast.","Indeed, the camera positions were much more professional than at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Along with various lighting setups.","The host was reading the opening lines.","Fans gradually entered the live streaming room.","They had been following the culinary competition for some time.","They were very familiar with this show.","Liu Chef sat upright on stage, looking very serious.","But many fans in the live stream could see that he was nervous, with sweat forming on his forehead.","\"He's practically acting out my life. I get just as nervous every time I face a big occasion.\"","When the camera turned to Shen Wei, everyone was struck by her beauty.","\"So beautiful!\"","\"Damn that scoundrel Gu Qingyan, draw your sword! Shen Wei is mine alone.\"","\"Great, another one's gone crazy.\"","Everyone was laughing and joking. The host from Cake TV Station was rapidly reciting the advertisements for the title sponsors.","His broadcasting had been professionally trained, so no matter how fast he spoke, you could clearly hear what he was saying.","But there were so many of these sponsors.","With his rapid speech, it took a full three minutes.","The online viewers in the live stream couldn't help but give likes in support: \"Wow, that's one long tongue twister!\"","\"What an impressive tongue.\"","\"If I had such an impressive tongue, I wouldn't be left speechless when my colleagues confront me.\"","Then, a large logo rose up on the entire venue, displaying a brand of soybean oil.","Shen Wei frowned. She looked around but didn't see the Gu Corporation logo.","They were supposed to be the title sponsor here.","Could the TV station have made such a significant blunder?","Just as she was thinking this, they began introducing the experts.","All the judges were friends of Liu Chef from before.","Now serving as TV judges, they were all dressed very formally like Liu Chef.","When their names were called, each chef would stand up and wave normally.","The audience began to cheer and scream wildly.","This made the chefs a bit nervous.","Then it was announced that the first dish would be braised abalone with sauce.","The contestants knew about this beforehand. The TV station had notified them.","The TV station had consulted with culinary masters in the industry to do their homework.","This time, they weren't using fresh abalone.","Instead, they were using dried abalone, with ten pieces per head.","The process of rehydrating them had taken more than five days.","The rehydrated abalone were larger than a man's fist.","They had turned slightly white from soaking, and when squeezed, had just the right softness – these were excellent quality abalone.","To eat this level of abalone in a restaurant, you couldn't order it for less than a few thousand yuan.","The time limit was set at an hour and a half.","The timer started.","Everyone began to process their ingredients.","Soon, Jiang Xun was seen picking up the abalone and starting to prepare it.","He thoroughly cleaned off the gills and teeth of the abalone. Then he began to slice it.","The most important part of braised abalone with sauce was the sauce itself.","The other contestants were even more nervous in front of the cameras than last time.","The show only provided one abalone per person, so if they ruined it, there was no chance for a do-over.","Cameras frantically moved through the crowd.","Everyone had their own secret recipe, and since the abalone had been announced beforehand, some contestants had secretly practiced for a while.","But faced with the actual challenge, they were still a bit nervous. In comparison, Jiang Xun seemed much more composed.","This was a dish that required skill. Previously, there was an old master chef who was particularly good at making abalone. He was invited to Ao City to specialize in abalone dishes, and it was said that his technique had been listed as intangible cultural heritage.","Many people visited just to taste that tender, umami flavor.","If abalone isn't prepared well, it has no taste, and everything is ruined.","So, with such large abalone, both the cooking time and flavor were crucial.","An average chef who hadn't made it before wouldn't dare to try.","As expected of a TV station program, they were playing for high stakes from the very first round.","The others whispered and watched the contestants below.","These chefs were a bit nervous when they first arrived at the TV station.","But seeing everyone start to work in an orderly manner, they relaxed.","Liu Chef had been watching Jiang Xun the whole time. Among all the people present, he admired this young talent.","He seemed very calm and collected while preparing the dish.","He was truly a young man with solid foundational skills. Whether it was frying, braising, or making the sauce, every movement was pleasing to the eye, as if everything was under his complete control.","His composure made the others seem flustered in comparison.","Time passed minute by minute.","Soon, the abalone dishes were ready.","When the final bell rang, everyone brought their finished dishes to be presented.","The most joyous moment for these judges had finally arrived.","One by one, they could go up and taste the dishes.","Shen Wei, as a special guest, was also allowed to participate in the tasting.","They sampled each abalone dish, with every piece cut into small chunks.","As they savored each bite, every dish had its own unique flavor.","Although Shen Wei couldn't cook herself, she had tasted and seen many dishes in her daily life. Some dishes tasted bland, others were slightly undercooked, and some lacked proper seasoning.","However, when she tasted Jiang Xun's dish, her heart skipped a beat.","It was on a completely different level compared to the others.","After the scoring, Jiang Xun's dish received the highest marks."]},{"number":178,"title":"Chapter 178: Last Class Just Last Class","paragraphs":["As expected of someone who was once carefully groomed for years as Si Jing's successor, he truly had some skills.","The culinary world also had a sense of respecting strength.","Previously, when it came to the incident between him and his master, many people stood by idly.","They didn't want to offend the elder members of the circle for the sake of a young man.","But if he had this level of cooking skill, that would be a different story altogether.","Not only did Liu Chef approve, but the other 9 judges were also impressed.","This meant that no matter where Jiang Xun went,","He already had a bright future ahead of him. The second dish was decided by drawing lots.","Jiang Xun drew \"Buddha Jumps Over the Wall,\" and then everyone brought over the prepared ingredients for him.","The ingredients provided by the TV station were certainly not as luxurious as what he might have prepared himself.","But the basic components of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall—small ham, fish maw, dried bamboo shoots, and pork belly—were all there.","There was only a two-hour time limit on site. This put considerable pressure on Jiang Xun.","The slow-cooking process was crucial for Buddha Jumps Over the Wall.","Due to the limitations of ingredients and time, this second round of competition was much more challenging than the first video round. This was the elimination round to narrow down from 50 to 40 contestants.","Some others drew simple home-style dishes.","Some drew specific dishes from the eight major Chinese cuisines, which made everyone even more nervous.","Jiang Xun picked up the knife skillfully and began to cut. His knife skills were impeccable, showcasing solid fundamentals.","The ingredients were neatly arranged.","Finally, he placed them one by one into the clay pot and started cooking on low heat. However, the cooking time for each ingredient varied, so he set his timer accordingly.","To create a golden, thick, and sweet broth, combined with the freshness of various ingredients,","And to remove any unpleasant odors,","Was inherently quite challenging.","Add to that the two-hour time limit,","And making Buddha Jumps Over the Wall became somewhat nerve-wracking.","It usually takes at least four hours to fully bring out the rich flavors.","Just an hour and a half had passed.","When the aroma began to playfully escape from the edges of the pot.","It spread wildly throughout the entire venue.","There were three people in total who had drawn Buddha Jumps Over the Wall this time.","The tantalizing aroma made many of the TV station staff's stomachs growl.","They truly experienced the power of Buddha Jumps Over the Wall, understanding why it earned such a name.","A chef nearby whispered to Liu Chef, \"Just smelling this, you know it's a sure thing.\"","\"This young man is really impressive. Has he agreed to go to Starry Sky Kindergarten?\" the person probed indirectly.","This competition was hosted by Starry Sky Kindergarten.","It was also to select chefs for the opening of their second branch.","This wasn't a secret in their circle.","If even they were impressed by someone like Jiang Xun, let alone Liu Chef.","Liu Chef knew this was his old friend testing him. He gave a vague reply, \"Hmm, hmm.\"","Then quickly changed the subject.","While they were talking, others were listening intently. Hearing Liu Chef's response, they were slightly disappointed. They then turned their attention back to the other contestants, hoping to find some other promising talents.","Then they noticed the dessert girl.","Earlier, for the braised abalone dish, she had made sliced abalone in sauce. It was flavorful,","But the presentation wasn't traditional enough. So she didn't score very high.","This time she had drawn Buddha Jumps Over the Wall, and everyone became curious. They wanted to know how she would approach it.","What happened next left everyone stunned.","She actually recreated Buddha Jumps Over the Wall as a cake.","Netizens were all bewildered: \"Is this even allowed?\"","\"Isn't this exploiting a loophole in the rules?\"","\"Whatever you think, you have to admit it's impressive.\"","\"Her Buddha Jumps Over the Wall looks exactly like the real thing, but it's actually a sweet cake. Somehow, I still feel like it would go well with a bowl of rice.\"","\"Just how skilled is this girl? She's amazing!\"","\"If it were me, I would never have thought of such an idea.\"","\"Didn't you all do your research before coming? This girl has been praised by world-renowned pastry masters and has participated in international competitions before.\"","\"Wow, this is the first time I'm hearing about this.\"","Everyone was shocked by the dessert girl's bold move.","Then, when no one was paying attention, a staff member quietly called Shen Wei aside.","As Shen Wei stood up, Liu Chef noticed.","Shen Wei said, \"It's nothing, I'll just go check it out.\"","Only then did Liu Chef relax.","When Shen Wei went over, she saw Little Mei.","Little Mei had a serious expression and said, \"I'm sorry!\" This matter was a bit difficult for her to bring up.","Shen Wei immediately said, \"Is it about the title sponsor issue?\"","Little Mei was surprised by Shen Wei's sharp intuition.","She had discovered the problem so quickly after it had just occurred.","Knowing it couldn't be hidden anymore, she said, \"Yes!\" Then she explained the situation with the deputy station director's unilateral decision.","\"I'm not telling you this to seek your forgiveness, but to try and resolve this issue!\"","Lin Rui had a fiery temper, and Little Mei feared the situation would be hard to control if she found out.","The current popularity had far exceeded their expectations.","The number of online fans had surged by 300,000, which was a significant force for an old-guard TV station that had fallen out of the top 10.","Many sister stations had started sending congratulatory messages.","This was exactly the goal she had hoped to achieve from the beginning.","The deputy station director's actions made it difficult for her to face her old friends.","As they were talking, Lin Rui's voice suddenly rose, \"What do you mean? Our title sponsor has been changed?\" Her voice was extremely cold.","Little Mei's surprised reaction confirmed Lin Rui's guess.","Then Lin Rui's anger erupted, \"I was coming over to say hello when I overheard you talking. And what did I hear?\"","The contract had been signed very carefully initially.","She could have done it herself.","She had freely given the TV station a boost in popularity. Now they were abandoning her after using her.","Little Mei said, \"It's not like that!\"","It was actually an internal matter that had affected external affairs.","Now that things had gone wrong, she had to come and clean up the mess.","Little Mei suggested, \"Why don't we arrange a dinner with the deputy station director to resolve this issue?\"","She still wanted to use a more gentle approach to solve the problem. She was at her wit's end now.","The old station director couldn't be reached, and the deputy director was arrogant and domineering. Now that Lin Rui was angry, her gaze became increasingly pleading. After all, they had grown up together since childhood. She had to give her some face.","Lin Rui was very angry, but seeing Little Mei's pleading look, she said, \"Fine. I'll give him this one chance.\"","She then said to Shen Wei, \"Don't worry about this.\" She had long since prepared for every contingency. If things went smoothly, that would be ideal. If not, she had ten thousand ways to deal with them.","Fortunately, she hadn't relied solely on goodwill when signing the contract. These days, anyone could potentially be a scammer.","When they initially signed the contract, it had been extremely detailed.","She never expected to actually encounter a situation where a big business would bully its customers. Since that was the case, she'd teach them a lesson."]},{"number":179,"title":"Chapter 179: Being Manipulated by Others","paragraphs":["Lin Rui was already furious. Little Mei tried her best to calm her down, barely managing to suppress the raging fire in her heart.","Little Mei's palms were sweaty as she briefly explained the situation to the Deputy Director via WeChat, hoping they could meet in person to discuss it.","The influence of Starry Sky Kindergarten, as well as the capabilities of the Lin Family and Shen Wei, were well-known to all.","Although they had made a mistake, as long as they actively clarified the situation, given Lin Rui's straightforward nature, it shouldn't be too serious an issue.","She thought it was a good plan.","Sending a message to the Deputy Director in advance was to prevent him from losing face, as he was, after all, a superior.","There was no problem that couldn't be solved over a meal.","Little Mei sent the WeChat message.","But there was no reply.","Soon, someone nearby informed her that the Deputy Director was in his office.","She could sense that Lin Rui's anger was reaching a boiling point, so she steeled herself and said, \"Then I'll take you to his office to find him.\"","Shen Wei knew that Lin Rui had always been quite strong-willed.","She had been personally involved in this matter from the beginning.","They had hoped that broadcasting on the TV station would expand Starry Sky Kindergarten's influence.","But unexpectedly, the TV station was being two-faced.","The broadcast had already garnered massive viewership.","Now they had switched out their title sponsor, clearly intending to betray them after using them.","Shen Wei was angry too.","But seeing Lin Rui's face turn pale, she couldn't help but try to comfort her: \"Why don't I go instead?\"","Lin Rui refused: \"You stay here and keep an eye on things. I want to see what he's trying to do.\"","If they wanted to steal the fruits of others' labor,","They'd have to see if she'd allow it.","They only wanted to look good, and moreover, they had signed a contract with an official seal.","Now saying they wanted to back out, playing the \"big store bullying the customer\" trick was truly disgusting.","Lin Rui stormed towards the Deputy Director's office, fuming with rage.","The Deputy Director had several capable subordinates in the station.","With such a commotion, it certainly wouldn't escape others' notice.","So various rumors began spreading through mobile phones to different places.","By the time Little Mei brought Lin Rui to the Deputy Director's office door,","The office door was locked from the inside, and they could hear the Deputy Director's voice inside.","But after knocking, the person inside wouldn't open the door.","At first, they knocked gently.","Then the knocking became louder and louder.","But the person inside acted as if they were deaf.","There was no sign of them intending to open the door.","Even the surrounding colleagues began to take notice.","Little Mei had managed to bring Lin Rui here with great difficulty, hoping to resolve the issue.","Who would have thought the Deputy Director would use this tactic? His refusal to communicate made Lin Rui laugh bitterly: \"So this is the caliber of your Deputy Director.\"","Little Mei immediately dialed the Deputy Director's number.","The call connected but was immediately hung up, three times in a row.","Little Mei was also angry now, knocking hard on the door, but the person inside stubbornly refused to open it.","Lin Rui was completely speechless.","Since returning from her studies abroad, and with her status as the Lin Corporation heiress, it had been years since anyone had given her the cold shoulder like this.","Today's incident was truly infuriating.","Lin Rui patted Little Mei's shoulder: \"It's not that I don't want to give you face!\"","As she said this, Little Mei's heart sank.","Clearly, Lin Rui was suppressing her anger.","Little Mei hadn't expected the Deputy Director to be this kind of person either.","What could have been clarified in a few words","Had now escalated the conflict.","Let alone Lin Rui, who had never been treated this way before, even Little Mei felt a hint of anger rising.","Little Mei said, \"I'm really sorry about this.\"","Lin Rui laughed coldly and turned to leave.","Lin Rui went back to find Shen Wei.","Seeing her return so quickly, Shen Wei knew the visit must not have gone well: \"How did it go?\"","Lin Rui said, \"I guess we'll have to let him experience the power of our legal team!\" Fortunately, she had been cautious when signing the contract.","\"Do whatever you think is necessary!\" Shen Wei said.","After all, Gu Corporation had invested 100 million.","They had repeatedly confirmed the title sponsorship issue with them.","At the time, they had agreed.","Now that things had turned out this way, Shen Wei wasn't a pushover either.","Since they had provoked them, they would have to bear the risks that came with it.","Lin Rui nodded.","Both of their expressions were grave.","The competition at the venue was still in full swing.","The chefs on stage were still focused on the contestants, completely unaware of what had just transpired.","As the two were talking, Shen Wei's phone rang. She answered to find it was Doctor Lu calling: \"Quick, check Weibo. The TV station is throwing shade at you guys.\"","Shen Wei's phone volume was quite loud.","Lin Rui, standing nearby, could also hear it.","Before Shen Wei could hang up, Lin Rui immediately took out her phone and opened the TV station's Weibo.","From the initial few thousand followers to now 350,000, Starry Sky Kindergarten's promotion had been crucial.","The latest post was from 5 minutes ago.","It read: \"All our staff have been working tirelessly in three shifts, day and night, all for the sake of making this show look good.\"","\"We never expected a certain kindergarten to obstruct our continued activities over some money issues, and even cause a scene in the Director's office. We really have to question the quality of some enterprises?\"","This statement all but named Starry Sky Kindergarten directly.","Previously, most of the organic traffic for this show came from Starry Sky Kindergarten, many being longtime fans of the kindergarten.","This time, with the upgraded platform, the old fans felt a sense of pride.","The show's popularity was at its peak today.","Unexpectedly, they saw the kindergarten being criticized.","One comment stood out particularly:","\"Just because you're an internet celebrity, you start making all sorts of demands? Your vision is too narrow. Getting to work with a TV station is a stroke of luck you might not see in several lifetimes. Don't throw away your future prospects over money!\"","The editor had prominently liked this reply.","Suddenly, the discord between Starry Sky Kindergarten and the baking show was seized upon by public accounts.","In an instant, there was a flood of inquiries, insults, and defenses for Starry Sky Kindergarten. The situation quickly became chaotic.","This undoubtedly added more heat to the show.","But it made Lin Rui's blood boil. They were truly shameless, mastering the art of the guilty party filing the suit first.","What did they mean by \"causing a scene\"? They couldn't even enter the Deputy Director's office earlier.","They were made to look like fools outside.","While they played their palace intrigues inside, they had their editor publicly insinuate things. This was nothing short of a declaration of war.","If she didn't slap them in the face for this, Lin Rui would write her name backwards.","Lin Rui immediately left the place.","As she walked away, many people's eyes were secretly glancing at her.","Evidently, a conflict had arisen between the production team and the television station, and everyone was now aware of it.","Both sides were unhappy and ready to compete. The kindergarten's fan base had already exceeded 1 million.","For such a niche field, having a million fans was already quite impressive.","Moreover, the kindergarten's fans were very dedicated, including many wealthy supporters.","As soon as Lin Rui and Shen Wei left,","someone immediately informed the Deputy Director about the situation.","The Deputy Director remained calm and collected.","He thought, \"So what if they're powerful now?\"","The internet was a double-edged sword that anyone could wield.","The Deputy Director had studied psychology before and knew that people loved to join in on the excitement, not minding the drama.","The more successful someone was, the more people wanted to pull them down from their high position."]},{"number":180,"title":"Chapter 180: Still Capable","paragraphs":["The Deputy Director immediately called the person in charge of the operations team and said, \"Well done this time! Give the editor a 500 yuan raise this month.\"","The operations team on the other end of the line was excited.","After all, departments like theirs...","They hadn't had access to leadership at the Deputy Director level before.","These were all valuable connections.","As long as they handled this matter well...","Once the Deputy Director was officially promoted, they would undoubtedly become his core team.","In a complex job market, choosing the right side was crucial.","\"Your next priority is to keep a close eye on Starry Sky Kindergarten. If anything happens, crush them immediately.\"","The operations team expressed understanding: \"I'm aware of this. We have seven or eight public accounts that we collaborate with. If they dare to refute, we'll immediately use these accounts to muddy the waters.\"","The Deputy Director said, \"You're doing well, very capable. I'll remember you.\"","With these words from the leader, the operations team was overjoyed, their smiles reaching from ear to ear.","\"Don't worry, I'll do my best!\" The Deputy Director, not in the mood for small talk, hung up immediately.","...","Previously, Shen Wei had always written the clarification posts for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","But this time, Lin Rui took the lead. She didn't even have time to go back and write a script.","She set up her phone in the car and recorded a video, explaining the ins and outs of the whole situation.","The accusation of causing a scene in the director's office was completely fabricated.","The other party had violated the contract by removing their title sponsorship.","So far, all the competition rules had been developed by Starry Sky Kindergarten.","They had helped grow so many followers, and now the other side was burning bridges.","This was going too far, and the legal department would follow up immediately.","She also warned in the video that the compensation wouldn't be a small amount, and hoped the Deputy Director would take a good look at the contract.","After recording, she posted it right away.","As soon as it was posted, there were already over 100 comments.","By the time she refreshed after posting, there were already 1,000 comments.","\"First row seats!\"","\"Taking a picture to remember this moment.\"","\"Leaving my mark before reading.\"","\"I knew Starry Sky Kindergarten wouldn't let me down. I've been quiet, just waiting for their statement.\"","As soon as they posted, the TV station saw it too. They wanted to continue smearing, but when it came to the contract issue, the operations team thought it over and called the Deputy Director again.","The Deputy Director frowned, \"What contract? I never signed such a contract!\"","He didn't want to acknowledge the existence of this contract.","But the operations team was still cautious and asked him to watch Lin Rui's video before saying anything more.","After watching, the Deputy Director became furious.","He quickly asked his assistant to bring the contract over. After carefully reading it, he realized the other party had been deeply calculating, having written all these terms into the contract in advance.","How insidious.","He immediately called Little Mei, wanting to question her about what was going on.","Why did they sign such a humiliating agreement?","They were a TV station.","Were all their time and effort just to benefit others?","...","Little Mei, also from a wealthy family, had quite a temper.","She had already offended Lin Rui for the sake of the station.","Even her best friend thought she had made a mistake.","Now, as the Deputy Director's call came through, ringing once, then twice...","Little Mei was furious. Hadn't the Deputy Director refused to open his door earlier? This time, let him experience what it feels like when no one answers the phone.","The phone kept ringing until it automatically hung up.","The Deputy Director couldn't believe it and continued to call. But still, no one answered.","The comments below were full of angry voices: \"Well, well, I'm witnessing a live demonstration of 'big store bullying customers'.\"","\"They've already signed a contract, and they still dare to act so crazy. I can't imagine how badly they'd bully people without power or influence.\"","\"I came here for Starry Sky Kindergarten, who knew things would turn out so disgusting.\"","\"Wow, as someone in academia, I really empathize. You work overtime to create something, and then others steal your achievements and use their power to silence you. They have legal contracts to protect themselves, but we can only endure silently, after all, our future and livelihood are in their hands.\"","\"I get it now, I'm thoroughly disgusted. I won't watch this show anymore.\"","\"Right, let's boycott this show.\"","\"To be honest, I was quite interested in this culinary competition. It's been years since we've seen a chef competition!\"","\"Are there any other TV stations interested in buying this show?\"","\"Sister, I think it's possible. Why don't we take the initiative to contact other TV stations?\"","Those saying this were definitely fans of Starry Sky Kindergarten, and everyone started to take action.","It immediately shot up to the top few trending topics.","There hadn't been any explosive news in the entertainment circle recently.","Compared to some other more boring news, this topic clearly had higher heat. A TV station bullying an online celebrity kindergarten with 1 million followers showed just how domineering the station was.","When this trending topic directly climbed to fifth place, suddenly a mysterious force began to make its heat instantly slide down to the teens.","Lin Rui, who had been monitoring the internet throughout, knew this was unusual.","She immediately had someone investigate, and sure enough, it was the TV station's people lowering the trending topic.","These trending spots were very expensive. To lower it once would cost at least seven figures.","Lin Rui immediately said, \"Keep buying!\"","She didn't lack money, and this would come from her own account.","As some bought, others withdrew.","It suddenly turned into a battle of the gods.","The trending topic was seen fluctuating like it was having a fit.","One moment it would jump forward a dozen places, the next it would retreat just as many.","Others started recording their screens, as they hadn't seen such a situation in years.","The Old Station Director was in charge of lowering the trending topic for the TV station.","But the cost was getting higher and higher, and he could no longer handle it.","After spending several million, the topic still hadn't been lowered.","Sweat was already forming on the operations team's forehead.","It would lower slightly, then start exploding upwards again.","This time, they felt they had met their match.","They immediately called the Old Station Director to ask for instructions: \"What should we do now?\"","After all, they were a TV station, and they really didn't have as much money to move around as Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The Old Station Director immediately tried to contact Little Mei.","But after being taught a lesson by the TV station, Little Mei wouldn't even give face to the Old Station Director, still not answering his calls.","There was no way out. Afterward, everyone tried to contact Shen Wei using the phone number in the contract, hoping to resolve this matter peacefully.","Shen Wei was with Lin Rui.","Lin Rui saw them frantically calling from the other end and sneered. Now they knew to be afraid? If only they had known this would happen, why did they act that way before?","Shen Wei didn't answer these calls either, so they kept trying.","Finally, they felt what it was like to be at someone else's mercy, like fish on a chopping block.","In just one day, the TV station's reputation took a complete 180-degree turn. This was something no one had anticipated."]},{"number":181,"title":"Chapter 181: Respectable is Fake","paragraphs":["The Old Station Director of Cake TV held a place of high esteem in everyone's hearts.","Many of the middle-aged core staff still at Cake TV were personally promoted by the Old Station Director, including Little Mei.","Little Mei always felt a sense of gratitude towards the Old Station Director for recognizing her talents.","This time, it was also the Old Station Director who saw potential in the culinary competition show.","After all, it was a crucial moment for the TV station to transition into the internet era.","Many major TV stations had already successfully made the transition, with 800-900 million young people currently active online in China.","Those meager TV ratings seemed hardly worth looking at anymore.","Cake TV had its moments of glory in the past.","A few years ago, their in-studio variety shows had led the trends for a while.","That was considered Cake TV's most glorious period.","But over the past decade, Cake TV had been on a steady decline.","It was clearly on a downward slope.","They had tried to utilize the internet before.","But no matter how much money they poured in, it always seemed to disappear without a trace.","After several attempts, everyone gradually lost hope.","This time, the Old Station Director saw that the online popularity was genuinely high.","The number of judges and applicants was particularly impressive.","However, when it came to production and filming, things seemed a bit rough.","There was indeed a noticeable gap compared to what their professional team could produce.","Upon inquiry, they learned that Lin Rui was behind it.","Lin Rui's Lin Family belonged to the same local wealthy circle as Little Mei.","When she came over with the intention of bringing the show under her wing, she brought along plenty of sincerity.","They wanted to use this popularity to help the TV station transition.","But who would have thought that after everything had been agreed upon, as the popularity grew, people's attitudes began to shift.","The Old Station Director handed these matters over to the Deputy Director.","When Little Mei called, although the Old Station Director didn't answer, he learned about the situation from someone who was online.","He couldn't be bothered to deal with these issues anymore; young people making a fuss, it was all trivial to him.","The Old Station Director had worked within the system for so long.","His thinking had become somewhat rigid, completely unaware that it was now time for young people to reshape the workplace.","He thought that even if they faced some unfair treatment, they would find various ways to voice their concerns.","They would work through layers of obstacles to ultimately achieve their goals.","But now, Lin Rui had chosen to confront the issue head-on, which was beyond everyone's imagination.","Upon learning of the situation, the Old Station Director immediately called Little Mei, but to his surprise, she didn't answer.","This left even the Old Station Director somewhat incredulous.","By the time the Old Station Director managed to find Little Mei, she had already packed up and resigned. He didn't even get to see her in person.","For Little Mei, staying at Cake TV was originally about repaying some of the Old Station Director's kindness.","But after a series of events, she realized she had been too naive.","They were all just employees, what kindness was there to speak of?","The other party promoted her because they valued her abilities and family background.","Since everyone had their own agendas, there was no point in talking about who owed whom.","This time, she felt she had let down her good friend Lin Rui.","Such immense popularity.","In internet terms, a fortune beyond measure had been handed to Cake TV.","Now Cake TV was publicly using their social media team to make snide remarks about others, how could she hold her head high when facing her old friend?","Moreover, she discovered that the Old Station Director wasn't as good as she thought. It was all an act.","He and the Deputy Director were cut from the same cloth.","One played good cop, the other bad cop.","It wouldn't be surprising if they had planned it all beforehand.","This time, the Old Station Director and the Deputy Director had taught her a lesson.","Lin Rui had blocked all of Little Mei's contact methods.","Now Little Mei's world was in chaos – she had lost her job, lost her good friend, and she didn't want to deal with this mess anymore, so she simply resigned.","Cake TV was a very large organization.","Including interns, there were several hundred employees, with talent coming and going, which wasn't important to the station.","When Little Mei resigned, the leadership only made a token effort to persuade her to stay.","Seeing her firm resolve, they signed her resignation papers.","After all, the leadership had been somewhat uncomfortable with Little Mei, a second-generation rich kid playing at work. Now that she left on her own, they felt more at ease.","By the time the Old Station Director came back looking for Little Mei, he learned that she had already resigned.","As soon as the Old Station Director returned, the Deputy Director hurriedly invited him to his office.","Along the way, many people stared, and they could hear whispers around them.","After all, this was a place of intense competition.","This time, with the incident occurring, there was no shortage of spectators.","\"What are we going to do now?\" The Deputy Director was getting anxious.","They quickly closed the office door after entering: \"Uncle, please say something.\"","The relationship between the Deputy Director and the Old Station Director wasn't like the typical superior-subordinate relationship people might imagine.","The Old Station Director had watched him grow up since he was a child.","Although they weren't relatives, their families had been close for twenty or thirty years.","It was an iron-clad network of relationships.","That's why the Deputy Director was able to stand out among so many excellent competitors.","To become the designated next station director.","The Deputy Director had often offended people in the office before.","But the Old Station Director had managed to eliminate most of his so-called opposing forces through various means.","Now the Old Station Director was planning to retire and enjoy his golden years.","Who would have thought his \"good nephew\" would cause such a big mess?","The Deputy Director was now as anxious as an ant on a hot pan. He had seen the comments online, which were a deluge of abuse.","Most people couldn't withstand this.","Every time he saw so many people start to attack him, his whole body trembled with anger.","His heart felt like it was suddenly gripped by a large hand.","People who haven't experienced it can't imagine what it feels like to be maliciously abused online.","It's a suffocating feeling that comes with just one glance.","As for the social media editor who made the post, he couldn't even look at the backend now.","All kinds of insults were coming in faster than he could delete them.","He had no idea that a mere kindergarten could wield such power.","At this moment, the Deputy Director was still rambling on: \"If only we hadn't collaborated with them!\"","Under this kind of institutional setup, they didn't seek to achieve great things, but rather to avoid making mistakes.","With this kind of incident, how could he hold his head up?","The Old Station Director, seeing his constant complaints, was also getting a bit impatient.","But after all, old ginger is spicier: \"I heard Little Mei resigned. What kind of leadership are you providing? She was a crucial person.\"","The Deputy Director had secretly rejoiced upon hearing that Little Mei was planning to resign. He believed that someone who didn't follow orders should indeed leave.","But now, hearing the Old Station Director say, \"She must have realized the mess this incident would cause, so she's resigning to take responsibility,\" the Deputy Director was shocked.","The Old Station Director gave the Deputy Director a long, evaluating look.","It seemed that after playing office politics for too long, the Deputy Director could no longer distinguish between the big players and the small fry."]},{"number":182,"title":"Chapter 182: The Mess","paragraphs":["The Old Station Director looks at the mess before him, urgently needing someone to solve it.","Yet the Deputy Director's mind is filled with complaints.","Over the years, having had it easy, suddenly having everything thrust onto him has brought out all the underlying issues.","One can scheme, as long as it remains within the rules.","But now that the other side has turned the tables completely disregarding the rules, there's no control.","All rants now only signal powerlessness.","The Old Station Director said: “We need to issue a statement now saying it was an intern's doing.”","He knows that many will mock this statement.","But with no other viable options, a small price to cover up the matter is the most crucial thing.","The Deputy Director, however, is still a bit angry.","“Initially, Little Mei signed such a contract without my consent. Her misconduct should be investigated. Do they really think we are pushovers here?”","Now, both sides are holding back, each assuming that the first to back down will lose.","The Deputy Director has always been a stickler for face-saving. How could he bow down and admit to the mistake?","The Old Station Director said: “I was about to retire.”","He didn't want to handle these troubles.","The older one gets, the less they want to invite trouble.","But now that the problem has occurred, it must be solved instantly.","The Old Station Director looked at the Deputy Director with disappointment, “You've been handling this for just a short while, and look at the mess you've created.”","“Uncle, how can you talk like that?” The other side seemed hurt.","The Old Station Director let out a deep sigh, “It's up to you, youngsters. If you don't listen to me, then do as you please!”","His voice quivered as he spoke, a clear sign that he was furious.","But the Deputy Director, immersed in his own anger, didn’t notice even when the Old Station Director had left.","The Deputy Director quickly told the operations team: “Don’t worry about those. All publicity is good publicity. If things get too heated, just ignore the comments.”","He had made up his mind.","Soon after, everyone noticed that the online backlash escalated further against Starry Sky Kindergarten, accusing them of double standards.","Netizens were completely outraged.","“This guy is shameless, just like my former boss.”","“Even a child knows to stand up straight when getting disciplined, why is he still arguing?”","“I hope he keeps this up; the last one who argued with netizens was beaten to death.”","“He's been in a high position for too long. Speaks like a real father figure!”","The matters escalated online.","Leadership directly asked the Deputy Director: “What exactly happened with this incident? Why darken our station's reputation?”","For other matters, the Deputy Director might've made up useless excuses.","But with this being the inquiry from higher-ups, he immediately showed respect.","He explained the incident thoroughly.","With an air of being wronged, he said: “We were fooled by them!” Acting like an aggrieved wife.","The higher-ups said: “Regardless, you need to mitigate this incident's added influence immediately. No wonder the Old Station Director washed his hands off this. If you insist on behaving recklessly, then I won't be bothered either.”","The Deputy Director sensed the underlying warning in the leader’s words and tensed up, \"What's going on?\" The Old Station Director had always been his safety net.","\"You don't know yet? He took early retirement!\" The leader announced. The man had tactfully distanced himself from the matter.","The Deputy Director had met the Old Station Director that very day and he had not expected that the Old Station Director would leave him in the lurch so abruptly, causing him to tremble with anger.","His most reliable ally had abandoned him. This unsettled him greatly. \"What am I going to do?\" he asked the leader.","\"You need to accept your mistakes immediately\", said the leader, having the wisdom of a broader perspective. It was now futile for him to continue arguing with the netizens.","Rather, it would only provoke them even more. It would be best if he was honest and accepted his fault.","Finally, the Deputy Director publicly released a video in which he frowned and read out a scripted apology. His tone did not waver, and he took pauses to apologize to the netizens.","\"I apologize. This incident occurred due to my negligence, which allowed an intern an opportunity to cause harm,\" he spoke.","\"He may have acted out of spite towards the society and leveraged this platform for his own agenda.\"","\"We have fired the intern and will manage our staff more strictly in the future.\"","\"We will ensure that our employees do not bring personal emotions to work, and we hope the netizens will keep us under strict supervision.\"","Though the Deputy Director thought he was humbling himself and admitting his fault, the netizens remained unimpressed.","\"He's not sincere at all. I can't even...\", one user commented.","\"He reminds me of my garbage ex-boyfriend who always said 'I was wrong, okay?' but that only made me more angry.\"","\"Look at his furrowed brows. It's obvious that he doesn't think he did anything wrong. I bet he's cursing us behind our backs!\"","\"I have studied microexpressions. He's insincere. And his eyes moved unnaturally, as if he was reading from a prompter.\"","\"Why is he using a teleprompter to apologize? He thinks he's some kind of big shot?\"","\"Continue the boycott.\"","The situation escalated by evening.","With no other option, they made the TV station's Weibo page inaccessible to comments.","But the sheer number of mentions was overwhelming. The contemporary netizens were rebellious.","The more the TV station tried to ignore the issue, the more they were harassed.","The TV station desperately attempted to come to an agreement with Shen Wei. But Shen Wei's side was not to be appeased.","To Shen Wei's defense, their person was bullied and the station had the audacity to muster different liaison tactics. This was downright shameless.","This time, the TV station was genuinely scared.","At first, they underestimated Shen Wei as a mere internet personality.","But now they realized the extent of Shen Wei's fan base and their collective power.","Moreover, some local magnates were also among Shen Wei's fans.","Once they learned about the shady dealings between Cake station and the Man in Star, many sponsors promptly withdrew their funding.","Even those who were about to sign contracts halted their process.","Companies took their own initiative to stand up for Shen Wei which nobody saw coming.","The slandering online had already infuriated the Deputy Director, but the withdrawal of sponsors was a real sting.","Sponsors were responsible for more than 90% of the station’s income.","Those were their real gold mines.","During normal times, they didn't dare to offend a single individual.","When dealings with the big shots arose, even the Director and Deputy Director had to personally accompany them.","Now, the television station's staff was in a state of chaos.","Even those who had previously held prejudices started collaborating together.","They'd decided on a plan: to sacrifice a Deputy Director, to pacify everyone's anger.","Only the Deputy Director was still clueless about the fact that he had been selected as the scapegoat."]},{"number":183,"title":"Chapter 183: More Serious Issues","paragraphs":["The power dynamics within the television station were rather strict.","It was doubtful whether they’d win this fight, had not the bigwigs taken collective action.","Their biggest fear was that the advertisers would withdraw en masse, which would affect the station's revenue for the upcoming year.","The outrage on the networks didn't seem that big of a deal to the Old Station Director. If a simple intern could quell the majority of the unrest, then what would be the impact of \"Starry Sky Kindergarten\", an Internet sensation?","They were not on the same level.","Most people would seek for peace in such situations.","However, unexpectedly, the opponents flipped the table – indeed, young people do react differently.","The Old Station Director was taught a lesson in his twilight years.","Those wealthy bigwigs siding with Shen Wei didn't do so because of her immense power.","It was because Shen Wei was one of the prominent, exceptional individuals of her generation.","They had more or less interacted with her at parties prior and felt that her accomplishment in scaling up a kindergarten to its present size in just over a year was no easy feat.","Seeing Shen Wei being bullied was akin to slapping their local tycoons - it's a matter of pride.","Hence, everyone came forward to defend her, coupled with the strength of Shen Wei, the power of the student's parents, and the hidden Gu Group.","And naturally, the situation turned into what it is today.","Netizens were also furious.","They had seen unpleasant people before, but never quite as repugnant as these people.","Outrage surged as they identified with Starry Sky Kindergarten who had over a million fans and was being treated atrociously.","Wouldn't those lesser known individuals be completely chewed and swallowed at their workplaces?","The cursing became more aggressive.","Even disabling the comment section did little to stem the tide.","Various private messages and tags flooded in.","Web users were followers of popular sentiment – when the wall falls, everyone pushes.","Observing the surge in attention, other internet celebrities joined in the condemnation which fueled the carnival-like atmosphere.","The number of posts bashing the Cake Station were overwhelming, appearing to be endless.","Cake Station, a big local TV station, and its employees enjoyed their share of the limelight.","By the same token, if they were publicly embarrassed, it would be quite a face-losing event.","Even the upper echelons of Cake Station couldn’t help but pay attention.","They had to minimize the impact of the situation.","In a well-established system like theirs, during a crisis, they could spare no cost.","So, a large number of videos attacking the TV station began to come down.","Except for the Starry Sky Kindergarten video, the comments were being deleted.","The original tens of thousands of comments were now only in the low thousands.","Their trending topic quickly quieted down.","The TV station, regardless of the cost, finally managed to suppress the trend.","They immediately dispatched someone to negotiate with Shen Wei at the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The man they sent was young and named Shi Zhong. Average in appearance, he had a peculiar charm about him.","He appeared to always greet everyone with a smile.","In Shen Wei's mind, the system was sending frantic alerts.","\"The system detects that Shi Zhong is a hidden character in the book, a new task is released. Assist Shi Zhong in standing firm in Cake Station, the reward is 20% reversal of the original plot.\"","The system soon brought up his track record.","He was like a hidden figure.","In the original book, he's caused a considerable trouble for Shen Qingqing.","In the end, Shen Qingqing couldn't topple him.","It was only after he failed to make any achievements in the city's television station and then moved abroad,","that Shen Qingqing could finally breathe a sigh of relief.","If Shi Zhong could have a firm foothold in the television station, Shen Qingqing wouldn't have had any chance of mischief.","Taking a look at Shi Zhong's resume, it was mundane and average, surprisingly causing so much trouble for Shen Qingqing.","It showed that this man was deep and cunning, and a wolf in sheep's clothing.","Shen Wei immediately had the idea to help him. The enemy of an enemy is a friend.","More so, the reward offered by the system was very generous.","The 1st time was when Lin Rui was brought in.","As Shen Qingqing's romantic rival, she shifted 15% of the plot.","The 2nd time, it was Qin Shu. As Shen Qingqing's right-hand man, he shifted another 15% of the plot.","This time, it straight up would shift 20%, meaning if this goes well, half of the original plot would change.","Shen Wei, who had been cooperating with the system for such a long time, was clear about the power of the system.","Including the reminder of getting a medical check-up for his parents.","Early stage cancer is hard to detect.","But this early warning dramatically changed Shen Wei's previous tragic fate. Therefore, this 20% reward is something that Shen Wei must win!","Later, the two went into a room to negotiate for some time.","No one knew what they were discussing.","When Shi Zhong came out, the two had a new contract.","By the time Lin Rui arrived, Shi Zhong had already left.","Angry, Lin Rui said to Shen Wei, “Even if you admit your mistakes, you should have a proper attitude. They just bring a young man over here, what does this mean?”","Shen Wei kept smiling, “Sometimes, it’s the young man who is the game-changer.”","Lin Rui did not respond.","But very soon, it seemed like there was a collective shuffling within the TV station which seemed to affirm what Shen Wei had said.","When the Old Station Director retired, the people he once promoted felt awkward.","The Deputy Director was one of the Old Station Director's men. As long as the Deputy Director could take over, they could maintain their prestige.","But who would have thought that the Deputy Director was transferred to a county television station.","Such places merely had television stations.","It was even hard to form a proper team.","A potential director of a well-established station was transferred there thus showing how much displeasure the higher-ups had towards him.","He caused a great damage to the station, both its reputation and financially.","All because of his poor decision, conflicts escalated.","The young people on the internet were collectively unhappy.","Even his colleagues were not happy.","Feeling unlucky, the Deputy Director thought that he was miserable enough.","He had no idea how to face his old friends.","After all, he had bragged a lot before.","The notice about his transfer to a county station just came down; he immediately took a year off.","Out of sight, out of mind. But who would have thought that it would cause more trouble.","He accepted bribes, but did not accomplish anything.","It's hard for a young person to get into a large station like this.","Sure, if you have real power, you can get a position, or you can just pay your way in.","People nowadays, they all want a decent job.","He took the money and was ousted.","How could those people who have spent hundreds of thousands accept it.","And so accusatory letters began to come in like snowflakes.","This time, they were accompanied by lawsuits.","Misappropriation of official funds and fraud, to top it all off.","This was already a very serious criminal issue.","They sued him directly, demanding not only that he return all the money but also that he be imprisoned.","Due to the large sum involved, he was sentenced to 10 years straight away.","When the Deputy Director received the verdict, he was gobsmacked.","He wasn't the only one doing this, so why was he the only one who was so unlucky and got locked up."]},{"number":184,"title":"Chapter 184: Young People Should Not Be Provoked","paragraphs":["The whole affair resonated like a clap of thunder.","With the retirement of the Old Station Director, and the Deputy Director’s departure, the otherwise vacant position drew covetous eyes.","Many wondered whose alliance could push their person to that position. Being the Station Director was indeed a tremendous honour.","Whoever breached this realm had already transcended the basic level.","In a surprising move, a young man was appointed; this young man was Shi Zhong.","His experience was lacking and his resume was unimpressive, which ruffled some feathers among the old hands.","With the Deputy Director position vacant, it set off everyone's imagination, all believed they were capable.","However, the appointment of an outsider gave them hope, only to take it away in swift disappointment. The shock of this huge disparity left them with a bitter taste.","Hence, grudges emerged.","Creating a TV show required a complex team.","Any single person could cause the failure of a project by not cooperating.","The older employees initially thought that this method could humiliate the new leader.","However, Shi Zhong started with three tough moves, outsourcing the work to a professional variety production team.","You guys decided not to work, didn't you? Well, there are others who would.","Upon hearing this, everyone panicked.","The cuisine battle show itself already had a tremendous following.","Coupled with the series of events that had transpired, even more fuel had been added to the fire.","Meaning, once one took part in the cuisine battle, it would be the brightest spot in their resume, whether they plan to change jobs or get promoted.","Who would have thought he would be so ruthless?","The team tried to convince him to retract his orders.","Though Shi Zhong appeared to be sarcastically cheerful and appeared amiable to everyone,","He spoke the iciest words with the warmest smile.","\"Some of the older employees are emotional and uncooperative. This matter couldn't be pushed, and my position in the station is somewhat difficult. I hope you all understand.\"","Thereupon, the anger of the others was diverted towards the older employees, successfully shifting the blame.","However, upon sober reflection, it was terrifying to realize the new Station Director's actions were childishly similar to their own – those who flip tables in dissatisfaction.","They all became docile.","After all, dealing with the Station Director was inevitable as long as they remained employed there. Thus, avoiding potential embarrassment.","When Full Star removed their previous posts, everyone could breathe a sigh of relief.","Word got around that it was the new Station Director who had approached Shen Wei to get this done.","No one knew what had been discussed, but in the end, he managed to retract the posts.","Otherwise, with the way things were escalating,","Once the show was moved to another place, for the Cake Station, it would be losing more than one battled.","After ruining the reputation and losing a popular show, just thinking about it felt suffocating.","Regardless, the controversial video was deleted on the other side, seemingly to lower the heat.","Shi Zhong's continuous moves made one wary; indeed, the leadership were not ordinary people.","Though the Old Station Director had retired,","He still heard about the happenings in his former unit.","He regretted it deeply.","Even though he didn't want to admit it, the stubborn Deputy Director was right. If they had known such an event would occur, they would have earnestly coveted the program.","Now, someone else reaped the benefits. Yes, the show was a hit, but what was the point for them both?","Television stations are a complicated place.","Even the Old Station Director, who maintains amiability from every angle, didn't manage his former employees properly.","The fact that a young man, who hasn't been on the job for long, was able to settle this complicated matter, made him ponder.","Even though the Old Station Director appears amiable, he feels superior and took a misstep with this issue.","But now even regret is useless. Having retired and even left a black mark behind, it's too late for anything.","...","Shen Wei returned to the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","He Lingfeng looked up at Shen Wei with worry in his eyes.","He felt a fledgling's affection for Shen Wei. The young boy often browsed the internet.","He watched everything happening at Starry Sky Kindergarten, revealing genuine thoughts upon seeing Shen Wei now.","He Lingfeng was a handsome boy, Shen Wei smiled and asked reason behind his frown, pinching his cheeks couldn’t help herself.","The boy was only 5 years old when he first arrived, and now he's turned 6.","Professor Liu had taken He Lingfeng to several crucial computer conferences before.","The child demonstrated astonishing talent, leaving all the big shots astounded.","They had seen plenty of geniuses, but such a young prodigy was perceived as a precious gift, especially when it came to the field of computing, where he seemed unbound in scope.","This was a significant asset in computer research.","Furthermore, to their delight, Starry Sky Kindergarten had built an excellent foundation for He Lingfeng.","At such a young age, he has already finished high school courses.","He'd even begun exploring university level knowledge.","However, university subjects being more profound and specialized, except for mathematics and computing, other subjects required slow digestion to understand.","But he was already more than capable.","Everywhere He Lingfeng went, he was hailed as a child prodigy.","Treated as something precious, no one had ever dared to pinch his cheek.","Except Shen Wei.","Seeing Shen Wei laugh, the young boy finally sighed in relief.","In the end, he offered his cheek, allowing Shen Wei to stroke it as she desires.","\"If you're unhappy, you can tell me.\" He looked at Shen Wei earnestly as he spoke in his childish tone.","Shen Wei was deeply touched.","Children have the purest hearts.","It's hard not to be moved when a child shows you their utmost sincerity.","Shen Wei too, couldn't resist, embraced the child, and said, \"Thank you, but you don't have to worry about me.\"","Having a child worrying about her, made Shen Wei feel both endearing and warm.","Being cradled in Shen Wei's arms, He Lingfeng's face softened, lay against her shoulder, and said, \"I'll grow up quickly, and then, we can do whatever we want without any fear of being bullied.\"","Shen Wei replied, \"Okay, protect me when you grow up!\"","The boy lifted his face, nodded with utmost seriousness, and said, \"I'll definitely become very strong.\"","Shen Wei couldn't resist and kissed his little face.","The boy's face turned crimson. Without knowing how to react, he decided to quietly nestle in Shen Wei's embrace, believing this moment to be particularly sweet.","No one knew where Doctor Lu could've possibly popped out from, but he did with an utterance of, \"Oh my, how shy!\"","He Lingfeng quickly pulled away from Shen Wei’s embrace. As a young man, he couldn't let others see him in such a bashful state.","He glared at Doctor Lu before departing.","Doctor Lu just laughed, seeing the whole situation as amusing and not minding getting involved. He found kids utterly delightful.","Shen Wei, fairly helpless in the face of Doctor Lu’s actions, asked, \"Why have you become so childlike now?\"","After all, he used to be the chief physician of the hospital.","His sober demeanor seemed as if it were deeply rooted in him.","Who would have thought that on stepping foot in a nursery, he’d gone to the extent of teasing the children, really showing no bounds to his casualness?"]},{"number":185,"title":"Chapter 185: Dr. Lu's Weight Loss","paragraphs":["After He Lingfeng left, Doctor Lu was overjoyed: \"The child is actually shy.\"","Usually, he always saw He Lingfeng putting on a serious face, not sure if it is because he always hangs out with the old professors. The aura he exudes is chilly and stern, unlike a kid.","It was as if through his present self, he could predict what this boy would look like in his twenties.","Only when he is around Shen Wei he would act so obediently. He would even bury his face in Shen Wei's arms.","Doctor Lu knew he was teasing, but he could not help it.","As soon as his words fell, this little guy blushed like anything, extremely shy and annoyed.","A bit amusing.","Doctor Lu looked at Shen Wei, and said: \"I am going to lose weight soon.\"","\"Ah?\" Shen Wei was somewhat taken aback: \"What happened?\" Doctor Lu usually had a great appetite and enjoyed eating. He could even eat three to four bowls of food himself.","Chef Liu liked the colleagues at the kindergarten, but his favorite was Doctor Lu!","Seeing Doctor Lu's good appetite, Chef Liu was a bit nostalgic. He said when he was young, he could also eat so much food, but now he couldn't, he was old!","Seeing that young people can eat always makes him happy.","Under Chef Liu's careful attention,","He successfully made Doctor Lu gain twenty-something pounds within a year. And after gaining weight, to tell you the truth, Doctor Lu looked ruddy, and the stomach problems and poor sleep caused by hunger when he used to work at the hospital, have been cured here.","Moreover, the fat Doctor Lu looked even more likeable, especially to children.","Doctor Lu's fatness was without any burden. But someone who loves to eat so much, today unexpectedly said he wants to lose weight: \"Why?\"","Doctor Lu touched his nose: \"Yesterday, I went to a gathering of my former colleagues.\"","As soon as he sat down, his colleagues didn't recognize him at first glance.","It took them quite a while to realize this lovely chubby guy was actually the handsome pediatrician from the past. Indeed, a weight gain can ruin everything.","The most important thing is, he used to admire a female internist at his previous unit, who entered the hospital later than him. This time, after gaining weight and facing her again, he felt slightly inferior.","Upon his return, he decided to lose weight, not aiming for six-pack abs or something, at least, he should slim down his jawline.","Otherwise, at first glance, someone might think he's just a lump of fat. What kind of appearance is that?","Shen Wei said: \"Hmm, it's okay. Just that the difficulty will be somewhat great.\"","\"It's okay, I have determination.\" It was the same when he was preparing for the college entrance examination. As long as he put forth effort, he could achieve any goal.","While the two were talking, they saw Song Ping An run over to play with Shen Wei, a dainty little flower clutched in his hands.","Song Ping An said to Shen Wei: \"Principal Sister, here, this is for you. Hope you feel better.\"","The child spoke slowly. But he said each word clearly.","These days, Shen Wei was angry with the outside television station, either a parent or a teacher mentioned it lightly, unexpectedly, the child overheard it.","He heard that women should be appeased with flowers, so the child searched the entire kindergarten and found the prettiest flower to give to her.","Shen Wei was somewhat touched: \"Thank you, baby.\"","Song Ping An shyly glanced at her and ran away.","Doctor Lu appeared to be preparing for a figurative war at sea. As the child was around, he didn't mention it. But when the child ran off, Lu couldn't help but remark, \"I hope that damned child didn't wreck Old Shen's $500,000 orchid.\"","Shen Wei's mother and father visited the preschool once they had recovered from their illness.","They took care of their flowers with enthusiasm lately, and this one, a $500,000 orchid, they had procured from a botany enthusiast. They treated it like a precious gem. As soon as it bloomed, they started to post the pictures of it on their Snack Circle.","When Shen Wei looked at it, it really did seem similar.","Unable to restrain herself, she glanced at her father's Snack Circle. Upon opening it, she saw a post made by Shen's Father just a minute ago, \"Who was it? Damn it, someone's pulled out my orchid which I had just managed to flower!!\"","Shen Wei:......","Doctor Lu:......","Even through the screen, they could sense Old Shen's meltdown. The flower, which he had been looking forward to seeing, was gone.","Doctor Lu said, \"Well, I'll take a stroll outside.\" He feared remaining by Shen Wei's side as he might burst into laughter."]},{"number":186,"title":"Chapter 186: Weight Loss Pitfalls","paragraphs":["The news that Doctor Lu wanted to lose weight quickly spread throughout Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Even Liu Chef came to have a heart-to-heart with him, wondering if the meals he had prepared recently weren't to Doctor Lu's taste.","Doctor Lu didn't know whether to laugh or cry. It wasn't that the food wasn't to his taste; it was too much to his taste. Otherwise, he wouldn't have gained so much weight in just a year.","Liu Chef usually took great pleasure in fattening people up.","Now, looking at Doctor Lu, he said, \"Your current weight is just right. Men shouldn't be too thin; it doesn't look good. Not like when you first came here.\"","Liu Chef still remembered what Doctor Lu looked like before.","He had carried a certain hospital aura about him.","His digestion wasn't good, and neither was his sleep.","So he didn't have that handsome, upright appearance.","Now he was chubby and loved to smile. He looked just like the kind of son-in-law that mothers-in-law adore.","Liu Chef asked why he wanted to lose weight when he was doing so well.","Doctor Lu replied, \"I've simply gotten too fat.\"","In his daily life at Starry Sky Kindergarten, he hadn't really noticed.","But when he met with his former colleagues,","Their shocked reactions had truly hurt him a bit.","Especially since no one had mentioned that the woman he used to have a secret crush on would be at the gathering. It left him feeling utterly embarrassed.","This time, he was serious about losing weight.","On the first day, he went running on the track with two dance teachers.","He originally thought running 5 kilometers wouldn't be a big deal.","In his younger days, he had even run 10 kilometers.","But he had underestimated how out of shape his body had become from lack of exercise.","After just three laps, he was gasping for air.","His heart was racing.","It felt like his heart might burst out of his chest at any moment.","He had no choice but to slow down a bit.","In the end, he managed to finish the laps by walking.","Drenched in sweat, he was both thirsty and hungry.","Since Doctor Lu had come to Starry Sky Kindergarten, when had he ever suffered like this?","They had mineral water readily available there.","As much as anyone could want.","Usually, if he got hungry, he could go to the kitchen for some fruit or snacks.","There were sweet and savory options, a mix of meat and vegetarian dishes.","At first, they all ate their three meals a day properly, feeling incredibly blessed.","Once they learned that the kitchen always kept food ready, worried they might go hungry,","The kitchen quickly became the favorite place for Starry Sky Kindergarten staff.","They'd pop in for extra meals at any time.","Plus, they'd wash fruit in the afternoon and place it in the office.","They could eat however they liked, and it was all high-end fruit.","For instance, the Shine Muscat grapes were sweet, crisp, and had a unique rose fragrance.","But when they bought them at the market, the skin was thick, and they were dry and sweet, tasting just average.","They couldn't figure out why the fruit at the kindergarten always tasted so good.","Now, more and more people were coming to eat at the kindergarten.","Including the scientists who had been researching the gaming pods.","They had initially come for the gaming pods. But gradually, Doctor Lu keenly observed that they were staying for the cafeteria.","Every few days, they'd give the children an open science class.","The kids found these science classes fascinating.","Especially when the children's enthusiasm was at its peak.","It was said that many had started visiting aerospace exhibitions, sparking an interest that made children want to learn on their own.","In addition, there were some children from wealthy families, along with their bodyguards and such.","These once-imposing young men who had arrived looking fierce,","Now looked like community security guards after all the eating.","They had grown chubby, with no trace of their former toughness.","Looking at the dance teachers, despite how much they ate daily,","They worked out regularly.","Although their weight had increased, it had all turned to muscle, so they looked great.","Doctor Lu's stomach was growling with hunger.","He knew this was a crucial period for his weight loss.","Having finally made this resolution, he couldn't let it all go to waste.","So this time, when mealtime came, he didn't go to the cafeteria.","Instead, he drove out for a spin.","He only returned to work when it was almost time for afternoon classes.","During his drive, he passed countless street food stalls.","But he didn't buy anything.","Since coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten, he had completely given up on street food.","Because he knew that no matter what, it couldn't compare to the delicious food at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","After tasting such good food, other snacks just couldn't cut it anymore.","So after looking around, he still wanted to eat at the cafeteria.","For lunch, he bought a diet bread.","Back at the office, he ate it while he was still hungry.","The first bite nearly choked him.","He couldn't understand how this tasteless, rough thing that scratched his throat could be sold, and at such a high price.","After one bite, Doctor Lu regretted it.","Why should a young man in his prime suffer like this?","He thought about taking a second bite.","But after the second bite, it caused such strong discomfort in his throat that he started to retch.","Doctor Lu quickly found some paper and spat the food onto it.","The bread had become a sticky mess, looking utterly disgusting.","After that, he completely lost interest in the diet bread.","He didn't want to eat another bite. His colleagues in the office saw Doctor Lu sitting there, looking utterly dejected.","They couldn't help but say, \"The kitchen saved some food for you. Are you really not going? Today it's your favorite braised pork trotters!\"","At the mention of pork trotters, Doctor Lu's mouth started to water.","Liu Chef's personally braised pork trotters were fragrant, sweet, and tender.","It was all skin and tendon, with each bite full of collagen.","And the immense satisfaction of gnawing on a pork trotter was unmatched by eating anything else.","His pork trotter rice bowl, with a bit of the sauce and Liu Chef's specially pickled radish,","Was so delicious, even the gods wouldn't trade places with him.","These pork trotters were quite troublesome to make, and with so many staff now, they had to cook several large pots at once.","And everyone absolutely loved them.","Usually, there might be leftovers with other dishes, but with pork trotters, there was never anything left.","Liu Chef had specially saved some for him; otherwise, he wouldn't have been so lucky.","You might think the kindergarten staff were all very friendly and nice,","But when it came to food, they wouldn't give up a single bite.","Doctor Lu said, \"I'm not eating.\" In that moment, he felt an indescribable sense of misery.","So he quickly gulped down some water and ran out.","His willpower was now on the brink of collapse.","Especially since he hadn't eaten properly for breakfast or lunch. He felt like his stomach was caving in.","He had reached his limit.","If someone kept tempting him with food at this point, he truly wouldn't be able to resist eating.","At that rate, forget losing weight; he'd probably gain another 20 pounds on top of his current weight.","He knew Liu Chef had this skill.","Just as he went out, he saw Mu Zhixing. When Mu Zhixing saw him, she said, \"Uncle Lu, why aren't you eating?\"","\"I'm not hungry.\"","\"I heard you didn't eat lunch. I've saved some of my food for you. Please go eat a little!\"","Girls are indeed thoughtful.","She knew he hadn't eaten and even specially saved some of her own food for him.","Doctor Lu usually lived in the dormitory of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","There were only four children living here in total.","One was a local prodigy, one was He Lingfeng, then Mu Zhixing and Song Ping An.","Doctor Lu didn't have much to do on a daily basis. He spent most of his time taking care of these children.","His style was becoming increasingly fussy.","But the children all liked him very much.","Doctor Lu hadn't expected Mu Zhixing to be so considerate, willing to give up her own meal just to make sure he ate.","\"Good child, you're still growing. You go eat your meal. Uncle Lu really isn't hungry.\"","Mu Zhixing, being an artistic person, was sensitive and perceptive. Seeing Doctor Lu not eating, tears started welling up in her eyes.","Qi Zhong, walking in from outside, immediately rushed over upon seeing his beloved student crying. He grabbed Doctor Lu by the collar and demanded, \"What did you do?\"","Qi Zhong treated Mu Zhixing like his own daughter, never even speaking a harsh word to her.","Now, under his guidance, Mu Zhixing's skills in sketching and quick drawing were almost on par with high school art exam candidates.","With such a considerate, obedient, and sensible favorite student, he couldn't understand what could have possibly made his precious pupil cry.","Doctor Lu said, \"I just didn't eat, is it really that serious?\" He had nearly been hit.","After Qi Zhong learned about what had happened, he realized that Mu Zhixing had saved her food for Doctor Lu.","The reason was simply that Doctor Lu was on a diet and hadn't eaten, which made the little girl worried.","Qi Zhong awkwardly straightened Doctor Lu's collar: \"I'm sorry, I got a bit emotional earlier. You should go eat now, look how thin you are. Besides, you can always start your diet again after this meal!\"","When he turned to Mu Zhixing, his voice softened: \"Sweetheart, you can't skip meals, okay? Come on, I'll take you to the cafeteria now. He's an adult, he knows whether he should eat or not. You're just a child, don't worry so much!\" There was a hint of sourness in his tone.","His beloved student was concerned about whether someone else had eaten or not.","Doctor Lu, as if possessed, also followed them to the cafeteria.","He really couldn't resist anymore, feeling hungry, craving food, and uncomfortable.","Having tasted Liu Chef's cooking before, he truly knew how delicious it was.","Now, it was as if he was hallucinating, with faint, tantalizing aromas wafting into his nose.","Who could resist that?","As soon as he arrived at the cafeteria, Liu Chef saw him and immediately brought out a prepared meal of four dishes and a soup.","This included two large pork trotters and glossy Wuchang rice.","The aroma was overwhelming. Doctor Lu was a bit speechless but ended up devouring a pork trotter ravenously.","Dieting was indeed not something an ordinary person could accomplish.","He was just an ordinary person after all. Forget it."]},{"number":187,"title":"Chapter 187: Quit the Race and Join the Stars","paragraphs":["At the cooking competition, the intense engagement skyrockets due to a mysterious ordeal at the cake station.","Everyone finally grasped the profundity of the deputy director’s words: Notoriety is still popularity.","They returned the sponsorship to the Gu Corporation as agreed.","However, the myriad of cooking brands and seasoning product placements were enough to make them roll in wealth.","The more engrossed a subject, the more it draws people in.","Many prominent chefs desired to join as judges.","Seeing the scenario, Chef Liu made a timely retreat.","He wasn’t aiming for the spotlight.","It was just before, this was his own business; hence, he needed to show support.","Without any option, he had to entrust the heavy load of affairs at the Starry Sky Kindergarten to his old friend Chef Zhang for the time being.","But he had hardly left and Doctor Lu had already started losing weight.","He was worried about his colleagues and the little tykes.","Seeing so many interested in being judges, he was delighted to retreat timely.","He was eager to get back to cooking.","The colleagues at Starry Sky Kindergarten were a bit taken aback to see Chef Liu return.","Contestants at the other end were becoming popular.","Among the judges, Chef Liu enjoyed the highest popularity.","His fans lovingly called him Grandpa Liu.","Even, those of the same age as him, leaving Chef Liu flabbergasted.","\"Why are you back?\" A colleague asked.","Chef Liu said, \"I couldn't leave all this chaos behind.\"","His life had been a roller coaster, learning young, getting fame in middle age, had students, and was also let go by his half-life of service unit.","His journey had ups and downs.","Although not monumental, he had had his moments of zenith.","His desire for fame and fortune was not as satisfying as cooking a delicious meal for Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Gasping at Chef Liu's magnanimity brought tears to the eyes' of his fellow colleagues.","That's why they said he stood high in grace.","When the same situation confronts them, not all are likely to be as detached as Chef Liu.","After all, wealth blinds one's sight!","But soon, his old friend started calling.","Chef Liu spent the whole day answering calls that day.","Since he withdrew from the program, many have been calling.","Some convincing him to return, some labeling him a fool, claiming fame is synonymous with money.","By his age, with children, even if he doesn’t leave some for himself, he should think more about future generations.","Who would say no to more money in this era?","Chef Liu assumed it was regarding the same issue.","He was in a hurry to explain.","But who would have thought this was something different?","The next phone call came from one of the ten chief judges, who said to Liu Chef, \"Hey, did you hear? Si Jing joined the competition.\"","\"What?\" Chef Liu was startled.","He understood.","But thinking about it again, it just didn’t seem believable.","Si Jing was Jiang Xun's master.","In the industry, he was on par with Chef Liu, and his skills were not inferior.","While others began judging, this master-level person chose to participate in the competition.","Moreover, everyone knows about the drama between Si Jing and Jiang Xun.","This time the TV station brought up the master-disciple drama, which was another high point.","For their show’s rating, these people at the TV station were being rather shameless.","Chef Liu felt somewhat indignant.","In his interactions with Jiang Xun during this period, he found him to be a good kid.","On the contrary, he had some discontentment towards Si Jing.","No matter what, a mentor shouldn't oppress a disciple to death, right? Just because he turned down a marriage.","The Qing Dynasty has been long extinct.","How could arranged marriage still exist? Nowadays, it's all about finding someone you genuinely like.","Nevertheless, to repay a debt of gratitude by risking one's lifelong happiness was entirely unreliable.","Ever since Jiang Xun was publicly humiliated by his master, he had been rejected by all major restaurants, refusing his association.","Si Jing's recent visit even carried an ill intent that he could sense. He found it hard to believe that no one else could sense it.","At that moment, Chef Liu regretted backing out of the competition.","If he hadn't, he could have protected Jiang Xun on site.","Being the type of person to worry about others, he had grown softer-hearted since working at the Starry Sky Kindergarten and couldn’t bear to see others suffering.","Just as Chef Liu was sighing deeply, Shen Wei happened to walk over, \"Let me share some good news.\"","Chef Liu asked, \"What good news?\"","Shen Wei revealed, \"Jiang Xun withdrew from the competition. He wants to join us at Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","Chef Liu immediately perked up, \"Really?\"","Shen Wei confirmed, \"Of course. His master participating in the competition was clearly forcing him into a corner. Jiang Xun knew he would inevitably get dragged into the drama linked to his past. His withdrawal not only gives his master a way out but also swiftly extricates himself from this swirl.\"","It was indeed a wise choice.","Despite being young and amidst crisis, he made a decision favoring his own interests which was undeniably astute.","Invitations were pouring in for the hot-topic, Jiang Xun, and the offered salaries were not low.","However, upon joining Starry Sky Kindergarten, it's no longer the time for random bidding.","As Starry Sky Kindergarten expanded gradually and started following proper procedures, the initial salary offer was 20,000.","Choosing to join Starry Sky Kindergarten, despite the circumstances, filled Shen Wei with joy.","After all, among the contestants, he was exceptionally talented.","If not for his master's interference, he would undoubtedly have been in the top three of the competition.","\"That's great!\" Chef Liu felt somewhat elated and immediately called Jiang Xun.","Upon learning that Jiang Xun had nowhere to live, Chef Liu instantly suggested, \"Come and stay at Starry Sky Kindergarten. I'll arrange a room for you!\"","With fewer children and plenty of rooms, making one available wasn't an issue.","Jiang Xun arrived on the same day.","Chef Liu gave Jiang Xun's shoulder a pat.","There were some things hard to vocalize, as it might seem like rubbing salt into the wound. But the affection he felt for him was conveyed through his gesture.","Jiang Xun was in good spirits.","Participating in the competition earned him numerous fans. Many apologized to him for past wrongs.","What he sought was not the apology from his assailants but the warmth offered through the internet — a feeling of relaxation like never before.","Upon arriving at Starry Sky Kindergarten, thoughts of gratitude emerged.","After all, if it wasn't for Starry Sky Kindergarten hosting this culinary competition, he wouldn't have had the opportunity to escape from his depressed and gloomy surroundings.","\"Join us from tomorrow then. Your salary here will be 20,000. Plus, there's a 100,000 buy-out clause for your creative rights. The finance department will detail it later, in any case, our welfare benefits are quite decent,\" Chef Liu informed.","Jiang Xun responded, \"Then I'll get familiar with the kitchen.\"","He was in a new place and wanted to make a good impression.","\"Sure,\" responded Liu Chef immediately, \"show us what you've got today!\"","He then brought him to the kitchen.","There were quite a few helpers in the kitchen, and the chopping board was spotless.","All types of pots were neatly arranged, making for a very pleasing view.","This sparked interest in Jiang Xun, who promptly made one of his signature dishes: dry pot cauliflower.","This is a dish that suits all, whether young or old, male or female.","Moreover, he cooked it just right, achieving the perfect balance between cooked and raw, while maintaining the crisp tenderness of the cauliflower.","Even though it's a simple dish, the crispy texture it offers doesn't come without effort.","It was heavily complimented that day.","Everyone was used to the meals prepared by Liu Chef and Chen Chef.","Today's arrival of the newcomer soon got everyone applauding.","The dry pot cauliflower was the first to be finished.","Also, many people complimented genuinely on how delicious Jiang Xun's cooking was.","Even the little children followed suit, saying, \"Brother, your food is really yummy.\"","The children of Starry Sky Kindergarten seem to grow up surrounded by love.","Hence, they excel in expressing their love.","Added to that, the children's innocent praises touched Jiang Xun deeply, and in a moment of emotion, he gave one of the kids a hug.","However, he let go pretty quickly.","A child, a bit upset, reached out his tiny hand, wanting another hug.","Thinking, 'Gosh, why can't adults hug properly?'","So Jiang Xun held the little one in his arms again.","Feeling the soft little body against his chest,","It dawned on him why people loved Starry Sky Kindergarten - the place was indeed therapeutic."]},{"number":188,"title":"Chapter 188: Newcomers Work Hard","paragraphs":["After coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten, Jiang Xun quickly became part of this place, and worked with great enthusiasm. He would cook several types of porridges just in the morning, from salty to sweet, millet porridge, and eight-treasure porridge - he could make them all.","The steamed buns, too, he made himself.","He had a machine for kneading flour, which made it easier.","However, it's not easy for average people to grasp the right measurements, but he excelled at it from his first attempt. The buns he made were fragrant and sweet, fluffy and similar to cake crumbs.","He would roll a bit of green onions inside, smear a bit of oil and sprinkle some fine salt.","They were so delicious even on their own.","Especially when paired with his special homemade pickles.","The combination of a mouthful of porridge, steamed bun, and pickle in the early morning made everyone overjoyed.","Before, they only cared about lunch and dinner.","They would buy breakfast from outside, they had no choice.","Nowadays, Liu Chef had to make too many things every day.","A lot needed to be handled from early morning, so breakfast was always average.","But everyone was already quite satisfied.","This time with Jiang Xun's arrival, breakfast became exceptional.","Including soy milk, milk, fried eggs, there was everything you could think of.","All the colleagues at Starry Sky Kindergarten exclaimed, \"How lucky we are to work here!\"","Each time they enjoyed a satisfying meal, they would remark this while feeling satisfied enough to make the journey for the sake of such meals.","Seeing Doctor Lu with the last salt and pepper bun on his plate struck his colleagues with awe.","How long did it take before the huge pile of freshly cooked buns, looking magnificent like mountains, were completely finished?","People truly know what's delicious, not leaving a chance for others to have any.","Seeing this, others asked, \"Aren't you on a diet?\"","Doctor Lu replied, \"Forget it, the more I diet, the fatter I get.\"","Dieting was indeed hunger-endurance.","He did not have the willpower.","Skipping just two meals already made him feel mistreated.","Moreover, each time he saw his colleagues enjoying delicious food, and talking about it in the office, he couldn't bear it.","So he just let loose and ate freely.","And when he did that, Liu Chef felt a lot more comfortable.","So, Liu Chef went ahead and ordered a large batch of beef tendons again.","Ever since their grilled beef tendon became popular, the market had been sold out.","As regular customers, they had their share reserved in advance.","Each cow only had a bit of tendons, saving up for it took quite some time.","Upon hearing that there would be grilled beef tendons soon, everyone became excited.","Some of the new colleagues had heard about the reputation of grilled beef tendon, but they had never tasted it.","Considering that even the pork trotters, pork ribs, stewed chicken, and stewed fish were all so delicious, they could barely imagine how good the beef tendons, which everyone loved, tasted.","When Doctor Lu heard about it, he decidedly abandonded his diet plan.","If he missed this rare occasion because of his diet, he would blame himself a lot.","So he let loose and indulged.","Seeing everyone happily enjoying the food, Liu Chef felt even more satisfied than eating it himself.","Noticing Jiang Xun's hardwork he approached him, placing a hand on his shoulder, said, \"You've worked hard.\"","He had put in a lot of effort in the morning.","He heard from the kitchen staff that he had arrived at 2 am.","Making breakfast was indeed tough.","Even with all the big equipment, cooking pot after pot, only a careful person could do this job.","At this, Jiang Xun replied, \"As long as everyone likes the food, that's all that matters.\"","Chef Liu said, \"You won't be needed this afternoon and evening. You'd better go home and rest. You've been busy enough this morning and didn't sleep well last night!\"","Jiang Xun responded, \"But, I don't feel tired.\"","However, Chef Liu asserted authoritatively, \"You may not feel the exhaustion now being young, but wait until you're older, and all kinds of ailments start setting in. Go and get some rest. Everyone's breakfast tomorrow depends on you.\"","Jiang Xun's eyes filled with warmth, it's been a while since an elder cared for him like this.","When he arrived at Starry Sky Kindergarten, it really was different from any other place.","The colleagues here felt like a family.","Jiang Xun liked this, the genuine feelings that everyone shared openly.","Everyone was united with one sole aim – to improve Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Joining here, he too, wanted to contribute to the kindergarten.","He had reached his limits trying to prepare the breakfast and lunch.","His culinary skills paled in comparison with Chef Liu, so he could only polish his breakfast menu.","Surprisingly, everyone showered him with praises.","Blushing and feeling warmth spread across his face.","But, deep inside, he felt gratified.","Though exhausting, it was worth it.","Soon, Chef Liu instructed him to go and rest.","Even after heading back, his heart was still pounding with gratification and satisfaction.","As someone who rarely updated his social media, he couldn't resist posting a happy emoticon.","There were no accompanying words.","But not even a minute after he posted it, his former Junior Brother called him.","\"Big Brother Jiang Xun, we're lucky you left!\"","He had a lot to vent about, \"Since you left, our master's temper got even worse.\"","Seeing such a competent person like Jiang Xun oppressed,","Almost got depressed to death. One by one, they began to behave.","When the Master asked them to do something, they dare not do otherwise.","Yet, Master's temperament only escalated.","Casually verbally and physically abusing, as if it was a common occurrence.","They wanted to leave but dared not.","Seeing Big Brother in good spirits, they couldn't help expressing their desires, \"Could I come and work with you?\"","Jiang Xun replied, \"Not for the time being.\"","The Junior Brother was disappointed, \"When you're recruiting, please think of me.\"","Jiang Xun agreed and then hung up.","When he was bullied, no one spoke up. Now everything was on track, those who watched from the sidelines were also being bullied.","It seems the Master never changes.","Back then, he didn't choose the right master. If he had been apprenticed under Chef Liu, he wonders how much happier he would've been now."]},{"number":189,"title":"Chapter 189: The Big Pig Farmer","paragraphs":["A new director suddenly appeared at the Cake Station.","People from all factions united as one, presenting a united front against this outsider.","With Liu Chef and Jiang Xun's withdrawal, this silent battle intensified.","One was the most popular judge in the culinary competition.","The other was one of the main characters in the master-apprentice feud.","These were the highlights of the show.","Now that they've both quit, it's as if half of the show's appeal has been cut away.","Everyone at the station wanted to see how he would wrap things up.","Having a direct superior suddenly parachuted in made them feel that their long struggle had been a joke.","No one from any faction had climbed to the highest position.","Instead, someone with average qualifications and education directly became the station director.","Everyone was waiting to see the new director fail.","But this \"failure\" wasn't what everyone had imagined.","First, Shi Zhong gained the support of Starry Sky Kindergarten, resolving the dispute.","As long as online disputes remained unresolved, they hung over everyone's heads like a sword. There was always worry about when the other side might bring up the issue for retribution.","Soon after the TV station gained popularity, he continued to invite others to join.","It was a time of high popularity.","It was still very tempting.","And those negative aspects, along with countless trending news stories every day.","Would eventually overshadow this incident.","Plus, with Liu Chef's connections from Starry Sky Kindergarten, they could contact experienced chefs and excellent contestants.","This time, they were producing the show purely as a variety program.","Besides cooking skills, they would invite some contestants with unique characteristics, like those with growth stories, drama queens.","And even those with a green tea bitch persona.","This would make the originally plain script colorful and diverse.","The audience had never seen anything like it.","They were immediately captivated.","After the incident, the ratings reached 2% on the first day.","Becoming the highest-rated show in that time slot.","The second day's ratings were even more surprising.","They directly jumped to 6%.","TV viewers were a minority.","Most people were on the internet.","The show's viral success online led to a sharp rise in TV ratings.","Another major source of revenue was signing video rights.","It depended on whether they signed exclusive or non-exclusive deals.","One thing was certain, no matter how they signed, it would be a large sum of money.","After these events, Shi Zhong, the young director, firmly established his position at the station.","He truly had talent.","Many outstanding students interned at the TV station.","The more excellent ones stayed.","But the internal factional struggles were severe. No one could remain neutral. Even the most talented people would unconsciously waste their talents in these struggles.","Shi Zhong was different. He was young and sharp, and in a high position. His program-making techniques were endless, directly amazing the entire TV station.","With Shen Wei's help, he quickly gained a foothold at the Cake Station.","Shen Wei, in turn, received rewards from the System.","\"Congratulations to Shen Wei for helping the new director take office. System rewards 2 million.\"","\"Reward: 100 jin of high-quality fruit.\"","\"Reward: 100 piglets.\"","\"20% of the original plot has been altered.\"","This time, there was no special prompt about changing the original story plot.","But Shen Wei couldn't care about that now.","Because 100 piglets suddenly appeared around her. The piglets were incredibly lively, scurrying about.","The large office could barely contain them.","Fortunately, when the System distributed the rewards, she was alone in the office.","There was no one else around.","Otherwise, these piglets appearing out of thin air would have shocked everyone.","The piglets were one month old. Pink and tender, they were very cute.","They were now frolicking in the office.","Previously, when the System only rewarded a few, Shen Wei could wrap them in clothes and take them away directly.","But now there were a full 100 piglets.","She didn't know how to handle it.","And these pigs were squealing more happily than ever.","If the System kept playing like this, she might develop heart problems from the shock.","With no choice, she had to contact a transporter to drive to the kindergarten.","But even so, they would still be discovered.","Left with no alternative, Shen Wei had to use the points she usually wouldn't spend in the System mall to customize a message. It opened a channel that made the pigs invisible to everyone.","This cost a whopping 20,000 points.","But 20,000 it was.","Otherwise, it would be very difficult to explain why so many piglets appeared simultaneously.","Shen Wei gritted her teeth and input the 20,000 points.","The System was stingy when giving points but acted like a profiteer when deducting them.","After confirmation, the 20,000 points disappeared.","Then a message appeared in the group chat, asking all those not in class to help in the kitchen.","This kind of situation happened often before, as the kitchen had to prepare three meals a day with many dishes, and sometimes they were short-handed.","It concerned everyone's food and drink. Others would help too.","The back kitchen was far from Shen Wei's office.","Meanwhile, even the surveillance videos were tampered with.","In any case, everything looked normal upon entry.","When the truck carrying the pigs arrived, Shen Wei and two others hurriedly grabbed the piglets and put them inside. After counting, there were exactly 100.","No one discovered anything, and finally, the truck drove away. Not a single person noticed.","Even the security guard, affected by something like an illusion from the System, saw it as just a cargo truck. He didn't think much of it.","And he couldn't hear the piglets' grunts. This System had some tricks up its sleeve.","As soon as the truck drove away, Shen Wei felt relieved.","Shen Wei followed the truck to the previously prepared pig farm.","It was owned by Chef Chen's relative.","They had left money earlier to build this place, but no piglets had been sent over.","The workers there didn't dare to act on their own and were about to contact Shen Wei.","Shen Wei seemed to have heard their thoughts.","She directly brought the piglets over.","Chef Chen's relative, formerly a big pig farmer, was an expert at assessing piglets.","Now, looking at the lively piglets, his eyes sparkled as he said, \"These are excellent pigs!\"","The System provided an explanation.","Each of the rewarded piglets could grow to 500-800 jin.","They were a specially bred variety, not only fast-growing for quick market readiness.","But also with strong reproductive abilities.","The meat was very fragrant, and in their super-space, it was even specially supplied.","Among this wave of rewards, the most valuable was undoubtedly these 100 piglets.","However, the 100 piglets cannot be crossbred with outside pigs.","Otherwise, the quality would decline.","Shen Wei directly conveyed all this information to the people at the farm.","The pig farm staff said, \"That's fine. I see about half of these pigs are sows!\"","This way, they could mate them internally.","The farm staff assured, \"Don't worry about this. I have plenty of experience!\"","Shen Wei hired the couple to raise the pigs, paying each of them 20,000 yuan per month.","The couple could earn 400,000 to 500,000 yuan a year, which was even more profitable than raising pigs themselves.","They would surely take good care of these pigs.","The three pigs from before had already transformed dramatically after just a few months.","Now they were plump and round.","Even people from nearby who came to look said they had never seen such fine pigs before.","Local pigs raised to this stage would typically be ready for slaughter.","But Shen Wei said these could be raised to 500-800 jin (250-400 kg).","They could continue raising these pigs, feeding them purely on grain here.","No commercial feed was used.","Yet the pigs just kept getting fatter and fatter.","Even the pig farmers marveled, wishing their own pig-raising endeavors had been this effortless in the past.","Pig farming requires various permits and paperwork,","But the System had already taken care of all that.","Now theirs was the only pig farm in the surrounding villages.","And it was quite a sizable operation.","The facility they built was particularly large. With just 100 piglets, it felt empty.","The pig farmers suggested, \"Should we add another 300 or 400 head?\"","Shen Wei replied, \"No need. Let's focus on these for now.\"","She had already seen the price of these pigs in the points mall of the System.","5,000 points per pig.","Suddenly, she understood why the System had specifically mentioned the pigs' value after rewarding her with the piglets.","The pigs rewarded by the System looked ordinary.","But if bought with points, it would cost 500,000 points.","In an instant, she realized these were no ordinary piglets – they were practically golden pigs.","The initial three pigs had already surpassed 300 jin (150 kg).","In another six months, they would be ready for slaughter.","She was eager to taste what the System described as tender, fragrant, and succulent white pork."]},{"number":190,"title":"Chapter 190: 20% Plot Twist","paragraphs":["Shen Wei returned from the pig farm, her body permeated with an unpleasant odor.","Pig farming wasn't a job just anyone could do.","Even though they had taken great care in tending to the animals,","the intense smell near the pigsties was too much for someone like Shen Wei, who wasn't used to such grueling work.","She drove home, took a shower first thing,","changed into fresh clothes, and finally tossed her worn outfit into the washing machine, hitting the start button before heading back to the kindergarten.","As soon as she arrived at the kindergarten, she spotted Doctor Lu waiting for her, scanning the area.","Shen Wei couldn't help but smile.","Doctor Lu's eyes lit up when he saw her.","Undoubtedly, some new gossip had reached his ears.","It was hard to imagine that he used to be an attending physician at a top-tier hospital, and the youngest person to earn a doctorate.","Yet in just a few years at the kindergarten,","he had transformed into someone who could out-gossip the old men at the village entrance if you gave him sunflower seeds to munch on.","As Shen Wei parked her car carefully, Doctor Lu rushed over before she could even step out.","Shen Wei asked, \"What is it now?\"","Doctor Lu blurted out, \"Have you heard? That ex-boyfriend guy is pestering Lin Rui again.\"","\"Who? Lu Zheng? Isn't he with my cousin?\"","The drama between Lu Zheng and Shen Qingqing had been the talk of the town back then.","Stories of him angering his father to the point of illness for love, leaving the Lu Group for love, and so on.","These tales were still circulating.","He had even opened an arcade to compete with them at one point.","\"Men, you know. They always want what they can't have. Haven't you read those 'chasing wife' novels? I'll tell you, as soon as the other woman gives up, the male lead comes crawling back.\"","Doctor Lu's greatest pleasures these days, apart from relishing various bits of gossip and searching for information about Starry Sky Kindergarten online,","were listening to web novels.","He'd spent quite a bit of money on this hobby.","Doctor Lu's eyes sparkled, thrilled to encounter a real-life 'pure love warrior'.","Shen Wei couldn't help but laugh, \"How did you find out about this?\"","Doctor Lu said, \"Our pure love warrior, CEO Lu, chased her all the way here. You have no idea, his belated passion is more persistent than weeds. It's left Lin Rui completely flustered.\"","Shen Wei said, \"I'll go check on her.\"","She then went to find Lin Rui.","Upon entering the office, she found Lin Rui fuming.","The office was empty except for her.","Lin Rui said, \"Doctor Lu told you, didn't he? How does that man know every bit of gossip!\"","She had just seen Lu Zheng and found it irritating. After exchanging a few words, she spotted Doctor Lu and her heart sank.","She wasn't surprised to see Shen Wei come in now.","Shen Wei couldn't help but smile, \"There's one thing that escaped him, and he still considers it a disgrace!\"","\"What's that?\"","Shen Wei said with a laugh, \"The affair between the security guard and Teacher Tang.\"","Hearing this, Lin Rui also laughed, \"The security guard used to be in the special forces and was trained in reconnaissance. No wonder he couldn't uncover that.\"","Shen Wei added, \"But since then, he's learned his lesson. He won't let a single piece of gossip escape his ears now.\"","As they joked, Lin Rui's mood improved a bit.","She couldn't help but vent, \"I can't believe he used to be such a jerk! How did I ever fall for him?\"","Their families had been friends for years.","Similar backgrounds, same age, and matching education levels. Their parents had encouraged the match.","A young girl's emotions, combined with Lu Zheng's handsome appearance, had inexplicably stirred something in her.","In the end, they naturally got together.","Without any formal confession, they went abroad together.","She thought it would be different from other business marriages.","At least they had feelings for each other, but Shen Qingqing's appearance shattered that illusion.","At that time, Lin Rui really wanted to get revenge on them.","She was disgusted by both of them.","If a man could be stolen away so easily,","what did all their beautiful past experiences mean?","It was hard to let go.","But what she couldn't let go of wasn't this scumbag of a man.","It was the version of herself who had invested so much in that relationship.","Later, she came to Starry Sky Kindergarten, initially intending to seek revenge on them.","Who knew that coming to Starry Sky Kindergarten would bring her healing instead.","Moreover, Starry Sky Kindergarten had entered a period of rapid development.","Among all of them, she was the one who had studied business.","So she focused more on expanding Starry Sky's reputation.","Including this culinary competition.","They had invested a great deal of manpower, resources, and energy into it.","Gradually, she forgot about him.","Who would have thought he'd go crazy and come looking for her again?","Before they could finish venting,","Lin Rui's phone rang.","Lin Rui glanced at it irritably, and Shen Wei knew it must be Lu Zheng calling again.","Shen Wei said, \"Answer it. Let's see what he has to say.\"","Lin Rui then picked up the call. For some reason, she put it on speaker.","They heard CEO Lu say, \"I know you said you were pregnant before just to upset me, and your so-called boyfriend is just an art teacher at Starry Sky Kindergarten. I know all this. You still care about me, don't you? Can we start over?\"","Hearing about it secondhand was one thing, but hearing it in real-time was quite another for Shen Wei.","She couldn't help but wonder if the system's claim about altering the storyline meant derailing Shen Qingqing's love life.","So Lu Zheng had remembered his feelings for Lin Rui.","After all, one was a pampered young lady, the only daughter of the Lin Group.","The other was a girlfriend without any support, who even brought him ridicule from others.","Everyone knew which choice to make.","As Lu Zheng was making his heartfelt confession, suddenly a woman's voice came through, \"Lu Zheng, what's going on? You're talking to another woman right in front of me? Is she trying to seduce you again? She's nothing but a homewrecker.\"","Shen Wei recognized it as Shen Qingqing's voice.","Chaos erupted on Lu Zheng's end, his voice tinged with impatience, \"Don't talk nonsense.\"","Lin Rui was speechless. She hadn't said anything, yet was suddenly labeled a homewrecker. Who would stand for that?","She then said, \"Keep your dog in check. I don't want him anymore. Only you still treat him like a treasure. It's laughable. Lu Zheng, listen carefully, even if there were no other men left in the world, I wouldn't take you back!\"","She then hung up the phone with flair.","It was truly insane.","Afterwards, Lin Rui blocked Lu Zheng's phone number and all other means of contact.","Before, she had thought that since they moved in the same circles,","they were bound to run into each other occasionally.","Cutting ties so completely didn't seem right.","But who would have thought these two would be so relentless?","Lin Rui looked at Shen Wei and said, \"Those two are fighting again!\"","The more Lin Rui thought about it, the angrier she became: \"Don't tell me we're just part of his game too. It's disgusting to even think about it.\"","Shen Wei couldn't help but say, \"Maybe there aren't any girls around him with better conditions than you. Boys are just that practical.\"","Lin Rui scoffed, \"As if he's worthy!\"","In the past, she had limited experience with men. But now, at Starry Sky Kindergarten, it was just like what people online said – all kinds of cute guys were available.","There were street dancers, classical dancers, artists, brooding types, muscular ones – who would even look at him?","It was absolutely laughable."]},{"number":191,"title":"Chapter 191: Obvious Affection","paragraphs":["Construction was in full swing at the second location of Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Their construction team was truly formidable.","They usually took on large-scale projects.","This time, they were hired to work on Starry Sky Kindergarten due to connections with higher-ups.","After several months, the initial construction was nearly complete.","For this project, they used building materials even better than required.","Even the construction workers said they had never seen anything like it.","Built to such high standards.","People began to inquire whether ordinary citizens could enroll their children in Starry Sky Kindergarten.","No wonder Starry Sky Kindergarten was so popular.","They spared no expense when it came to facilities and equipment, both hardware and software.","After Shen Wei arrived,","She saw the expansive grounds, an impressive sight. Being a kindergarten, it was only three stories tall.","They had more rooms to set up specialized facilities.","For instance, there was an indoor temperature-controlled swimming pool for children to play in.","There was also a dedicated multimedia computer classroom.","The computers used here were the most expensive models on the market.","They were more than capable of running professional gaming tournaments, let alone for teaching purposes.","There were also various competition-grade classrooms inside.","The dance studio had specially laid flooring and full-length mirrors covering an entire wall, all custom-made.","The dance bars were built into the walls.","There was even a street dance room with colorful spotlights, creating a beautiful atmosphere.","It could create all sorts of lighting effects.","There was even a stage where children could showcase themselves or record videos.","Besides that, there was a mock courtroom to cultivate children's sense of right and wrong.","It could be said that the second location of Starry Sky Kindergarten was essentially a miniature society within the kindergarten.","Once revealed, it would astound many people.","The interior design contractors were already amazed.","However, they had signed non-disclosure agreements.","No matter how surprised they were, they couldn't say anything.","Seeing Shen Wei arrive, the contractors excitedly expressed their commitment to doing their absolute best.","They looked forward to the public reveal of Starry Sky Kindergarten's second location.","Because their hard work and dedication were poured into its construction.","\"This kindergarten is just too good! It's a pity my child is already in elementary school!\"","\"Why weren't there kindergartens this nice before?\" The construction workers couldn't help but marvel.","The most eye-catching feature was Starry Sky Kindergarten's kitchen.","After all, they first gained popularity through their cuisine.","The kitchen was extremely professional.","From the ventilation system","To the separate areas for Chinese cuisine, Western cuisine, and desserts.","Each section was distinct yet interconnected.","It would be perfect for filming or cooking.","The chefs had very spacious workstations.","Shen Wei fell in love with it at first sight.","It was hard to imagine how excited Liu Chef and the others would be when they saw it.","There was also a restaurant next door.","This restaurant would be open to the public.","Many people had wanted to dine here before.","But it wasn't allowed. A few people were fine, but too many would disrupt the kindergarten's normal operations.","So eating here had become a collective yearning among netizens.","This time, with the opening of the second location,","The most excited were the internet users.","They strongly requested that a restaurant with the same cuisine be opened.","So they could come and eat there whenever they wanted.","Shen Wei was quite fond of her fans.","Since everyone had asked for it, how could she refuse?","So she opened a restaurant, not too large, with seating for over 100 tables on two floors.","There were only two private rooms, the rest was open seating.","This part was relatively easy to set up.","But it would still take three months to get everything fully ready.","Shen Wei noticed that Gu Qingyan had lost some weight recently.","She felt a bit guilty.","Gu Qingyan used to be a pampered young master at home.","Now he was here working hard for her.","Even though Shen Wei compensated him well financially, he didn't lack money to begin with.","Shen Wei said, \"Why don't you take a couple of days off? We have the assistant here.\"","He had been here constantly, as someone was needed to make decisions.","It was because of his presence that Shen Wei could set her mind at ease.","And fully devote herself to other work.","After all, Shen Wei's responsibilities were growing.","Fortunately, the pop-up stores also had capable managers.","Otherwise, just dealing with all these trivial matters would consume too much of her energy every day.","Gu Qingyan looked at Shen Wei and couldn't help saying, \"You care about me.\"","His eyes sparkled, as if all his previous fatigue had suddenly vanished.","It was quite endearing.","Shen Wei chuckled softly, and quickly noticed Gu Qingyan's mood lifting.","The assistant couldn't help but laugh and say, \"You don't need to give him time off. Just praise him and he'll be as energetic as if he's had an adrenaline shot!\"","Gu Qingyan's emotions were so transparent, it was quite amusing.","Gu Qingyan coughed lightly, \"What are you talking about?\"","But the corners of his mouth were slightly turned up: \"You can rest assured with me here.\"","He now finished work around 5 PM every day.","He could still go back to Starry Sky Kindergarten to grab a meal.","Then play a couple of games.","His life had never been so fulfilling before.","It wasn't just him who felt fulfilled.","Even some of his fair-weather friends, seeing his progress, couldn't help but start working hard too.","Parents began to praise him.","Gu Qingyan had never experienced this kind of treatment before.","In the past, as a wealthy playboy, people would compliment him too.","But they would only praise his good looks.","Plus, with capable older siblings above him, he didn't need to worry about Gu Corporation.","So he developed the spoiled personality of a rich second-generation.","Now that he had pulled himself together, others were following suit.","Everyone was working hard.","With more positive friends around him,","Even those who used to look down on him in other circles wanted to approach him.","Thinking about it, it felt pretty good.","No wonder so many people wanted to be top students, to be the cream of the crop.","He was now experiencing that happiness firsthand."]},{"number":192,"title":"Chapter 192: Baby is Very Su","paragraphs":["Starry Sky Kindergarten was thriving.","Previously, Noble Kindergarten could still compete with Starry Sky Kindergarten. But recently, Starry Sky Kindergarten seemed unstoppable, causing even Noble Kindergarten to back off.","Being in the spotlight constantly might have offended some people.","Recently, a provocative post suddenly appeared.","\"Starry Sky Kindergarten is truly shameless. They'll stop at nothing for publicity, even bringing in academicians and scientists to give public lectures to children.\"","\"Let's not even mention how unlikely it is for such high-level experts to come to a small kindergarten to teach children.\"","\"Either this is all fake, or there's some strange deal going on.\"","\"Besides, what can children of that age understand anyway?\"","\"They've lost all shame in their pursuit of appearing high-class and sophisticated.\"","\"What's most annoying is how Starry Sky Kindergarten is always marketing itself. Eight out of ten times I scroll through news, it's about this kindergarten. I beg this kindergarten to calm down a bit; it's really making me physically disgusted.\"","This malicious message surprisingly received 5,000 likes.","Netizens didn't hold back: \"If you don't like it, just don't look. Are you saying that just because you don't like it, it shouldn't exist? What are you, an emperor?\"","\"Moreover, you shouldn't say such ignorant things without doing a bit of research. If you doubt the scientists' identities, you can easily search online. These experts are all there, many even have positions at universities. These scientists contribute to our country, and just because you don't like marketing, you're putting such a vicious label on them. Is that fair?\"","\"My cousin works in operations, and he says Starry Sky Kindergarten has hardly ever bought trending topics. It just naturally trends, what can anyone do about it?\"","\"You don't like seeing it, but who are you to decide if the public likes it or not?\"","\"It's really hard to imagine someone harboring such malice towards a kindergarten.\"","The person who posted this, unable to argue against so many people, became angry and embarrassed. They blocked and deleted all the rebuttals, keeping only those that supported them.","As a result, the comment section quickly turned toxic.","It seemed like everyone was criticizing Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Moreover, this person was obsessive. Despite being criticized by so many, they not only refused to delete the post and apologize but became more excited, creating several videos in succession.","They dug up past events related to Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Especially the incident where He Lingfeng was once called a genius.","After so much time had passed, there wasn't much buzz about it online anymore.","Only faint traces could be found in old reports.","This person immediately seized on this point and began to attack: \"Huh, claiming he's a genius, a 5-year-old child who can learn middle school courses? Why don't you just say he can fly?\"","\"Do you think I'd believe such a thing? If there really was such a genius, with Starry Sky Kindergarten's marketing prowess, they would have promoted it everywhere. Why hide it?\"","\"Not letting these people show their faces says a lot!\"","\"Parents who send their children to this kind of kindergarten, where everything from top to bottom is focused on marketing and quick success, how can they provide good basic education?\"","The attacks became increasingly vicious.","The scientists giving lectures to the children were even caught in the crossfire.","These scientists came to Starry Sky Kindergarten to research the gaming pod.","The gaming pod hadn't been successfully developed yet.","But they were very comfortable here.","Every day they enjoyed meals prepared by great chefs, and they could play a few games.","They could experience cutting-edge technology.","Not just the software, but also the hardware, like the one-piece wire drawing process.","Current technology can hardly achieve this level.","Combined with Starry Sky Kindergarten's generous hospitality.","Children are the hope for the country's future, and planting a seed of technology in these children's hearts was something the scientists aspired to do.","This time, they conducted some introductory experiments, which unexpectedly received a good response.","Many children had already begun to show interest in science.","They wanted to explore the mysterious space and the calm underwater world.","This was much better than children being addicted to online streaming and imitating streamers' catchphrases.","The detractors completely missed these positive aspects.","Instead, they felt that these scientists weren't focusing on their research and were collaborating with the kindergarten for publicity, which was annoying.","Shen Wei had the System helping to monitor online public opinion.","As soon as this incident occurred, she was the first to know.","With Doctor Lu also there, the others in the kindergarten quickly found out as well.","Shen Wei was thinking about how to counterattack.","This time, even the scientists were implicated, and she couldn't tolerate it.","Just as she was furiously writing a rebuttal,","She heard the System's alarm beeping.","Shen Wei immediately went to check.","He Lingfeng had posted a clarification video.","In the video, a serious-faced little boy was looking at the camera.","He had appeared in live streams before.","But it was the first time he faced the camera alone, so he was a bit nervous.","The more nervous he got, the more serious his little face became.","Little did he know that such a reaction from a child his age was extremely adorable.","He Lingfeng said: \"I've seen some comments about me online. First of all, I haven't just completed middle school courses, I've already finished high school courses!\"","He then showed a video of himself taking a real high school exam, which after grading scored over 530 points. The entire process was only sped up without any cuts, even the grading was done live.","This score isn't considered exceptional at the high school level.","Many students can achieve higher scores after solid studying.","But considering he's only a 6-year-old boy,","And this was last year's exam paper,","The number becomes terrifyingly impressive.","He Lingfeng said: \"If I were to take the exam again this year, I predict my score wouldn't be lower than 600.\"","\"Starting tomorrow, I'll begin a series of math lectures, based on middle school and high school knowledge.\"","\"Also, I hope those haters will stop criticizing Starry Sky Kindergarten.\"","\"The kindergarten has helped many homeless children like me. It's not like you imagine, focused only on marketing every day.\"","\"If anyone doesn't believe what I'm saying, they can directly connect with me online tomorrow. I know one shouldn't fall into the trap of self-justification. But the internet is a terrifying environment. If you don't prove yourself, you'll be trampled under dirty water, forever bearing a bad name. I don't want that.\"","\"The kindergarten principal has already shielded me from a lot of harm. This time, it's my turn to protect her.\"","As the words fell, the child looked solemnly at the camera. His eyes sparked with determination. It was truly quite moving.","It was only a one-minute video.","Posted on an account named He Lingfeng, but tagged with the Starry Sky Kindergarten topic, so anyone searching would see this video.","As a result, fans in the livestream room were really excited. Many had watched this child grow up.","Especially the older fans who could still recall. They used to think He Lingfeng didn't fit in, but later learned that this child's intelligence was much higher than others. It was difficult for him to play with peers. But the fact that he could learn high school curriculum still shocked people.","\"My internet son is so smart, I couldn't help but kick my biological son who scored 18 points when I saw him.\"","\"I've long heard that He Lingfeng has strong learning abilities, but I never expected him to score so high on the college entrance exam. I must come to the livestream room tomorrow to see.\"","\"'This time it's my turn to protect you.' It's hard to imagine such a touching line coming from the mouth of a 6-year-old child. He's truly a born protagonist.\"","Shen Wei was also speechless after watching, truly moved by the little villain she had raised."]},{"number":193,"title":"Chapter 193: The Show-off Online Course","paragraphs":["All the internet users were shocked.","In recent years, no one had heard of following an online course taught by a small child.","And the subject matter was middle and high school knowledge.","How surreal could this world get?","The internet never lacks idle people looking to join the excitement. So, one by one, they set their alarms and followed this ID, waiting to watch the next day.","Under this video, some people even boldly questioned in the comments:","\"I'd like to ask, what's the possibility of this being fake?\"","Below, netizens eagerly replied: \"Almost zero. Even if it's just rote memorization, a child might not be able to remember it all.\"","\"Let me put it this way, my child is already 8 years old and in first grade, but only knows a few dozen characters.\"","\"Math trains thinking ability. Everyone's thought process is different, and this is very difficult to replicate.\"","\"Even if they were trying to create a 'prodigy', they wouldn't guide them towards mathematics.\"","Bystanders below were astonished: \"Could this actually be real?\"","Soon, this video account had reached over 3 million views, with more people sharing it, adding fuel to the fire.","In no time, everyone knew that tomorrow this child would be livestreaming to teach middle and high school math publicly.","Some netizens went directly to the comment sections of certain math teachers to ask their opinions on this matter.","The most prominent was a big V with already 300,000 followers.","The blogger hadn't gained all his followers from teaching math; many came from his comments on hot topics, like a public intellectual.","Upon seeing this news, he immediately posted a short video saying: \"A 6-year-old child wanting to teach middle and high school math? What a joke. If he could do that, wouldn't all our years of learning be in vain?\"","Netizens, smelling controversy, flocked over. Seeing his response, they all got excited: \"Are you saying this is completely fake and just for show?\"","The math teacher didn't comment.","But he liked the comment below, making his stance clear.","In an instant, there was both praise and criticism, and his traffic suddenly soared.","When Shen Wei got the news, she immediately went to find He Lingfeng.","At that moment, He Lingfeng was with Professor Liu.","Seeing Shen Wei approach, Professor Liu immediately shielded the child behind him.","It was as if he was afraid the child might be wronged.","He looked at Shen Wei and said: \"I already know about the online situation. You young people should have some spirit, don't be too modest.\"","He understood that Starry Sky Kindergarten had been keeping a low profile to protect the children.","But recently, Professor Liu had frequently been taking He Lingfeng to various computer science summits.","His talent had been recognized by many industry bigwigs.","Seeing uninformed people online attacking the child, he couldn't stand it anymore.","Now that the child was directly challenging these people to teach them math, he wholeheartedly supported it.","He Lingfeng saw Shen Wei and felt a moment of guilt. Then he raised his head and said: \"I want to do this.\"","Starry Sky Kindergarten had frequently encountered issues before.","He Lingfeng had seen it all.","He had always been close to computers.","So he was well-informed about online news and clearly felt that recently, Starry Sky Kindergarten's sudden fame had made things very difficult for Shen Wei.","Especially the culinary competition, which had consumed a lot of Shen Wei's energy.","He had also seen the online comments.","If it weren't for the fan base Shen Wei had built for Starry Sky Kindergarten,","If it had happened to someone else, they would have been eaten alive, with nothing left.","So this time, he also wanted to become Shen Wei's protector.","Shen Wei said: \"Do what you want to do. We adults have got your back.\"","He Lingfeng was touched, and then pitter-pattered over to hug Shen Wei's legs.","Shen Wei immediately bent down to embrace the child.","Professor Liu watched from the side, feeling a bit jealous: \"This child is only so docile in front of you.\"","They say you can see a person's nature at three, but it's the same at six.","He Lingfeng had already shown his cool demeanor in daily life.","He rarely spoke, and only showed childlike qualities in Shen Wei's arms.","Although Professor Liu hadn't been teaching He Lingfeng for long, he had suffered while teaching at a third-tier university.","Seeing such a promising seedling, he truly cherished him from the bottom of his heart.","So it could be said to be one-on-one teaching.","He had never put so much heart into a single student before.","But the effort was paying off. He Lingfeng was quiet until he made a splash.","When the news that the child would be teaching came out,","Many of Professor Liu's friends sent him WeChat messages.","\"Old Liu, not bad! Your little apprentice can even teach high school courses now. Many people are asking if he really has the ability. I told them straight up, he's your disciple, and everyone understood immediately.\"","\"Can you get me one of these genius seedlings? I also want to experience what it's like to teach a genius. My current students are driving me crazy, no matter how I teach, they just don't get it!!!\"","Every time his friends said such things, he couldn't help but boast: \"What can I say, I didn't specifically look for this, it's just fate.\"","If it hadn't been for Shen Wei bringing the child to listen to his lecture back then,","How would he have stumbled upon such a treasure?","He could assert that with He Lingfeng's talent, no matter which academic giant's hands he fell into, he would be treated like a precious gem.","A genius so young, Professor Liu had only encountered one in his decades-long teaching career.","The next day, no one at Starry Sky Kindergarten had slept well.","Because it was the child's first time facing such a large audience, and malice was everywhere online.","They were afraid he might get hurt, so all the kindergarten teachers had dark circles under their eyes the next day.","Just after 8 o'clock, He Lingfeng opened his live stream.","This classroom had been specially cleared out for him.","He usually had it to himself, but for this first broadcast, others didn't dare to disturb him.","But one by one, they secretly took out their phones to go to his live stream room, giving him likes, supporting him, and sending popularity tickets.","As soon as the live stream opened, many viewers flooded in.","\"I was betting earlier that I didn't know if he would actually start the live stream. I didn't expect this kid to have such courage, he really did start streaming.\"","\"But we still have to see how good your teaching skills are in the end.\"","\"I can't believe this. My mom woke me up early to attend an online class, but it turns out it's being taught by a kid? You've got to be kidding me. We're middle school students, and our time is precious, you know?\"","\"Is this what they mean by other people's children? This is my first time encountering one face-to-face.\"","You can find all sorts of comments online. However, He Lingfeng remained composed and simply presented a problem.","After adjusting the camera, he began solving the problem.","He explained each step of the problem-solving process concisely and clearly.","Many adults had initially tuned in just to watch the spectacle.","But they found themselves drawn in by the child's sweet, innocent voice.","Gradually, they realized they were actually learning how to solve the problem.","Just as they were marveling at this, the child continued teaching.","He had designed this set of problems himself, covering material from first year of middle school all the way to high school. The difficulty of each problem increased progressively.","He occasionally answered questions from online viewers.","For instance, he explained problem-solving strategies, but ignored any teasing comments or gossip.","He lectured for a full two hours, covering material from the first year of middle school to the final year of high school.","The online audience was left in awe.","\"Wow, this kid really knows how to teach.\"","\"This is no joke. Where on earth did they find such an advanced child?\"","\"Doesn't society encourage us to have children? Well, I want one like this.\"","\"Why didn't I have teachers like this when I was in school? I actually understood everything.\"","\"I totally agree with you. When I was in school, the teachers droned on and on. I always felt sleepy during math class. I came here expecting to see some drama, but ended up spending several hours solving problems. It's addictive.\"","\"Has anyone noticed the truly scary part? This child can teach from first year of middle school all the way to the final year of high school. The increase in difficulty is exponential.\"","Since He Lingfeng used to cover an entire year's curriculum in a single day when he was studying, he didn't think this approach was anything special.","But for ordinary people, this range of knowledge seemed like showing off."]},{"number":194,"title":"Chapter 194: Mutual Pursuit","paragraphs":["When the livestream ended, the top three IDs on the leaderboard were all math teachers from various schools.","They even sent messages on the public screen, hoping He Lingfeng could come to their middle schools to give lectures, issuing all sorts of invitations.","The most ridiculous was a parent asking He Lingfeng to tutor their underachieving child, saying they could negotiate the price.","They even sent expensive special effects gifts like \"Number 1 So-and-so\" to show their appreciation.","After seeing this, others couldn't help but rush to confront the math teacher who had previously criticized He Lingfeng: \"Didn't you say this kid couldn't teach? So what do you call this now?\"","The teacher hadn't deleted his previous posts, and instead continued to post his own videos as if nothing had happened.","His attempt to ignore the situation didn't sit well with netizens.","Instead, they kept questioning him one after another.","Opening each of his pinned videos, there were comments saying: \"He really knows his stuff, you're just short-sighted.\" This message was copied by countless people.","The math teacher behind the screen was fuming, his private messages in complete chaos.","In all his years of teaching, he had never seen a child like He Lingfeng.","Teaching from middle school to high school senior year.","Even a seasoned teacher, without thorough preparation, might not be able to achieve this level of performance.","What on earth did this kid eat growing up?","The teacher who had criticized He Lingfeng was now trying to lay low.","But the comment section had been completely overtaken by enthusiastic netizens.","It wouldn't be long before he would break down.","The power of the internet was unstoppable. In contrast to his gloomy mood, Starry Sky Kindergarten was in high spirits.","Everyone had seen He Lingfeng's livestream performance and found it very inspiring.","At first, they were nervous, fearing the child might make a mistake.","Actually, making small mistakes would have been normal; they were more worried about online attacks and insults.","But seeing him pull it off perfectly, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","Professor Liu even rushed over to pick up the child, wanting to plant a big kiss on his little face.","But He Lingfeng deftly dodged it - joke's on you, only Shen Wei was allowed to kiss his face.","Professor Liu was overjoyed holding the child, proud of the disciple he had personally trained.","At his age, he wouldn't take on any more apprentices.","But having such an impressive disciple before retirement was the perfect way to conclude his career.","Online discussions about He Lingfeng continued to ebb and flow.","\"You can always trust Starry Sky Kindergarten. They hadn't revealed He Lingfeng's true abilities before, they were really protecting this child.\"","\"Remember when He Lingfeng said in the video that it was his turn to protect Shen Wei? People said it was so touching at the time.\"","\"Finally, we can feel what it means to have love that goes both ways.\"","\"Remember He Lingfeng's background? He was previously abused by his biological father. Thanks to Shen Wei, otherwise he might still be scavenging for food in some garbage dump. So please, stop criticizing Starry Sky Kindergarten, it has really changed many people's fates.\"","\"Just thinking about how a genius like He Lingfeng was almost buried breaks my heart.\"","\"As a fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten, I will also do more good deeds in the future. Who knows how many lives might be changed by a single act?\"","\"This is really meaningful, this must be the positive energy brought by internet celebrities.\"","Every time Starry Sky Kindergarten hit the trending topics, other kindergartens in the city would quietly observe.","This time, seeing He Lingfeng able to tutor from middle school math all the way to high school, everyone was stunned.","Especially Noble Kindergarten, they really felt a sense of helplessness.","The scales had unconsciously tipped towards Starry Sky Kindergarten. How could Shen Wei be so lucky?","She managed to snag a once-in-a-century genius.","If she doesn't become famous, who will?","Noble Kindergarten used to think about competing with Starry Sky Kindergarten for the spotlight, but now they were completely speechless.","Starry Sky Kindergarten's recent viral successes were unpredictable, without warning, and impossible to replicate.","Shen Qingqing was currently planning her own kindergarten, also promoting the gimmick of operating at a loss to provide benefits for families.","The prices were very low, attracting some fans.","But the lower the price, the more problematic people it attracted. They kept bothering the customer service with questions, constantly comparing with Starry Sky Kindergarten. These parents hadn't even come yet, but they were already giving the staff a hard time.","Some even asked if parents could come to eat meals. It was infuriating for Shen Qingqing.","On top of that, Shen Qingqing's once sweet love life had hit a bottleneck. Lu Zheng had somehow caught up with Lin Rui.","Previously, they were secretive, but now they didn't even try to hide it. He openly posted on social media, repeatedly asking mutual friends to mediate, completely forgetting that he still had a girlfriend named Shen Qingqing.","Facing internal and external troubles, seeing Starry Sky Kindergarten go viral again, Shen Qingqing angrily smashed a cup in her office.","Why? On what grounds?","She was having a hysterical meltdown in her office.","Others didn't dare to breathe.","The CEO's patience with her was wearing thin. Hearing about Shen Qingqing's outburst through the office intercom, he directly said on the phone: \"Let's break up.\"","Shen Qingqing said: \"Breaking up is impossible.\"","Although they hadn't gotten a marriage certificate, they had done everything else. To talk about breaking up now would be too unfair.","The CEO didn't care about any of that and hung up the phone.","This angered Shen Qingqing, who started smashing things again furiously."]},{"number":195,"title":"Chapter 195: Thank You, Amway","paragraphs":["Ever since He Lingfeng went viral online as a math prodigy, Starry Sky Kindergarten has also risen to fame.","The employees of Starry Sky Kindergarten have all gained quite a few followers riding this wave of popularity.","The culinary competition there is also in full swing.","Liu Chef's account has gained the most followers, growing from an initial 37,000 to 153,000 now.","Liu Chef had originally wanted to share some simple cooking tutorials.","But he felt that simple dishes wouldn't meet others' expectations.","Even if he revealed all the steps, the success rate for recreating the dishes would be low.","This may be the difference between a top chef and an ordinary restaurant cook.","Liu Chef's cooking process is very intricate.","This is what the ancients meant by \"food should be refined and dishes should be delicate.\"","The more elaborate the process, the more delicious the result.","That's why gourmets were willing to spend thousands on a meal prepared by Liu Chef.","Liu Chef had already formed this habit.","Even when cooking large batches at Starry Sky Kindergarten,","He couldn't help but make them a bit more refined.","Plus, filming cooking videos was quite troublesome.","Putting the phone in front of the stove was dangerous.","And when it's time to cook, the kitchen gets as busy as a battlefield, leaving no time to hold a phone and film here and there.","So Liu Chef thought of a good alternative.","He could film the vegetable garden.","If there's anything at Starry Sky Kindergarten that he's proud of, firstly it's fattening up his colleagues and the little tots,","And secondly, it's that vegetable garden.","It grows lush and abundant. Even the old farmers who help in the garden praise the place, saying the soil is rich and fertile.","The vegetables grow with thick stems and large leaves, bearing abundant fruit.","The tomatoes are white with a hint of pink.","You can break one open and eat it raw.","The inside is grainy, nine parts sweet and one part sour.","It's incredibly juicy when you eat it.","If you chill it slightly,","It's almost like eating fruit.","Using these tomatoes to make scrambled eggs with tomatoes, it's extremely easy to get the juices flowing.","The result is sweet and sour, and the kids love to eat it mixed with rice.","Although this dish of scrambled eggs with tomatoes is simple, it's number one in the children's hearts.","With this dish, all other meat dishes take a back seat.","Cucumbers, eggplants, and peppers are all growing vigorously.","The eggplants, who knows how they grow, their plants are as big as trees.","Each eggplant is as thick as an adult's arm.","The last time he made fish-flavored eggplant, it was wiped clean, everyone loved it.","Liu Chef has figured it out.","No matter how they cook the vegetables here, they taste good.","He couldn't help but take out his phone to film, barely editing it, just adding some music.","The caption read: \"Look at the vegetables I've grown.\" The video ended with a shot of his face, full of smiles and satisfaction.","After posting it, the comments from netizens exploded.","\"Is this a vegetable garden or a small forest?\"","\"The last time Grandpa Liu posted, this area was still bare. In just a few months, it's grown so lush and green.\"","\"To be honest, I live nearby, and every day when I open my window, I can see all the greenery below. It's a mood-lifter just looking at it.\"","\"These vegetables look so tempting.\"","\"No way, really? Are there people who haven't eaten vegetables grown by Starry Sky Kindergarten? Last time they sold seedlings, I bought a few pots, and now they've become my mother-in-law's favorite. Only the most favored people get to eat a cucumber grown in the flower pot, it's crisp, sweet, and refreshing.\"","\"I bought a bunch of chive seedlings, and I keep cutting them again and again. Every time the chives grow out, it's dumpling-making day at our house. They're so delicious, what should I do? I'm craving them again, I wish I had bought more.\"","\"Speaking of which, I initially bought 10 pots, and my wife thought it was a waste of money. Now she guards them like they're her eyeballs, praising me for my good purchase every time. This time we plan to save seeds and plant more pots next time.\"","\"Are you guys trying to make everyone else hungry?\"","\"That's right, we've never eaten Starry Sky Kindergarten's vegetables, but we'd love to try them.\"","\"Starry Sky Kindergarten, can you eat all these vegetables? Could you sell some?\"","Soon, this message was upvoted to the top.","It received over 3,000 replies and 163,000 likes.","Liu Chef wasn't very savvy with social media, even though the notification showed 99+ messages, he hadn't noticed.","Cooking was such a big project.","By the time he remembered to check, it was already the next day, and a colleague had to tell him about it.","Seeing how much people wanted to eat their vegetables,","Liu Chef didn't dare to reply casually,","After all, the last time he tried to sell vegetables outside, his senior, Chef Chen, had criticized him quite a bit.","But at this moment, Teacher Tang came to find him.","Teacher Tang was a long-time employee of the kindergarten, and a core staff member.","Usually, she was gentle and soft-spoken.","Perhaps because things were going well with the security guard, Li Yi,","Her whole face had become even more gentle.","It was said that they were both considering trying for a baby.","Everyone else at Starry Sky was waiting for good news from the two of them.","Now that Teacher Tang had come to find Liu Chef, his first reaction was: \"Should I prepare a couple of tables?\" Surely there must be good news.","Teacher Tang blushed and said, \"Not yet.\"","Given their age, to have a healthy baby, they needed to do a lot of preparation in advance. They had already started taking folic acid.","At this moment, she was consulting with Liu Chef: \"Could we arrange a vegetable picking activity for the kindergarten children?\"","In the past, such activities were usually arranged with picking farms.","Children born in the city rarely had contact with these things.","This would also be a good opportunity for children to learn about vegetables.","Liu Chef said, \"Sure, that's a great idea!\"","The children could pick vegetables, and what they picked wouldn't go to waste.","It would be sent directly to the kitchen.","And they could also let the children take some home.","Their current yield was indeed very high.","Liu Chef was in charge of the vegetable garden, so if he agreed, it could happen.","Afterwards, Liu Chef mentioned it in the work group chat, and teachers from other classes started to arrange shifts.","The first to go would definitely be Teacher Tang's Class One.","Children going to pick vegetables, this was an exciting new project.","The kindergarten's daily live stream would film it.","This time, the children would wear mini cameras on their chests.","He Lingfeng had already set up the computer program.","People could input a child's name,","And they could see the view from the camera on that child's chest, which was quite clever.","The livestream room suddenly became lively.","As the children happily rushed towards the vegetable garden with their baskets, even the viewers watching the livestream couldn't help but smile with a sense of ease.","It's no wonder everyone loves watching the Starry Sky Kindergarten livestream; it's incredibly heartwarming.","After the viewers entered the names of their favorite little ones, they suddenly felt as if they had stepped into a primeval forest.","The vegetables here grew lush and tall, while the children were quite small in stature.","So, as they weaved through the garden, it became an immersive experience of primitive society.","Every vegetable and fruit appeared enormous in the children's eyes.","When a child struggled to twist off a tomato larger than their face with both hands and laboriously placed it in their small basket, the joy of harvesting was even more delightful than if the viewers had gone picking themselves.","At that moment, Xiao Li, lying in bed at home watching the livestream, had a doting smile on her face.","She then switched to a smaller screen and sent a message to her friend: \"No wonder you love watching the Starry Sky Kindergarten livestream.\"","Previously, when her friend enjoyed watching the Starry Sky livestream, she thought there was nothing interesting about a bunch of kids running around and making noise.","It wasn't until she watched for a few days that she discovered how addictive it truly was.","Her friend's status showed: The other party is typing.","Then she saw the text come through: \"Sure enough, no one can resist the charm of Starry Sky Kindergarten!\"","She had successfully recommended it to several people already, and they all had the same reaction."]},{"number":196,"title":"Chapter 196: Feeling Proud Again","paragraphs":["Shen's Father approached Shen Wei and said, \"Your Uncle Liao wants to come and pick fruits here.\"","Every time he visited the livestream, he was the top donor, gifting several million yuan.","He was also a local tycoon in their circle.","In the hierarchy of the wealthy, he stood at the very top. Money was just a number to him.","Someone must have recommended the kindergarten to him.","Now he had become a fan of Starry Sky Kindergarten's livestreams.","Whenever he joined, the screen would be filled with flashy gift effects.","It was a dazzling sight for viewers.","Rumor had it that people were even privately messaging him, trying to compete for the top donor position.","He had contacted Shen's Father because he wanted to experience the children's joy firsthand.","Knowing that Shen Wei was busy, he didn't want to bother her with such a small matter.","So he decided to approach someone he considered influential.","As it happened, Shen's Father had previously bought some mutual funds and stocks, one of which was recommended by Uncle Liao.","It had made him a fortune.","That's why he had invested in Shen Wei's Third-tier University, becoming a board member and setting up a scholarship fund, wanting to do some good.","Now that Uncle Liao had made his request, Shen's Father felt he couldn't refuse.","Shen Wei said, \"Just a moment!\" Then she made a call to Liu Chef.","After all, such matters should be discussed with the person in charge.","Liu Chef immediately agreed upon hearing the request.","Although he wasn't part of the wealthy circle,","As a top chef, he was well aware of which families truly had influence.","He was touched that Shen Wei had called him about this.","It would have been fine if Shen Wei had agreed directly.","But the fact that she called him showed real respect.","He readily agreed, \"Of course!\"","When Uncle Liao arrived, he was dressed in casual clothes.","The children had already finished their picking. The vast vegetable garden was all his.","He fell in love with it the moment he entered.","As soon as he stepped in, he was greeted by the fresh scent of vegetables.","He had been itching to come ever since he saw the children picking vegetables on the livestream.","Now that he was here in person, it was even more impressive.","The vast scale of the garden was truly stunning.","He too picked up a basket and went in, choosing the cucumbers that caught his eye.","He only picked tomatoes that were pinkish-red and perfectly shaped for his basket.","With each pick, the rich aroma of vegetables became even more refreshing.","The scent seemed to soothe and massage his spirit through his sense of smell.","After filling a small basket, he realized this vegetable garden was truly exceptional.","It was like playing house as a child.","Everywhere he turned, there were \"treasures.\"","He had initially thought one basket would be enough, not wanting to be greedy.","But he enjoyed it so much that he ended up filling several baskets.","He spent five or six hours at it.","When he finally straightened up, his back and waist were aching.","But he felt an immense sense of satisfaction.","Working in the fields was far more enjoyable than attending business functions.","Afterward, he remembered to take a selfie and post it on his rarely updated social media.","The tycoon's social circle was full of other big shots.","His friends were surprised to see him picking vegetables at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","And he had picked so much, seven or eight baskets by the looks of it.","They quickly asked, \"What's going on? How did you get in there? Who did you talk to?\"","They were all intrigued.","After all, many people had been eyeing Starry Sky Kindergarten's vegetable garden.","But they had held back due to their status, not wanting to impose.","Yet this old fox had managed to get in and picked so much!","The tycoon gave a brief reply and was about to leave.","He had picked seven or eight baskets, each weighing seventy to eighty pounds.","He couldn't take them all, so he was planning to take just three to five pounds. But Liu Chef insisted he take a whole basket.","They filled it with a bit of everything, and before they knew it, the large basket was full.","It contained all kinds of vegetables.","All picked by the tycoon himself.","Eating something you've picked with your own hands makes it taste different.","When the tycoon returned home that evening, he had his personal chef prepare the vegetables with great care.","The seeds used in the garden had been optimized by the system.","They tasted incredible even with normal preparation.","The home chef, eager to please the tycoon, pulled out all the stops, bringing out the best in each vegetable.","For the first time, the tycoon understood that the phrase \"so delicious you could bite your tongue off\" wasn't just an exaggeration.","The other tycoons also wanted to visit, but they were too polite to ask directly.","Shen's Father knew that if he opened this door, it would be hard to refuse others later.","So he ignored all their hints.","The other tycoons suggested, \"Why not sell tickets?\" They really wanted to come and pick vegetables.","They were willing to pay even if it was expensive.","Somehow, this idea made its way onto the internet.","Netizens shared the same thought.","Soon, every video Liu Chef posted about the vegetable garden had comments saying, \"Sell tickets!\"","Liu Chef was walking on air.","Yesterday, each of the little treasures from the picking garden had taken two pounds of vegetables home.","The parents, having tasted Starry Sky Kindergarten's vegetables before, treated them with great care.","The parent group chat was flooded with food photos and long, praising messages.","Liu Chef couldn't stop scrolling through them.","He wore a satisfied smile.","After just a few steps, he bumped into Chef Chen.","Liu Chef's smile hadn't faded yet when Chef Chen said sarcastically, \"Feeling smug again, are we?\"","\"Huh?\"","Chef Chen grumbled, \"You really can't help showing off every little thing you've got.\"","Now even people asking for vegetables were coming to Chef Chen.","These vegetables were needed for the main restaurant and the pop-up store.","In a few days, they would also be supplying meals to the second Starry Sky Kindergarten.","They were already stretched thin.","Now they had the attention of the entire internet and all the students' parents.","No matter how many vegetables they had, it wouldn't be enough to satisfy everyone's interest.","Chef Chen was at a loss with his junior colleague.","Liu Chef felt a bit guilty: \"But I didn't agree this time, did I?\"","If he had acted like he used to, getting excited over every compliment, he might have switched to selling vegetables on the spot.","Remembering how selling seeds had blocked the road last time, he shuddered.","When your side business becomes too successful, it can be a sweet burden."]},{"number":197,"title":"Chapter 197: Live Painting","paragraphs":["He Lingfeng is an overnight sensation, with every teacher and student in the Starry Sky Kindergarten singing his praises.","Everyone knew before that He Lingfeng was extraordinary.","He was the child that Shen Wei protected with all her might.","But no one expected him to be so exceptional.","Surprisingly, a child was able to lecture middle and high school students.","His foundation was incredibly solid, which allowed him to apply it to various areas.","His popularity was spreading all over the internet and still growing.","He conducts live streams every other day.","And each live stream attracts more and more viewers.","The first one had 300,000.","By the later stages, his live streams would have over 600,000 online viewers.","Even many top streamers rarely have such high viewer rates.","Whenever He Lingfeng streams live, it leads to a battle of recruitments among schools.","Many elite high schools have special programs for young prodigies.","These classes are for targeted training.","You could say entering one of these programs guarantees a bright future.","Students of these programs don't apply for jobs.","Instead, major firms proffer high annual salaries to bid for them.","However, these children usually get early job offers from state-owned enterprises.","Some even conduct certain clandestine researches.","The youngest members of these programs in universities used to be around 15 years old.","But now, it's dropped to a 6-year-old. Regular internet users find it hard to take.","They repeatedly question whether He Lingfeng is a real genius or it's just hype.","Every time there's a probe, including random connections.","They prepare questions in advance, just to pester He Lingfeng.","But now, all of He Lingfeng's teachers are at the professor level.","They have just consolidated all his previous knowledge.","So those supposedly difficult questions became as easy as eating and drinking.","Those who can enter top schools all have one common understanding.","That is, talent is actually more important than effort.","Talking about talent, He Lingfeng's is not something gifted by God, but it's like God keeps pushing it on him.","Not only are heads of admissions scrambling for him online","But even offline, people have come to Starry Sky Kindergarten, wanting early contact with this child.","Even Professor Liu's old colleagues came to inquire about this child's past intentions.","All this quickly made He Lingfeng the little celebrity of his class.","Faced with this situation, Shen Wei isn't surprised.","She knew early that once He Lingfeng's talents were revealed, this would be the outcome.","But she did underestimate everyone's fervor for He Lingfeng.","Now, netizens have even set up a fan club for He Lingfeng.","And the fan club quickly expanded to 20 groups.","Even new idol groups didn't have such a scale for their fan club at the beginning.","She Shen Wei sighed at this spectacular sight!","Soon Qi Zhong came to contact Shen Wei, saying: \"Mu Zhixing also wants to start livestreaming her paintings.\"","\"Ah!\" Shen Wei was somewhat surprised.","Qi Zhong said: \"Ever since He Lingfeng became famous, the look in Mu Zhixing's eyes has always been full of envy!\"","Qi Zhong treats Mu Zhixing as if she was her own daughter.","Not to mention Mu Zhixing is her disciple, she certainly favors her more and couldn't bear to see her upset.","If you really compare talents, Mu Zhixing's talent in painting is definitely no less than He Lingfeng's talent in maths.","There's an old saying that goes: \"Make a name for yourself while you're young\".","Qi Zhong had always been known for her youthful fame which bred a tinge of arrogance deep in her bones, leading her to do many unconventional things.","So much so that he took such an extreme measure to avenge his student.","Early fame can be unhealthy for a child's physical and mental development.","But today's children are in a rapidly developing era.","They are exposed to various novel things at any time and anywhere.","If they have the chance to shine, why not let her show it?","Shen Wei said, \"Sure.\"","People were then sent to apply for a new short video account for Mu Zhixing.","And Shen Wei followed.","Shen Wei only follows about 30 people in total.","They are all related to the Starry Sky Kindergarten.","This time, seeing her follow a newcomer, they hurriedly went to check.","Surprisingly, it was Mu Zhixing.","There was no content on her account, it was just registered.","On seeing this, everyone decided to follow enthusiastically.","When the account was handed over to Qi Zhong, it already had more than 2000 followers from zero.","Shen Wei asked Qi Zhong when he would start live streaming, \"I will promote it on my platform later.\"","Afraid that the lack of people would dampen the child's enthusiasm.","Qi Zhong looked at Shen Wei, a little moved, \"The live stream will start tomorrow morning.\"","Mu Zhixing had always shown a slight tendency towards introversion, after treatment, she improved a lot at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","No different from ordinary children.","But she's also overly timid.","Facing so many people, plus the possibility of unfriendly remarks in the bullet screen.","Shen Wei gave Qi Zhong a worried look.","Qi Zhong understood what Shen Wei was worried about because anyone who loved Mu Zhixing would have same thought.","Qi Zhong said, \"No worries, if she can't carry on through one course, I'm there.\"","Qi Zhong's reputation in the industry is quite renowned.","Ever since he became popular in Starry Sky Kindergarten.","Everyone started digging up his past exhibitions for a look.","If it weren't for that incident back then.","He would have been a standout among young artists, a definite leader.","And potentially a future master who could start his own school.","His paintings could mimic both ancient and modern styles.","His lively and elegant sketches, such as a veil bride, would make one believe it was a black and white photo.","His highly detailed works are something not even many art academy deans could necessarily create.","Plus the internet is full of enthusiastic youth.","Knowing his unfortunate experience for standing up for his students.","Many sympathized with him and he gained a large following.","Previously, many art exam students came to the pop-up shop because of him.","Getting some advice from such a master is more beneficial than laboring over ten or more paintings.","There've been calls for him to start online classes, but he's quite proud.","And he doesn't lack money now, so he doesn't want to do online courses.","He's fully focused on teaching his good disciples.","But feeling that his disciple is little envious of He Lingfeng, he as a master couldn't tolerate it.","He immediately told Shen Wei that he wanted to start online classes.","After Shen Wei agreed, Qi Zhong rushed to tell his little disciple the good news.","However, the young disciple was a little scared, \"I can't do it.\" Although she worked as a young assistant in the pop-up shop.","And was adored by netizens during her live streams.","However, facing so many people, she was a little trembling.","She wasn't like He Lingfeng. Apart from her talent in drawing, she's just like a regular child.","And many words are unknown to her.","Whenever she thought about people conversing online while she was oblivious to what they were saying, a chill of the unknown would creep over her.","Qi Zhong comforted, \"Don't worry, I'll be with you. Besides, if you'll not manage to learn, you still have the teacher, who will always have your back.\"","Just like that, Shen Wei promoted Mu Zhixing's art course in her own short video.","Some snide comments came in: \"See, I knew it! Starry Sky Kindergarten had a taste of He Lingfeng's success and now they are marketing a prodigy.\"","But not everyone was ready to put up with them.","Mu Zhixing drawing his sweet pictures was quite a calming sight on regular days.","But the kindergarten's live stream was no longer concentrated in one class.","Mu Zhixing had a lot of fans too, who were patiently watching despite the commotion.","Suddenly fury rushed in.","\"Our child was talented all along, he even had an art exhibition in the U.S.\"","The naysayers and fans were now engaged in a full-blown argument.","The naysayers thought there was a conspiracy.","The fans felt it was really inhuman to target a child.","Usually, Qi Zhong was the one who defended Mu Zhixing the most, but this time he saw Mu Zhixing remain unaffected.","A ludicrous thought suddenly crossed his mind; it was a good thing that the little baby couldn't read!"]},{"number":198,"title":"Chapter 198: “Missed the Point”","paragraphs":["On the second day, everyone came to Mu Zhixing's livestream room.","The number of viewers wasn't as high as He Lingfeng's stream.","But it was still decent.","In the morning, there were 30,000 people online simultaneously, which was considered good traffic for a niche category.","Many people entered to see Mu Zhixing asking the camera: \"Is anyone here?\"","Because no matter how much she asked, no one would respond audibly.","It was the little one's first time streaming.","Her eyes were full of curiosity like a kitten's, tilting her head to look left and right.","The aunties in the stream room were melting from cuteness, and they all started using special effects to tease her.","Some effects put a red veil on her head.","Others made cat ears appear.","There were all sorts of strange and fun effects.","Mu Zhixing was truly a soft and cuddly little girl.","Every time an effect covered her, she would shyly tell Qi Zhong: \"Look, I have two little ears now.\"","This world can't do without girls, especially soft and cuddly babies.","The little one was having fun, and the viewers in the stream room were delighted, saying: \"Baby, you don't need to draw, just smile at the aunties in the stream room, and we'll give you anything!\"","They looked completely enchanted.","\"So cute, my goodness, I want to take you home right now.\"","Qi Zhong stood behind, holding his phone, watching how everyone teased his disciple.","He felt somewhat speechless, thinking the viewers should go have their own babies if they like them so much, instead of drooling over someone else's child.","At this moment, Qi Zhong said: \"Let's start drawing.\" His voice was very gentle.","Many of those who came to support Mu Zhixing were old fans of the stream room.","They were now laughing hysterically in the chat: \"Oh my god, the Drawing Teacher's voice is so soft, remember how he used to coldly criticize everyone's homework before?\"","\"I remember when he was evaluating those art students before, he didn't hold back at all, several people were almost brought to tears by his comments.\"","\"This is Qi Zhong's beloved disciple. I heard that when some senior figures in the art world tried to poach Mu Zhixing before, Qi Zhong got furious on the spot.\"","\"How could he not be angry about someone trying to steal his student? After all, who wouldn't like such a sweet, soft, and talented baby?\"","Qi Zhong could see these people frantically typing in the comment section behind her, almost spilling all his secrets.","He coughed dryly.","Mu Zhixing immediately sat up straight.","She took out a piece of paper and said: \"Now I'll teach everyone how to draw together!\"","Because she was teaching, she chose some simpler drawings.","She selected some roses.","Her flower wall painting from before had truly amazed many big names in the industry.","This time it was just a single rose, A5 paper size, which could be framed and placed on the bedside table once finished.","It looked very pretty.","Then the baby said in her milky voice: \"First, draw an oval shape!\"","The child drew very slowly, stroke by stroke.","As if afraid that everyone wouldn't be able to keep up.","She would announce each subsequent stroke in advance.","Children are truly too adorable and cute. The fans in the livestream couldn't resist, showering her with endless compliments.","\"Oh my, it's the first time being treated like a child by a child, it feels so good!\"","\"Auntie is going to find paper now, baby is teaching so hard, I'll show you my homework later, okay?\"","Others seemed to snap out of it, realizing they just needed paper and a pen, so they followed the child's instructions step by step.","They didn't know why the pen seemed to obey Mu Zhixing's hand so well.","Every stroke was so smooth.","Although each step was taught very carefully and in detail.","But somehow, they lost track at some point.","Then they realized that the pen in their hand seemed to have a mind of its own.","Even when they were told to turn one way, it insisted on going another.","While everyone was still immersed in drawing.","Suddenly, the livestream was bombarded with donations.","Some donations came with vibrations and sound effects.","A dragon suddenly emerged from the screen, looking very cool.","It circled above, then swam around below several times, before finally freezing in the middle and gradually disappearing.","Mu Zhixing immediately looked up, almost stunned.","The dragon only appeared for about a minute.","Mu Zhixing used the large blank space next to the rose, and with a few quick strokes.","Soon, the dragon shape from earlier was replicated exactly on her paper.","Her hand was small.","Somehow, it became incredibly nimble when drawing.","Everyone watched as a vivid dragon appeared on the paper before their eyes.","The viewers were all amazed.","Is this what real skill looks like?","Having both a camera-like memory and photocopier-like ability.","\"What are kids eating these days to grow up like this?\"","\"My goodness, it's miraculous. No wonder Qi Zhong dotes on this little disciple so much, who wouldn't love her!\"","Just then, the dragon that had appeared earlier made another appearance.","A viewer below explained: \"This special effect costs 3000 yuan.\"","Even in top streamers' rooms, such expensive donation effects don't often appear.","Everyone realized this was serious.","The person who made the donation turned out to be the master painter who had publicly tried to poach from Qi Zhong last time.","The viewers, always eager for drama, kept chanting in the comments: Fight, fight!","They loved watching poaching dramas in livestreams, completely illogical, just snatching left and right.","Mu Zhixing saw the dragon appear again and her eyes lit up with joy.","Mu Zhixing didn't know how expensive this donation was.","She just thought the special effect looked really cool.","As if it could come out of the phone screen.","Then the top donor, the master painter, started coaxing: \"Baby, do you want to learn painting with me? I'm very good at ink painting, come play at my studio sometime.\"","Although there was no voice, one could somehow sense this person speaking in a coy manner.","At this point, Qi Zhong couldn't hold back anymore.","He said from the side: \"My disciple can't read.\"","\"Okay, hahahahaha.\" The viewers burst into laughter.","\"Hahahahaha.\" This was like winking at a blind person.","At this moment, the top donor's face changed in front of his phone: Really, I underestimated the situation."]},{"number":199,"title":"Chapter 199: Regretful Parents of a Scoundrel","paragraphs":["Mu Zhixing's live-streamed painting session received quite a positive response.","In one live stream, her followers increased from just over 2,000 to 62,000.","The comment section was filled with praise.","\"When's your next live stream, baby?\"","\"This is the first time I've found painting so interesting. I'm planning to join an amateur painting class and then ask our little teacher here to critique my work.\"","\"That 'she can't read' moment was today's highlight. I'm still laughing about it.\"","\"Exactly! The painting master probably never experienced such embarrassment before. Someone tipped thousands of yuan, and she couldn't even read it.\"","\"If everyone hadn't emphasized it so much, I would've forgotten that our baby is a little one not even 7 years old.\"","\"That's incredible.\"","Qi Zhong selected some of these compliments to share with Mu Zhixing.","The child's cheeks were rosy, but her eyes sparkled brightly.","It was clear that the little one enjoyed being praised, though she was naturally shy.","Faced with such direct and enthusiastic compliments, her face turned bright red.","In one live stream, many people were astounded by Mu Zhixing's talent.","Being able to recreate something almost perfectly after just a glance is an ability even art school students would envy.","No wonder the masters they looked up to were eager to come down from their pedestals to recruit her.","Mu Zhixing's birth parents also watched this live stream.","Her birth father regretted his past decisions, slapping his thigh in frustration.","If he had known about the child's abilities earlier, he should have kept her by his side.","She could have become an internet celebrity, doing live streams and promotions. He'd heard they could earn tens of thousands a month.","But he didn't dare to suggest it.","Mainly because his new wife had a fiery temper.","Ever since she heard that Mu Zhixing had become famous, her first reaction wasn't to bring the child back home.","Instead, she sent their three children to learn painting.","Since the family had this genetic talent, maybe their own children could succeed too.","Moreover, all three of her children were boys.","And the stepmother was the jealous type.","If the children's father praised Mu Zhixing even once, it would infuriate the stepmother.","Unable to bring the talented child home, the birth father could only give up.","Mu Zhixing's birth mother also watched the live stream.","Seeing the once timid little girl now confident and natural, her feelings were complex.","Truthfully, both of the child's parents were good-looking, but the little girl's previously shy personality had hidden her beauty.","Now, under the nurturing care of Starry Sky Kindergarten,","Her appearance had suddenly become outstanding.","She even looked prettier than her younger sister.","When the incident happened in their family, the child's father was sentenced to three months of probation.","The stepfather lost his prestigious job.","The whole family was also evicted from their apartment complex.","Most people are just. The thought of someone so heartless, with evil intentions towards a child,","Made everyone feel disgusted.","So every day, people would come to throw rotten vegetables and rotten eggs.","Whenever this family went out, they would be pointed at and whispered about.","Some even said to their faces, wondering if such a beast would do the same to his own daughter.","Every time she heard these words, Mu Zhixing's birth mother would become furious.","They had no choice but to move away, now living in an old residential building.","She hadn't worked for many years but now had to find a job as an hourly maid.","Her beloved younger daughter, moving from a spacious, bright apartment to an old, shabby place, cried every day.","Moreover, after Mu Zhixing's stepfather's true nature was exposed, his personality changed dramatically.","Gone was his previous gentle and caring demeanor, replaced by frequent outbursts of anger.","Now their home didn't feel like a home, everything falling apart.","They had been too high-profile before.","She regretted some of her words, but whatever happened afterward, she had to grit her teeth and swallow her pride.","Now, seeing Mu Zhixing looking bright and beautiful, she felt a sense of disconnect, as if from another lifetime.","A faint feeling of regret welled up inside her.","But she had learned the power of cyberbullying.","If she were to try and claim her daughter back now, forget everything else, netizens could drown her with their spit alone.","She had finally reached a point where her neighbors didn't know about her past; if it all happened again, she would truly have a mental breakdown.","There was nothing she could do; she had to suppress all her dissatisfaction.","The daughter she once looked down upon now had a bright future ahead of her.","Every word of praise on the screen stung her eyes.","A mix of resentment, jealousy, and complex emotions knotted in her chest.","Soon she felt a tightness in her chest, struggling to breathe.","She had to forcefully push these feelings down. She wanted her younger daughter to learn painting too.","But the little one didn't understand her mother's intentions.","The child was old enough to remember.","She knew there used to be an older sister who liked to paint and was quite good at it.","Whenever the family tried to make her learn, she would throw a tantrum.","Breaking all the watercolor pens and then bursting into tears.","Like a super aggressive child. Every time she would cry until everyone was mentally exhausted, and they had to give up.","In just over a year,","So many changes had occurred in the family.","Looking at Mu Zhixing's mother now, she seemed to have aged ten years.","All the hardships she hadn't experienced in years","Were condensed into these few months.","When the incident first happened,","She had boasted about their unbreakable love, refusing to divorce the man she married later. But after all that had happened,","Now it was a matter of basic necessities.","The family's money was gone too.","And her husband had inexplicably become distant.","He would run off every day with some cheap woman.","Even leaving lipstick marks on his shirt collar, not even trying to hide it.","She couldn't bear this kind of life for a single day.","But she had no money.","She couldn't imagine how she would survive if she left this home with her daughter.","If she left without her daughter, she didn't trust her husband's character.","Life seemed to be dragging her down like a ball of mud, relentless until death.","...","Mu Zhixing knew nothing about what was happening with her birth parents.","Since escaping from that suffocating home, she had come to see Starry Sky Kindergarten as her true home.","Now, with so many people praising her painting skills,","The little one happily went to find Shen Wei.","She even showed Shen Wei the painting from her live stream.","Shen Wei had already watched the child's live stream.","Seeing the little one's face eager for praise, she quickly hugged the child and said, \"That's wonderful!\"","Mu Zhixing shyly nestled in Shen Wei's embrace: \"I'm giving it to you!\"","The child's paintings were her most prized possessions.","Previously, Qi Zhong had repeatedly instructed her not to give her paintings away casually.","However, there was one exception. It was Shen Wei.","As long as Shen Wei liked it, Mu Zhixing would have gladly drawn 10 or 20 more pictures on the spot.","Even Qi Zhong felt a bit jealous of this affection.","But there was nothing he could do about it.","After all, Shen Wei was the one who had pulled her out of the fire. While he might be jealous, he knew deep down that he couldn't compare to her.","Shen Wei said, \"Thank you, sweetheart!\"","Then she put away the child's drawings.","Mu Zhixing gathered her courage and said, \"What else do you like? I'll draw it for you next time!\"","After speaking, she lowered her head shyly but secretly glanced at Shen Wei from the corner of her eye.","Shen Wei said, \"I love everything you draw, darling.\"","The little one suddenly perked up as if energized and said, \"Alright then, I'll keep drawing for you forever.\"","She skipped out of the room, clearly in high spirits.","Shen Wei watched her retreating figure, a smile playing on her lips.","Her heart had softened beyond measure.","Indeed, places with children were the most healing."]},{"number":200,"title":"Chapter 200: Clear Love","paragraphs":["Professor Liu came to find Shen Wei on his own initiative for the first time.","Shen Wei was a bit surprised: \"What's the matter, Professor Liu?\"","Professor Liu said, \"The scientists are about to leave, and before they go, they want to invite the kindergarten staff for a meal to thank them for their care.\"","These scientists had initially come for the all-in-one gaming pod.","After arriving, they wanted to conduct in-depth research.","But the holographic gaming pod...","Both its software and hardware were very valuable for reference.","However, this device was too sophisticated, with only one unit in the entire country.","There was really no way around it.","They couldn't violently damage it and then disassemble its components.","Others couldn't make heads or tails of it based on experience alone.","They had finally managed to track down the designer.","But this designer was an eccentric scientific genius.","In the end, he disappeared.","It brought enormous pressure on the local police.","But when someone can't be found, they just can't be found.","Due to years of neglect, many surveillance cameras in that area were just for show.","This led to substantial funding from higher-ups.","They wanted to have a guard every three steps and a sentry every five steps.","The small county town was practically covered with surveillance cameras, and now even the crime rate had decreased.","Moreover, the scientists spearheaded the creation of a science museum.","They hoped to commemorate this scientific genius.","They hoped this person would reappear.","Even communication via email would be acceptable.","But there was still no sign of him.","They were treated like VIPs at Starry Sky Kindergarten.","The food here was already delicious.","Add to that the gentle, lovely, and polite children.","The scientists became somewhat reluctant to leave.","Several of them even wanted to buy houses locally.","Just like Professor Liu and Professor Gao, who had already planned out their retirement lives.","But there was no helping it.","They needed to train the next generation of talent for the country.","They had already been away for too long this time.","The people at their original workplaces were getting restless.","The minor leaders were calling them three times a day, urging them to return.","No matter how reluctant they were, they had to leave.","This time, they had booked a rather luxurious local restaurant.","They invited everyone from Starry Sky Kindergarten to come for a meal.","They reserved four or five tables, with their table costing over 5,000 yuan.","Shen Wei notified everyone accordingly.","On that day, many people from Starry Sky Kindergarten came.","Although the employees of Starry Sky Kindergarten earned quite well, they had never been to such an expensive restaurant.","They wanted to taste how it differed from Liu Chef's usual cooking.","But after the dishes were served and they started eating, they felt a bit disappointed.","The signature dishes here were far inferior to Liu Chef's cooking.","Liu Chef also grumbled a bit about wasting money unnecessarily.","But the scientists appreciated Liu Chef's care and wanted him to rest this time, not to be busy.","Not only that, but an elderly scientist also took the initiative and said, \"Let's have some drinks.\"","The scientists used to drink before, pouring themselves white liquor. Shen Wei couldn't handle the strong stuff, so she ordered a bottle of red wine.","\"I'm very happy that we're all gathered here today! To have met such an outstanding young person like Shen Wei.\"","Shen Wei quickly said, \"I don't deserve such praise!\" The others were truly national treasures.","She was just running a small kindergarten, how could she compare to them?","After a few drinks, everyone became more talkative.","Others also started to loosen up.","They began to feast heartily, all thanks to Shen Wei's influence.","Several scientists who had become familiar with Professor Liu and Professor Gao said, \"You two really know how to pick a place!\"","The oldest among the scientists was already 76 years old.","He had wanted to retire, but he couldn't. His project was of national importance, ranking first or second.","He still had to continue mentoring students.","If he had a choice, he would really like to come to Starry Sky Kindergarten to plant some flowers, play with children, and enjoy good food.","To experience the joy of being an ordinary old man.","Professor Gao said with a disgruntled face, \"Professor Liu is the luckiest, I have to go back soon!\"","He still had work to do over there.","If he had known earlier, he shouldn't have signed for 5 years.","Three years would have been enough.","He still had a year and a half of work left as the head of the Computer Science department.","They had been away for too long now and had to go back to continue working.","They were all in the same boat, making the wine taste a bit bitter.","Shen Wei said, \"You're welcome to come back anytime. Your presence has injected a lot of scientific knowledge into Starry Sky Kindergarten, giving wings to the children's imagination. We're really grateful to you.\"","Mentioning this, the oldest scientist among them couldn't help but say, \"It's us who should thank you, otherwise we wouldn't have known that there are such talents among ordinary people!\"","Even he was very impressed with the holographic game.","And after entering the gaming pod, it felt like being young again.","There were no worries in the game.","Once such a thing is introduced to the world, the whole country would go crazy for it.","Unfortunately, he didn't have the ability to extract the specific technological content inside.","The gaming pod was out of place in this era.","It was like a product from the future.","Its appearance was a heaven-sent treasure.","After a melancholy drink, he couldn't help but sigh, \"I wonder if I'll live to see the decryption of the gaming pod in my lifetime. That will usher in a new era, entering the Internet of Everything.\" It was the era every scientific worker aspired to.","As he spoke, the old man's eyes reddened. The people next to him quickly consoled him, \"If our generation can't do it, there's still the next generation. With young people working hard generation after generation, we'll definitely catch up and become the best internationally.\"","Everyone ate and drank merrily. At the end, the old professors finally revealed their bombshell news.","They had saved frugally all their lives, collecting some prize money. They had pooled together 10 million yuan to donate to Shen Wei.","Shen Wei said, \"There's no need!\"","She didn't lack money here.","The old professors were all very simple people.","Even the shoes they wore were old styles. They wouldn't buy new clothes.","What they had earned were all national-level awards.","How could she let these not-so-wealthy professors donate the money they had saved frugally all their lives to a well-off kindergarten?","Shen Wei repeatedly refused.","But the old professors said, \"This is our collective wish. Children are the hope, and we truly believe that your kindergarten is run very well!\"","Whether it was He Lingfeng or Mu Zhixing, or other sunny and cheerful babies, the kindergarten really took good care of them all.","They had also learned about Shen Wei in depth. How she had rescued Song Ping An, who had been fighting with stray dogs for food.","They were truly moved.","They also wanted to contribute their modest efforts, but this money was too heavy for Shen Wei.","Shen Wei didn't want to take it.","But the old gentlemen were all stubborn.","Once they decided to give it, Shen Wei had no choice but to accept.","When Shen Wei took it, the money felt like it weighed a thousand pounds.","The greatest wish of these old professors was to bring the gaming pod into the real world.","Their pure love was for the country.","They had dedicated their entire youth and descendants.","Shen Wei couldn't help but enter the system internally.","Starry Sky Kindergarten had always been popular.","The online reputation value plus the system reward points totaled 940,000.","Shen Wei had never been so well-off before.","She had intended to use the points where they were most needed, but this time, she wanted to indulge herself a bit.","Shen Wei wanted to exchange for the complete blueprints of the gaming pod.","Written in the system's customization area, it showed that 1 million points were needed.","All of her points weren't enough.","But at this moment, the system, like a sly merchant, persuaded her.","\"If you don't have enough points, you can owe them for now. When you have points, they'll be automatically deducted!\" encouraging her to consume on credit.","Shen Wei knew it was a trap. But thinking of the selfless love of the old professors, she couldn't help but grit her teeth and exchanged for the blueprints.","Soon, 940,000 points were instantly cleared to zero, and it showed -60,000.","Back to square one in an instant."]}]);
